window.AKK_AH_THE_VILLAINS_I_FORCED_TO_TURN_EVIL_CAN_READ_MY_MIND_CHAPTERS=(window.AKK_AH_THE_VILLAINS_I_FORCED_TO_TURN_EVIL_CAN_READ_MY_MIND_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":1,"title":"Chapter 1: Killed by the System According to the Script, but Her Brothers Hear Her Thoughts","paragraphs":["The author who wrote this book must be insane!","Absolutely insane!","Qiao Chuchu stood on top of the high-rise building, trembling with fear, her calves spasming uncontrollably.","The System excitedly said: [Jump down, host! Jump down and everything will end! End your fate as the villainous supporting character, and receive billions in after-tax assets instantly, with a luxurious mansion on the Bund waiting for you!]","Qiao Chuchu's inner fear was instantly overwhelmed by the dazzling prospect of immense wealth.","Yes!","She would be rich!","Rich enough to even keep handsome men as her sugar babies!","Qiao Chuchu looked toward the rooftop entrance.","Seven handsome men slowly approached her, their expressions grave with a hint of disgust, afraid of provoking her to jump.","The man at the front exuded an imposing aura and spoke coldly: \"Qiao Chuchu, get down here. Stop making a spectacle of yourself.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","Although she had done many terrible things, she was about to die, yet he told her to get down?","Qiao Chuchu feigned anguish: \"I'm about to die and you're still so cold to me, big brother, you're heartless!\"","Pei Yuan looked at her coldly, his dark eyes filled with ominous gleams: \"This isn't your first suicide attempt. Us being here is already giving you face.\"","Qiao Chuchu was stunned.","Indeed.","In real life, she was an orphan born with a genetic disease and abandoned at an orphanage.","Despite living optimistically and saving money for treatment, she still died.","The System gave her a chance to transmigrate into this world of one woman and multiple men.","She transmigrated into this novel world when this body was three years old.","On her first day after transmigrating, her birth parents died.","But her adoptive mother, who was also the mother of Pei Yuan and his brothers, adopted her.","Her adoptive mother was her birth mother's best friend. After her parents' death, the adoptive mother, grief-stricken, raised her to adulthood.","In her previous life, she had never experienced what having a family felt like.","But here, she was the precious pearl of the Pei family.","Just as the novel described, her seven brothers doted on her immensely!","Though they had no blood ties, their relationship was stronger than blood.","She was truly happy.","When she was ten, her adoptive parents died in a plane crash.","Her eldest brother Pei Yuan, not yet of age, became the Pei family's successor candidate. All her brothers carried heavy burdens, yet she remained their precious pearl.","She was willing to share their joys and sorrows.","But she was merely a bound tool.","If she didn't comply, she would die, and suffer all sorts of punishments.","She had to drive her brothers to become dark and sensitive towards all women, paving the way for the female lead.","She didn't know what kind of novel she had transmigrated into, but she felt the author must be seriously ill!!","Weren't supporting characters' lives worth anything?","Her brothers would become twisted because of her, both loving and tormenting the female lead, dying in the grand finale.","And she was destined to die today.","The System urged: [Host, say your lines, quickly say your lines!]","A sudden feeling of reluctance rose in Qiao Chuchu's heart as she gazed deeply at the seven men before her.","After being bound by the System, she had always acted against her will.","Trampling their gifts underfoot, turning like into dislike, deliberately making them despise her.","But that was never truly her.","Today, she could finally make her own choice.","Qiao Chuchu felt relieved as she looked up at the starry sky: \"Brothers, I'm sorry, but after this, you'll never see me again.\"","Pei Yuan's expression gradually turned to astonishment.","Qiao Chuchu suppressed the sourness in her throat and forced her professional, grotesque smile: \"You'll always be my brothers. I'll die before your eyes, so you'll never forget me for all eternity.\"","She looked back at the \"endless abyss\" behind her.","[Holy crap, it's so high! I don't want to jump! Will I be splattered all over?!]","[But after I jump, I'll become a billionaire in another world! Just endure it!!!]","Pei Yuan: \"?\"","What did he just hear?","The third brother beside him shook his head in confusion: \"Am I hearing things? I thought I heard Qiao Chuchu's voice in my head.\"","Pei Yuan looked at him in shock.","The seventh brother was stunned: \"I heard it too, something about becoming a billionaire!\"","Standing at the height, Qiao Chuchu couldn't hear their discussion due to the strong wind. She shouted: \"I'm leaving, brothers!\"","The seven men watched her in shock.","For some reason, she felt their expressions seemed to contain something else.","She smiled tearfully with reluctance: \"Goodbye forever.\"","[With billions in assets, I'll be a happy rich lady, never having to be controlled by others. Although my brothers will meet tragic ends... well... it won't be my concern anymore. Goodbye, this novel world.]","Qiao Chuchu closed her eyes and gently leaned backward.","Memories flooded her mind like a slideshow.","She remembered running toward her seven brothers with open arms on tiny legs.","Now she was falling from the rooftop.","She would never see them again.","Qiao Chuchu closed her eyes, a tear sliding down her cheek as her body fell backward, experiencing free fall.","Suddenly, her falling body jerked to a stop, both arms seized by powerful grips!","She opened her eyes in pain, meeting Pei Yuan and her other brothers' somewhat maniacal expressions!","\"Tell us more about how we'll meet tragic ends?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","[Did I accidentally say my thoughts out loud?]","Pei Yuan raised an eyebrow sharply.","Inner thoughts?","These were her inner thoughts?","He exchanged glances with his brothers as they deliberately pulled her up.","The System urgently said: [Host, struggle! If you miss this timing, you won't be able to return!]","Qiao Chuchu came to her senses and tried to slap Pei Yuan's face: \"Let me die!\"","Pei Yuan ignored her as he and his brothers carefully pulled her up.","[What's wrong with these people?! I've been so horrible yet they still want to save me?]","[Although I'm reluctant to leave, I want those billions more!!!]","For some reason, she felt their grip on her tighten even more!","Qiao Chuchu was pulled up looking ashen-faced.","She knelt on the ground, looking at their immaculate leather shoes before raising her head in a daze: \"You saved me, you must care about me, you love me, you want to marry me.\"","Pei Yuan frowned in disgust: \"Say more and I'll shut your mouth.\"","Qiao Chuchu retorted: \"How will you shut it? With your sexy lips?\"","Pei Yuan: \"...Go ahead and jump.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"Gladly!!\"","She immediately made a flying leap toward the stairs!","Pei Xun reacted quickly, pouncing to catch her and pinning her to the ground!","She was pressed down like a ball under him!!","Qiao Chuchu wailed in despair: \"Help! Please just let me die!\"","[If I don't die now, I won't be able to return! How can I survive in this world if I can't go back! I've offended all of them beyond redemption!]"]},{"number":2,"title":"Chapter 2: Let Me Die I Want to Be a Millionaire","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu opened her eyes in despair and thought to herself: \"System, are you there? This isn't going according to plan!\"","The original script was supposed to go like this: she would jump down, and before anyone could react to grab her, she would fall to her death.","Because these people all thought she wouldn't dare to die.","After all, the old her often used suicide attempts to get their attention.","But what happened this time?","[Weren't you supposed to let me fall to my death?! Why did these people manage to grab me?]","[System, why aren't you responding? Don't tell me you're trying to back out of our deal? No way, right? No way?]","No one answered her.","She heard the system's voice coming through intermittently, then suddenly, it went silent.","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","Ten years.","Her mind had never been this quiet before.","She awkwardly looked at the man pinning her down.","Pei Yuan looked down at her, his gaze full of meaning.","The other brothers also watched her vigilantly.","Suddenly, Qiao Chuchu felt overwhelmed with grief and burst into tears!","[It's over, the system malfunctioned. If I can't go back, the Pei family will go bankrupt in a year! These seven men will meet terrible ends, and so will I!!]","The seven men: \"????\"","Fourth Pei couldn't hold back and wanted to question Qiao Chuchu.","The eldest, Pei Yuan, quickly grabbed him and pulled him aside: \"Stay calm.\"","Fourth Pei anxiously said: \"Big brother, this girl says we'll meet terrible ends and that we'll go bankrupt. Shouldn't we get to the bottom of this?\"","Pei Yuan looked at the distraught Qiao Chuchu and warned in a low voice: \"Don't forget, we're hearing her inner thoughts, and she's bound to a system. We don't know what consequences there might be if we question her about it.\"","Seventh Pei said: \"I know about systems, I read novels all the time.\"","All the brothers turned to look at him in unison.","Seventh Pei explained: \"In novels, systems bind themselves to protagonists, making them do various tasks. Once the tasks are completed, they can receive their promised rewards. If we interfere with the system, it might cause this world to collapse, and then we'd all be done for.\"","He paused: \"Qiao Chuchu's reward must be returning to her original world as a trillion-dollar heiress.\"","The second brother pondered: \"So what has Qiao Chuchu done?\"","The seven brothers lowered their heads in thought, remembering all of Qiao Chuchu's outrageous actions in the past, their faces gradually darkening.","If they were to count, there were too many instances to keep track of.","\"I don't believe it!!\" Sixth Pei objected: \"Qiao Chuchu wanted to have all seven of us to herself. She's had ulterior motives towards us since puberty. I just don't believe she acted this way because of some system's control.\"","Pei Yuan thought for a moment, his eyes flashing with insight: \"Let's test it then.\"","Qiao Chuchu's legs were too weak to stand, so she crawled toward the edge of the building.","She had to get down today, even if she had to crawl!","Suddenly, someone grabbed her ankle.","Qiao Chuchu turned back in despair, meeting Pei Yuan's deep gaze.","He held onto her ankle, looking at her seriously: \"Do you really like us that much?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","Pei Yuan glanced at his six brothers behind him: \"If you really like us that much, choose one of us seven brothers. Let's see who you want to marry, how about that?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"Huh?\"","Huh??","HUH???!","She gaped, stammering and unable to speak, her gaze sweeping across the faces of the seven brothers as she mumbled in shock: \"Whoever I choose will marry me?\"","Pei Yuan nodded.","The six brothers behind him reluctantly nodded as well.","Qiao Chuchu felt her mouth twitching as she pointed at Pei Yuan: \"Then... if I choose you, would you be willing?\"","Pei Yuan's eyes darkened: \"I'll take you to look at engagement rings and wedding dresses right now.\"","Qiao Chuchu froze.","Qiao Chuchu turned around.","Qiao Chuchu leaped down like she was flying!","[Ahhhhhhhhhhh I don't want to get married! I'd rather die than marry any of them!!!]","Pei Yuan, like a predator waiting to strike, pounced and pinned Qiao Chuchu down again!","Qiao Chuchu felt the male force restraining her and screamed in panic!","\"Don't touch me!!!\"","Pei Yuan effortlessly held her down, cradling her head: \"Calm down, Qiao Chuchu!\"","Qiao Chuchu ignored him and slapped Pei Yuan hard across the face!","\"SLAP!!!\"","The other six Pei brothers were stunned.","Qiao Chuchu was also shocked, staring in disbelief at the red handprint forming on Pei Yuan's face.","Pei Yuan's facial muscles twitched, his eyes looking like they could tear her apart.","\"Have you calmed down now?\"","Qiao Chuchu's lips trembled, her throat letting out a whimper like a small animal.","[I'm done for, I hit Big Brother, he's going to chop me into pieces!]","[No, wait, he was trying to force me, why should I let him chop me up? I should be the one chopping up his little birdie, that shameless jerk!]","Pei Yuan: \"?\"","Suppressed laughter sounded from behind him.","He turned back warily.","All six brothers were covering their mouths, their shoulders shaking violently.","Seventh Pei cheekily mouthed: \"Big brother, do you have a little birdie?\"","Pei Yuan: \"I do not!!\"","Qiao Chuchu came to her senses, looking at Pei Yuan in shock.","Pei Yuan's face gradually darkened as he pressed down on her: \"Qiao Chuchu, I was just testing you earlier. Of course I don't want to and won't marry you. Now I know you don't actually want to marry me, you're just being unreasonable. From now on, no more acting out. Stay with us, and I'll continue to take care of you.\"","Qiao Chuchu was stunned: \"Why?\"","Pei Yuan's eyes darkened as he looked at her with exasperation: \"Because you're our family.\"","[But they're about to go bankrupt, aren't they? In a year, they'll all die on the streets. They can barely take care of themselves, yet they still want to take care of me?]","Pei Yuan's expression grew even more severe as he pulled her up from the ground: \"Don't worry, our family won't go bankrupt. I can take care of you until death.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","[Can Pei Yuan hear my thoughts? How did he know I was thinking about bankruptcy?]","Pei Yuan looked down at her coldly and snorted.","As for the bankruptcy matter, he would find a solution from her inner thoughts.","He would absolutely protect the entire Pei family.","Pei Yuan grabbed her arm: \"Come on, let's go home.\"","Qiao Chuchu followed behind him in a daze, while the other brothers naturally surrounded her, watching her from the corners of their eyes.","She was surrounded in the center, staring at Pei Yuan's straight back.","She felt something had changed.","But somehow, some things hadn't changed at all.","Only their gazes toward her had less disgust and more suspicion and wariness.","Could it be... they had forgiven her unreasonable behavior once again?","[No, no, that's not the point. The point is, does my trillion-dollar assets deal still count?!]","[If I can't go back, what was the point of all my years of effort? After all, I worked hard to give up on love, studied all sorts of self-defense techniques that a single wealthy woman should know... Was it all for nothing?!!]","The seven brothers' eyelids twitched as they wordlessly took out their phones.","Qiao Chuchu hung her head pitifully, wearing an expression of 'having lost trillion-dollar assets' dejection.","Suddenly, her phone rang.","She picked up her phone and saw a transfer notification message.","Then her phone chimed seven more times in succession.","[User Pei Yuan has transferred 500,000,000 yuan to you.]","[User Pei Si has transferred 500,000,000 yuan to you.]","[User Pei...]","Each of the seven brothers had transferred her five hundred million?!","She looked at them in shock: \"You all?\"","Pei Yuan led her into the elevator and pressed the button for the first floor: \"As long as you stay alive and behave yourself, we'll give you money every month.\"","Second brother Pei Che gave her a disdainful look: \"So you don't need to keep trying to die. As long as you're obedient, you'll become a trillion-dollar heiress eventually.\""]},{"number":3,"title":"Chapter 3: The Brothers Who Give Allowance Are a Bit Handsome","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu held her phone, her mouth slightly open, and suddenly felt a lump in her throat.","[The brothers are so handsome!!]","[They look so cool giving me pocket money!]","[Wuwuwuwu... even though I have such good brothers, I have to hurt them. I'm really sorry.]","Her inner voice even had a crying tone: [They are the family members who love me the most.]","The group felt a twinge of sadness as their gazes met.","If Qiao Chuchu was really being controlled by the system to do those things...","They would forgive her.","[If I can't go back and the system stops coming for me, I'll stay with them through thick and thin. We can convert this money into gold bars. After our family goes bankrupt in a year, we'll still have some money. With my brothers' money-making skills, it's possible to make a comeback. After all, they're very smart and know how to earn money.]","The brothers' lips curved slightly upward.","They had thought she was heartless, but hearing this, she seemed quite conscientious.","[But— after everything I've done to them, they're still giving me money?]","Qiao Chuchu had a sudden revelation: \"Did you buy insurance for me?\"","The brothers: \"?\"","Qiao Chuchu grew increasingly paranoid: \"You're not planning to have me die in an accident, are you? Is that why you're being so nice to me?\"","Pei Yuan: \"...\"","The others: \"...\"","Indeed, years of estrangement couldn't be fixed overnight.","Third Pei brother, Pei Youchuan, knocked her head hard: \"Shut up, you idiot!\"","Finally, the elevator reached the first floor.","Pei Yuan dragged her out of the elevator.","She struggled: \"I can walk by myself!\"","Pei Yuan ignored her: \"Aren't you worried we'll kill you? If I hold onto you, I can protect you if anything happens, then you won't die.\"","Without thinking, Qiao Chuchu asked: \"Then did you buy insurance for yourself?\"","Pei Yuan: \"?\"","The others: \"?\"","Just how obsessed is she with insurance!","Pei Yuan was furious and forcefully kept her by his side: \"We haven't looked after you for so many years, and you've grown up so strangely. When we get back, I need to thoroughly examine what kind of twisted person you've become.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","Because of her many questionable actions, she and her brothers no longer lived together.","In recent years, they had even stopped giving her money.","It was because during New Year's, she had worn a sexy spaghetti strap dress and acted flirtatiously in front of them, angering them so much that they cut off her living expenses and never spent New Year's with her again.","So she only appeared before them when her presence was required.","Because in their eyes, she was a psychotic yandere, they were reluctant to meet with her.","She didn't think she was psychotic; rather, she thought herself clever for gradually understanding the seven brothers' preferences and temperaments under the system's commands.","Whenever it was their birthday, she would precisely give them gifts they liked.","The seven brothers' only reaction to receiving these gifts was being thoroughly creeped out.","Qiao Chuchu anxiously followed Pei Yuan out of the lobby.","A coquettish crying voice came from another direction: \"I said I don't want money! I just want dignity!!!\"","Qiao Chuchu's ears perked up!","[Could this be the female lead who has my seven brothers head over heels?!]","The seven men paused their steps and uniformly looked at Qiao Chuchu.","Female lead?","Qiao Chuchu excitedly peered toward the source of the voice. She wanted to run over but noticed her brothers were still beside her, and immediately lost interest.","She had just made a suicide attempt, so they probably wouldn't let her wander off, right?","What if she used her old method?","Qiao Chuchu's eyes darted around, and she coquettishly clung to Pei Yuan's arm: \"Gege~ Let me sit with you later!~ Let's get close close close!~\"","Pei Yuan's face turned ashen as he quickly pulled his arm away: \"What are you doing?!\"","Qiao Chuchu couldn't hide the glee in her eyes: \"Oh my, since brother doesn't like me touching him, let's go our separate ways then!\"","[Hahahahaha I knew this trick would work every time!~]","Pei Yuan: \"?\"","Qiao Chuchu ran towards the voice!","[Off to find the female lead!~]","Pei Yuan: \"???\"","Second Pei stood beside Pei Yuan, unable to resist teasing: \"Brother, she really has you figured out.\"","Pei Yuan glared at him with a dark face: \"Don't pretend, I don't believe you're not disgusted.\"","Second Pei shrugged: \"I actually don't mind it. I quite like it when little sister acts cute with her brothers, but that's acting cute, not deliberately seducing.\"","Pei Yuan: \"...\"","Qiao Chuchu was definitely trying to seduce just now!","The worst part was that she thought seducing him would help her avoid him!","Pei Yuan's gaze grew sharp: \"Come on, let's follow her and see.\"","The brothers walked a few steps and found Qiao Chuchu eavesdropping.","Qiao Chuchu was sneakily pressed against the wall, looking like a big toad.","The seven: \"...That pose is really unsightly.\"","[So this is the woman who has my seven brothers completely enchanted?]","The seven: \"?\"","They decisively joined Qiao Chuchu in being big toads.","What entered their sight was a playful ponytailed girl, defiantly raising her head to confront a man in a black coat.","The man was quite handsome, surrounded by an unapproachable coldness as he looked down at the female lead condescendingly.","[Looks like this man is the male lead of this novel.]","The seven brothers followed her gaze and were somewhat surprised.","It was actually Ji Yanchuan?","He was an acquaintance of theirs.","Qiao Chuchu pouted: [So the male lead looks like this? Not as handsome as my brothers.]","The seven men behind her were stunned, their lips curving slightly upward.","[Now I'm just waiting for the female lead to turn around so I can see what she looks like. That's the face my brothers fell in love with at first sight!]","The men's expressions grew serious as they watched intently.","Finally, the high-ponytailed girl turned her head tearfully, revealing her true appearance.","The girl was quite cute, with tears in her eyes as she bit her lower lip, seemingly trying to swallow her grievances.","But—","The seven: \"?\"","Is that all?","This type of girl that you can find anywhere on TV made them fall in love at first sight?","This appearance wasn't even half as good as Qiao Chuchu's.","When Qiao Chuchu was in school, she was the acknowledged school beauty.","With such a gem before them, how could they possibly fall for the female lead's ordinary looks?","Sixth brother Pei Mu whispered: \"This female lead just has a typical cute Japanese girl look, while Qiao Chuchu is a beauty who perfectly combines sweetness and allure. What was the author thinking, choosing this ordinary girl as the female lead instead of our sister?\"","Fifth brother Pei Ci said with disdain: \"How could Ji Yanchuan possibly be worthy of Qiao Chuchu? Unless I'm dead, Ji Yanchuan won't get to marry my sister!\"","The others nodded.","Qiao Chuchu also nodded: [This female lead has a quality that makes people want to protect and bully her, and her cute sweet appearance is exactly my brothers' type. No wonder they fell in love at first sight.]","The seven men looked at the back of Qiao Chuchu's head with extreme absurdity.","They did not fall in love at first sight, okay?!","They didn't!!!","Qiao Chuchu poked her head out a bit further, her eyes lighting up with excitement!","[Oh! The female supporting character is here! My favorite Lin Qing is here!!]","The seven: \"?\"","There's also a female supporting character?","And it's Lin Qing?"]},{"number":4,"title":"Chapter 4: The Supporting Actress Lin Qing Can Also Hear Chu Chu's Thoughts","paragraphs":["Lin Qing was a classmate of Third Pei, one of the Pei brothers.","Due to their similar family backgrounds and compatible personalities, she was Third Pei's close friend from middle school through high school.","Unfortunately, after Lin Qing got engaged to the Male Lead, she gradually cut off contact with her male friends.","Lin Qing, wearing a stylish motorcycle outfit with high boots, strode over to the Male Lead with her long legs: \"I'm ready, we can go now~\"","The Male Lead nodded and was about to pass by the Female Lead to leave.","The Female Lead deliberately spread her arms to block them, with a righteous expression: \"You can't leave. You haven't said whether my friend will be fired or not. Although she made a mistake, she knows she was wrong. She can't lose this job - her parents are in the ICU waiting for money for treatment.\"","Lin Qing finally turned her attention to the Female Lead, frowning in confusion: \"And you are?\"","[This is your future love rival! Never mind that your childhood sweetheart fiancé is dating you now, but after today his attention will be completely occupied by this little radish. Of course, I'm not the one who came up with that nickname - it's your fiancé who calls her that. Your fiancé's pet name for the Female Lead is little radish!]","Lin Qing: \"?\"","Who's speaking?","She looked around and her gaze fixed on Qiao Chuchu's half-exposed face.","Qiao Chuchu quickly withdrew like a hamster!","Lin Qing: \"?\"","Was that Qiao Chuchu, the adopted daughter of the Pei family?","And did Qiao Chuchu's voice just echo in her head?","Lin Qing looked toward Ji Yanchuan.","Qiao Chuchu's head peeked out again like a little hamster.","[That was close, almost got discovered.]","Lin Qing: \"...\"","No, she had already been discovered.","But how could she hear Qiao Chuchu's thoughts?","Lin Qing recalled what was just said, and experimentally linked arms with Ji Yanchuan, pretending to ask: \"What's going on here?\"","[Ahhhhhhh sister don't link arms with him!!!]","Lin Qing was startled into withdrawing her hand!","[Phew~ good thing she let go. Beautiful sister, although I like you, from today onwards, your life is going downhill.]","Lin Qing: \"????\"","Downhill?","How could she, the young lady of the Lin family, possibly go downhill??","Qiao Chuchu sighed regretfully: [Even though you're the one who grew up with the Male Lead, childhood sweethearts with an engagement and everything, the Male Lead ends up emotionally cheating with the Female Lead. When he's with the Female Lead, he even says he's never experienced the feeling of love before.]","[The Female Lead knows the Male Lead has a fiancée but still confesses to him, saying it's brave to pursue love. When you get jealous and angry, the Male Lead says you're being unreasonable, that they're just friends. In the end, you go crazy and try to run over the Female Lead with a car, end up in prison, and commit suicide after getting out! Meanwhile, the Male Lead and Female Lead have two kids in three years!]","Lin Qing: \"!!!\"","She suddenly started retching!","The Male Lead Ji Yanchuan worriedly held her: \"What's wrong, Lin Qing?\"","\"Don't touch me.\" Lin Qing pushed him away, gritting her teeth: \"I feel sick.\"","Pei Yuan and the others felt gloomy.","It seemed Lin Qing shared their fate as supporting characters with bad endings in the novel.","Pei Yuan thought seriously.","Was Qiao Chuchu's inner voice correct?","What if it was just an illusion?","Lin Qing also regained her composure, staying vigilant.","She couldn't be certain that what Qiao Chuchu said was true.","What if she was just hearing things?","Just then, a group of people carrying things rushed past behind the Female Lead: \"Sorry, please make way, make way!\"","Qiao Chuchu's eyes widened!","[Here it comes! The scene where the Male Lead and Female Lead share their first kiss!]","[Even though his fiancée Lin Qing is right behind him, the Male Lead instinctively chooses to protect the Female Lead Xia Xuechun, and then they trip and fall into a kiss out of nowhere!]","Lin Qing and Pei Yuan suddenly became alert.","The other six brothers poked their heads out with wide eyes.","They all had the same thought!","This was the moment to verify if Qiao Chuchu's inner voice was true!","The panicked people brushed past Xia Xuechun, clearly heading toward Lin Qing.","Lin Qing could have dodged, but she didn't.","She was intently watching her fiancé Ji Yanchuan.","Ji Yanchuan noticed she was about to be hit, but when he heard Xia Xuechun's scream, he turned back and pulled Xia Xuechun into his arms!","They both fell!","The rushing people passed by like a gust of wind.","Leaving the hallway in dead silence.","What everyone saw was the Male Lead Ji Yanchuan pressing the petite Xia Xuechun beneath him, their lips meeting as if deliberately aligned.","Ji Yanchuan and Xia Xuechun looked like they'd seen a ghost!","Pei Yuan and the other six brothers also looked like they'd seen a ghost.","What Qiao Chuchu said was true.","She had accurately predicted what would happen next!","So what would happen next?","Qiao Chuchu couldn't contain her excitement!","[It's amazing to see this happen in person! Next, the Female Lead Xia Xuechun will slap the Male Lead Ji Yanchuan, then Ji Yanchuan will angrily call Xia Xuechun a little radish, and then Xia Xuechun will run away crying!]","\"Slap!\" came the sound!","Xia Xuechun slapped Ji Yanchuan!","Xia Xuechun stood up crying: \"You jerk, that was my first kiss!\"","Ji Yanchuan wiped his mouth in disgust, saying in his deep voice: \"I didn't want to kiss you either, little radish head!\"","Xia Xuechun's face turned bright red, and she ran away covering her mouth in humiliation.","Everyone who could hear the inner voice drew in a sharp breath!","It was exactly the same!","Absolutely identical!","[Now it's Female Lead #2 Lin Qing's turn.]","Lin Qing snapped out of her shock.","What should she...?","What should she do...?","[Lin Qing will be consumed by jealousy, help Ji Yanchuan up, worry about his condition, and harbor hatred for the Female Lead.]","Hearing this, Lin Qing let out an incredulous laugh, cracked her knuckles, and helped Ji Yanchuan up.","Qiao Chuchu couldn't help but peek out.","The brothers also peeked out.","All eight siblings spread out behind the wall like peacocks watching the show!","They saw Lin Qing raise her hand, press it against Ji Yanchuan's mouth, and say in a dark tone: \"Ji Yanchuan, she's a little radish, do you know what I am?\"","Ji Yanchuan met her gaze in confusion: \"What?\"","Lin Qing punched him directly!","\"I'm your mother!!!\"","Ji Yanchuan fell to the ground with a thud!","Qiao Chuchu couldn't help but exclaim: \"Holy crap! This isn't following the plot!\"","The Male Lead Ji Yanchuan was even more shocked than her, pressing his reddened mouth: \"Lin Qing, what are you doing?!\"","Lin Qing stepped on his stomach, looking down at him with disdain: \"Ji Yanchuan, your mouth is no different from having kissed dog shit now. I, Lin Qing, don't want secondhand goods. Our engagement is off.\"","Ji Yanchuan stared at her in disbelief, unable to process: \"What did you s—\"","Lin Qing kicked him hard!","Ji Yanchuan curled up on the ground in pain, unable to speak.","Qiao Chuchu was confused and quickly hid back, processing what she had just witnessed.","[Why is the plot different? Lin Qing is supposed to love Ji Yanchuan the most and would never get angry with him, how could she suddenly hit him?]","[But I have to say... that was so cool!]","[Such a cool sister, that felt so good! Hahahahahahaha!]","Lin Qing's lips curled into a slight smile as she strode over to Qiao Chuchu.","The smile froze on Qiao Chuchu's face as she looked up to meet Lin Qing's intrigued gaze.","Lin Qing smiled at her: \"You're very cute, you know that?\"","Qiao Chuchu gasped, dazzled by her beauty and stammered: \"You're beautiful too, you know that?\"","Lin Qing laughed and extended her hand: \"Then it seems we're kindred spirits. I'm Lin Qing, can we be friends?\"","Her narrow eyes narrowed like a fox's as she smiled meaningfully: \"I believe we'll become very good friends.\""]},{"number":5,"title":"Chapter 5: Pei Yuan Says They Are Not Sister Con, Please Don't Misunderstand","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu's brain short-circuited.","[What?! This beautiful big sister actually wants to be friends with me? I thought I'd never have friends in my life!]","Because of her reputation as a \"brother-obsessed\" girl, no one her age wanted to be friends with her.","This was the first time someone wanted to be her friend!","Qiao Chuchu was bubbling with excitement.","[Lin Qing has always been the beautiful girl I admired, and as the male lead's fiancée, it's not right that she got replaced by that homewrecker. A girl like her deserves a better life!]","Lin Qing was surprised.","To be honest, she approached Qiao Chuchu because she valued her ability to know inside information.","But... she didn't expect Qiao Chuchu would think of her this way in her heart.","She was a sincere little sister.","Lin Qing's eyes sparkled, and she couldn't help but become more genuine.","Then, she heard Qiao Chuchu's excited inner thoughts—","[Big sister has such nice abs, if we become close friends, can I touch them? I've never touched abs before.]","Lin Qing raised an eyebrow, her smile becoming more alluring as she unzipped her motorcycle jacket, revealing her slim waist underneath.","Her perfectly defined abs were clearly visible to Qiao Chuchu.","Qiao Chuchu's eyes nearly popped out of their sockets!","[Holy crap! What's going on?! Is this a gift from heaven?]","Lin Qing curved her lips, coaxing gently: \"If you're willing to be my friend, you can touch my abs.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"!!!!!!\"","[She actually knows what I want! She understands me! She loves me! She must like me!!]","The brothers behind her: \"...\"","It was confirmed that Lin Qing could also hear Qiao Chuchu's thoughts.","But was Qiao Chuchu really so easily impressed by just some abs?","How ridiculous, which of the seven brothers didn't have abs?","Pei Yuan looked at Third Brother: \"Pei Youchuan!\"","Third Brother Pei Youchuan stood at attention.","Pei Yuan: \"Take off your shirt!\"","Without a word, Pei Youchuan started unbuttoning.","Under his white shirt was an impressive eight-pack that looked incredibly touchable!","And with a healthy tan to boot!","Pei Youchuan smiled confidently: \"Chuchu.\"","Qiao Chuchu turned around, her eyes wide as saucers!","Pei Youchuan hooked his thumb in his waistband, proudly showing off his muscular physique: \"Look at what your brother's got?\"","As he spoke, Pei Youchuan cockily raised an eyebrow at Lin Qing.","Lin Qing suddenly understood something and asked in surprise: \"Could you all also hear—\"","Pei Youchuan smiled mysteriously: \"Yes, exactly that.\"","Lin Qing: \"!\"","Damn it!","Didn't that mean their objectives had collided?","She had originally planned to keep Qiao Chuchu by her side.","Lin Qing felt somewhat annoyed.","Neither group spoke, and the atmosphere gradually became tense.","Qiao Chuchu was now a precious resource since she knew their future paths.","They would never let go!","Everyone simultaneously looked at Qiao Chuchu, waiting for her final judgment.","Pei Youchuan puffed out his chest and cleared his throat: \"Your brother works out every day, there isn't a single imperfect muscle on my body. Look at Third Brother's physique, these V-lines, aren't they much better than mere abs?\"","Lin Qing glanced at Pei Youchuan's muscles.","...They were indeed impressive.","They looked like they'd feel nice to touch.","Feeling inferior, she put her clothes back on.","Qiao Chuchu: \"? Third Brother, are you a pervert?\"","Pei Youchuan: \"?\"","Others: \"?\"","Lin Qing's eyes brightened as she asked in surprise: \"What's wrong, don't you like your brother's abs?\"","Qiao Chuchu said with disgust: \"Who would like their own brother's abs? I'm not a pervert—no, I mean, precious things should be kept hidden for private appreciation, right? I don't want anyone to see my brothers' abs.\"","[That was close! I almost forgot I'm supposed to be playing the brother-obsessed role. I nearly slipped up!]","[Even though the system isn't by my side right now, I should maintain my character until it returns, otherwise it might punish me again!]","Lin Qing's eye twitched.","So it was the system that made Qiao Chuchu brother-obsessed.","She looked at Pei Youchuan with interest: \"Third Brother Pei, looks like you've failed. Those muscles of yours have zero appeal.\"","Pei Youchuan choked, retorting indignantly: \"You're the one who failed! You just don't know how to appreciate this!\"","Qiao Chuchu secretly rolled her eyes dramatically.","[Appreciate? Please, can someone lend me a pair of eyes that haven't seen their brothers' bare stomachs?!]","Pei Youchuan's mouth twitched as he glared at Qiao Chuchu in annoyance.","It seemed his dear sister had always been two-faced!","Noticing Pei Youchuan's resentful gaze, Qiao Chuchu immediately put on a professional fake smile: \"Brother is so handsome, I'll look more when we get home.\"","[As if I'll look when we get home!]","Pei Youchuan gritted his teeth as he slowly buttoned up his shirt: \"Qiao Chuchu, I'm warning you, if you don't look, I'll gouge out your eyeballs and put them on the table to make them look.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","[What's wrong with him? Usually, he can't wait to fly away when standing next to me, but today he wants me to look at his abs? He might as well blind me, then I won't have to wash my eyes even if he strips naked in front of me.]","The other brothers: \"Pfft!!\"","Damn, she really went there with the naked comment.","Pei Youchuan's face reddened with anger as he lowered his voice: \"What are you laughing at? You don't know what she's thinking about you guys in her head!\"","The other brothers' smiles froze as they began to realize.","Right.","Qiao Chuchu was only pursuing them because the system forced her to.","She didn't actually like them at all.","Was she talking trash about them in her mind?!","The brothers' internal alarms went off!","Lin Qing smiled slyly, shaking her head: \"Looks like among all of you, only I've earned genuine appreciation.\"","Qiao Chuchu asked confused: \"What do you mean, Sister Lin Qing?\"","Lin Qing shook her head affectionately: \"Nothing, let's add each other as friends.\"","Qiao Chuchu nodded, but as she was about to scan the code, she suddenly remembered her profile picture.","It was a Q-version family portrait of all eight of them.","She drew it herself.","Her infamous reputation as a brother-obsessed weirdo was well-known throughout Lan City's social circles.","She didn't want Lin Qing to think she was a pervert and lose this hard-won friendship.","Qiao Chuchu looked awkwardly at Lin Qing: \"Um... Sister Lin Qing, you don't mind my... personal preferences?\"","Lin Qing remained composed: \"You mean the brother-obsessed thing?\"","Qiao Chuchu nodded self-consciously.","Lin Qing typed casually on her phone: \"It doesn't matter, after all, you and your brothers are mutually devoted. They're pretty sister-obsessed themselves.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","The seven Pei brothers: \"?\"","Pei Yuan scolded: \"Lin Qing, stop slandering us!\"","Lin Qing shrugged indifferently: \"Well, you can call it slander if you want.\"","Pei Yuan was speechless but warned Qiao Chuchu sternly: \"Don't believe what she says, understand?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","[I wouldn't believe it anyway, after all, you guys don't even look at me during holidays, and you cut off my living expenses for several years. How could people like that be sister-obsessed?]","Pei Yuan: \"...\"","They cut off her allowance because she danced in front of them wearing a sexy camisole during New Year's!","They never stopped paying for her food, tuition, driver, and housekeeper!","Pei Yuan wanted to argue.","But he decided against it.","It was better if she misunderstood, otherwise this girl would be overjoyed.","However...","If Qiao Chuchu was no longer controlled by the system, would she still be that clingy, dramatic, unreasonably spoiled little sister?"]},{"number":6,"title":"Chapter 6: Qiao Chuchu's Little Sister Really Knows How to Talk","paragraphs":["Just then, Pei Yuan's phone rang.","[Mr. Pei, the banquet starts in an hour. Should I come pick you up?]","Pei Yuan frowned: \"The banquet is about to begin, let's hurry and change clothes.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"? Banquet.\"","Lin Qing enthusiastically put her arm around her shoulders: \"Little Chuchu, don't tell me you didn't know? Today is Old Mr. Zhao's birthday banquet, we all need to attend.\"","Qiao Chuchu remembered.","How could she have forgotten Grandpa Zhao's birthday banquet?","The Zhao family was one of the prominent families in Lan City, and Grandpa Zhao had always been very caring towards her since she was little, being a kind elder.","But for the sake of causing drama, she had deliberately chosen to attempt suicide two hours before Grandpa Zhao's birthday banquet, causing not only her brothers to miss the event but also shocking Grandpa Zhao with news of her suicide attempt on his birthday, dealing him quite a blow.","She had been led by the nose by the system for so many years, completely conditioned by it.","Every day she only thought about how to complete tasks, completely forgetting about the harm she caused to those around her.","Qiao Chuchu looked guiltily at Pei Yuan and the others.","[I almost caused my family to miss Grandpa Zhao's banquet.]","Her brothers looked at her in surprise.","Qiao Chuchu lowered her head: [It's strange, now I feel like I can save my family's fate, even though I haven't done anything.]","The eight people, including Lin Qing, awkwardly looked away upon hearing this.","No, she had done plenty.","Lin Qing hugged Qiao Chuchu and said cheerfully: \"Let me borrow your stylist, and lend me your dress too, I probably won't have time for mine.\"","Qiao Chuchu felt a bit awkward: \"But I don't have a dress.\"","Pei Yuan: \"No, you do.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","Pei Yuan looked down at her: \"Old Mr. Zhao specifically asked for you to come, I've prepared the gift for you, and the dresses too. I prepared several - as long as you haven't gained weight, they should fit perfectly.\"","Qiao Chuchu was stunned.","Pei Yuan even knew her size?","The system had never revealed such details.","Lin Qing beamed: \"That's great, I'll borrow one of Chuchu's dresses.\"","Pei Youchuan standing nearby showed his disapproval: \"Not lending to you.\"","Lin Qing's smile instantly vanished: \"Pei Third, are you asking for trouble?\"","Pei Youchuan remained unfazed and retorted: \"Lin Qing, don't forget, you chose love over friendship first. I was your best friend, but after you got together with Ji Yanchuan, you completely ignored me. Now you come looking for us again? I'm not having it!\"","Lin Qing's breath caught, hit right where it hurt, her eyes immediately turning red.","But she quickly averted her gaze, and the thick-headed Pei Youchuan didn't notice at all, even continuing to grumble with his arms crossed.","\"You toss your friend aside when dating, then pick me back up when you're not. Am I just a dog in your eyes?\"","Lin Qing felt a lump in her throat, guilt and sadness surging up together, leaving her unable to argue back. She could only mumble: \"Alright, I get it.\"","As soon as she finished speaking, Qiao Chuchu jumped up like a leopard and gave Pei Youchuan a smack: \"Shut up!!\"","Qiao Chuchu was 1.6 meters tall, while Pei Youchuan was 1.91 meters.","She jumped up like a little bean, treating Pei Youchuan's head like a basketball hoop!","Pei Youchuan held the back of his head, completely bewildered: \"Qiao Chuchu, what are you doing!\"","Qiao Chuchu turned and hugged Lin Qing, \"I'm willing to lend my dress to Sister Lin Qing! What's it to you!\"","Pei Youchuan was stunned.","The sixth Pei brother was dumbfounded: \"My goodness, so Qiao Chuchu has to jump to reach Third Brother's head?\"","The other brothers were equally shocked: \"That was intense, like watching a kitten jump up to hit a tiger.\"","Qiao Chuchu really was like a cat asserting its dominance, pursing her lips hostilely at Pei Youchuan: \"Pei Youchuan, if you had a girlfriend, would you be okay with her having a really close male friend?\"","Pei Youchuan was taken aback.","Qiao Chuchu continued: \"If I had a boyfriend, would you be okay with him having a female friend who's closer to him than I am?\"","Pei Youchuan answered without thinking: \"I'd break that guy's legs!\"","Qiao Chuchu nodded approvingly: \"See, you wouldn't accept it either.\"","Pei Youchuan fumed: \"The reason I can't accept it is because someone would dare to date you - I'll break the legs of anyone who tries to date you!\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...Huh?\"","Pei Youchuan didn't think there was anything wrong with what he said, and awkwardly looked at Lin Qing: \"I was too harsh earlier, I'm sorry.\"","Lin Qing's eyes widened!","To think this stubborn mule Pei Youchuan would actually apologize after just a few words from Qiao Chuchu?!","This was the same guy who, when cornered in the bathroom by senior students in his youth, got kicked until his face was bloody but still wouldn't beg for mercy - he even took a mouthful of toilet water and spat it in the senior's face!","Lin Qing looked at Qiao Chuchu in shock, \"This stubborn mule must have saved the galaxy in his past life to have such a sweet sister like you.\"","Qiao Chuchu was confused, and got another kiss from Lin Qing!","Lin Qing's eyes sparkled: \"Thank you for speaking up for me, sister will look after you from now on!\"","Chuchu was puzzled: \"How will you look after me?\"","Lin Qing grinned mischievously: \"My family owns a media company, we have several popular young actors signed with us, I can introduce you to them.\"","Qiao Chuchu grabbed Lin Qing's hand: \"Then please definitely look after me, sister!\"","Lin Qing laughed heartily.","Pei Yuan pulled Qiao Chuchu away with a dark face: \"Don't embarrass our Pei family at the banquet later, understood?\"","Qiao Chuchu regained her composure, nodded, feeling a bit worried.","[According to the plot, many things will happen at the banquet, but in the original script, neither I nor my brothers were there - it was just the male lead, female lead, and the second female lead Sister Lin Qing. I don't know what will happen now with our intervention.]","A dark gleam flashed in Lin Qing's eyes as she said to Pei Yuan: \"Big Brother Pei, can we talk?\"","Pei Yuan nodded, instructing Qiao Chuchu: \"At the gathering later, besides not talking nonsense, remember to stay away from the Lou father and son.\"","Qiao Chuchu became interested.","Oh right, today was the debut of the Lou father and son - the big psycho and little psycho!","These two were the characters she most wanted to meet besides the male and female leads and the second female lead!","Qiao Chuchu couldn't help but get excited!","She was really looking forward to the appearance of these psychopathic antagonists!","-","In the banquet hall before the official start, Lou Tingsi was lazily playing with a lighter on the sofa.","Light, extinguish, light, extinguish.","Beside him, Lou Yuejue wore a gloomy expression, his bored gaze sweeping across the room: \"Dad, when are we leaving here?\"","Lou Tingsi checked his watch: \"In two hours. Be good and stay put. There are several boys over there, you can go play with them.\"","Lou Yuejue glanced at the young boys playing with their phones and rolled his eyes: \"I'm not interested in people my age.\"","Lou Tingsi stopped paying attention to him and went to chat with others, gradually walking away.","Lou Yuejue sighed in boredom, his gaze freezing on one spot.","Qiao Chuchu entered the banquet hall wearing a powder pink puffy formal dress, instantly attracting everyone's attention.","Lou Yuejue stared in a daze.","He watched the delicate young girl bathed in light, dimples appearing when she smiled, her eyes as bright as stars.","He mumbled absurdly: \"Is she... a fairy?\""]},{"number":7,"title":"Chapter 7: The Mentally Ill Father and Son - Lou Tingsi Lou Yuejue","paragraphs":["Pei Yuan walked over to Qiao Chuchu's side and offered her his elbow.","She took her brother's arm, maintaining a perfectly appropriate smile while greeting people one by one.","[The advantage of being born into such a wealthy family is getting to see the world. When I return to my own world later, I won't have to worry about being deceived by these cunning rich people~]","Pei Yuan gave Qiao Chuchu a speechless look.","How could she avoid being deceived?","Qiao Chuchu remained oblivious and gave him a sweet smile: \"Brother, what's wrong?\"","Pei Yuan: \"...\"","He was blinded by Qiao Chuchu's smile.","While Qiao Chuchu smiled on the surface, she was secretly gritting her teeth.","[It hurts so much, when will these damn high heels stop rubbing my feet?!]","Pei Yuan glanced at her reddened feet: \"Go rest.\"","Qiao Chuchu was surprised: \"Eh?\"","Pei Yuan said: \"You've greeted most of the people you know. I'll handle the rest, you go sit down.\"","Qiao Chuchu's eyes widened.","[Wow! Since when did big brother become so considerate? He used to constantly nag that I wasn't ladylike enough or that I looked awful, just like a palace matron.]","Pei Yuan: \"?\"","Palace matron?","This girl always said he was the most gentle and considerate brother when she saw him, but her real evaluation was that he was like a palace matron?!","When they got home, he would have to discipline her with a ruler!","Completely unaware of her brother's indignation, Qiao Chuchu scanned the room and locked onto a boy.","Lou Yuejue caught her gaze and naturally looked away, his heart beating a bit faster.","Qiao Chuchu sat down directly beside him.","Lou Yuejue: \"!\"","His body tensed up!","Qiao Chuchu remained oblivious as she surveyed the room.","[I wonder where that Lou father and son are, if they've arrived yet.]","Lou Yuejue: \"?\"","He looked at Qiao Chuchu.","Did she say something?","Qiao Chuchu casually glanced at Lou Yuejue, a flash of amazement crossing her eyes as she nodded with a smile.","[Ah!~ What a handsome young boy! So delicate and refined!]","Lou Yuejue: \"???????\"","What's going on?","He didn't see this woman's lips move, yet he could hear her speaking?!","Could her voice travel without her opening her mouth?","Could she be a real fairy?!","Lou Yuejue asked in shock: \"Are you human?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","Lou Yuejue looked her up and down, suspicious yet serious: \"Are you not human?\"","Qiao Chuchu fell silent.","Qiao Chuchu stood up.","Qiao Chuchu walked away.","As Lou Yuejue watched Qiao Chuchu walking further away, he could still hear her voice in his mind—","[Does this child have any manners? Actually asking if I'm human or not? I really want to snap back, but I don't know whose big shot's kid he is. How annoying!]","Lou Yuejue: \"?\"","He stood up wanting to chase after her, when he suddenly heard some young girls nearby saying: \"Let me tell you, I've been reading several mind-reading novels lately, they're super good! Would you like to read them? I'll share them with you!\"","\"Yes, yes!\"","Mind reading?","Lou Yuejue pondered briefly.","Could it be that he could hear this woman's thoughts?","Lou Yuejue quickly caught up with Qiao Chuchu, and heard in his mind again—","[Where are Lou Yuejue and Lou Tingsi, this father and son pair? I'd be happy just to catch a glimpse of them from afar.]","Lou Yuejue had raised his hand to grab Qiao Chuchu but froze mid-air upon hearing this.","He had thought she looked like a fairy and wanted to talk to her, but it turned out she was just another person trying to curry favor with him and his father.","How boring.","He turned to leave.","[This might be my only chance to see this father and son pair, after all, they'll only revolve around the female lead later, and die tragically.]","Lou Yuejue: \"...\"","What?","Suddenly, Qiao Chuchu's hand was grabbed.","She turned back confused, meeting Lou Yuejue's grim expression: \"What did you just say?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"Huh?\"","She hadn't said anything.","But Lou Yuejue stared at her intently, almost maniacally: \"You said my father and I would die tragically?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","\"Lou Yuejue!\" a cold male voice rang out nearby.","Qiao Chuchu looked over to see a tall man striding towards them.","The man's hair wasn't short but rather fell on his shoulders like a wolf's tail, with loose strands falling across his forehead. Even in a suit, he maintained an air of unrestrained grace.","He had beautiful eyes, deep-set features with strong mixed-race characteristics, and his gaze was like that of a wolf fixated on its prey as he approached Qiao Chuchu step by step.","Instinct told Qiao Chuchu she should flee.","But under Lou Tingsi's gaze, her feet wouldn't move at all!","Lou Yuejue protested defiantly: \"Dad, I just heard her say—\"","\"You didn't hear anything.\" Lou Tingsi smiled without it reaching his eyes, extending his hand to Qiao Chuchu: \"Hello, I'm Lou Tingsi, and this boy is my son Lou Yuejue. I apologize for his rudeness earlier.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"!\"","[Holy crap, so these are the big psycho and little psycho!]","Lou Yuejue opened his mouth to argue!","Lou Tingsi pressed down on his shoulder!","Lou Yuejue looked at his father in confusion.","His father smiled coldly, mouthing the words: \"Shut up.\"","Lou Yuejue shuddered in fear and fell silent, lowering his head resentfully.","Dad had no idea what this woman was thinking!","She was just two-faced.","\"Hello, I'm Qiao Chuchu.\" Qiao Chuchu cautiously shook Lou Tingsi's hand, her eyes suddenly lighting up!","[Ahhhh I felt the calluses, the legendary calluses that only come from long-term gun use! So cool!~]","Lou Yuejue looked at Qiao Chuchu with a questioning expression.","Qiao Chuchu was like a little cat, composed on the surface but unable to hide the delight in her eyes.","[I have to say, this father and son pair are truly handsome, with such presence and class.]","Lou Yuejue was taken aback, his anger suddenly dissipating by half.","He looked at Lou Tingsi.","Whether it was his imagination or not, his father seemed to be smiling.","Qiao Chuchu withdrew her hand and politely nodded: \"I have matters to attend to over there, I'll take my leave now, goodbye.\"","She turned and left, her heart leaping like an excited fawn!","[Ahhh this father and son are so handsome and charismatic! These kinds of dangerous characters are exactly what makes novels exciting!]","[But... sigh...]","[Such good-looking people could do anything else, why did they have to get involved with the female lead? Lou Yuejue falls from a building trying to save the female lead and gets completely crushed, and when Lou Tingsi sees his son dead, he goes mad on the spot and tries to make the female lead join his son in death, only to end up being shot to death.]","[What a pity... they never did anything too extreme, yet met such a tragic end, purely serving as plot devices for the main couple's romance.]","Lou Yuejue grew increasingly anxious as he listened.","He would fall from a building trying to protect some woman?","And his father would be shot to death trying to avenge him?!","He was only ten years old!","How could he possibly protect a woman?!","\"Miss Qiao!\" Lou Tingsi suddenly called out.","Lou Yuejue looked at his father in surprise.","Qiao Chuchu turned back puzzled: \"Yes?\"","Lou Tingsi raised a smile, though his eyes remained cold: \"Would you do us the honor of sitting down for a chat?\""]},{"number":8,"title":"Chapter 8: Qiao Chuchu's Words Are All True","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu choked up, furrowing her brows.","Out of politeness, she should agree.","But—","[Although I quite like these dangerous characters, getting them involved in my life is definitely a no-go.]","[After all, I don't even know what dangerous business the Lou family is really involved in. The novel didn't specify, just mentioned something about the mafia. What if I get mixed up in those unspeakable things?]","\"I'm a weapons merchant, which is legal overseas. I don't deal with drugs, gambling, or prostitution,\" Lou Tingsi spoke up, his phoenix eyes twinkling as he stared at her. \"Miss Qiao, you wouldn't happen to think I'm a bad person and don't want to talk to me, would you?\"","Chuchu was startled and hurried to explain, \"No, how could I think that?\"","She felt a chill run down her spine.","[Can this guy read my thoughts? He hit the nail right on the head.]","Lou Yuejue looked at his father in surprise.","Could Dad also...","Lou Tingsi smiled meaningfully and gestured toward the sofa nearby. \"Please, have a seat.\"","Qiao Chuchu reluctantly sat down with Lou Tingsi.","Lou Yuejue sat on her left.","Lou Tingsi sat on her right.","Both subtly leaned closer to her.","She sat uncomfortably between them, enveloped in their faint tea fragrance.","[Why are these two fixating on me? According to the script, when the female lead appears, Lou Yuejue is supposed to find her warmth reminiscent of his mother's and become her devoted fanboy from then on.]","[By this point in the script, I should be dead already. This world shouldn't have any more scenes with me, so why are they seeking me out?]","Qiao Chuchu wanted to cry.","[Tsk, it's my first time talking to a psychopath. What should I say? I'm so nervous.]","Somehow, she felt the atmosphere grow even more peculiar.","Lou Tingsi handed her a glass of champagne. \"Miss Qiao, had you heard of us before?\"","Qiao Chuchu accepted the champagne with both hands and replied softly, \"I'm terribly sorry, Mr. Lou, but my brothers handle all the family matters. I'm not very knowledgeable about these things.\"","[As if! You're one of my favorite characters! Of course I know about you. I even know what color underwear you wear!]","Lou Tingsi raised an eyebrow and glanced down at Qiao Chuchu.","Qiao Chuchu stared at the bubbles in her champagne while mentally reciting: [Lou Tingsi, a Chinese resident of Country Y, showed exceptional business acumen in the family enterprise from an early age. He's been a perfect marksman since age ten, ruthless but not disloyal. Due to childhood trauma from witnessing his mother with another man and learning his younger brother wasn't his father's biological child, followed by his mother's suicide with his brother, he developed a strong aversion to women.]","[However, due to his special profession, he had to plan for the family business, so he simply used a high-quality donor egg to have his son Lou Yuejue, whom he raised single-handedly. As a result, although Lou Yuejue lacked a mother's care, he wasn't an emotionally deprived child.]","[After all, Lou Tingsi never neglected him, so Lou Yuejue is extremely dependent on his father and inherited Lou Tingsi's ruthlessness and coldness. He's practically a carbon copy of Lou Tingsi!]","Lou Yuejue couldn't help but puff out his chest.","Being compared to his father was the highest praise for him.","[Actually, apart from being slightly mentally unstable, this father-son duo doesn't have any real problems. They shouldn't have met such a fate.]","Qiao Chuchu sighed regretfully, her gaze casually sweeping across the room before locking onto the female lead in her server's uniform. Her mind immediately let out a sharp alarm—","[Ah! The female lead is here!]","Pei Yuan and the other brothers alertly looked toward the source of the sound.","The female lead is here?","Lin Qing immediately turned around.","The female lead is here?","Lou Yuejue looked toward the entrance.","The female lead is here?!","Qiao Chuchu watched Xia Xuechun's figure as she wandered through the venue with her server's tray, passing by the three of them.","She gestured: \"Hello!~\"","Xia Xuechun looked at her.","She handed her the champagne: \"Thank you for your trouble.\"","Xia Xuechun frowned almost imperceptibly, reluctantly taking the used champagne glass. Her gaze inadvertently fell on the Lou father and son, her eyes widening in amazement.","Qiao Chuchu felt a bit of secret excitement.","She had indirectly helped Lou Yuejue see the female lead, hadn't she?","Qiao Chuchu expectantly looked at Lou Yuejue.","She could finally see the legendary expression of \"sparked interest.\"","But—","Lou Yuejue's eyes were as unfocused as a yo-yo, his gaze wandering aimlessly around the room as if searching for something.","Where is she? Where's the female lead?","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","[This guy should have fallen in love at first sight with the female lead. How come he's looking elsewhere when she's right in front of him?]","Lou Yuejue looked up and finally saw Xia Xuechun.","Their eyes met.","He froze.","[Ah, they made eye contact! Lou Yuejue and the female lead made eye contact! Well, how about it? Isn't your little heart racing wildly?]","Lou Yuejue felt like he'd been struck by lightning!","Is this it?","This ordinary woman who could be found anywhere on the street is supposed to make him feel his mother's presence?","He's supposed to die for someone like her?","Is this it???!","Xia Xuechun noticed him staring at her for too long and considerately crouched down: \"Young master, would you like something to drink?\"","Lou Yuejue exploded in anger: \"Drink my ass, get lost!\"","Xia Xuechun: \"?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"! Lou Yuejue, what are you doing?\"","Lou Yuejue turned to her angrily: \"I should be asking you that! You think I've never seen impressive scenes or beautiful women before? How could I possibly be interested in this kind of wo—\"","Before he could finish, Lou Tingsi suddenly grabbed and dragged him away!","Lou Yuejue struggled in his father's grip: \"Dad! Let me go!\"","Lou Tingsi walked away without looking back.","Qiao Chuchu watched the father and son pair disappear into the distance, then awkwardly turned to the female lead: \"I'm sorry about that, the kid has some mental issues. Don't take it personally.\"","Xia Xuechun stood up straight, looking somewhat dejected but maintaining a haughty, self-important attitude. \"It's fine.\"","Xia Xuechun muttered under her breath: \"Rich people are all like this, so full of themselves.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","Full of themselves?","Lou Yuejue aside, as he did offend her.","But she, Qiao Chuchu, hadn't been arrogant at all?!","Moreover, her seven brothers, Lou Yuejue, Lou Tingsi, Lin Qing, and many other innocent people all died because of her and the male lead's love story!","They were all just stepping stones for these two idiots' romance!","How dare she call them arrogant?!","If she's so capable, why doesn't she avoid marrying rich men altogether?!","Meanwhile, Lou Tingsi dragged his son to a secluded spot and warned: \"Don't speak carelessly!\"","Lou Yuejue affirmed: \"Dad, you heard Qiao Chuchu's inner thoughts too, right? She's insulting me! How could I possibly be interested in such an ordinary woman, and like you, I don't need a mother's care.\"","Lou Tingsi responded coldly: \"We're not sure if what she's saying is true or false yet, why get angry about it?\"","Lou Yuejue had a revelation.","Right, they didn't know if what this person was saying was true or false yet. What if he and his father were just going crazy?","Lou Tingsi spoke in a grim tone: \"Now I'm taking you back there to continue listening to what she might say. We'll decide what to do after confirming whether it's true or false.\"","They both walked back toward Qiao Chuchu.","Qiao Chuchu was staring intently at Xia Xuechun's back.","[Hmph, female lead, go ahead and act proud in front of me. I'm not contradicting you because you're about to spill red wine on a woman. You have your own tribulations to face!]","As soon as the thought finished, Xia Xuechun suddenly tripped, falling forward with the red wine into a woman's arms!","Screams erupted at the scene!","Xia Xuechun and the woman fell together. The woman got up awkwardly and slapped Xia Xuechun hard: \"What are you doing?!\"","Xia Xuechun slapped her back: \"It wasn't on purpose! Why did you hit me?!\"","With that, chaos erupted!","Outside the commotion, Qiao Chuchu confidently crossed her arms and raised her chin with a smile.","[See? I told you, I know the plot like the back of my hand. No character can escape my eye!]","Lou Yuejue stood dumbfounded, exchanging glances with Lou Tingsi.","It was true.","Everything she said... was all true!"]},{"number":9,"title":"Chapter 9: The Female Lead Is That It","paragraphs":["The woman was wearing a high-end custom-made dress, now completely stained with red wine that would never wash out.","Evening gowns are typically worn only once, so each one is always new.","She had just put it on, and it was ruined before the birthday banquet even began.","The woman who had wine spilled on her was so angry her voice cracked: \"You're just a server who can't even do your job properly, and you dare to hit me?\"","Xia Xuechun retorted defiantly: \"You hit me first! Why shouldn't I hit back?! Just because you're rich, you think you can trample on other people's dignity?!\"","Qiao Chuchu watched coldly.","That's how this world's female protagonist was - she viewed her own dignity as paramount, but loved to crush others' dignity under her feet.","Just like...","Her brother.","Qiao Chuchu's eyes darkened as she thought about her brothers' future downfall. Though they would lose everything because of the female lead, she would self-righteously comment: \"Money truly is something that corrupts the heart.\"","After making such remarks, she would then climb into the male lead's Rolls-Royce.","Qiao Chuchu snapped back to reality and sneered.","She had never liked the female protagonist.","But since she was an early-stage character who died before the female lead's appearance, they had never crossed paths.","Until now.","Not in text, but seeing this person's arrogant and aloof face in reality.","It became more irritating the longer she looked.","The guests gathered around in a circle. While no one politely recorded with their phones, neither did anyone intervene - all too concerned about maintaining their own image to act rashly.","So the wine-stained lady was getting beaten one-sidedly.","Since Xia Xuechun had been working hard all her life, dealing with a pampered woman was no challenge.","She pinned the woman down and shouted: \"I can apologize to you, but you can't slap my face!\"","The woman screamed and pushed back: \"This dress was specially prepared for this banquet, do you know how much money and thought I put into it?!\"","\"I don't care how much money or thought you put into it, how is that my problem?! I'll pay for it!\" Xia Xuechun grabbed her hair: \"But you need to apologize for slapping my face first!\"","Pei Yuan and the others slowly gathered around.","Xia Xuechun refused to admit her mistake and instead reasonably demanded the victim apologize first.","Pei Yuan's eyes turned cold as he looked at his six brothers: \"Would any of you ever fall for this woman?\"","The sixth brother said sinisterly: \"Even if I went blind and deaf, I still wouldn't like her.\"","Pei Youchuan mocked: \"She can't even apologize for normal mistakes, our female lead thinks the world revolves around her.\"","Lin Qing sneered: \"Of course, she's the female lead - haven't you watched TV dramas? Many female leads are like this.\"","And this female lead would even go on to date three men at once in the future.","Laughable.","From a distance, Lou Yuejue saw this scene and scoffed: \"This female lead is just garbage, making mistakes but not knowing how to apologize. I'd rather protect that fool Qiao Chuchu than ever protect this garbage female lead.\"","Lou Tingsi curved his lips in a smile, but his eyes watching the female lead were filled with murderous intent.","Xia Xuechun grabbed the woman's hair: \"Apologize for hitting my face! Now!!\"","The woman screamed like a kettle: \"Security! Security!\"","Xia Xuechun thundered: \"Hurry up!\"","The guests exchanged glances, their eyes full of judgment as they looked at Xia Xuechun.","Old Master Zhao walked out imposingly with his cane, about to rebuke her.","Suddenly, Qiao Chuchu called out loudly—","\"What right do you have to demand an apology from her?!\"","The scene fell silent.","Old Master Zhao and those beside him stopped in their tracks.","Pei Yuan and the others also turned to look at the source of the voice in surprise.","Wearing a light pink puffy dress, Qiao Chuchu walked out from behind the crowd to face Xia Xuechun: \"Tell me, did this lady trip you, causing you to spill red wine on her?\""]},{"number":10,"title":"Chapter 10: Shut Up, Pay Up","paragraphs":["The venue was deathly silent.","Xia Xuechun's lower lip trembled slightly as she straightened her body, her tone resistant: \"I didn't do it on purpose, and it's just a dress, why should I be beaten for it?\"","Qiao Chuchu spoke calmly: \"Just because she came to a very important gathering for herself, looking glamorous, and you ruined it for her.\"","Xia Xuechun laughed: \"What did I ruin? It's just a dress—\"","\"This dress costs seven hundred thousand, it's the latest high-end luxury from D's, you can look it up online,\" Qiao Chuchu interrupted her: \"Now, pay up.\"","Xia Xuechun: \"...What?\"","Qiao Chuchu helped the woman, who was covered in red wine, to her feet, and took a blanket from a waiter to cover her: \"You think you just stained a dress, and she slapped you, hurting your dignity, but have you thought about this guest's dignity?\"","Xia Xuechun's face gradually turned pale.","Qiao Chuchu spoke clearly: \"Today is Grandpa Zhao's birthday banquet, and this lady came here at the invitation. There are even many people here she knows. In front of so many acquaintances, you splashed her with red wine, ruining her glamorous outfit. Doesn't she feel embarrassed?\"","Qiao Chuchu pressed on: \"Why should this innocent lady pay for your mistake?\"","Xia Xuechun was not convinced: \"But she hit me too!\"","Qiao Chuchu laughed: \"In today's society, a slap is worth at most two or three thousand, even if she compensates you three thousand, you still owe sixty-seven thousand. How do you plan to pay?\"","Xia Xuechun was choked, frowning in distress.","Qiao Chuchu was skillful and composed: \"Let me guess, your family's bankbook doesn't even add up to sixty-seven thousand, right? So why can you make a mistake and not admit it, and still hold on to her hitting you?\"","The scene was filled with scattered laughter: \"I thought she was so capable, turns out her parents' assets combined can't even cover this.\"","\"Haha, wouldn't she have to sell her house for a dress?\"","\"Only loans then.\"","\"Hah, I thought she had a hidden identity, ready to reveal it and slap us in the face, turns out she's just someone who can't afford it, hahaha!\"","Xia Xuechun's face turned red enough to bleed, glaring resentfully at Qiao Chuchu without speaking.","Qiao Chuchu looked coldly, suddenly pushed aside: \"That's enough!\"","A handsome young man, also dressed as a waiter, stepped in front of Xia Xuechun, shouting at Qiao Chuchu: \"It's just compensation, I'm willing to pay for her!\"","Xia Xuechun was taken aback, surprised looking at the man: \"Jiahao Ge?\"","Qiao Chuchu raised an eyebrow, noticing the teardrop mole under the man's eye.","【Oh, the big sacrificial male second lead, Li Jiahao, has arrived.】","The Pei family, Lin Qing, and the Lou father and son looked at Li Jiahao.","Li Jiahao first helped Xia Xuechun to her feet, then spoke resolutely: \"Xia Xuechun did something wrong, but let's talk about it objectively. It's also because this woman hit Xia Xuechun first that she retaliated. You were wrong first, you can't use your money to bully people!\"","Others rolled their eyes dramatically.","Old Master Zhao frowned disapprovingly: \"Can these two kids not tell right from wrong?\"","Qiao Chuchu raises the corner of her mouth: \"Right and wrong are in people's hearts, you said you'd pay, so pay up.\"","She looked at the woman in red wine: \"You were hit three times, and you slapped her once. According to the price of three thousand per slap, seventy thousand plus six thousand, seventy-six thousand, can you accept that?\"","The woman in red wine was flattered.","This girl is the eighth daughter of the Qiao family, right?","It's such a blessing that she could help the Qiao family's eighth daughter!","She nodded eagerly: \"Yes.\"","Qiao Chuchu smiled at Li Jiahao: \"Seventy-six thousand, pay up.\"","Li Jiahao was shocked: \"Wait, wasn't it sixty-seven thousand just now?\"","Qiao Chuchu nodded: \"Yes, we calculated it at three thousand per slap. Xia Xuechun hit this lady three times, and the lady hit Xia Xuechun once. The dress is seventy thousand, so seventy-six thousand is correct. If you don't want to calculate it that way, you can also let this lady pay you three thousand, and you pay her seventy-nine thousand, it's the same.\"","Li Jiahao's mouth twitched, clenching his fists.","Xia Xuechun bit her lower lip, her eyes red, looking like she was about to cry.","Qiao Chuchu smiled faintly: \"Unfortunately, there can't be any discounts, after all, Xia Xuechun's favorite dignity definitely doesn't allow for discounts.\"","The venue burst into laughter again!","Li Jiahao's face turned red, fumbling with his phone: \"Give me the account number.\"","The woman in red wine took out her purse and handed him the card.","Lou Yuejue laughed loudly: \"Dad, Qiao Chuchu is quite interesting.\"","Lou Tingsi nodded with a smile.","Pei Yuan praised: \"It seems that after so many years not living with Qiao Chuchu, she's not useless after all.\"","Pei Youchuan was proud: \"Our sister, of course, is like us.\"","The other brothers couldn't help but agree.","Lin Qing whistled: \"Nice one, Chuchu! So cool!\"","Applause thundered, even Old Master Zhao was beaming, clapping for Qiao Chuchu.","Finally, amidst the applause and cheers, Li Jiahao transferred all his savings plus all the credit from his loan app, totaling seventy-six thousand, to the woman in red wine.","The woman in red wine smiled: \"Very well, I received it.\"","Li Jiahao's face turned red, glaring resentfully at Qiao Chuchu, dragging Xia Xuechun away.","Xia Xuechun seemed to want to fix her gaze on Qiao Chuchu, reluctantly being dragged away.","The venue instantly erupted in cheers: \"OHHHHHH!~\"","Lin Qing directly pounced on Qiao Chuchu: \"Nice one, Chuchu, I thought you were a little softie, turns out you've got some spirit!~\"","Qiao Chuchu was proud: \"That's right~\"","She had long known that such a plot would happen, and had been imagining in her mind what she would do if she were there.","Because the original ending was that after things escalated, the male lead appeared and shielded Xia Xuechun from this lady.","The lady, having suffered a silent loss, couldn't match the male lead's economic strength, lost the seventy-thousand dress without compensation, and cried in grievance.","Xia Xuechun got the upper hand and acted spoiled, feeling that rich people were all bad, going crazy at the male lead, accusing him and the lady in red wine of not being good people.","Clearly, she was the one at fault, but she could comfortably shift the blame onto others, turning herself into the biggest victim.","The lady in red wine was really a big sacrificial character.","So thinking of this ending, she couldn't help but intervene.","The woman in red wine came to her: \"Thank you, Miss Qiao, if you don't mind, can we exchange contact information and have a meal together another day?\"","Qiao Chuchu gladly agreed, exchanging contact information.","The woman in red wine's eyes lit up: \"Thank you for today's help, I will thank you, I'll go change my clothes first.\"","Qiao Chuchu smiled and watched her leave, Old Master Zhao following: \"It's been a long time since I've seen Chuchu, not only has she grown so graceful, but she's also become much smarter!\"","Qiao Chuchu was delighted, hugging Grandpa Zhao: \"Grandpa Zhao!~\""]},{"number":11,"title":"Chapter 11: Good News: The System is Back, Bad News: The System is Gone Again","paragraphs":["Grandpa Zhao lovingly held Qiao Chuchu in his arms: \"I always thought you were too shy to speak up, but you're quite reliable when it matters.\"","Pei Yuan and his brothers approached Old Master Zhao with a wry smile: \"Grandpa Zhao, you know Qiao Chuchu has always been clever with her little tricks.\"","Qiao Chuchu raised her chin proudly: \"Big brother wishes he had my wit!\"","Pei Yuan snorted.","Old Master Zhao looked pleased: \"Seeing you like this puts my mind at ease. But at your age, shouldn't you be dating?\"","Qiao Chuchu froze.","The Pei brothers suddenly tensed up.","Pei Yuan chuckled softly: \"She's still too young. We don't want her dating yet.\"","Old Master Zhao was shocked: \"Over twenty and not dating? You're more old-fashioned than me, and you're so young!\"","Pei Yuan lowered his head with a faint smile: \"I just don't trust anyone else with my sister.\"","Old Master Zhao sighed at his words: \"I understand. After your parents passed away, Chuchu became your only emotional support. I know how much you children have always loved Chuchu.\"","Qiao Chuchu looked at her brothers.","They all had stern expressions, giving her awkward glances without saying more.","She felt troubled too.","When she was little, her brothers doted on her the most. Whenever she got sick, they would be extremely worried and insisted on taking turns caring for her until she recovered.","But after the system's intervention, their once-pure sibling relationship had become what it was today.","Qiao Chuchu lowered her head guiltily.","Suddenly, a cry rang out—","\"Look out!!!\"","Qiao Chuchu startled, looking up to see a dark shadow rushing toward her, a knife plunging into her forehead!","Qiao Chuchu collapsed!","Her brothers' expressions changed drastically as they rushed to her in panic: \"Chuchu!\"","\"Call an ambulance! Quickly call an ambulance!!\"","Pei Yuan stared at her face in shock: \"Don't be afraid, Chuchu, the ambulance is coming. Don't fall asleep! Chuchu!! Wake up! Don't sleep!!\"","-","\"Ah!\" Qiao Chuchu screamed as she sat up from the ground, frantically touching her forehead.","Her forehead was empty – no knife was embedded there.","She was dazed, looking around to find herself in a pure white world.","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","Was she dead?","\"Yes, you're dead,\" a small golden ball floated before her: \"You were killed by an accidentally thrown knife, dying instantly.\"","Qiao Chuchu recognized the voice: \"Are you the system?\"","Golden ball: \"Yes.\"","She burst out in anger: \"Were you playing with me? You wouldn't let me jump to my death, but you let me die by a knife, and in front of so many people? You wretched system, you've done nothing but evil!\"","But she quickly adjusted: \"Whatever, just send me back to my original world. I don't want to waste any more energy, or I might start getting attached.\"","The system sighed: \"Host, you can't go back.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","System: \"To be honest, you weren't in a novel world, but rather one of many parallel universes. The 'novel script' you saw was these people's destiny.\"","Qiao Chuchu listened in a daze: \"Then why did you lie and say it was a novel?\"","System nodded: \"Describing this destiny as a novel helps dimensional travelers like you understand faster and more conveniently. Besides, Xia Xuechun and Ji Yanchuan are indeed the protagonists of these destinies, with their own halos. Calling them novel protagonists is actually quite accurate.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...Then why can't I go back?\"","System helplessly: \"Because you've been registered as a citizen of this world, and the destinies of everyone involved have become unknown, no longer requiring our system's intervention. I can't stay bound to you anymore.\"","Qiao Chuchu was shocked: \"So- so I died for nothing?\"","\"No,\" the system said: \"You can't return to your original world due to our system's judgment error. We'll give you ten chances to revive at the time before your death, whether it's minutes or hours before, to save your own life.\"","Qiao Chuchu grew more confused: \"If you say I can't return to my original world, then I won't commit suicide. Why do I need to save my own destiny?\"","System: \"Because according to our agreed 'script,' you're already dead, host.\"","Qiao Chuchu felt like she'd been plunged into ice!","The system's voice gradually became deep: \"Although the destinies of all characters in the 'script' have begun to change, the story still follows its initial setting. That's why I gave you ten revival chances – you can change your destiny.\"","Before Qiao Chuchu could say more, she felt her body floating up, pushed forward by a gust of wind!","The system's voice echoed in her mind: [You're both inside and outside the script. If you survive until the grand finale, the death buff on you will disappear.]","[Take care, host.]","Qiao Chuchu gasped, stumbling as she found herself standing beside Old Master Zhao.","Old Master Zhao looked at her puzzled: \"What's wrong, Chuchu?\"","Qiao Chuchu was completely dazed, seeing the number 10 before her eyes.","10 slowly changed to 9.","Indicating she had nine lives left.","Qiao Chuchu looked around.","She was back to when she was chatting with Old Master Zhao.","Pei Yuan and her brothers were looking at her curiously, not yet showing signs of grief.","Lin Qing stared at her with interest: \"Could it be that you're embarrassed because Grandpa Zhao mentioned dating?\"","The guests around them chuckled.","Qiao Chuchu searched the surroundings, her gaze settling on a little boy.","The boy was playing recklessly with a sharp dagger, showing off to a little girl: \"Cool, right?\"","The girl frowned: \"How could you bring a knife in here? You'll get scolded by your parents.\"","The boy dismissed her concerns: \"What's wrong with bringing a knife? It's not like it'll hurt anyone. Try and take it if you can!\"","He held the knife above his head, running toward Qiao Chuchu's direction, teasing the girl: \"Come on, come on!\"","Suddenly, the boy tripped, and the dagger flew toward Qiao Chuchu!","Someone screamed: \"Look out!!!\"","Qiao Chuchu pushed Old Master Zhao aside and caught the dagger with her hand!","The crowd gasped!","Qiao Chuchu gripped the knife tightly, blood dripping from her palm.","She couldn't feel the pain, only an endless sense of relief spreading through her limbs, warming her entire body.","She... survived.","Everyone around was stunned.","Some adults reacted and went after the boy: \"How could you bring a knife here? You almost killed someone!\"","The boy, realizing his mistake, got up and ran away!","Many people gathered around, exclaiming: \"Ah! Miss Qiao is bleeding so much!\"","Qiao Chuchu stared at the knife in her hand, still shaken.","Auntie Zhao stood nearby, stunned: \"You saved my father, Chuchu.\"","Qiao Chuchu froze, meeting Auntie Zhao's excited expression: \"That dagger was clearly aimed at my father. If it weren't for you, he would have been injured. You saved his life!\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"No, I didn't—\"","Old Master Zhao grabbed her shoulders, overwhelmed with gratitude: \"Say no more, child. This old man understands everything. Quick, go get your wound bandaged!\"","Old Master Zhao instructed his son: \"Go prepare a thank-you gift for Chuchu!\"","His son responded: \"Yes!\""]},{"number":12,"title":"Chapter 12: Just a Look at the Hand, Even the Lou Family Father and Son Are Here","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu sat on the couch in the lounge, with people standing behind her.","Her palm had a large knife wound, with blood continuously flowing out, looking quite frightening.","But compared to what could have happened earlier, this minor injury was quite merciful.","The only awkward part was that Old Master Zhao misunderstood that she had protected him.","Auntie Zhao, Old Master Zhao's daughter, worriedly said beside them, \"Why did you grab the knife directly? Couldn't you have dodged it?\"","Qiao Chuchu shook her head dejectedly, \"I was afraid the dagger would stab someone else.\"","If it could kill her, it could kill others too.","At least this way, the damage was minimized.","The family doctor took her hand and carefully said, \"This might hurt a bit, please bear with it.\"","Qiao Chuchu nodded, secretly gripping the corner of the sofa with her other hand.","With so many people watching, it would be embarrassing to cry out.","But when the iodine gently brushed against her wound, Qiao Chuchu's face turned as red as a liver, and her hand gripping the sofa instantly turned white.","[It hurts so much! Why does it hurt this badly!]","All her brothers' expressions changed simultaneously.","Pei Youchuan couldn't help saying, \"Please be gentler.\"","Qiao Chuchu looked at Pei Youchuan with tears in her eyes.","Pei Youchuan stiffly met her gaze for a moment before turning away.","The doctor became more gentle.","Qiao Chuchu didn't feel it was too unbearable anymore, but when she looked at the large wound on her palm, with flesh slightly protruding, it was both shocking and nauseating.","Everyone present changed their expression: \"This needs stitches, right?\"","The doctor nodded: \"I'll bandage it for now, but you need to go to the hospital immediately for stitches and a tetanus shot.\"","Qiao Chuchu felt it was too much trouble: \"There's no need—\"","\"Yes, there is.\" Pei Yuan cut her off before she could finish, gesturing to the doctor to continue bandaging: \"I'll take her there right now.\"","Soon, Qiao Chuchu was being hurriedly pulled downstairs by Pei Yuan.","Lin Qing and the other brothers followed closely behind.","Qiao Chuchu repeatedly emphasized: \"I'm really fine, Big Brother.\"","Pei Yuan ignored her, pulling her into the family van and forcibly sitting next to her: \"We're going to the hospital.\"","Pei Youchuan followed behind: \"Should we find that brat's parents?\"","Pei Yuan tucked Qiao Chuchu into the car: \"Check the surveillance cameras, confirm which family's child it is. Give them one day - if they don't come to apologize by midnight tonight, handle it as you see fit.\"","Pei Youchuan understood and took out his phone to deal with it.","Qiao Chuchu wanted to continue arguing.","Pei Yuan glared at her: \"Shut up.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","The atmosphere in the car was tense.","The other brothers had unpleasant expressions, staring resentfully at Qiao Chuchu.","Qiao Chuchu looked to Lin Qing for help.","Lin Qing held back his laughter, appearing unsurprised, and shrugged at her.","His expression seemed to say: 'I told you they're sister-complex.'","Qiao Chuchu bit her lower lip and didn't make another sound.","Lou Tingsi stood outside the hotel, watching the family van disappear from his sight.","Lou Yuejue stood beside him, curious: \"Dad, do you think Qiao Chuchu protected Old Master Zhao because she predicted what was about to happen?\"","Lou Tingsi neither confirmed nor denied: \"Whatever the case, Qiao Chuchu has information we need.\"","Lou Yuejue was confused: \"But don't I just need to avoid Xia Xuechun?\"","Lou Tingsi snorted coldly: \"You think just avoiding Xia Xuechun is enough? Have you thought about what you did before dying for Xia Xuechun, what I did, why I was shot to death in China where guns are banned, who shot me, and why we're both supporting characters?\"","Lou Yuejue gradually began to understand.","Lou Tingsi lit a cigarette, determined: \"Whatever it takes, we need to keep Qiao Chuchu close as a precaution. I don't mind dying, but you can't die.\"","Lou Yuejue was startled, nervously grabbing his hand: \"Dad, I don't mind dying, but you can't die. I'm still young, it doesn't matter, I'm not afraid of death.\"","Lou Tingsi looked down at his son.","Lou Yuejue gazed back determinedly.","The two looked as if they were cut from the same mold, even their determined expressions were identical.","Lou Tingsi gently patted his son's head: \"Seems we have the same goal, so let's work together.\"","Lou Yuejue nodded firmly.","For his dad's sake, for his own sake, he would definitely stick close to Qiao Chuchu!","He had to find out everything that was going to happen to them!","-","Qiao Chuchu's hand was wrapped like a mummy as she walked out of the hospital, enduring the pain.","She was surrounded by a group of handsome men, constantly drawing curious glances from passersby.","The only flaw was that neither the handsome men nor the beautiful woman looked particularly happy.","Pei Yuan took off his coat and draped it over Qiao Chuchu, pulling her by her other arm toward the parking lot.","Qiao Chuchu didn't dare say a word.","When Big Brother was angry, neither she nor the other siblings dared to breathe.","A male voice called from behind them: \"Miss Qiao.\"","Qiao Chuchu stopped and turned around.","Lou Tingsi stood under the yellow streetlight, smiling at her: \"Are you alright?\"","Qiao Chuchu was surprised: \"Mr. Lou?\"","Everyone else's expression changed.","Pei Yuan looked at Qiao Chuchu in surprise, asking quietly: \"What's going on? Didn't I tell you not to get involved with the Lou family?\"","Qiao Chuchu was also surprised, defending herself in a low voice: \"I didn't, we barely exchanged three sentences on the sofa earlier.\"","Suddenly, Lou Yuejue enthusiastically threw himself into her arms: \"Sister Chuchu!\"","Qiao Chuchu stumbled back a couple of steps, surprised as she held him.","Lou Yuejue looked up at her pitifully: \"Are you okay, sister?\"","Qiao Chuchu froze.","Was this yandere boy always this gentle?","Lou Tingsi said helplessly from the side: \"My son has been worried about you since you got hurt. No matter how I explain it to him, he wouldn't listen and insisted on coming to check on you.\"","Lou Tingsi's gaze was fox-like, craftily moving between Qiao Chuchu and the others: \"We father and son... haven't disturbed you, have we?\"","\"Of course not.\" Pei Yuan walked up to Lou Tingsi and extended his hand: \"It's an honor for my sister to receive concern from Mr. Lou and young Master Lou. I'm Pei Yuan.\"","Lou Tingsi shook his hand with a smile: \"I've long heard of Mr. Pei's reputation.\"","The two men were of the same height, and though they wore smiles, their eyes were full of wariness.","Lou Yuejue stood on tiptoes, concernedly saying to Qiao Chuchu: \"Sister, why don't you ride with me and my dad? I'm so worried about you.\"","Qiao Chuchu felt even more uncomfortable.","[When did this cunning little shota become so cute and refreshing? It's weird.]","Lou Yuejue: \"?\"","Pei Yuan smiled and pulled Qiao Chuchu behind him: \"My sister is injured right now, it wouldn't be good if she accidentally hurt you.\"","\"I don't mind,\" Lou Yuejue replied promptly: \"As a real man, I should protect the sister I like.\"","He tilted his head and smiled at Qiao Chuchu: \"Right, sister!~\"","Qiao Chuchu shuddered violently!","[Yeah right, if other kids talked to me like this I'd just think they're cute, but when you talk like this, I just find it scary!]","Lou Yuejue: \"...\"","This fool was getting a bit too presumptuous.","He was being so sincere, yet she still called him scary!"]},{"number":13,"title":"Chapter 13: Unavoidable Plot, Qiao Chuchu Being Erased by the World","paragraphs":["Just as Lou Yuejue was about to lose his temper, Lou Tingsi's hand pressed on his shoulder to stop him.","\"Sister isn't feeling well. Let's not force our son. Why don't we just follow behind Sister Qiao's car?\"","Lou Yuejue reluctantly nodded: \"Fine.\"","Lin Qing seized the opportunity: \"I just had someone bring my car over. I won't ride with you all; I'll go first.\"","Lin Qing walked toward her family's car.","Qiao Chuchu tilted her head.","[Wait, why does this scene feel so familiar?]","Lin Qing's movement to enter the car froze.","Everyone alertly looked toward Qiao Chuchu.","Qiao Chuchu remained oblivious, looking around in confusion: [This seems to be where the female lead's mother works. Xia Xuechun's mother is a cleaner at my second brother's hospital, right?]","[According to the plot, Lin Qing should hit Xia Xuechun's mother with her car, and when Xia Xuechun arrives, she'll accuse Lin Qing of doing it intentionally. Lin Qing will feel wrongly accused, their conflict will escalate, and then the male lead will appear and join in blaming Lin Qing.]","[But that story development happens during broad daylight, not now. The timing doesn't match, which means... Lin Qing is safe for now.]","Lin Qing breathed a sigh of relief: \"I'm leaving first.\"","She started the engine and drove toward the exit, her nerves still highly strung.","Damn it, nothing good has happened since running into Xia Xuechun!","Qiao Chuchu watched as Xia Xuechun's car grew distant, then casually glanced into the distance and her eyes widened: [The female lead's mother?!]","When this thought suddenly echoed in Lin Qing's mind, she immediately slammed on the brakes.","In the darkness, the female lead's mother was walking past them, looking down at her phone.","Everyone subtly breathed a sigh of relief.","Had they managed to avoid this crisis?","Lin Qing broke out in a cold sweat, only starting to drive away after confirming the female lead's mother had left.","Suddenly, the woman walking ahead turned back and ran toward her!","Lin Qing hit the brakes again!","But the female lead's mother slipped on ice, violently crashed into her car's hood, and immediately lost consciousness!","Lin Qing: \"?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","This smooth sequence of events shocked everyone.","Qiao Chuchu ran over while holding up her dress, grabbing her hair in disbelief: \"Is the female lead's mother a professional scammer?\"","Lin Qing got out of the car, her hands and feet weak with fear, her face ashen.","Pei Youchuan was furious: \"Is she crazy?! Running back across a parking lot without looking for cars, and managing to crash into a stopped car - if this isn't a scam, what is it?!\"","Lin Qing stood rigid, trembling as she grabbed Pei Youchuan's arm: \"It's not a scam.\"","She was shaking severely, whether from cold or fear, and said in an extremely weak voice: \"It's... I can't escape my plot.\"","Everyone's expressions changed.","Unable to escape the plot?","What about them?","A large truck drove by quickly on the road, and a stone suddenly flew toward Qiao Chuchu!","Qiao Chuchu raised her hand to block it!","The stone hit her palm!","She cried out in pain: \"Ouch!\"","The others looked at Qiao Chuchu in surprise, while she remained unaware, holding her injured left hand and whimpering: [There's really not a moment to breathe. The moment we let our guard down, the 'plot' tries to eliminate us.]","[I should have died by suicide originally, but I've survived until now, so this world probably wants me dead.]","Everyone's expressions suddenly became solemn.","Clearly, all of this was hinting at something.","On one side was 'the plot they couldn't escape'","On the other was 'Qiao Chuchu, who should have committed suicide, now being eliminated by this world'","A thought began to grow in all their minds.","A family's decline doesn't happen in a day, but builds up from many events.","Qiao Chuchu was the only one who knew about all the events happening to them.","Only by protecting Qiao Chuchu could they protect themselves.","Gradually, Qiao Chuchu felt the atmosphere around her change.","Everyone was staring intently at her.","Including her brothers, the Lou father and son, and Lin Qing.","The way they looked at her was like they were looking at a must-have prize.","Qiao Chuchu felt creeped out: \"...Why are you all looking at me like that? Is there something on my face?\"","After a moment of silence, Lin Qing was the first to snap out of it, taking a big step forward and giving her a bear hug!","\"Oh darling, are you okay?! How's your hand, is it worse than before?\"","Qiao Chuchu was surprised by the attention, opened her mouth to speak, but before she could say anything, someone else hugged her waist.","Lou Yuejue tightly hugged Qiao Chuchu's waist: \"Sister, are you okay? That driver was terrible, I'll definitely find him and make him kneel down to apologize to you!\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"? That's not necessary.\"","Lou Tingsi stood to the side with a dangerous smile: \"How could a truck drive so fast in the city? I'll report that driver for speeding right away.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...It was just an accident, everyone doesn't need to be so nervous.\"","\"Let me check if anything's broken.\" Pei Yuan took her hand and examined it carefully.","Qiao Chuchu was overwhelmed by the attention and quickly pulled her hand back: \"It hurts, but I'm definitely fine. We should deal with the unconscious lady first.\"","Hearing this, everyone's attitudes took a sharp turn, coldly looking at the middle-aged woman lying unconscious on the ground.","Lin Qing couldn't hide her disgust, her tone dropping eight degrees: \"I'll call someone to help her right away, and have my lawyer come too. She better not try to extort me - she's the one who suddenly ran into my car.\"","-","Xia Xuechun rushed to the hospital and went straight to a VIP single room: \"Mom!\"","When she and her family pushed open the door, they were shocked by the scene inside.","Qiao Chuchu sat in the center of the sofa, wearing an evening gown with a Bulgari scarf draped over her shoulders, like a princess surrounded by admirers.","Lou Yuejue on her left, Lin Qing on her right, and her brothers flanking them.","The whole group turned to look at her the moment she pushed open the door.","In comparison, the woman lying on the bed seemed almost non-existent.","When Xia Xuechun saw Qiao Chuchu's familiar face, she immediately became angry, storming toward her: \"Did you hit my mother?! Did you deliberately take revenge on my mother?!\"","She was like gunpowder ready to explode, screaming as she charged forward!","Pei Yuan quickly moved to protect Qiao Chuchu, his expression cold: \"What are you doing?\"","Xia Xuechun screamed heartrendingly: \"What do you mean what am I doing?! What are YOU doing?! Are you trying to kill people just because you're rich?!\"","Qiao Chuchu's face darkened as she grabbed Lin Qing's phone and met her eyes: \"Look for yourself how your mother fainted!\"","Xia Xuechun paused and carefully watched the footage.","The surveillance video showed her mother crossing the parking lot, suddenly turning back.","Lin Qing's car stopped, but her mother slipped on ice and crashed headfirst into the car, immediately passing out.","The truth was now clear.","Xia Xuechun's face turned bright red as she stepped back guiltily: \"If you didn't hit her, why didn't you say so earlier?\"","Qiao Chuchu put down the phone and mocked her: \"Why should I have to explain when I didn't hit her? If you dare to yell at me again, your mother will be fired from this private hospital, you'll be kicked out of this VIP room, and no one will help pay your medical bills.\"","Xia Xuechun stared in disbelief, laughing angrily: \"What gives you the right to decide that?\"","Pei Che, the second Pei brother, stepped forward coldly: \"Because I'm the chairman of this private hospital.\"","He stood in front of Qiao Chuchu, looking down at Xia Xuechun: \"If you dare to yell at my sister again, I'll have security throw your whole family out.\""]},{"number":14,"title":"Chapter 14: This is not normal, why does my brother care for me so much","paragraphs":["Xia Xuechun was left speechless by the rebuke.","Pei Che's expression was sinister, as if he had emerged from hell: \"What are you standing there for? Hurry up and apologize to my sister!\"","Xia Xuechun trembled, her eyes gradually reddening.","Yet she still held her head high, stubbornly refusing to admit her mistake.","Xia Xuechun's good-natured father tugged at her sleeve and bowed in apology: \"We're terribly sorry, everyone. My daughter has quite a sharp tongue. Please, please don't take her words to heart.\"","Pei Che persisted: \"Is saying 'sorry' the proper way to apologize? Then if I throw your whole family out, can I just say 'sorry' too?\"","The atmosphere grew tense.","Xia Xuechun looked at Pei Che with humiliation.","Pei Che tilted his head and looked at her contemptuously, as if she were trash, his gaze equivalent to giving her the middle finger.","Xia Xuechun's breathing quickened as she glared at Pei Che, tears welling up in her eyes.","Only when Xia Xuechun's father tugged at her sleeve did she come to her senses and reluctantly bow to apologize.","The family of three said in unison: \"We're sorry, please forgive our rudeness.\"","Pei Che let out a cold snort and dragged Qiao Chuchu away, his face stern.","Qiao Chuchu followed behind him awkwardly, feeling uncomfortable.","[When did my second brother, who's as cold and unfeeling as a refrigerator, start being so protective of me?]","[The last time he protected me like this was several years ago, before he cut off my living expenses.]","Suddenly, Qiao Chuchu stumbled and bumped into Pei Che's back.","Pei Che looked down at her, his presence looming over her like Mount Tai.","Qiao Chuchu felt chills run down her spine and instinctively tried to pull her wrist away.","Pei Che gripped it even tighter.","His long fingers, like works of art, firmly gripped Qiao Chuchu's wrist, his gloomy eyes churning with unreadable emotions, almost pulling her in.","\"Come home with me.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"But Grandpa Zhao—\"","\"I'll handle it,\" Pei Che said sternly. \"I'm taking you home now.\"","The other brothers gradually caught up.","Lou Tingsi and Lou Yuejue frowned upon hearing this.","Lin Qing interjected: \"Pei Che, Qiao Chuchu has lived alone for so many years, you should let her live by herself.\"","She playfully raised her eyebrows at Qiao Chuchu: \"That way, I can live with you too, and we can strengthen our relationship, right?\"","Just as Qiao Chuchu was about to nod, Pei Che tightened his grip on her hand: \"She's my sister.\"","He looked at Qiao Chuchu, his eyes flashing coldly: \"From now on, she'll live with us brothers. She's moving back in.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"????\"","[What's wrong with him? I don't want to live with them at all, I'm used to living alone.]","Pei Che's eyes darkened as he pulled her along: \"Let's go!\"","Qiao Chuchu stumbled behind him, struggling several times, but Pei Che maintained his grip.","Although she had practiced self-defense for many years, her brothers also worked out daily, completely overwhelming her in terms of strength!","Qiao Chuchu wailed internally: [What sin did I commit to deserve this? I've already driven them crazy, and now I have to live with them? They're not going to abuse me, are they? They're not planning to dismember me, right?!]","Pei Che pulled her along with a dark expression, gripping her hand even tighter.","Pei Youchuan watched their retreating figures and smugly said to Lin Qing: \"Sorry, Lin Qing, but she's our sister, and we have to take her home.\"","Lin Qing ground her teeth, hiding daggers behind her smile: \"She seems quite unwilling. She might run away sometime, and then I can steal her away.\"","Pei Yuan chuckled, saying meaningfully: \"We're seven people. Keeping an eye on one Qiao Chuchu is well within our capabilities. It might be a bit difficult for you to steal her.\"","Lin Qing's smile vanished: \"Weren't we supposed to cooperate?\"","Pei Yuan remained noncommittal: \"Yes, but our sister still needs to stay with us brothers. If she says anything about you, we'll let you know.\"","Lin Qing was speechless and rolled her eyes dramatically: \"You're all sister-complex freaks.\"","The Pei brothers responded in unison: \"Say that again - we don't have a sister complex.\"","Lin Qing dismissed them contemptuously, brushing past them: \"Just wait and see. With your fractured relationship, I can easily lure Qiao Chuchu away!\"","Pei Youchuan smugly watched her retreating figure: \"You'll need more practice then. My sister's bond with us is stronger than gold! She loves us to death! She'd even jump off a building for us!\"","After Lin Qing disappeared from view, Pei Youchuan's smile vanished abruptly. \"I think Qiao Chuchu doesn't love us anymore. She must be forced by the system. We're in a dangerous situation here.\"","Pei Yuan: \"...So you were just showing off earlier.\"","Pei Youchuan's face turned slightly green: \"Yeah, and I don't want to live with Qiao Chuchu. I'm traumatized by her. I'm afraid I'll open my closet and find her smiling at me in a dress!\"","The other brothers nodded in agreement!","They were all somewhat afraid of Qiao Chuchu in their own way.","\"It doesn't matter if you don't want to,\" Pei Yuan said grimly. \"If we don't take her, Lin Qing will snatch her away. Plus, Qiao Chuchu is being erased by this world - she could die in some accident at any time. What would we do then?\"","Thinking about the father and son from the Lou family, Pei Yuan narrowed his eyes darkly: \"Moreover, I suspect more people will be able to hear Qiao Chuchu's thoughts in the future. There will be more and more people trying to claim her. We must take the initiative and protect our sister by keeping her close. It's our only chance.\"","\"First, to prevent the world from erasing her through accidents, and second, to prevent people like Lin Qing from taking advantage of the situation, understand?\"","Pei Youchuan and the others' expressions changed slightly as they nodded comprehendingly: \"Understood.\"","Lou Tingsi and Lou Yuejue, hidden in the emergency stairwell, watched them walk away.","Lou Tingsi bit down on a cigarette, his eyes narrowing like a fox's: \"It seems we're not the only ones who can hear Qiao Chuchu's thoughts. In this plot, everyone who would have been killed by Xia Xuechun can hear her thoughts.\"","Thinking of Qiao Chuchu's innocent face, he smiled playfully: \"With so many people and so many factions, it'll be quite challenging to claim her.\"","Lou Yuejue seemed lost: \"What should we do?\"","Lou Tingsi contemplated: \"Since her relationship with her brothers isn't good, we'll be the better option.\"","Lou Yuejue didn't understand: \"The better option?\"","Lou Tingsi took out his phone and made a call: \"It's me. Investigate the addresses of the seven Pei brothers. I only want to know about the house where all seven of them regularly stay together.\"","The sound of typing came from the other end of the line, and the person quickly replied: \"The Pei brothers own many properties, but currently they all live together in the Lan City East Suburb Villa District. It's their father's old house, with neighbors on both sides.\"","Lou Tingsi: \"Give me the neighbors' contact information. I'll speak with them personally.\"","\"Yes, Mr. Lou.\"","Lou Tingsi received the phone number and casually searched his WeChat contacts, finding the person immediately.","Lou Tingsi let out a confident laugh, certain of his success."]},{"number":15,"title":"Chapter 15: I've got them covered, brothers, let's group up and fight","paragraphs":["Lin Qing picked up her phone to call her brother: \"Brother, I want to buy the villa next to the Pei family.\"","Her brother on the other end: \"...Why? Didn't you just buy a house next to Ji Yanchuan's place?\"","Lin Qing replied listlessly: \"I just went through a breakup, I just want a change of environment, buy it for me.\"","\"...\"","Noticing his silence, Lin Qing said seriously: \"Brother, if you don't buy me this house, I'll die young.\"","Brother: \"? Are you threatening me?\"","Lin Qing sighed: \"No, I'm just informing you.\"","After a moment of silence, her brother said: \"Well, if you're going to live next to the Pei family, I'll move in too.\"","Lin Qing found it strange but didn't ask further, simply responding cheerfully: \"No problem, I just need long-term living rights, I don't even care if my name's not on the deed.\"","With that, she promptly hung up.","A call from \"Ji Yanchuan\" followed immediately.","Lin Qing looked at the flashing name on her phone and rejected the call.","As she did so, she saw Ji Yanchuan hurriedly entering the hospital, coincidentally running into Xia Xuechun.","Xia Xuechun seemed to be crying, looking at him with tear-filled eyes before running away with her face covered.","Ji Yanchuan stared at her retreating figure in confusion, then picked up his phone again.","Lin Qing's phone rang once more.","Lin Qing had no intention of answering, keeping her eyes fixed on Ji Yanchuan.","Although Ji Yanchuan was calling her, his gaze remained absently fixed on the direction where Xia Xuechun had disappeared.","As if possessed, Lin Qing answered the phone.","Ji Yanchuan spoke hurriedly: \"I'll call you back later.\"","He quickly hung up and strode towards Xia Xuechun, raising his hand to gently touch her shoulder.","Xia Xuechun turned around tearfully, her tears immediately flowing: \"Why did you come looking for me?\"","Her lips trembled, and before Ji Yanchuan could answer, she sobbed: \"Let me lean on your shoulder for a moment!\"","She threw herself into Ji Yanchuan's arms, holding him tightly.","Ji Yanchuan stood stunned in the darkness, not struggling against her embrace.","Lin Qing's heart turned to ashes as she took out her phone to record video evidence.","This scene, seemingly unremarkable, was being watched by three different parties.","Besides Lin Qing, there were Lou Tingsi and his son smoking at the hospital entrance.","Lou Tingsi narrowed his eyes and remarked with interest: \"Embracing another woman when he has a fiancée?\"","Lou Yuejue rolled his eyes dramatically: \"Trash.\"","And then there was...","Qiao Chuchu, waiting for her brothers to get in the car.","She sat in the passenger seat, biting hard on the seatbelt, her anger rising rapidly.","Pei Che, sitting in the driver's seat, saw this scene and sneered: \"These two idiots are moving faster than animals in a breeding farm.\"","Qiao Chuchu jumped out of the car like an agile mountain creature!","Pei Che: \"? Hey!\"","Qiao Chuchu wrapped her scarf around her head and charged towards Ji Yanchuan in her high heels like a mad woman!","Pei Che: \"??!\"","Just then, Pei Youchuan, who was passing by, noticed Ji Yanchuan and pointed in surprise: \"Hey, isn't that Ji Yanchuan? Why is he hugging Xia Xuechun?\"","Pei Yuan frowned: \"Disgusting.\"","Sixth Pei scratched his head: \"Are we sure Ji Yanchuan is the male lead of this novel? He looks more like an adult video actor to me.\"","\"SCUMBAG!!!!!!!!!\"","An angry roar echoed through the sky!","Everyone froze as they saw a girl in a pink dress, wearing stilettos, her head wrapped in a scarf, launch a flying kick at Ji Yanchuan!","\"Go to hell!!!\"","Ji Yanchuan was caught off guard and crashed to the ground!","Xia Xuechun was instantly knocked down by Ji Yanchuan: \"Ah!\"","Qiao Chuchu's anger surged as she took off her shoe and kicked at him: \"One's emotionally cheating! One's a homewrecker! Today, I, an anonymous female warrior, will teach you two scumbags a lesson!\"","Lou Tingsi: \"?\"","Lou Yuejue: \"?\"","Lin Qing: \"?!\"","Pei Youchuan rubbed his eyes: \"Is that flea-like person... Qiao Chuchu?!\"","Pei Yuan's mouth twitched: \"Who else would be running around the street in the only dress of its kind in all of China?\"","Qiao Chuchu coldly held up her high heel like a sword: \"En garde!!\"","Ji Yanchuan and Xia Xuechun looked at Qiao Chuchu: \"Who—\"","Pei Che suddenly descended from above!","With a powerful move!","He covered Ji Yanchuan and Xia Xuechun's heads with his coat!","The two screamed: \"Ah!!!\"","\"I can't see!\"","Qiao Chuchu looked at Pei Che in surprise.","While firmly holding them down, Pei Che calmly asked Qiao Chuchu: \"What are you doing?\"","\"I can't stand the sight of them!\" Qiao Chuchu said angrily: \"They're just a pair of scumbags, they betrayed Sister Lin Qing, don't they deserve some punishment?\"","Pei Che warned her: \"Even if they need to be taught a lesson, it's not your place to do it. Lin Qing hasn't even said anything yet.\"","As he finished speaking, Ji Yanchuan, who was pinned down, roared: \"Which bitch dared to kick me?! Are you asking for death?!\"","Pei Che responded with a punch!","His tone was eerily calm: \"Who are you calling names?\"","One punch wasn't enough, Pei Che delivered three more in quick succession!!","Ji Yanchuan cried out in pain!","Pei Che raised his hand to strike again!","Qiao Chuchu sensed something was wrong and quickly stopped Pei Che: \"Brother, hitting is one thing, but we can't hit the head! Hitting the head could kill someone!\"","Pei Che's eyes were red with anger: \"Don't stop me! If he's asking for death, I'll grant his wish!\"","Qiao Chuchu used all her strength to pull him back: \"Second Brother, don't be rash! Impulse is the devil!\"","Pei Youchuan walked up to them, looking at them expressionlessly.","Qiao Chuchu saw him and felt relieved: \"Third Brother, you're here, quick, help me stop Second Brother!\"","\"Alright.\" Pei Youchuan crouched down, holding down the suit jacket that Ji Yanchuan was about to break free from.","\"I've got him pinned! Brothers, come join the fight!!!\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","Pei Mu, the sixth brother, rushed in with a flying kick: \"You're getting quite arrogant, aren't you!\"","Pei Ci, the fifth brother, wasn't to be outdone: \"Keep running your mouth, go ahead!\"","The Pei family members went wild like unleashed horses, punching and kicking Ji Yanchuan!","Although they weren't specifically targeting Xia Xuechun, she was occasionally caught in the crossfire, screaming continuously: \"Ah! Help!\"","Pei Yuan made a phone call from the side: \"This is Pei Yuan, remove the cameras in the parking area and clear all the data.\"","Qiao Chuchu stood dumbfounded.","How did it turn into this?","How did it end up like this?!","Nearby, Pei Buxian, the seventh brother, coughed weakly: \"Cough cough cough... stop beating him.\"","Qiao Chuchu looked at Pei Buxian with delight: \"Seventh Brother, you're still the most gentle one.\"","Pei Buxian took out a knife from his pocket: \"Use this instead.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","Qiao Chuchu snatched the knife.","Pei Buxian gave her a cold look and took out another knife.","Qiao Chuchu: \"? Where did you get so many knives?!\"","Pei Buxian smiled coldly: \"Bought them from the store.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"? Of course I know you bought them from the store, I mean why do you have so many knives?\"","Pei Buxian: \"Because I brought them after buying them from the store.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","Pei Buxian lowered his gaze and noticed Qiao Chuchu's bare feet.","In the bitter winter, Qiao Chuchu stood in her dress, her dust-covered feet turning purple on the cold cement ground.","He frowned: \"Hey! Stop fighting!\"","The brothers paused and looked at him in unison.","He jerked his chin towards Qiao Chuchu: \"Look.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"? Look at what?\"","The brothers followed his gaze and noticed Qiao Chuchu's bare feet.","The atmosphere suddenly became tense.","Qiao Chuchu sensed it.","But she didn't understand: \"What... what's wrong?\""]},{"number":16,"title":"Chapter 16: Qiao Chuchu, Come Back Home with Big Brother","paragraphs":["Pei Che's eyes darkened as he stood up and stared at her coldly.","Qiao Chuchu kept backing away, sensing something was wrong. \"What's the matter?\"","Pei Youchuan approached step by step, his eyes as cold as a zombie's.","Qiao Chuchu looked at her clothes in terror.","[I'm wearing an evening gown, not some sexy little camisole! I wasn't trying to seduce anyone, why are you looking at me like that!]","Pei Youchuan reached out towards her: \"You—\"","Qiao Chuchu turned and ran!","Pei Youchuan let out an angry roar: \"Qiao Chuchu, stop right there!!!!\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"Ahhhhhhh!\"","A crowd of people swarmed after Qiao Chuchu, chasing her: \"Don't let her run!!!!\"","Ji Yanchuan and Xia Xuechun emerged from under the clothes, their faces covered in nosebleeds and their hair a mess, looking like bewildered groundhogs.","Ji Yanchuan was furious: \"Where is she?! Where's the person who hit me!\"","Lin Qing was recording video on her phone, crying and laughing at the same time: \"Hahahahaha this is too funny!\"","She sent the video to her brother: \"Brother, look quickly! Ji Yanchuan was cheating, and my new friend helped me get revenge!~\"","Soon, the man who had just taken a shower received the video.","While drying his hair, he clicked play.","He first saw Ji Yanchuan embracing another woman, and his face darkened. Then, suddenly, a girl in a pink dress and scarf appeared in the frame, delivering a flying kick that sent the cheating couple flying!!","The man was surprised and burst out laughing.","This girl was like a little fighter!","Agile and nimble, and quite cute too.","Right after, Pei Che swooped in and covered the couple on the ground with his suit jacket!","When the girl anxiously tried to stop Pei Che, her scarf fell off, inadvertently revealing her profile.","The man's smile froze. He zoomed in on the image and quickly replied: \"Is the girl who helped you Qiao Chuchu?\"","Lin Qing: \"Yes! I was really sad at first, but when she suddenly appeared it was hilarious! Her brothers helped me get revenge too. I didn't go out because I was crying and looked terrible, haha, but I'll remember this favor!\"","\"But brother, how do you know Qiao Chuchu? Aren't you the same age as Pei Yuan? You couldn't have met her in school, right?\"","Lin Shen remained silent, watching as more familiar faces appeared in the video, his brows furrowed: \"Has she reconciled with her brothers now?\"","\"Yes, for some reason, she's moving back to the family house.\"","Lin Qing paused, then felt something was off: \"Do you know Qiao Chuchu?\"","Instead of answering, Lin Shen said: \"The house is settled. Moving in tomorrow.\"","Lin Qing: \"You're coming back tomorrow? Didn't you say you weren't coming back for New Year's this year?\"","Lin Shen didn't answer, picking up a photo frame from the desk.","In the picture, he was wearing a suit and holding a bouquet of sunflowers, with Qiao Chuchu standing beside him, smiling radiantly at the camera.","It had been three years since he cut ties with Qiao Chuchu.","The reason was that he had discovered Qiao Chuchu's abnormal feelings.","He had witnessed Qiao Chuchu, dressed provocatively, desperately clutching Pei Yuan's hand, begging him not to leave.","\"Brother... I can't live without you, brother, please, don't leave me!\"","Pei Yuan had shaken off her hand and left without looking back.","Qiao Chuchu sat on the ground, sobbing uncontrollably.","He had walked up to her, getting straight to the point: \"Do you have special feelings for your brother?\"","Qiao Chuchu looked up in surprise, as if she hadn't expected him to be there: \"Senior Lin Shen?\"","She had been grief-stricken moments before, but now showed only shock, her emotions jarringly disconnected: \"Why are you here?\"","He hadn't answered, still holding a bouquet of delicate pink roses, feeling foolish: \"I thought you liked me, Qiao Chuchu. I was planning to confess to you today.\"","Qiao Chuchu's face suddenly turned pale as she stumbled to her feet: \"No, it's complicated, actually I—\"","She suddenly clutched her chest, as if having a heart attack, too much in pain to speak.","Despite this, Qiao Chuchu still trembled as she grabbed his clothes, covered in cold sweat: \"I have my reasons, I was—\"","Before she could finish, Qiao Chuchu fainted.","After being taken to the hospital, all seven Pei brothers came.","Seeing the unconscious Qiao Chuchu, they all looked tired and weary, as if they couldn't be bothered to deal with it.","It was also that day when he learned the truth about this seemingly bright and cheerful junior's private life.","So this was the famous sister with a brother complex, the one everyone called perverted.","His stomach churned as he threw the roses in the trash.","After Qiao Chuchu woke up, she sent him one message: \"I'm sorry, senior, for disappointing you.\"","He hadn't replied, choosing instead to study abroad, staying away for three years.","Now watching this video, seeing the harmony between the siblings, Lin Shen found it laughable.","Three years had passed, and Qiao Chuchu had even reconciled with her brothers, even winning Lin Qing's favor.","The people around her had changed so much.","Yet he was still thinking about her.","But it was fine.","Lin Shen put down the photo frame.","Tomorrow he would see her.","Perhaps seeing her relationship with her brothers would finally help him let go.","But Lin Shen couldn't help wondering.","What was Qiao Chuchu doing right now?","Was she very happy about reconciling with her brothers?","-","Qiao Chuchu was running wildly down the street, screaming like a stuck pig: \"Ahhhhh what are you doing?!!!\"","Pei Youchuan quickened his pace, wrapped an arm around her waist, and hoisted her up with one hand!","Qiao Chuchu felt like a sack of flour, effortlessly hanging over Pei Youchuan's shoulder.","This disparity in strength and dominance made her realize for the first time how terrifying her brother could be.","[Is this dog Pei Youchuan raised on protein powder or something?!]","Pei Youchuan smiled dangerously.","Dog?","He scooped Qiao Chuchu into his arms!","Qiao Chuchu let out a shriek, grabbing his neck, surprised to meet his mischievous gaze.","\"You were cursing me in your head, weren't you, Qiao Chuchu?\" Pei Youchuan smiled slightly, showing a small fang, full of wickedness.","\"I. Can. Hear. You. You. Know.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?!\"","Pei Youchuan lifted her straight above his head!","She let out a short scream as Pei Youchuan threw her into the air!","Pei Youchuan caught her steadily!","Then threw her up again!","Qiao Chuchu's hands frantically grabbed at the air, but before she could grab anything, Pei Youchuan caught her again!","Then threw her up again!","And caught her again!","Pei Youchuan was tossing her like a chef flipping food in a wok!","Qiao Chuchu screamed repeatedly!","[Damn it ahhhhhhh! You little beast Pei Youchuan ahhhhhh!!!]","Pei Youchuan lifted her high again!","Pei Yuan reprimanded: \"Stop bullying her!\"","Pei Youchuan paused, licking his back teeth reluctantly before slinging Qiao Chuchu over his shoulder.","Qiao Chuchu was panting heavily.","Pei Youchuan, neither flushed nor breathless, treated her like a piece of clothing draped over his shoulder, casually threatening her: \"Watch yourself, Qiao Chuchu. I recently gained mind-reading powers, I can hear when you curse me in your head.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","[Bull**** mind-reading! Can you hear me cursing you now?! I dare you to answer if I call your name, Pei Youchuan!]","Pei Youchuan narrowed his eyes, putting on a fake friendly smile: \"Cursing me again, aren't you?\"","He threw Qiao Chuchu into the air again!!","Pei Yuan's eyes darkened as he pushed Pei Youchuan aside and caught Qiao Chuchu!","Qiao Chuchu was still in shock, breaking out in a cold sweat: \"Thank you, big brother.\"","Pei Yuan looked down at her: \"You're welcome.\"","Her legs had turned to jelly as she stammered: \"You can... put me down now.\"","Pei Yuan: \"No.\"","Someone grabbed her foot.","Qiao Chuchu looked down in surprise.","Pei Che was holding her foot, saying disapprovingly: \"Walking barefoot in winter, how impressive.\"","Despite his tone, he took out a handkerchief to wipe her feet, put her shoes on, and fastened the ankle straps.","Only then did Qiao Chuchu realize her feet were ice cold, and her whole body was freezing.","She awkwardly met Pei Che's annoyed gaze.","Pei Che stepped back: \"There, they're on.\"","Pei Youchuan snorted, taking off his coat and draping it over her.","Qiao Chuchu was surprised by this kindness and tried to get down from Pei Yuan's arms, but he tightened his grip and warned coldly: \"If you don't want Pei Youchuan carrying you, stay still.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...So where are you taking me now?\"","\"Home,\" Pei Yuan strode forward: \"Back to our home.\""]},{"number":17,"title":"Chapter 17: Qiao Chuchu, from today onwards, you will lose the freedom of being alone","paragraphs":["Returning to a home she hadn't been back to in seven years was an indescribable feeling.","Qiao Chuchu stood awkwardly at the doorway.","The air was filled with a faint fragrance, so familiar yet the furnishings had all changed.","She stood there, not knowing what to do.","Pei Youchuan lightly patted her back, his tone teasing: \"What, don't know where to find your slippers anymore? Need your dear third brother to help you?\"","She glared at him, then bent down to search the shoe cabinet.","Opening it, her pink slippers were still on top.","Bought seven years ago, their position remained unchanged.","Qiao Chuchu changed her shoes.","Pei Youchuan laughed beside her: \"Good girl, well done.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"......\"","【Asshole.】","Pei Youchuan's eyes darkened, as if challenging her, he grabbed her arm and pulled her into the living room: \"I've dragged Qiao Chuchu over!\"","The living room was already full of people.","Her brothers sat in their respective places, looking up at her.","Their expressions were grim, clearly here to question her.","Qiao Chuchu suddenly felt like she had entered a strange secret organization.","One where she could be killed at any moment.","Pei Youchuan annoyingly pressed her shoulder, smirking close to her ear: \"You're welcome~\"","She clenched her fists!","【This bastard!!】","Pei Youchuan laughed out loud, sitting in his seat, crossing his legs and watching her with amusement.","Pei Yuan sat in the middle, coldly glaring at her: \"Why are you still standing? Sit down.\"","Qiao Chuchu reluctantly looked at the only seat left for her.","In the very center of the living room.","A spot with a 360-degree view where she was on display like a monkey.","She reluctantly sat down.","The scrutinizing gazes from all directions became even sharper.","Qiao Chuchu felt like her butt was being pricked, and she suddenly stood up: \"I think I'll just stand.\"","【Too scary, being surrounded by them, I feel like a pig waiting to be slaughtered during the New Year.】","Somehow, she heard someone laugh.","Qiao Chuchu looked up in confusion.","Everyone was watching her with amusement.","Qiao Chuchu: \"......\"","【Are they laughing at me?】","Pei Yuan paused, quickly suppressing the corner of his mouth: \"Qiao Chuchu.\"","Qiao Chuchu nervously stared at him.","Pei Yuan said seriously: \"From today on, you will live with us. We will take turns watching and supervising you, preventing you from any possibility of suicide again.\"","\"That means...\"","Pei Yuan crossed his hands over his knees, speaking with a solemn tone: \"You will lose your freedom to be alone from now on.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"Huh?\"","Huh???????","She was stunned: \"Big Brother, I'm a big fool, and I'm a perverted brother complex, aren't you all the most disgusted by being with me? If I'm with you, what if I, I, I, I lose control?\"","Pei Yuan playfully raised an eyebrow: \"Then lose control.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","Pei Yuan leaned his hands on his chin, speaking seriously to her: \"We've thought about it. Since you genuinely like us, to the point of wanting to die if you can't be with any of us, maybe we can try.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","Pei Youchuan grinned: \"Yeah, after all, legally we have no adoption relationship. Although you've lived with us since you were three, we've been together for twenty years, but you're still on the same household registration as your birth parents. If we can get past that mental hurdle, marrying isn't impossible.\"","Qiao Chuchu's legs weakened.","She plopped down in her chair, muttering: \"Tell me the truth, did you really buy insurance for me?\"","Pei Yuan's eyes darkened: \"I'll tell you one last time, our family's financial situation doesn't need fraud. If you say it again, I'll get angry.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"......\"","【Why though!】","【What kind of play is this?!】","【Isn't this driving me crazy?!】","Pei Youchuan watched her with amusement: \"Qiao Chuchu, are you ecstatic?\"","【I'm ecstatic, your grandma's leg!】","Qiao Chuchu took a deep breath, looking at them seriously: \"Actually, just now when I tried to jump off the building to commit suicide, I had a profound realization, I embraced Buddhism, I don't like you anymore!\"","Pei Yuan raised an eyebrow, not surprised: \"So you don't have those feelings for us anymore?\"","Qiao Chuchu nodded vigorously: \"I was really confused back then. I left so many good men unpursued, chasing after all seven of you, I was really blind.\"","Pei Yuan: \"? Why do I feel this sounds awkward?\"","\"You don't need to feel awkward, Brother!\" Qiao Chuchu took a big step forward, grabbing his hand: \"Big Brother, in my heart, you're my mom.\"","Pei Yuan: \"?\"","She walked to Pei Che: \"Second Brother, you're my dad!\"","Pei Che: \"......\"","She walked to Pei Youchuan.","Pei Youchuan looked expectant: \"What am I?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"You're a donkey.\"","Pei Youchuan: \"?\"","Qiao Chuchu stood solemnly before them, took a deep breath, and bowed 90 degrees!","\"I want to apologize to everyone!\"","\"I shouldn't have harbored strange feelings for you, I won't dare to do so again in the future, and I hope everyone can forgive my past actions.\"","\"From now on, you take your path, I take mine, we maintain our past relationship, don't interfere with each other, and during holidays, we exchange tangerines. That's it, goodbye.\"","Qiao Chuchu turned and ran!","Pei Yuan grabbed her back: \"To hear you say that, I'm really gratified, Qiao Chuchu.\"","Qiao Chuchu turned around in surprise, struggling but unable to break free.","How did this guy manage to twist her arm while speaking to her so earnestly!","Pei Yuan easily held her wrist: \"So from now on, we seven brothers will take turns staying with you, cultivating the sibling affection we lost over the past decade.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","【I've already said I don't like them anymore!】","\"Because you don't like us anymore, we should restore our past relationship,\" Pei Yuan said with a smile that hid a knife: \"Finding back the lost decade, don't you think so?\"","Qiao Chuchu was stunned into silence.","【I don't think it's right, but I feel like no matter what I say, they won't let me go.】","Pei Yuan laughed.","Yes.","He wouldn't let her go.","Seven years ago, he sent her away out of heartache.","Now, he wouldn't let go.","Of course, he didn't forgive her right away, as the resentment and hatred remained.","Keeping her by his side was for his own salvation and re-adjustment.","Pei Yuan tightened his grip, speaking slowly: \"I like your frankness, but I don't like your evasion. Since you say I'm your mom, then treat me like a mom.\"","Qiao Chuchu was dazed: \"But I don't know how to treat a mom.\"","Pei Yuan put on a kind smile, gently patting her head: \"This 'mom' doesn't ask for much, just be obedient, understand?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"......\"","Pei Yuan's eyes flashed with a cold light: \"Understand?\"","Qiao Chuchu held her breath, nodding repeatedly: \"Understood.\"","Pei Yuan's smile didn't reach his eyes, gently patting her head: \"Be good, stay with your second brother, the brothers are going to a banquet.\"","Qiao Chuchu looked at Pei Che.","Pei Che sat on the sofa, legs crossed, coldly watching her."]},{"number":18,"title":"Chapter 18: The Sole Doctor Role in the Pei Family: Pei Che","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu felt suffocated and quickly turned her head away.","Pei Yuan and the others walked past her one by one.","Pei Youchuan blocked her path and teased her, \"Little Eight, say goodbye to your brother~\"","She gave him a big, exaggerated eye roll.","Pei Youchuan pinched her cheek, forcing a smile, \"Say goodbye to your brother!\"","Qiao Chuchu mumbled, \"......Bye.\"","Pei Youchuan let go, satisfied, and walked away.","Qiao Chuchu rubbed her sore cheek.","【Is Pei Youchuan going through a rebellious phase again, teasing me like this.】","Pei Youchuan waved at her with a smile and turned to leave, disappearing from her sight.","In the living room, only she and Pei Che remained.","Compared to the previous commotion, it was now unusually quiet.","She felt her awkwardness rising again.","Among all the brothers, Pei Che was the most reserved and quiet.","She never felt awkward when she was with Second Brother before.","But now, after all the foolish things she had done, being with Second Brother, who was so quiet, made the air feel heavy.","Qiao Chuchu looked at the empty courtyard and awkwardly said, \"Uh... Second Brother.\"","Pei Che was looking at his phone, completely ignoring her.","She scratched her head, \"I guess you don't want to be with me either. About the meeting just now... I think we should rethink it, so I'll leave first.\"","【After all, this family hasn't had a place for me for a long time.】","Pei Che's thumb paused on the phone screen, \"Stay.\"","Qiao Chuchu stopped and turned back, puzzled.","Pei Che sat on the sofa, his long legs bent, his eyes like an unfathomable abyss, \"Go back to your room.\"","Qiao Chuchu was surprised and awkwardly laughed, \"Uh... it's not necessary, Second Brother. I know you all don't like me, and I know I've done a lot of wrong things. I think we should keep a safe distance—\"","\"Go. Back. To. Your. Room.\" Pei Che put away his phone and commanded her directly.","Qiao Chuchu frowned, sensing something was off.","Pei Che's gaze at her was dangerous.","But she still tried to reason, \"Second Brother, I know I scared you all earlier. I promise I won't cause trouble again! I really can't stay in this house anymore. I don't want to stay. I feel weird living with you all, it might involve your privacy or something.\"","Pei Che's face suddenly darkened.","Qiao Chuchu quickly backed down, \"I'll go upstairs right now.\"","Pei Che put away his phone, expressionless, and followed her.","Qiao Chuchu glanced back at him, feeling a chill run down her spine, and quickened her pace.","Pei Che followed her calmly.","Apart from his cold, handsome face, his behavior was like that of a creepy ghost.","Qiao Chuchu's palms were sweating, not knowing what he was up to.","She almost tripped on the stairs and nearly fell, looking back in panic.","The light from the living room cast a faint glow into the corridor. Pei Che stood at the boundary of light and shadow, looking up at her.","She was even more frightened and stumbled into her room, locking the door without hesitation!","Pei Che put his hand in his pocket, revealing a noticeable scar from a wrist cut, hidden in his pocket, and slowly ascended the stairs.","Qiao Chuchu listened to his footsteps, her palms sweating.","She was afraid of Second Brother.","Pei Che was born to be the master of the house.","Cold, quiet, with a perfect physique.","He was a man who could be described as beautiful, with delicate features, cat-like narrow eyes, pale skin, making the teardrop mole under his eye stand out, and well-defined lips that curved slightly upward.","Despite having such a smile, his expressionless face was still eerie.","He was meticulous and ruthless in his actions, decisive and efficient.","She always felt that beneath Second Brother's calm exterior lay a twisted madness.","Pei Che used to be a heart surgeon, extremely skilled, but for some reason, he hadn't performed surgeries in the past two years, only dealing with medical investments.","The reason she found Second Brother terrifying was that before they fell out, she once asked him why he wanted to be a doctor.","Back then, Pei Che was still a teenager, looking at her with a calm gaze.","—\"I like hearts because they control life and death. I can witness a heart struggling to beat, and I can either help it or destroy it.\"","Despite saying that, Pei Che never failed. He established himself, became renowned, and became a sought-after elite doctor among patients' families.","Even after so many years, she still remembered the chill that ran down her spine when she heard that answer.","Suddenly, the door handle of her room turned halfway down.","Qiao Chuchu looked terrified at the door.","The man outside tried to turn the handle twice but couldn't open it.","Qiao Chuchu felt short of breath, biting her lower lip, not making a sound.","After a while, it was quiet outside.","She let out a sigh of relief.","But then the sound of keys clinking came from outside.","The lock turned.","\"Click!\" The sound of the lock opening.","The door slowly opened.","Qiao Chuchu backed away in terror!","Pei Che walked in as usual, \"You forgot your door can't be locked from the inside.\"","As he spoke, he calmly put away the key.","Qiao Chuchu noticed a detail.","Pei Che's car key... was tied together with her room key.","Seven years.","Her room key had always been kept with his car key.","【...How could I forget? The distance between my brothers and becoming a yandere is only one step away from my death in front of them. They're already hidden yanderes.】","Qiao Chuchu's palms were sweating, and she lowered her head, \"Uh... yes, I forgot.\"","She pretended to be relaxed and looked around her room, \"My room hasn't changed.\"","Her room was filled with items left from seven years ago.","She wiped her finger on the table and left a thick layer of dust.","The dust almost covered her fingerprints.","It wasn't hard to guess; after she was kicked out, no one had cleaned this room, and it had been neglected.","She awkwardly brushed off the dust, \"This room hasn't been cleaned, it's not livable. I think it's more convenient for me to stay outside, after all these years, right?\"","Pei Che let out a cold laugh, \"No.\"","Qiao Chuchu expected it, still trying to persuade, \"There's no reason why not. I won't try to kill myself again, and I won't cause trouble, I—\"","Pei Che's voice grew colder, \"Qiao Chuchu, don't push your luck.\"","Qiao Chuchu was surprised, \"What?\"","She just turned around when the lights in the room suddenly went out.","Qiao Chuchu reached for her phone but remembered she had left it in the living room.","Pei Che was blocking the door.","The light from outside cast a faint glow, but it was hard to see clearly.","She could only notice Pei Che's dark eyes reflecting tiny sparks, like a vast, burning net.","She was trapped in it, feeling unable to breathe.","Pei Che stood in the shadows, half of his cold, sculpted face illuminated by the cut light, devoid of any emotion.","\"Why do you come and go as you please?\"","Pei Che's voice was like a sharp bone scraper, calmly scraping every inch of her body.","\"What do you take this family for?\""]},{"number":19,"title":"Chapter 19: We Eight Will Always Be Together","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu's heart raced!","Pei Che was angry.","She tried to sound casual: \"There's no place for me in this home anymore. It's awkward for me to come back now.\"","Pei Che pressed: \"And who is it that made this home not have a place for you?\"","Qiao Chuchu was hit where it hurt, and she fell silent.","Pei Che's imposing presence loomed over her, knowing full well: \"Tell me, because of whom?\"","Ashamed, Qiao Chuchu lowered her head and tried to walk past him.","Pei Che grabbed her wrist!","Qiao Chuchu felt a dizzying spin and was suddenly pinned down on the bed!","She widened her eyes in terror: \"Brother!\"","\"Don't call me brother!!!\"","Pei Che's voice suddenly rose, like a raging beast: \"I'm no longer your brother! Because you destroyed everything!!!\"","Qiao Chuchu tensed up, feeling Pei Che's strength like a vice pressing down on her.","She couldn't even move her arms.","Fear crept up her limbs like a swarm of insects, and she struggled to control herself, her voice already trembling with tears: \"If you hate me, then let me go, why hold me here like this, are you sick or something?!\"","\"I said you're staying here, and that's final.\"","Pei Che pinned her hands above her head, straddling her waist with his legs firmly trapping her: \"Qiao Chuchu, don't forget, even though you call us brothers, we have no blood relation, not even linked on the household register. Do you know what that means? It means we could be siblings, or we could be man and woman. Our boundaries are defined by our hearts.\"","Under the silvery moonlight, Qiao Chuchu's skirt spread across the bed, looking extremely disheveled, while Pei Che, impeccably dressed in a suit, looked down at her darkly: \"You told me this yourself, do you remember?\"","Qiao Chuchu closed her eyes in humiliation.","Of course, she remembered.","She could never forget the look in Pei Che's eyes after she said those words.","The look of looking at trash.","Pei Che squeezed her wrist, leaning closer: \"You destroyed the home we painstakingly built, the happy times of our family of eight. I don't care what your past grievances or reasons were, now that there's a chance to mend this family, you must stay.\"","Qiao Chuchu's heart nearly leapt out of her chest from fear: \"We can't go back to how things were.\"","[I've done so many terrible things, how can I just act like they never happened?]","Pei Che's voice rose: \"So what!!!\"","His forehead veins bulged, his handsome face contorted with hatred: \"Tell me, even if you've done some wrong, so what?! Now you can come back, why are you being picky and unwilling to stay?!\"","He just couldn't understand: \"Clearly, you're the one who made mistakes, so why are you the one choosing to stay away?!\"","Qiao Chuchu's head buzzed, and she got angry: \"Can you treat me like you used to?!\"","\"I can!!!\" Pei Che retorted sharply.","Qiao Chuchu couldn't hold back her tears: \"Then look at what you're doing now, you're pinning me down, you're pressing me onto the bed!\"","Pei Che was stunned, slowly realizing their positions.","Qiao Chuchu's tears streamed down: \"You're terrifying right now, Second Brother!\"","Pei Che was taken aback, gradually loosening his grip.","She sobbed softly, almost pleading: \"Just let me go, we can't go back to how we were, but I can promise I won't cling to you like before, I'll help you in my own way, repaying all I've done.\"","[I'll use my strength to prevent our brothers from ending tragically, I won't hurt them anymore, I don't want this... I'm really sorry.]","Pei Che's heart skipped a beat.","Tearful, Qiao Chuchu said: \"Let me go, I really don't belong here.\"","Pei Che didn't speak, looking down at her with a stern face.","Qiao Chuchu's curls spread across the bed, the moonlight casting a beautiful sheen on her hair.","Her eyes seemed to hold shattered stars, tears falling in big drops, wetting her auburn hair, her chest heaving with sobs.","He could even hear her breathing.","Mysteriously, Pei Che raised his hand and pressed it against her carotid artery.","Qiao Chuchu grew even more terrified.","[What is he going to do? Strangle me?]","Pei Che ignored her, just feeling the pulse under his fingers.","Qiao Chuchu was alive.","She hadn't fallen from a height, hadn't been stabbed.","She was alive, could retort, could fear, and would cry during arguments.","He moved his hand up, roughly wiping away her tears.","Qiao Chuchu felt like a kitten being groomed by a lion.","Pei Che's hand swept over her face, smearing her eye shadow and mascara into a mess.","She looked up, dazed.","Pei Che's face was no longer as contorted: \"Don't let me hear you say you don't want to stay again.\"","Qiao Chuchu opened her mouth: \"But—\"","Pei Che covered her mouth: \"You're dying here, do you hear me?\"","She widened her eyes in terror, her body reflexively trembling.","Pei Che felt her tremble, a sinister smile curling his lips: \"Are you afraid of me?\"","Qiao Chuchu bit her lip, too scared to speak.","[How could I not be afraid, big brother? You're holding the key to my room, staring at me, and pinning me down, I've never been pressed down by a man like this my whole life, and your aura is heavier than a ghost's!]","Pei Che chuckled softly, leaning down: \"Qiao Chuchu, don't you remember? When you were little, you liked me the most among the seven brothers.\"","Qiao Chuchu felt absurd: \"Huh?\"","She thought back, not really believing that.","She had always liked the eldest brother, Pei Yuan, the most.","Because Pei Yuan was gentle, like a nurturing mother, even though he was talkative, he really took care of people.","Pei Che had always been eerie.","As she thought, Qiao Chuchu suddenly had an epiphany, realizing something.","She looked at his wrist, where a scar of overlapping cuts was visible.","Pei Che followed her gaze to the scar on his wrist: \"Remember now?\"","Qiao Chuchu felt a creeping horror.","She remembered.","After their foster parents passed away, each of the brothers was devastated, and Pei Che had tried to commit suicide by slashing his wrists.","It was her who found him in the bathtub, holding him tightly in the blood-stained water.","Pei Che, drowsy, leaned on her shoulder: \"Chuchu, there's nothing left in this world worth living for, I don't want to live anymore.\"","\"You can't think like that, Second Brother, you have me, and the rest of us, if you leave, what will happen to the rest of us? We eight are indispensable.\"","Pei Che, sickly: \"Indispensable?\"","\"Yes, indispensable!\" She wiped the blood from his face: \"We're a family, we have to stay together forever, never separate.\"","That day, Pei Che's dull eyes lit up with hope.","What else they said, she couldn't recall.","She only remembered Pei Che solemnly telling her: \"It's settled then, Chuchu, no matter what happens, our family of eight must stay together, eat together, celebrate the new year together, go shopping together, travel together, not neglect family for love, not fall apart for money, and never hurt each other.\"","\"We must stay together forever.\""]},{"number":20,"title":"Chapter 20: The Abnormal Brother's Account Has Been Cultivated, But Whether to Play or Not Is Another Matter","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu trembled in fear.","The more she thought about those youthful promises, the clearer they became.","Like a whip striking her soul.","She felt ashamed, yet couldn't ignore that deep scar: \"I remember the scar from your wrist-cutting has faded, why is there a new one?\"","Pei Che calmly retorted: \"What do you think?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"......\"","Pei Che leaned over her, his hands on either side of her face, staring at her in confusion: \"It's been over a decade, and I haven't forgotten a single moment of what you said that day. These years, I've thought about it over and over again. Was it that you lied to me back then, or were those promises true, but your betrayal was also true, and the torment you put us through was real.\"","\"I know you had your reasons.\"","\"But in your heart, what are we to you?\"","Pei Che placed his hand on her pulsating pulse, baffled.","Was he the brother who raised her?","Or just a predetermined character in a novel?","Pei Che couldn't figure it out and didn't care to dwell on the process; he only wanted the outcome.","\"No matter how you see me, you destroyed everything, and you have to make up for the past thirteen years, okay?\"","The tone was a request, but it was clearly an order.","Qiao Chuchu looked at him with unfamiliarity, not answering.","Pei Che's hand on her neck gradually tightened: \"Okay?\"","She felt suffocated, nodding painfully: \"Okay.\"","Pei Che: \"Don't ever say the word 'leave' again, okay?\"","\"......Okay.\"","\"And don't try to escape, or you'll face even worse consequences when caught, okay?\"","\"......Okay.\"","\"Don't destroy this home anymore, fulfill the promises you once made, okay?\"","\"......Okay.\"","\"Good girl.\" Pei Che smiled, finally releasing his grip on her neck.","Qiao Chuchu coughed violently.","Dust flew in the room as she waved her hand while coughing, her eyes misty with tears as she glanced at Pei Che.","Pei Che watched her with a half-smile, as if looking at a new toy, his interest piqued as he stared into her eyes.","She pretended to be indifferent and looked away: \"But......\"","Pei Che tilted his head.","She had objections but didn't dare to voice them.","【My room is full of dust, how can I live here?】","Pei Che: \"......\"","He raised his hand, pointing outside.","Qiao Chuchu's eyes lit up: \"You're letting me stay outside?\"","Pei Che: \"Stay in my room.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","Pei Che got off her, coldly saying: \"The bedsheets in my room are newly bought and washed, I haven't used them yet, you can stay there.\"","The guest room wasn't cleaned, and there were no bedsheets, leaving no other choice.","Qiao Chuchu thought it over and accepted, meekly saying: \"How much did your bedsheets cost?\"","Pei Che frowned: \"Why do you ask?\"","Qiao Chuchu looked serious: \"After all, I'll be using them, and it wouldn't be good for you to use them afterward. I'll replace them with new ones tomorrow, but if they're too expensive, I'll just sleep on the sofa for tonight.\"","Pei Che: \"Are you crazy?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","Pei Che snapped: \"Just go, don't make me angry!\"","Qiao Chuchu sprang up from the bed, giving Pei Che a strange look.","【Times have changed, the germaphobic second brother is actually letting me stay in his room? Is he crazy or just stupid?】","Pei Che: \"?\"","Qiao Chuchu felt a chill down her spine and hurried away!","Pei Che glared at the door, muttering darkly: \"I used to wash her hair when she was little, now she's counting the cost with me.\"","-","At two in the morning, the other brothers returned home from a business meeting.","Qiao Chuchu's room door was silently pushed open.","The air was filled with the scent of her shampoo, masking the faint cold fragrance from Pei Che's room.","Pei Che entered first, walking to the bed.","Weak moonlight from the window illuminated the sleeping girl.","He called: \"Qiao Chuchu.\"","Qiao Chuchu's breathing was even, sleeping deeply like a pig.","Pei Che looked at the door and whispered: \"Come in, she's asleep.\"","The men outside filed in, surrounding Qiao Chuchu.","Qiao Chuchu's sleeping posture was serene, her hands neatly placed on the blanket.","Pei Youchuan stared, his voice lowered: \"I remember every time she slept as a child, I would watch her because I thought she was an angel when she slept.\"","\"Quiet, not fussy, with long eyelashes and a small mouth.\"","Pei Youchuan saw the little girl through Qiao Chuchu, smiling as he reminisced: \"She was my little sweetheart back then.\"","Pei Buxian frowned: \"You're talking nonsense, young Qiao Chuchu was clearly my little sweetheart.\"","Pei Youchuan was displeased: \"Mine.\"","Pei Buxian lowered his voice: \"Mine.\"","\"What are you arguing about?\" Pei Che suggested indifferently: \"Since she's lying here, why don't you wake her up and ask her who her little sweetheart was back then?\"","Pei Youchuan was surprised: \"Wouldn't that blow our cover?\"","\"Oh, so you know we're sneaking in,\" Pei Che said with a deadpan expression: \"I thought you didn't.\"","Pei Youchuan: \"......\"","Pei Buxian: \"......\"","Pei Yuan reached out to tuck in the blanket around Qiao Chuchu: \"You know, if the plot had gone as planned, and she had died, what would we be doing now?\"","They imagined that scene, their noses tingling, and remained silent.","Pei Buxian raised his hand: \"I know what we'd be doing.\"","The brothers looked at him.","He spoke calmly: \"We'd still be around her, the only difference being one would be breathing, the other not, one in pajamas, the other in a shroud.\"","Pei Yuan: \"......\"","The other brothers: \"......\"","Pei Buxian lowered his hand, somewhat puzzled: \"Am I wrong?\"","Pei Yuan ignored him: \"Now that things have come to this, I believe it's the will of heaven. From today on, we'll live with her again.\"","The other brothers looked at Qiao Chuchu.","Pei Youchuan smiled, his eyes cold: \"Although Qiao Chuchu is a bit twisted, I'm willing to give her a chance.\"","He stared intently at Qiao Chuchu's sleeping face: \"I hope she won't disappoint us again.\"","Pei Buxian: \"What would make you disappointed?\"","Pei Youchuan glared at him: \"Of course, if she doesn't know her limits, always clings to us, secretly cares about us, and understands everything about us, behaving like a yandere.\"","Pei Buxian tilted his head: \"But we entered her room at two in the morning, forming a circle around her bed. Don't you think we're more twisted?\"","Pei Yuan: \"......\"","Pei Che: \"......\"","Pei Youchuan: \"......\"","Pei Fengnong: \"......\"","Pei Mu: \"......\"","Pei Ci: \"......\"","The six men rushed out of the room in a frenzy!","Pei Youchuan, still in shock, checked himself: \"Am I twisted? Have I become a twisted brother?!\"","Pei Ci patted his shoulder: \"Don't worry, third brother, usually twisted people are unaware of their condition. We realize what we've done is wrong, so we're not twisted.\"","Pei Youchuan: \"But our twisted behavior was pointed out by seventh brother, wasn't it?\"","Everyone: \"......\"","They turned to look at the seventh brother.","Where was he?","Pei Youchuan peeked into the room, whispering: \"Pei Buxian, what are you doing?\"","Pei Buxian stood straight at Qiao Chuchu's bedside: \"You guys go back, I still want to stand here for a while.\"","He smiled at the sleeping Qiao Chuchu: \"I haven't had enough yet, heh.\"","Everyone: \"......\""]},{"number":21,"title":"Chapter 21: Eight Siblings, Form a Group Without Qiao Chuchu","paragraphs":["The next morning.","Qiao Chuchu looked at Pei Buxian.","Pei Buxian was holding his West Highland Terrier, staring blankly out the window.","Pei Buxian's skin was very fair, so the bruise around his eye was particularly noticeable, looking like a panda eye hanging on half his face, extremely comical.","After a moment of hesitation, Qiao Chuchu couldn't help but ask, \"Brother Seven, did someone beat you up?\"","Pei Buxian finally glanced at her.","It was exactly 8 a.m., and the brothers were gradually emerging from their rooms to have breakfast.","Each of them was dressed in a sharp suit, looking handsome and walking with a breeze.","Hearing Qiao Chuchu's question, they all paused and glared at Pei Buxian.","Pei Buxian, in his casual home clothes, holding a dog, spoke slowly, \"Yes, I got beaten up by the brothers.\"","Qiao Chuchu was shocked, \"Why?\"","Pei Buxian calmly reported, \"Because I wanted to stand beside a girl and watch her sleep, and they wouldn't let me.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","Pei Buxian's tone was listless, \"Don't you think the brothers are being too harsh?\"","Qiao Chuchu's mouth twitched as she looked at the six men, who were sitting in their respective chairs, their expressions sullen, as if they would beat her up too if she agreed.","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","【I think it's better to sort out what will happen next.】","The seven of them: \"?\"","They were all ears!","Qiao Chuchu leaned back in her chair and thought.","Although this world was real, she had treated it as a novel for so long that she was used to sorting out the plot with a novel mindset, which made the storyline clearer.","She quietly slid her fingertip on the table: 【The beginning of the story is after my death, when the brothers' personalities drastically changed, suffering a significant blow. At this time, the female lead enters their lives, making them fall in love at first sight and gradually healing them, while also arousing their possessive desires.】","As she went along, Qiao Chuchu felt something was off: 【Wait, yesterday my brothers already met Xia Xuechun, did they fall in love at first sight?】","The seven of them: \"...\"","Did they look like they fell in love at first sight?","Pei Youchuan picked up his phone: \"Ahem!!\"","The six of them looked at him.","Pei Youchuan shook his phone.","They understood, opened their phones, and received a notification.","【Pei Youchuan invited you to join the group chat.】","Pei Youchuan: \"Listening to Qiao Chuchu's thoughts while chatting in the group, isn't that the most fun?\"","Pei Buxian: \"I'll sprinkle chili in your coffee.\"","Pei Youchuan spat out his coffee in one gulp!!","Pei Yuan: \"Quiet, Qiao Chuchu is looking over.\"","They immediately looked at Qiao Chuchu.","Qiao Chuchu looked at Pei Youchuan strangely.","Pei Youchuan picked up a napkin to wipe the coffee on the table, looking normal as he glanced at Pei Buxian.","Pei Buxian gave him a sweet smile.","Qiao Chuchu: 【...Am I imagining things? Why do I feel like they're hiding something from me?】","They tensed up, pretending to look at their phones normally.","Qiao Chuchu didn't think much about it and turned her head to look out the window: 【Although there are seven brothers with seven emotional lines, the timeline of their deaths is closely linked. If I want to change the situation, I should kill their love in the cradle, so they won't die, right?】","Pei Yuan typed in the group: \"As soon as we saw Xia Xuechun, the so-called love at first sight was already killed.\"","Pei Che: \"How come Qiao Chuchu didn't notice we're not interested in Xia Xuechun?\"","Pei Ci: \"Haha, Qiao Chuchu's brain is smaller than a butternut squash, what do you expect her to notice?\"","Pei Mu: \"She can't even do multiplication and division!\"","Pei Fengnong: \"Yet she dares to protect us.\"","Pei Youchuan: \"...Isn't that kind of touching?\"","Pei Buxian: \"But isn't she protecting us because she'll be affected too after we die?\"","The other six: \"?\""]},{"number":22,"title":"Chapter 22: The First to Face the Challenge of Not Dating is Pei Buxian","paragraphs":["Oh, right.","If they died, Qiao Chuchu would go bankrupt and might end up in a terrible situation.","That was close; I almost got moved.","Qiao Chuchu furrowed her brows in thought: [Regardless of whether they fall in love at first sight, since Lin Qing bumped into the heroine's mother, I think the events in the plot will inevitably happen, so they will definitely develop feelings.]","[And among the seven, the first to fall in love will be the seventh brother, Pei Buxian.]","The six people at the table looked at Pei Buxian in unison!","Pei Buxian, holding a dog, looked up innocently and clueless.","The other brothers exchanged glances.","Why him?!","Any of the brothers could have taken on the challenge first.","But it couldn't be Pei Buxian, the most eccentric of them all!","Pei Youchuan: \"It's heartbreaking that the first one is Pei Buxian! I bet a hundred bucks that Pei Buxian will fall for Xia Xuechun!\"","Pei Ci: \"I'm in!\"","Pei Mu: \"I'm in too!\"","Pei Fengnong: \"You guys are too much, how can you think that of our little brother? He's still our seventh brother!\"","Pei Youchuan: \"So, are you in or not?\"","Pei Fengnong: \"I'll go all in.\"","The others: \"?\"","Qiao Chuchu was still deep in thought: [Xia Xuechun will come to this mansion as a temporary maid, so this month will be the golden period for her to interact with the brothers.]","Pei Youchuan quickly made a joke: \"Meeting canceled, I'm going to the gate to place thumbtacks.\"","Pei Fengnong: \"Meeting canceled, I'm going to chase away all the maids.\"","Pei Ci: \"Meeting canceled, I'm going to find a master to exorcise evil spirits.\"","Pei Mu: \"Meeting canceled, because I want the meeting canceled.\"","Pei Che: \"...\"","Pei Yuan: \"Warning you all, no one is allowed to interfere with the plot, or Qiao Chuchu won't be able to predict what happens next. We just need to turn the tide at the most critical moments, don't make things difficult.\"","The chaos in the group stopped.","Pei Yuan looked at Pei Buxian: \"Little brother, can you handle this on your own?\"","Pei Buxian: \"I'm not alone, I have a dog.\"","Pei Yuan: \"...\"","The others: \"...\"","Pei Yuan sighed: \"Everyone be prepared, if Pei Buxian really falls for Xia Xuechun, we'll send him to a mental asylum abroad.\"","Pei Youchuan: \"Yes, sir!\"","Pei Yuan: \"Pei Buxian, since today's plot revolves around you, can you stay behind to protect Qiao Chuchu?\"","Pei Buxian didn't answer.","But he looked at the message and smiled strangely.","He had platinum blonde hair, like a fluffy golden shorthair, with a slight curve at the corners of his mouth.","Pei Yuan: \"...\"","Maybe we should just cancel the meeting.","In the end, Pei Buxian stood at the door with the dog, sending off his six working brothers.","Pei Yuan was extremely worried, patting his cheek: \"Be sure to stay awake, if you feel your heart racing for Xia Xuechun, think about how you'll end up.\"","Pei Buxian obediently replied: \"Don't worry, brother, I'll treat the world as if I'm already dead.\"","Pei Yuan nodded seriously: \"Then I'm relieved.\"","The six others nearby: \"...\"","Why does that sound off?","Qiao Chuchu happened to pass by the gate, seeing the group of them.","They noticed her too, their expressions of worry instantly turning cold, and they got into their respective cars.","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","They don't want to talk to me, yet they let me come back; they're so bizarre!","Luxury cars drove out of the courtyard one by one.","Xia Xuechun entered from the side door, watching the scene in awe.","Her friend Qi Xiaojia patted her arm hard: \"Oh my god, Xuexue, look at these cars, all worth millions and even tens of millions!\"","Xia Xuechun came to her senses, unimpressed: \"Just cars.\"","\"Just cars?\" Qi Xiaojia was astonished: \"Look at those cars, the leading ones are Rolls-Royces and Maybachs, even custom sports cars! These are the cars that novel heroes drive! We'll never earn that kind of money in our lifetime, yet they use it as their daily vehicles. Do you know the significance of this?\"","Xia Xuechun shrugged, unimpressed: \"But money can't buy happiness, they've lost a lot of life's pleasures.\"","The aunt leading them laughed: \"Xuexue is right, the seven gentlemen in this house really aren't happy.\"","Xia Xuechun proudly lifted her chin, her tone playful: \"See? I knew rich people aren't happy!~\"","Qi Xiaojia's focus was elsewhere: \"Aunt Wang, you said there are seven men living here? Are they handsome? Are they hot?!\"","Aunt Wang nodded: \"Yes, they're more handsome than many stars, but their tempers are all strange.\"","Aunt Wang warned again: \"You two are here to fill two vacant positions, not to chat with the gentlemen. Their tempers are all strange, you can't talk to them first, just do what they tell you to do, don't offend them, or you'll lose this high-paying job.\"","Xia Xuechun and Qi Xiaojia nodded seriously.","This was the wealthy villa district in the eastern suburbs of Lan City, where every household had its own swimming pool, and it took five minutes to walk to a neighbor's house.","And this villa was the most prestigious and spacious house in the eastern suburbs.","Working here for a month could earn you thirty thousand yuan!","The main job was household chores, laundry, cleaning, helping in the kitchen, serving tea and water, and other trivial tasks.","Don't underestimate these tasks; it was a coveted position.","Aunt Wang had been working here for three years and finally climbed to the position of deputy housekeeper, so she quickly recruited them as soon as there was an opening.","After all, one shouldn't let good opportunities slip away.","Xia Xuechun followed Aunt Wang into the villa, finding it very luxurious, like a Western palace, with extravagant crystal chandeliers and oil paintings as decorations, not in line with current interior design tastes.","Aunt Wang said: \"This house is decades old, designed by Madam Pei when she was alive, so the gentlemen cherish everything very much. Be very careful when you work, don't knock anything over.\"","She led them to the servants' quarters, handing them two documents: \"Memorize the information about the seven gentlemen, it includes their taboos, preferences, and habits.\"","Xia Xuechun opened it and saw Qiao Chuchu's photo at the bottom, surprised: \"Why is it her?!\"","Qi Xiaojia was surprised: \"Who?\"","Xia Xuechun pointed at Qiao Chuchu's photo: \"She's the one who made me pay seventy-six thousand yuan for a ruined dress!\"","Qi Xiaojia's mouth gaped: \"She's that bitch?!\"","Qiao Chuchu's photo next to the seven handsome men didn't get overshadowed at all, but rather left a lot of room for imagination.","In the photo, her curly hair tucked behind her ears, revealing a delicate face, she smiled brightly at the camera.","Her eyes and brows were full of lively charm.","Qi Xiaojia was indignant: \"With seven brothers and so rich and beautiful, that bitch sure knows how to be born into a good family.\"","Aunt Wang added: \"She's adopted, and her relationship with her brothers isn't good, she just moved back.\"","Xia Xuechun was surprised: \"Adopted? Relationship not good? Are you sure?\""]},{"number":23,"title":"Chapter 23: Pei Buyuan was Enchanted by Xia Xuechun","paragraphs":["She couldn't help but feel that these seven men seemed very fond of Qiao Chuchu.","Auntie Wang affirmed, \"Of course, one of the seven gentlemen's taboos is not to mention their sister in front of them.\"","She pointed to the taboo written on the paper: \"Look, this is the only taboo that everyone agrees on, and it's even highlighted in red. You must be very careful.\"","Xia Xuechun scanned through it: \"Why doesn't Qiao Chuchu have any taboos or preferences?\"","Auntie Wang sighed helplessly: \"It's because she just came back, and everyone who knew her before is no longer here. We don't know her, only what she looks like.\"","Xia Xuechun understood.","So this girl wasn't liked by her brothers.","No wonder.","Such an arrogant and greedy person indeed isn't likable.","Qi Xiaojia whispered in her ear: \"Since her brothers don't like her, it's okay for us to secretly disobey her, right?\"","Xia Xuechun smiled and nodded: \"As long as we don't make it too obvious.\"","-","Qiao Chuchu sat on the sofa drawing on her tablet. After a while, she sighed: \"Can I go to the study to draw? I feel uninspired here.\"","Pei Buxian sat beside her, looking at his laptop: \"No.\"","Qiao Chuchu was speechless: \"Why?\"","Pei Buxian, expressionless, sipped his strawberry milk: \"I need to keep an eye on you to prevent you from committing suicide. If you go to the study, I'll have to go too, but I don't want to now because I'm inspired to write my novel in the living room.\"","She protested: \"What about my drawing? I also have inspiration.\"","Pei Buxian picked up his phone and transferred fifty thousand yuan to her: \"I'll buy your drawing.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","Pei Buxian, still chewing on his straw, looked at her calmly: \"I'm your employer now, can you listen?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"......\"","She angrily threw her tablet away!","【Pei Buxian is such a stubborn donkey!】","Pei Buxian remained expressionless.","Yes, he was.","Xia Xuechun walked into the living room and just happened to see this scene.","The siblings sat on the sofa, the atmosphere stiff.","Qiao Chuchu crossed her arms, seemingly pouting at Pei Buxian.","Pei Buxian typed on his laptop, ignoring Qiao Chuchu's mood.","Xia Xuechun couldn't help but mock inwardly.","She thought she was a little princess surrounded by stars, but she was just a tool pretending to be perfect in front of others.","She walked towards Qiao Chuchu.","Qiao Chuchu noticed her and became interested.","【Oh, the heroine is here.】","Pei Buxian paused typing and looked at Xia Xuechun.","Qiao Chuchu glared at Pei Buxian: 【Hmph, Pei Buxian, you're pretending to be indifferent, but in reality, you're just a lovesick fool. If I die, you'll become the most obsessive one in the seven-man group!】","【Because after you fall deeply in love with Xia Xuechun, as the master of Chinese suspense and detective novels, you'll start writing \"Dragon-Pride Male Protagonist Novels,\" and the heroine in your novels will always be Xia Xuechun. Your love for her will be engraved in your words, disappointing your readers and even making it to the hot search several times. Readers will try to persuade you, but you won't listen, and they'll throw eggs at you in anger!】","Pei Buxian's eyes flickered, curious like a puppy as he stared at Xia Xuechun.","All along, there had only been one heroine in his detective novels.","What kind of charm did this Xia Xuechun possess to replace the original heroine in his novels and occupy his creative world?","Xia Xuechun felt Pei Buxian's intense gaze and was a bit uncomfortable.","She used a clean cloth to wipe the opposite sofa.","Pei Buxian kept staring at her.","Xia Xuechun secretly glanced at Pei Buxian and just happened to meet his eyes, quickly looking away in panic.","The masters of this house were all so handsome.","Pei Buxian's features were exquisite, a kind of delicate beauty.","He had a feminine appearance and dyed his hair platinum blonde. His beautiful, clear eyes were like the starry sky in a doll's eyes, drawing people into his enchanting gaze.","Xia Xuechun's movements became stiff under this intense gaze.","Qiao Chuchu watched from the side.","Pei Buxian was so focused on staring at Xia Xuechun.","Xia Xuechun was already flustered and shy, her cheeks flushed, her eyes moist like a little deer's.","Qiao Chuchu sighed: 【Ah, it seems that this destined love cannot be avoided.】","Pei Buxian's eyes flickered as he continued to look at Xia Xuechun.","After hesitating, Xia Xuechun finally mustered the courage to greet Pei Buxian: \"Mr. Pei, you've been watching me all this time, is there something you need?\"","Pei Buxian came to his senses: \"I was thinking.\"","Xia Xuechun was curious: \"Thinking about what?\"","Pei Buxian: \"Thinking about why someone like you, who's practically useless, could be hired for a thousand yuan a day.\"","Xia Xuechun: \"?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","Pei Buxian tilted his head, indifferently: \"And you work very much like someone.\"","Xia Xuechun was a bit panicked: \"......Like who?\"","Pei Buxian: \"Like a great-grandmother who crawled out of someone else's ancestral grave.\"","Xia Xuechun: \"?????\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"Pfft!\"","Pei Buxian stood up: \"Let's go, Qiao Chuchu, to the study.\"","Qiao Chuchu suppressed her laughter and stood up from the sofa.","Pei Buxian looked around: \"Westie, come with Dad.\"","......","Pei Buxian frowned: \"Westie?\"","......","Qiao Chuchu looked around.","The vast living room was quiet, making one worry.","Pei Buxian's face turned pale in an instant: \"Westie? Westie?!\"","Seeing his bad complexion, Qiao Chuchu quickly stood up: \"Brother Seven, it's okay, Westie is probably just playing in another room. Although the house is big and hard to find, all the doors are closed, where could Westie go? I'll help you look for it.\"","Xia Xuechun held her breath, looking embarrassed: \"Uh......\"","Qiao Chuchu was on guard: \"What's wrong?\"","Xia Xuechun stood there awkwardly, her hands fidgeting in front of her: \"When I came in through the side door, I didn't close it.\"","She apologized to Pei Buxian: \"I forgot......\"","Qiao Chuchu widened her eyes in shock: \"What?! How could you forget to close the door? The employer's house has pets, and not just one. What if the cat or dog gets lost?!\"","Xia Xuechun shivered from her yelling, pouting unhappily: \"I didn't do it on purpose!\"","Pei Buxian suddenly grabbed her collar: \"Just because it wasn't on purpose, does that make it okay?!\"","Xia Xuechun screamed, meeting Pei Buxian's furious gaze: \"Find my Westie, I want it back in my arms.\"","Xia Xuechun couldn't help but tremble: \"But... I don't know where to look.\"","Pei Buxian's eyes darkened, clenching his teeth: \"You don't know where to find the dog, but I know where to find your stupid father, mother, and brother.\"","Xia Xuechun: \"!\"","Pei Buxian gripped her collar tightly, threatening fiercely: \"Now do you know where to find my dog for me?\""]},{"number":24,"title":"Chapter 24: I Love You So Much, I Hate You So Much","paragraphs":["An hour had passed since the disappearance of Xigaodi.","Pei Buxian had reviewed the surveillance footage. Xigaodi had bolted out of the villa's side door, never looking back as it sprinted out of the courtyard, squeezing through the gap in the main gate's fence and disappearing from the cameras.","Qiao Chuchu immediately contacted the property management company overseeing the entire villa district and posted a reward notice for the dog's return, but there was still no news.","Most of the household staff had gone out to search for the dog.","Only she and Pei Buxian remained at home.","Qiao Chuchu sat in Pei Buxian's room, glancing around.","Pei Buxian's room was cozy, with a cream-colored decor and filled with photos and portraits of Xigaodi and him, clearly illustrating the dog's significance in Pei Buxian's heart.","Pei Buxian sat by the window, lost in thought.","His golden hair shimmered under the sunlight, his profile as exquisite as a sculpture, resembling a golden-haired beauty from a manga.","Qiao Chuchu was mesmerized.","Before she knew it, Pei Buxian, just one year older than her, had grown into a mature man.","She still always felt that Pei Buxian's mentality was younger than hers.","Suddenly, there was a knock on the door.","Xia Xuechun entered, looking guilty: \"I'm sorry, Mr. Pei, I still haven't found your dog.\"","Pei Buxian grabbed a teacup and threw it at Xia Xuechun!","Xia Xuechun didn't dodge, and the cup shattered on her forehead, blood trickling down.","Qi Xiaojia happened to see this and screamed: \"Xuexue!\"","She ran to Xia Xuechun's side and scolded Pei Buxian: \"Are you crazy? It's just a lost dog! It's not dead! Maybe it can find its way back on its own!\"","Without a word, Pei Buxian picked up another cup and threw it at Qi Xiaojia!","Qi Xiaojia couldn't dodge in time, and blood immediately streamed down her forehead!","Both girls were shocked!","Pei Buxian roared: \"If my dog dies, I'll drag you both to hell with me!!!\"","The sisters covered their foreheads in shock, too frightened to speak.","This guy is a pure madman!","Pei Buxian's eyes were bloodshot as he ranted: \"I've raised this dog for six years. It's so stupid and stubborn, too dumb to know the way, too dumb to follow anyone who leads it! It definitely doesn't know how to find its way back, and it's winter now. My dog has never been cold since I raised it. If anything happens to it, your whole family will have to wait for me!!!\"","The two girls shivered simultaneously.","Pei Buxian bellowed: \"Keep looking for it!!!\"","They ran off without looking back!","Qiao Chuchu looked at the mess on the floor and felt a headache coming on.","She knew Pei Buxian's fits of rage.","Calm as an old dog when normal, wild as a mad dog when triggered.","However, after seven years of not living together, Pei Buxian's fits seemed even worse.","He used to never hit people, let alone throw things at them.","Qiao Chuchu couldn't hold back: \"I can't wait anymore, I'll help you look for it too.\"","Pei Buxian: \"Stay put!!!\"","She sat back down on the sofa, startled.","Pei Buxian's chest heaved violently, his eyes red as he glared at her.","\"This is all your fault.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"Brother, don't be ridiculous, what does this have to do with me?\"","Pei Buxian lifted her up and pinned her against the wall!","Qiao Chuchu was caught off guard, accidentally knocking over a picture frame on the table!","Glass shards scattered on the floor, revealing two photos inside.","Xigaodi's photo was on top.","Her photo was below.","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","Why was her photo under Xigaodi's?","Her chin was tightly gripped by Pei Buxian, who forced her to look at him: \"Look at me!\"","Qiao Chuchu winced in pain, meeting Pei Buxian's gaze.","His golden hair covered his eyes, but through the gaps, she saw his crazed stare: \"If it weren't for you, Xigaodi wouldn't exist. It's because you betrayed us first that I bought Xigaodi to keep me company. It's all your fault!\"","Qiao Chuchu's heart trembled!","But feeling wronged, she caught onto a detail: \"So... Xigaodi was meant to replace me in your heart?\"","Pei Buxian didn't deny it.","Tears glistened in his glassy eyes, \"Now my dog is gone, and I can't go look for it because it's dangerous outside. I need to protect you, to keep you from dying accidentally.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","Protect her?","Why protect her?","But before she could think further, Pei Buxian suddenly grabbed a craft knife and pressed it against her neck!","She gasped, all blood rushing to her head, her voice strained: \"Brother?!\"","Pei Buxian, devoid of reason, pressed the knife against her flesh: \"Why do you always hurt everything I cherish?\"","She tilted her chin up, trying to avoid the knife's tip, but didn't answer.","Pei Buxian looked at her in disbelief: \"You lost my 200,000-word manuscript, destroying a month of my hard work and inspiration!\"","\"Didn't I treat you well? Don't I love you? Why do you keep hurting me over and over again?!\"","A sharp pain shot through Qiao Chuchu's neck.","She didn't struggle, just turned her head away, unable to face him, ashamed.","She didn't want to.","She had traveled here at three years old, experiencing love she had never felt in her previous life, sharing joys and hardships with them, giving her all to her family.","But the system forced her.","It made her delete Pei Buxian's 200,000-word manuscript, under unreasonable threats.","It demanded that Pei Buxian kiss her.","When he refused, she deleted the manuscript without hesitation, not even leaving it in the recycle bin.","Pei Buxian's month of hard work was destroyed, and he was so furious he ended up in the hospital.","She had done such cruel things countless times.","She didn't want to, she really didn't.","But any hint of resistance would make the system inflict the unbearable pain of a terminal illness on her.","And any suicidal thoughts would be met with pain that immobilized her until she was completely subdued.","She truly had no face to see them.","So she didn't understand why, after doing so many wrong things, she was still allowed to return to this home.","She looked guiltily into Pei Buxian's eyes.","His fierce gaze was hidden under his disheveled hair.","He gripped her tightly, his mental state precarious.","Qiao Chuchu felt he was like a golden apple, shining under the sun, but on the verge of rotting.","But this apple's decay was also due to her and the system's interference.","Suddenly, Qiao Chuchu was calm: \"Okay.\"","Pei Buxian: \"?\"","Tears streamed from the corners of her eyes: \"You kill me, and I'll disappear from this world, you'll never see me again, and I won't appear in front of you anymore.\"","Pei Buxian widened his eyes, tears spilling out: \"Do you think this can threaten me?\"","\"It's not a threat,\" Qiao Chuchu calmly said, \"I mean it, brother. If you want me dead, you don't have to dirty your hands. I can leave this world myself.\"","She said: \"I can atone.\"","The craft knife fell from Pei Buxian's hand, and he hugged her tightly!","His broad hand pressed against the back of her head, holding her fiercely, as if she were his life.","Qiao Chuchu leaned on his shoulder, gradually calming her breathing: \"You don't want me dead?\"","Pei Buxian shook his head.","Tears dripped onto her shoulder as he sobbed softly: \"Letting you die would be too easy on you.\""]},{"number":25,"title":"Chapter 25: This is an Opportunity for Her to Make Amends","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu closed her eyes wearily, her mind fixated on one thought.","【Absolutely must not let this madman fall in love.】","Pei Buxian's tears rolled down in large droplets, his voice choked with sobs, \"I won't fall in love.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"? What did you say?\"","Pei Buxian let go of her, his eyes and nose red, looking like a pitiful little fawn. He seemed to want to say something, but he remained silent, pushing her away in a daze, \"Go away, I don't want to see you now, but you're not allowed to leave this house.\"","He stood up dejectedly, pulled the curtains shut, and lay on the bed melancholically.","As if waiting for death.","Qiao Chuchu watched him quietly for a moment, then picked up the two photos on the floor and went to the corridor, comparing them with the photo of her and the West Highland Terrier.","In the photo, she was sitting on the sofa, tilting her head and smiling at the camera.","The West Highland Terrier was in the same pose, tilting its head adorably at the camera.","Was it Pei Buxian who deliberately hid her photo, or was he just too lazy to take down the original photo?","Qiao Chuchu quietly pushed open Pei Buxian's door and stole the frame from the cabinet by the door.","She quickly disassembled it.","There were still two photos.","One was of the West Highland Terrier and Pei Buxian.","The other was of her and Pei Buxian.","The angles of the two photos were exactly the same.","Clearly, the West Highland Terrier's photo was deliberately used to cover up.","Qiao Chuchu inadvertently flipped the photo over and saw Pei Buxian's neat small handwriting on the back.","\"I tried to love you as much as you love me, but I couldn't do it, I struggled in my heart for a long time, and when I turned back, I realized I had lost you, and you had lost me.\"","\"So I carefully weighed who was more at a loss between us, whether it was you losing our seven wealthy brothers or me losing you, and in the end, I think I'm more at a loss.\"","\"Because I lost the sister who rushed into the men's restroom without hesitation, wielding a stick to protect me.\"","She was astonished, picking up another photo of her alone, which also had words on the back.","\"My little elf will never come back.\"","Qiao Chuchu's nose tingled, and she leaned against the wall, covering her face and quietly sobbing.","After her foster mother passed away, they went through a long period of dark days.","Because all of her mother's inheritance was taken away by the so-called grandparents.","The most ridiculous thing was that her mother's parents never loved her.","When her mother was alive, she severed ties with them, working alone from scratch, even finding a husband who was willing to be a househusband, an orphan without parents.","So they all shared the surname Pei, following the mother's family.","Despite her mother's efforts to live independently and cut ties with the past, it didn't stop her relatives from seizing everything after her death.","Because the so-called severed parent-child relationship was not recognized by the law.","Thus, her mother's family used every dirty trick to take all the property, and to silence the public, they arranged the best schools for the seven of them, while completely neglecting their living conditions.","She was not included.","Because she was an adopted daughter, they didn't want to take responsibility for her.","It was her eldest brother who made a big fuss that she was able to go to school and join them at the international academy.","Those days were the darkest times.","They bore the prestigious surname, yet were bullied by other Pei family members.","Every day after school, when they gathered together, they would see new scars on each other, or brown stains from pranks on their trousers.","If it weren't for the fact that they were eight of them, if they didn't lean on each other, she would have gone mad.","Pei Buxian, during his adolescence, was thin and small, looking very much like a girl, often cornered in the bathroom and had his pants pulled down, his attempts to resist futile.","One day, she heard about this and rushed to the men's restroom with a baseball bat.","Ignoring the boys inside, she jumped up and hit the bully with a stick, grabbing Pei Buxian's hand and dragging him away.","That day, Pei Buxian looked at her as if he had seen a deity.","Of course, her actions also attracted the bullies.","The next day, she was cornered in a storage room, her clothes torn and photographed by a group of boys.","Her seven brothers arrived simultaneously, seeing her in tattered clothes.","Soon after, members of the Pei family met with one accident after another.","Within a year, the Pei family's entire fortune's heirs were reduced to just the eight siblings.","From then on, no one dared to bully them, she stood in the center, surrounded by her brothers, with no adults in sight.","Her brothers, feeling she had lost both sets of parents, indulged her, agreeing to even the most unreasonable requests, for fear of not giving her enough love.","She was happy, and two years later, she was bound by a system, under whose influence she destroyed their strong bond with her own hands.","The system said that each of them felt hatred towards her.","Particularly intense hatred.","She knew, because she also hated herself, hated the self that was increasingly manipulated by the system, becoming more and more shameless and callous.","Qiao Chuchu looked at the photo of the West Highland Terrier: [Pei Che is right, this is the only chance to make up for our broken relationship.]","Pei Buxian opened his eyes on the bed.","[I have to find the West Highland Terrier back!]","Pei Buxian: \"?!\"","He rushed out of the room, looking around, hearing the roar of an engine outside.","Pei Buxian ran to the window, shocked to see Qiao Chuchu riding a motorcycle, speeding out of the courtyard without looking back.","He was anxious: \"I already told her she can't go out, why did she still go out?! And her hand is still injured!\"","Pei Che hurriedly put on clothes, ran to the underground garage, and followed in a car.","Meanwhile, Xia Xuechun was frantically searching the house for the dog: \"Why is this house so big! Annoying! Why do all the troubles come to me?\"","Her phone suddenly rang.","She answered irritably: \"Hello? Mom?\"","Xia's Mother was in a good mood: \"Xuechun, I just got home, and I heard your Aunt Wang found you a good job, Aunt Zhao just picked up a little dog by the roadside, saying she'll kill it for meat, and even invited me to eat it, to replenish my health, you should come home tonight, we'll celebrate together, after all, there have been so many things lately, we need to wash away the bad luck.\"","Xia Xuechun couldn't be bothered: \"Eat it then, but—\"","Dog?","Xia Xuechun urgently said: \"Mom, do you have a photo of that dog?\"","Xia's Mother thought: \"It seems to be a white dog, snow-white, looks like a dog from a good family, quite plump.\"","Xia Xuechun was shocked: \"Have Aunt Zhao send me a photo!\"","Soon, the photo arrived.","The originally snow-white West Highland Terrier, after playing outside for a while, had turned dirty and pitiful, with a cheap hemp rope around its neck.","She was overjoyed and quickly said: \"Mom, that dog absolutely cannot be eaten, tell Aunt Zhao that this dog belongs to my employer, and I lost it!\"","Xia's Mother was shocked: \"Oh, oh, oh, I'll tell Aunt Zhao right away, but she might already be preparing to kill it, not sure if she's already made the cut.\"","Xia Xuechun put down her phone and rushed out.","Qiao Chuchu drove the motorcycle, roaring past the neighbor's house with the engine.","Lou Tingsi and Lou Yuejue were standing at the door directing people to move.","Lou Yuejue pointed at her back: \"Dad, is that Qiao Chuchu?\"","Lou Tingsi's eyes lit up, quickly grabbing Lou Yuejue and getting into the car: \"It's her, that motorcycle is hers, follow her.\""]},{"number":26,"title":"Chapter 26: I have confidence because I have money, but the money is not my brother's, it's mine.","paragraphs":["Lou Yuejue was stunned as he watched Qiao Chuchu's retreating figure: \"With such cold weather, she actually rode a motorcycle away. Isn't she cold?\"","Inside, Qiao Chuchu was screaming: \"I'm freezing to death!!\"","She stopped by the roadside, carefully recalling the events of this part of the story.","Pei Buxian would fall in love with Xia Xuechun, but how did Xia Xuechun get into his heart?","Besides being silly, cute, beautiful, innocent, and love at first sight, something else happened between them...","Qiao Chuchu had a flash of insight.","West Highland Terrier!","Xia Xuechun lost the West Highland Terrier but also helped Pei Buxian find it!!","The address where the West Highland Terrier was found was a fruit supermarket!","Qiao Chuchu started the engine and drove there without hesitation!","Pei Buxian was about to catch up but saw her turn at the end of the road, so he could only follow closely.","Lou Tingsi drove behind, keenly observing Pei Buxian's car: \"It seems like a good show is about to unfold.\"","Xia Xuechun left by taxi, taking a different route.","Four groups of people were heading towards the same destination.","In the fruit supermarket, Auntie Zhao picked up the West Highland Terrier, looking left and right: \"This little dog is pretty, shiny and smooth, but it's a bit dirty.\"","Her phone received two messages from Xia Xuechun's mother.","But she didn't hear them at all.","A customer curiously asked: \"How much did you pay for this dog?\"","Auntie Zhao smiled and shook her head: \"I found it, no one wanted it, and it looked pitiful, so I adopted it.\"","The customer was surprised: \"Oh, this dog is a West Highland Terrier, the cheapest ones are over a thousand, and the most expensive ones are tens of thousands!\"","Auntie Zhao was astonished: \"Ah, this scruffy dog is so expensive?\"","The customer left with their items, saying: \"Pets are all about pedigree. If your dog has good bloodlines and looks, it could sell for five figures!\"","Auntie Zhao hummed and looked at the West Highland Terrier more closely.","The West Highland Terrier stared at her with its black eyes, looking adorably silly.","She couldn't help but feel a bit of worry: \"If it's that expensive, it would be a pity to eat it.\"","Qiao Chuchu rushed in furiously: \"Are you going to eat it?!\"","Auntie Zhao was startled: \"Ah! Who are you?!\"","The West Highland Terrier saw Chuchu and wagged its tail frantically.","Qiao Chuchu stepped forward to take the dog: \"This is my dog, give it to me!\"","Auntie Zhao twisted her body to hold onto the dog, stubbornly saying: \"Who says it's yours? It's mine!\"","Qiao Chuchu was amused by her: \"Yours? This dog has an implanted chip, and the owner is Pei Buxian. What's your name? Are you Pei Buxian?!\"","Xia Xuechun ran into the fruit store, angry: \"What are you yelling at my aunt for?!\"","Qiao Chuchu looked at her in surprise: \"Xia Xuechun?\"","Xia Xuechun nodded, also surprised: \"How did you find this place?\"","Qiao Chuchu ignored her, stepping forward to take the dog: \"It's none of your business, give me the dog.\"","Pei Buxian and Lou Tingsi parked their cars by the roadside, seeing the figures inside the fruit store across the street.","Pei Buxian's eyes were sharp; he immediately spotted the snow-white fur: \"The West Highland Terrier?!\"","He was overjoyed, wanting to stop the car to get the dog, but there was no parking spot, so he had to grit his teeth and look for one.","In another car, Lou Tingsi calmly instructed his son: \"You go find Qiao Chuchu, I'll park the car.\"","Lou Yuejue got out of the car, crossed the road, and ran into the fruit store.","Qiao Chuchu was still trying to take the dog: \"I'm telling you, don't force me to lay a hand on you. If we really fight, you won't be my match!\"","Auntie Zhao held the dog tightly, not letting go: \"Hit me! If you dare touch me, I'll lie down and make you bankrupt!\"","Xia Xuechun protected Auntie Zhao: \"Qiao Chuchu, I know what your position is in your family, so don't put on an act in front of me!\"","Qiao Chuchu was stunned, narrowing her eyes: \"What did you say?\"","Xia Xuechun stood up straight, full of righteous indignation: \"I know your family doesn't like you, and I know your brother only pretends to protect you outside. So don't put on an act in front of us, because we're not afraid of you.\"","Xia Xuechun was extremely confident: \"You're just a pampered lady. Without your brother, you're nothing.\"","Qiao Chuchu threw Xia Xuechun over her shoulder with a single move!","Xia Xuechun landed at Lou Yuejue's feet!","Lou Yuejue stepped back in surprise, laughing loudly: \"Wow, Qiao Chuchu, you're amazing!\"","Qiao Chuchu ignored him, turning Auntie Zhao's shoulder and speaking in a low voice: \"Considering your age, I'll give you some face. Give me the dog.\"","Auntie Zhao stubbornly shook her head, looking terrified: \"I'm telling you, I have heart disease, high blood pressure, and high cholesterol. Would you dare to lay a hand on me?!\"","Qiao Chuchu kicked her away: \"Even if you had your great-grandma, it wouldn't matter!\"","Auntie Zhao fell to the ground with a thud, crying out in pain: \"Oh! My back!\"","Qiao Chuchu picked up the West Highland Terrier with one hand, looking at the two people rolling on the ground.","Pei Buxian rushed in just in time to see this scene.","He widened his eyes in amazement, staring at Qiao Chuchu's back.","Lou Tingsi peeked in, seeing the scene and directly laughed: \"Tsk, too bad.\"","Qiao Chuchu crouched down, looking at the disheveled Xia Xuechun and Auntie Zhao: \"Listen carefully, I have the confidence to act today because I have money. I can hire the best lawyers to deal with you, so I'm not afraid of your extortion.\"","\"And that money isn't from my brother.\"","Qiao Chuchu looked at Xia Xuechun, speaking clearly: \"It's mine.\"","Xia Xuechun: \"!\"","Qiao Chuchu smiled brightly: \"So, are you going to fight me with the 760,000 yuan debt you owe, or with your aunt who wants to eat a dog she found?\"","The atmosphere instantly dropped to freezing point.","Lou Yuejue crossed his arms, keenly observing Qiao Chuchu.","Lou Tingsi stood by, smiling faintly at Pei Buxian: \"Are you guys so stingy? So rich, yet you don't give your sister money?\"","Pei Buxian glared at him defensively: \"Whether we give her money is our freedom.\"","Lou Tingsi sneered: \"Childish, arguing with your sister over money, my son wouldn't do such a thing.\"","Lou Yuejue nodded in agreement: \"If Qiao Chuchu were my sister, I definitely wouldn't argue with her over money.\"","Pei Buxian's face darkened: \"Please don't arbitrarily assume the role of Qiao Chuchu's brother. You're not us.\"","Lou Tingsi nodded nonchalantly: \"Yes, we're not you, but now your sister is fighting for your dog. What do you think as her brother?\"","Pei Buxian's heart tightened as he looked at Qiao Chuchu's back, his expression gloomy and silent.","Outside the fruit supermarket, many people had gathered.","A group of people were holding their phones, chattering: \"Are they arguing?\"","\"It seems the shop owner found a dog, won't return it to the owner, and wants to eat it.\"","\"Ha? How greedy must she be!\"","\"The shop owner's character isn't good, we can't buy fruit here anymore, it's bad luck!\"","\"Right, finding someone else's dog and the first thought is to kill and eat it. Who knows what underhanded things she does in private!\"","\"I love drama, let's get it started, let's get it started, I'm going to post this on TikTok!\""]},{"number":27,"title":"Chapter 27: Dangerous Rescue of Oneself, and Then a Convenient Rescue of Lou Yuejue","paragraphs":["Auntie Zhao panicked and stumbled to her feet, \"Oh dear, they're all recording! This can't be recorded, or all my customers will run away!\"","She grabbed Qiao Chuchu's arm tightly, \"Go help me clarify, tell them I didn't want to eat dog meat, or how can I run my business in the future?\"","Qiao Chuchu scoffed, \"Isn't what they said the truth? The first thing you thought of when you found the dog was to kill and eat it.\"","Auntie Zhao gasped, her tone becoming aggressive, \"Who told you to lose your dog in the first place? Isn't it my freedom to decide what to do with your dog?\"","\"Not clarifying is also my freedom,\" Qiao Chuchu pulled her arm back, \"You're not good at extorting others with your high blood pressure and high cholesterol? Whoever records you, just collapse and convulse on the ground, lose control of your bowels and bladder, scare them to death.\"","Auntie Zhao: \"?!\"","Xia Xuechun couldn't stand it anymore and stood up, \"Qiao Chuchu, how can you talk like that? Do you know how hard Auntie Zhao has it?!\"","Qiao Chuchu picked up the dog and left, \"Send me a 'Biography of Auntie Zhao' to my email, I'll take a look when I have time.\"","Xia Xuechun: \"?\"","Auntie Zhao's face turned red as she followed Qiao Chuchu, \"You're not helping, are you?!\"","Qiao Chuchu walked out of the crowd, ignoring her.","Auntie Zhao suddenly snatched the dog from her arms and threw it onto the road, \"Then I'll smash this worthless dog to death!!\"","The West Highland Terrier let out a pitiful yelp!","Qiao Chuchu was shocked and rushed towards the dog first!","Lou Yuejue also instinctively followed, \"Doggy!\"","Lou Tingsi and Pei Buxian followed closely behind, only to see a white blur flash past, accompanied by a loud crash!","Lou Tingsi's head exploded, he ran towards Lou Yuejue, \"Son!!\"","Pei Buxian froze on the roadside, his face ashen!","Auntie Zhao screamed at the sight, \"This has nothing to do with me!\"","What everyone saw was Qiao Chuchu lying on the ground with her neck twisted 180 degrees, and Lou Yuejue in a bizarre posture.","The West Highland Terrier was crushed under the wheels, dying on the spot.","Car parts were scattered all over the ground.","Pei Buxian stumbled to Qiao Chuchu's side.","Her death was horrific, her face completely twisted to the back.","Passersby couldn't help but vomit at the sight!","Yet Pei Buxian didn't mind, he knelt on the ground, trembling as he held her in his arms, \"Chuchu!!\"","-","Qiao Chuchu woke up in terror, panting heavily.","She had been hit by a car and died!","The system floated in front of her, \"Well, this time not only did you die, but you also caused Lou Yuejue's death.\"","Qiao Chuchu was stunned for a moment before realizing Lou Yuejue was with her at the time.","She angrily got up from the ground, \"I'm going to kill Xia Xuechun!!\"","Since she couldn't return to this world, and Xia Xuechun was no longer the heroine, what was there to be afraid of killing?","\"No,\" the system was calm, \"Xia Xuechun is the heroine of fortune, Ji Yanchuan is the hero of fortune, they are the attackers, you are the defender, they have fate protecting them, you can't do anything by taking action.\"","\"Everything will proceed as planned, even if the timeline or location is wrong, the scripted events will still happen. You can only turn your situation around at the most critical moment, after all, in your and other 'supporting characters' lives, they are still the 'main characters'.\"","Qiao Chuchu's head buzzed, \"So I can only defend?\"","The system was unhurried, \"You can attack by defending, isn't that what you're best at?\"","She was stunned, her body rapidly retreating, a moment of dizziness brought her to the road!","Her body was still in a running posture, Lou Yuejue was a step ahead of her!","She ran towards the West Highland Terrier together!","Before she could think more, Qiao Chuchu first grabbed Lou Yuejue, then deliberately grabbed the dog, preparing to dodge!","\"Bang!!\"","Qiao Chuchu died on the spot!","Qiao Chuchu woke up again, drenched in sweat!","The system floated in front of her, \"Try again.\"","A moment of dizziness brought her back to the road.","Lou Yuejue was still a step ahead of her!","Lou Tingsi noticed the car coming and shouted, \"Watch out for the car!\"","Pei Buxian didn't hesitate, rushing towards Qiao Chuchu, \"Chuchu, the car is coming!!\"","In a flash, Qiao Chuchu hugged Lou Yuejue tightly!","Lou Yuejue: \"?!\"","As she dodged the car while holding him, she kicked the West Highland Terrier away, avoiding the car's path!","The West Highland Terrier: \"Awoo!!\"","The white car screeched to a halt!","The car on the other lane also quickly stopped!","The West Highland Terrier lay on the ground whimpering.","The world fell silent.","Qiao Chuchu and Lou Yuejue were caught between the two cars, drenched in cold sweat.","The numbers in front of her eyes changed from 9 to 8, then from 8 to 7.","7 lives.","Seven chances.","The onlookers came back to their senses, clapping enthusiastically, \"Amazing, miss!!\"","\"Did you see that, she just performed an extreme dodge, it seems that everyone has martial arts skills in the face of life-threatening danger!\"","\"Her movements were so smooth, I just slow-motioned her video, her brain was like a computer, saving people and kicking the dog in one go!\"","Qiao Chuchu's body couldn't stop trembling, she looked at Lou Yuejue, \"Are you alright?\"","Lou Yuejue was tightly held by her arm, nodding blankly, \"I'm fine...\"","She protected him strongly.","Just like... a mother.","Lou Tingsi and Pei Buxian ran to them, \"Are you hurt?!\"","Qiao Chuchu, still in shock, shook her head.","Pei Buxian quickly checked her up and down, finally picking up the West Highland Terrier and pulling her back to the sidewalk with a pale face, \"For a moment there, I thought you were going to get hit by the car.\"","Qiao Chuchu was still in shock.","【I died twice.】","Pei Buxian: \"?\"","Lou Tingsi: \"?\"","Lou Yuejue: \"?\"","Qiao Chuchu looked at Lou Yuejue: 【Not only did I die, but so did Lou Yuejue. If it weren't for my nine chances to be reborn, Lou Yuejue and I would have been killed by this old lady.】","【Luckily, I saved him.】","【Luckily, my favorite character didn't die because of me.】","Her legs couldn't stop shaking, she tried to stay calm and crouched in front of Lou Yuejue, \"Are you okay?\"","【The first time I grabbed him, I still got hit and died, finally, I saved him the second time.】","【It scared me to death...】","She was trembling all over, but still checked Lou Yuejue's body, \"Not scared, right?\"","Lou Yuejue's hair was messy, his delicate face filled with complex emotions not fitting his age, his phoenix eyes locked tightly on her, \"You saved my life.\"","And twice.","He didn't have time to wonder if Qiao Chuchu had a chance to be reborn, he was sure that Qiao Chuchu, who was so persistent in saving him between two rebirths, was the person he wanted to get close to.","Lou Yuejue cupped her face, gently and intently kissed her.","Qiao Chuchu: \"!\"","She met Lou Yuejue's eyes in surprise.","His clear and exquisite face relaxed, like moonlight pouring over her, he smiled slightly, \"Thank you~\""]},{"number":28,"title":"Chapter 28: The Character I Support Actually Has a Crush on Me","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu's heart skipped a few beats as she stared blankly at Lou Yuejue.","[OMG, my favorite character just kissed my cheek!!!]","Suddenly, someone grabbed Qiao Chuchu's hand.","She turned her head and met Lou Tingsi's peach blossom eyes, filled with tenderness.","He held her hand firmly in his warm palm, reverently bending down to kiss the back of her hand.","Qiao Chuchu was startled, feeling the heat on the back of her hand, and tried to pull away.","Lou Tingsi held her hand tightly, smiling tenderly and affectionately: \"Thank you for saving my son's life.\"","Qiao Chuchu was overwhelmed by the honor: \"It's not that serious, it's what I should have done.\"","\"No.\" Lou Tingsi spoke with understanding, his words carrying deeper meaning: \"I believe in such critical moments, most people would instinctively protect themselves rather than save a stranger.\"","The distance and speed of that car had been terrifyingly close.","He thought they would be hit.","When Qiao Chuchu failed to save Lou Yuejue the first time and died, it proved that saving him was risky and time-wasting.","If she had just abandoned Lou Yuejue, she definitely wouldn't have died.","But she still chose to run with Lou Yuejue the second time, risking another chance if she failed.","He couldn't help but feel grateful: \"You're a hero to both my son and me.\"","Qiao Chuchu's cheeks burned hot, her eyes growing misty: \"Oh...\"","On the surface, she remained composed.","But inside, she was screaming frantically—","[My favorite character kissed me! My favorite character kissed me! My favorite character kissed me!]","[Ahhhhhhhhhhhhhhh I actually earned the gratitude of both characters I love, who could understand this feeling ahhhhhhhhhhhhhh!]","[This feeling is so wonderful ahhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhh!]","The three people who could hear her thoughts felt like their heads were about to explode!","Qiao Chuchu pressed her lips together, secretly smiling while screaming wildly in her heart!","Lou Yuejue couldn't help but smile.","He didn't understand what she meant by \"favorite character,\" but since she was so happy—","Lou Yuejue cupped Qiao Chuchu's face: \"Here's another kiss for you.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"Eh?\"","Lou Yuejue gently kissed her left cheek.","Qiao Chuchu's face exploded with color, becoming even more flustered: \"W-why?\"","Lou Yuejue laughed softly: \"Because you're too cute, big sister.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"!!!!\"","[This little yandere knows how to flirt so well!]","Lou Yuejue raised his eyebrows, looking at her with composed amusement.","Suddenly, another hand reached over and pulled Qiao Chuchu back: \"Enough!\"","Qiao Chuchu stumbled a few steps, bumping into Pei Buxian's broad shoulder.","Pei Buxian, with a dark expression, wordlessly stuffed her into the car and coldly looked at the Lou father and son.","Lou Tingsi stood in place, with a meaningful smile: \"Mr. Pei, why are you unhappy? Did our way of expressing gratitude displease you?\"","Lou Yuejue stood with his hands in his pockets, a confident smile playing on his lips: \"You're not angry, are you, Brother Pei?\"","The father and son pair were clearly deliberately provoking him.","Pei Buxian glared at them both, gripping the car door tightly: \"I'll settle accounts with you later.\"","He turned and got into the driver's seat, roughly wiping both sides of Qiao Chuchu's face!","She winced in pain: \"That hurts, what are you doing?\"","Pei Buxian wiped her face with a dark expression, \"Are you that happy just because someone kissed you?!\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","He took out a pack of disinfectant wipes from the storage compartment, pulled out a thick stack, and slapped them onto Qiao Chuchu's face!","All while muttering—","\"You're supposed to be my sister, yet you're so happy because of others, you're really greedy... too greedy!!!\"","Qiao Chuchu was shocked as he wiped her face: \"What are you talking about? Are you crazy—\"","Pei Buxian roared at her with reddened eyes: \"Aren't you my sister?! How can you be so happy when other brothers kiss you, shouldn't I be angry?!\""]},{"number":29,"title":"Chapter 29: I Have Never Been Aggressive, I Am Good at Counterattacking","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu stood with her mouth half-open, stunned by what she'd just heard.","After a while, she recovered from her shock and asked in disbelief, \"What did you just call me?\"","Pei Buxian's expression changed, and he wanted to scold her.","Qiao Chuchu, like a cat whose tail had been stepped on, immediately launched into a tirade—","\"Are you sick in the head?\"","\"What gives you the right to lecture me?!\"","\"I may be your sister, but I'm not your property!!!\"","Pei Buxian was taken aback by her outburst, and as he opened his mouth to argue—","Qiao Chuchu raised her hand and smacked him on the head: \"Shut up, I don't want to hear you speak!\"","Pei Buxian: \"!\"","He was completely stunned by the slap!","Qiao Chuchu glared at Pei Buxian with disdain.","[After not living together for seven years, I really can't understand Pei Buxian anymore. What gives him the right to talk to me like this? Is he jealous?]","Pei Buxian: \"?\"","Jealous?","No.","He definitely wasn't jealous.","There was a knock on the window.","Lou Tingsi's handsome face peered through the car window, smiling warmly: \"Are you alright, Miss Qiao? Your brother isn't bullying you, is he?\"","His bright smile was like adding fuel to the fire.","Just as Qiao Chuchu was about to answer, Pei Buxian suddenly pulled her into his arms.","?","Pei Buxian had a faint sweet scent about him, very similar to a bakery's aroma, sweet with a hint of soft bread.","Without a word, she punched him right in the thigh!","Pei Buxian winced in pain and snapped angrily: \"Qiao Chuchu, have you lost your mind?!\"","Qiao Chuchu shot back defiantly, \"Yes, I have! Because you offended me with your words!\"","Pei Buxian took a deep breath, his gaze equally dangerous: \"I offended you? What about you?\"","Qiao Chuchu responded righteously: \"What about me?!\"","Pei Buxian's face turned ashen: \"When a group of girls showed interest in me at my birthday party, you chased them around with a water gun! And I was the one who had to apologize afterward!!!!\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","[Ah, sorry about that, the system made me do it.]","Pei Buxian's eyes turned fierce as he gripped her shoulder tightly, emphasizing each word: \"It's not the first time you've been possessive of your brother, so why can't I do the same?\"","Qiao Chuchu froze, awkwardly removing her hand from his thigh.","Pei Buxian's eyes darkened as he smiled: \"Qiao Chuchu, I've never tried to invade your space.\"","He leaned closer to her: \"If you think I've offended you, it's only because I'm getting back at you.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","She turned to look out the window.","Lou Tingsi was still standing outside, looking into the car.","The privacy film blocked his view.","He politely kept his distance, his gaze calm like flowing water, quietly observing the glass as if taking in everything.","Qiao Chuchu felt uncomfortable and tried to push Pei Buxian away.","[I don't want others to see us like this.]","Pei Buxian let out a mocking laugh and lowered the car window to confront Lou Tingsi.","When Lou Tingsi saw the position of the two inside the car, he narrowed his fox-like eyes and let out a cold laugh.","Qiao Chuchu was like a small cat caught between two alpha wolves, her eyes darting around uncertainly.","Pei Buxian's fluffy golden hair partially covered his round eyes as he glared hostilely at Lou Tingsi.","\"Stay away from my sister.\"","Lou Tingsi's dark pupils suddenly sparked with fire as his smile widened: \"Why?\"","Pei Buxian gritted his teeth: \"Because she's my sister.\"","Lou Tingsi smirked: \"But you don't even give your sister living expenses.\"","\"I do now.\" Pei Buxian took out his phone and transferred two million to Qiao Chuchu.","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","Lou Tingsi glanced at the amount dismissively: \"How many bags can that buy?\"","He handed his phone to Qiao Chuchu: \"Enter your card number.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\""]},{"number":30,"title":"Chapter 30: It's Just Two Million, How Could You Faint","paragraphs":["When Qiao Chuchu saw the amount displayed on Lou Tingsi's phone, her eyes nearly popped out: \"Five million?!\"","Lou Tingsi nodded with a smile: \"Yes, consider it compensation for saving my son. Just enter your card number, and I'll transfer it to you directly.\"","Pei Buxian's heart tightened, and not wanting to be outdone, he transferred another four million to Qiao Chuchu!","Now it was six million!","Qiao Chuchu's head was buzzing.","[What are these two doing?! What kind of madness is this?!]","Pei Buxian and Lou Tingsi turned to look at her simultaneously.","They both had only one thought—","She actually thought transferring money to her was crazy?","Then he would act even crazier! Until she was so happy she was screaming internally with joy, with no time left to criticize!","Pei Buxian raised his chin proudly at Lou Tingsi: \"I already have Qiao Chuchu's card number. I don't need to pretend to ask.\"","Lou Tingsi laughed sarcastically: \"You're calling me pretentious?\"","He grabbed his phone back and entered another string of numbers.","Seven million!","\"Qiao Chuchu, enter your bank account number!!\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?!\"","Pei Buxian picked up his phone, ready to transfer another four million!","Qiao Chuchu felt her blood pressure soaring: \"??? Stop!\"","Pei Buxian ignored her, showing off his achievement: \"I'm transferring another four million right now.\"","Lou Tingsi's eyes darkened as he snatched his phone to make a call: \"Since Miss Qiao won't tell me her card number, I'll investigate your bank account.\"","Qiao Chuchu was shocked: \"??? I'm not telling you because I don't want you to transfer it. I don't need this money.\"","Lou Tingsi insisted: \"But I need to transfer it to you. I believe no one dislikes money, and don't tell me you don't like money.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"????\"","A moment later, Lou Tingsi smiled: \"Found it. I'll transfer it right now.\"","Pei Buxian sneered: \"I've already transferred eight million.\"","Lou Tingsi refused to back down: \"Then I'll transfer nine million, OK?\"","Pei Buxian: \"Then I'll transfer ten million!\"","Lou Tingsi spoke darkly: \"Then I'll match that ten million!\"","Passersby outside were stunned, their mouths half-open: \"Are they talking about real RMB or just game coins?\"","\"...Ga-game coins, right?\"","\"But they're all driving luxury cars...\"","\"It must still be game coins, right? How else could they transfer ten million so casually?\"","Xia Xuechun stood nearby, listening to their argument, and walked over aggressively: \"Hey!\"","Lou Tingsi and Pei Buxian ignored her, continuing their argument.","Xia Xuechun glanced at Lou Tingsi's transfer screen and her eyes widened.","It was unbelievable!","Giving so much money to a girl like Qiao Chuchu!","She looked at Qiao Chuchu resentfully: \"You must be very pleased with yourself now. You rich girls are all the same!\"","But her voice was too soft and was completely drowned out by Lou Tingsi and Pei Buxian's voices.","No one present had heard clearly what she said.","Xia Xuechun bit her lip, feeling wronged: \"Ignoring me, huh?\"","...Still, no one paid attention to her.","Qiao Chuchu watched her phone continuously flood with various payment notifications, feeling overwhelmed: \"Please stop this! It'll be such a hassle to transfer it back!\"","Pei Buxian glared at her: \"What are you talking about? When has big brother ever asked you to return money?\"","Lou Tingsi laughed mockingly: \"Someone who won't even give his sister living expenses, who knows if he'll ask for it back privately.\"","He proudly waved his phone at Qiao Chuchu: \"Miss Qiao, my son's life is worth this money. Thank you for your help.\"","Qiao Chuchu was dazed: \"But I don't need so much money. This is strange, it feels like you're trying to buy my favor or something.\"","Lou Tingsi and Pei Buxian objected: \"No, you do need it.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","Lou Tingsi bent down and gently patted her head: \"Besides, what's wrong with trying to win your favor? You're completely worth it.\"","Pei Buxian turned Qiao Chuchu's head towards him: \"A thirty-four-year-old man still trying to compete with me? Then I'll give Qiao Chuchu twenty million.\"","Lou Tingsi's face darkened, laughing angrily: \"Fine, then I'll give Miss Qiao thirty million!\"","\"I'll give Qiao Chuchu forty million!\"","\"I'll give her a hundred million!!\"","Qiao Chuchu gasped, suddenly her vision went black, and she collapsed limply against the car.","Lou Yuejue standing nearby: \"...Did you two make her faint?\"","Pei Buxian: \"?\"","Lou Tingsi: \"? Did she faint?\"","Both men looked at Qiao Chuchu simultaneously.","Pei Buxian gently patted Qiao Chuchu's face: \"Hey!\"","Qiao Chuchu didn't respond at all.","Pei Buxian rolled his eyes dramatically: \"Goodness, fainting over a little money, when did she become so weak?\"","Lou Tingsi stood up straight and commented coldly: \"It's probably not that she's weak, but that you rarely treat her this well. She was overwhelmed with happiness.\"","Pei Buxian gritted his teeth: \"I told you, we treat her very well.\"","Lou Tingsi smiled perfunctorily: \"Mm-hmm, the kind of 'well' where you don't give living expenses.\"","Lou Yuejue held his head, annoyed by their arguing: \"Can you two adults do something? Even taking her to a crematorium would be better than standing here arguing.\"","Pei Buxian snorted and raised his car window.","Lou Tingsi, refusing to be outdone, got in his car with his son: \"Let's go.\"","Xia Xuechun stood behind them in surprise: \"Where are you going? This isn't resolved yet!\"","Pei Buxian and Lou Tingsi warned her with dark expressions: \"We'll send someone back to resolve it! No need for you to wait here!\"","Xia Xuechun froze, looking at Qiao Chuchu slumped in the passenger seat.","She laughed bitterly.","How interesting - she was strong enough to throw her to the ground earlier, and now she's fainted.","She really knows how to make people pity her!","Auntie Zhao tugged at her sleeve nervously: \"Xuexue, will they take revenge on me? They all look quite wealthy.\"","Xia Xuechun patted her shoulder reassuringly: \"Don't worry, Auntie. I'll help handle anything that comes up.\"","At least she could plead with them not to bully Auntie.","But that was assuming...","That Qiao Chuchu wouldn't incite them against her.","Xia Xuechun ground her teeth.","She rarely disliked anyone, but Qiao Chuchu was the first girl she truly despised.","She even felt that this person deserved to die!!","She absolutely had to have a word with Qiao Chuchu's brothers!","-","In the hospital emergency room.","The doctor looked at the unconscious Qiao Chuchu lying on the hospital bed: \"So you're saying... the patient was talking to you, and she just fainted in the middle of the conversation?\"","Pei Buxian frowned deeply: \"Yes, we were just having a normal conversation.\"","Lou Tingsi said grimly: \"She fainted after we transferred twenty million to her.\"","The doctor nodded: \"Oh, twenty million- Wha-what??\"","Lou Tingsi furrowed his brows: \"Twenty million. Her brother and I together gave her twenty million.\"","The doctor was dumbfounded: \"Why would you give her twenty million?\""]},{"number":31,"title":"Chapter 31: Meeting Cancelled, I Will Judge Xia Xuechun","paragraphs":["Pei Buxian: \"Because we competed to see who could give her more money.\"","Lou Tingsi: \"And then she fainted.\"","Lou Yuejue commented from the side: \"How pathetic, it's just a little money.\"","The doctor remained silent.","The doctor gradually came to a realization: \"Now I know why she fainted.\"","The three looked puzzled.","The doctor said gravely: \"She was knocked out by an overwhelming fortune.\"","The three: \"?\"","The doctor leaned close to Qiao Chuchu: \"Someone's trying to steal your money!\"","Qiao Chuchu sat up abruptly: \"What?! Who dares to touch my money!\"","The doctor shrugged: \"See? She's fine now.\"","The three: \"...\"","Qiao Chuchu was a bit dazed, looking around confused from her hospital bed.","Pei Buxian, Lou Tingsi, and Lou Yuejue looked down at her from above.","She was bewildered: \"Did I faint again?\"","She often fainted because whenever she disobeyed the system's management, she would be punished by the system and then pass out.","Over time, her body had been worn down, and sometimes even without the system's punishment, she would suddenly faint when her emotions ran high.","Lou Yuejue shook his head in disgust: \"How can someone like you be called the eighth young lady of the Pei family? You're the most small-minded person I've ever met.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"? That's because your father keeps transferring money to me.\"","Lou Yuejue rolled his eyes: \"What if I were to transfer twenty million to you too?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?! You wouldn't dare!!\"","Lou Yuejue laughed and sat provocatively on her hospital bed: \"Oh, but I would dare, sister. I've also learned about investment and made lots of money, maybe even more than your little nest egg.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","[They really are a pair of weirdos! I shouldn't have had any good feelings about this father and son duo. The father at least appears normal in front of others, but this kid is just purely a little devil!]","Lou Yuejue raised his eyebrows, smiling more provocatively: \"Sister, are you cursing me in your mind?\"","Pei Buxian noticed something amiss and narrowed his eyes.","Qiao Chuchu, completely unaware, put on a smile: \"No, of course not.\"","Lou Yuejue, like a little demon, eyes sparkling with mischief, said meaningfully: \"You don't need to lie to me. Even if you're cursing me in your mind, I still find you quite entertaining.\"","The suspicion in Pei Buxian's eyes grew heavier.","Lou Tingsi noticed Pei Buxian's strange look and quickly pulled Lou Yuejue aside: \"Be polite, son. Your sister just fainted and needs to rest.\"","Lou Yuejue reluctantly agreed: \"...Fine.\"","Lou Tingsi gave Qiao Chuchu a polite smile: \"We'll be leaving now. The money we gave you is a thank-you gift, you don't need to return it. Let's have dinner together sometime.\"","Qiao Chuchu was stunned and wanted to refuse, but the father and son pair didn't give her a chance to speak, leaving swiftly.","She quietly watched their retreating figures, then thought about her bank account balance.","[I never expected... I just came to save the West Highland Terrier, but ended up making twenty million yuan?!]","[Don't tell me I've accidentally stumbled into a 'beloved by all and suddenly rich' plot hahahahahahahahaha!]","Lou Yuejue stumbled in his steps, looked back at her, and shook his head helplessly.","Qiao Chuchu picked up her phone, opened the banking app, and looked at the account balance.","3,520,000,000.","...She couldn't even read the number.","She asked Pei Buxian: \"Brother, how do you read this string of numbers? Is it three billion five hundred and twenty million or three billion and twenty million?\"","Pei Buxian had a question mark flash through his mind: \"We spent money to send you to a prestigious foreign university, and you really didn't learn anything, did you?\"","Qiao Chuchu felt somewhat defiant: \"I did learn!\"","Pei Buxian frowned: \"Then why can't you read such a simple number?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"Because I didn't master it.\"","Pei Buxian: \"? Then do you know why your ID card shows 'Qiao Chu' instead of 'Qiao Chuchu'?\"","Qiao Chuchu choked up, feeling a bit ashamed: \"Because my birth mother hoped I would become outstanding.\"","Pei Buxian spread his hands: \"So do you think you're outstanding now?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"Why not? Being outstanding at being lazy and enjoying life is still being outstanding!\"","Pei Buxian: \"???? Then does not being able to read this number prevent you from spending money?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"? No, it doesn't.\"","Pei Buxian: \"Then why are you asking?!\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...Why are you getting angry? If you don't want to tell me, maybe Lou Tingsi would be willing to.\"","Pei Buxian's head buzzed with anger, roaring at her like a monster: \"You're not allowed to ask him! He's just an outsider, why are you being so intimate with outsiders?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"? What does it matter to you who I'm close with?\"","She felt indignant.","[And I was right, Pei Buxian isn't far from needing to be admitted to a mental hospital.]","Pei Buxian: \"...\"","He wanted to argue back but realized he had lost his composure.","He rarely got angry.","But today, because of losing the dog, he had lost his cool.","Pei Buxian calmed down a bit.","Qiao Chuchu had almost died.","No, actually she had died twice.","She even had chances to be reborn, this needed to be told to his brothers.","And then there was this father and son pair, Lou Tingsi...","He felt they could also hear Qiao Chuchu's thoughts.","But whether they could or not, he still needed to test.","After careful consideration, Pei Buxian said: \"Since you're better now, let's go home and settle accounts with Xia Xuechun.\"","Qiao Chuchu was dispirited.","[What's there to settle? Even though Xia Xuechun lost your dog, she's excellent at talking her way out of things, and since you're destined to fall in love with her, you'll end up being convinced by her even if she didn't help you find the West Highland Terrier.]","Pei Buxian was speechless: \"...Qiao Chuchu.\"","She looked up confused, and he lightly flicked her forehead.","Pei Buxian returned to his lifeless demeanor and calmly told her: \"You really should get to know what kind of people your brothers are.\"","Qiao Chuchu looked completely puzzled.","[Why should I get to know you guys? It's not like I have nothing better to do.]","Pei Buxian: \"? Are you really that busy?\"","Qiao Chuchu rolled her eyes.","[Yes, I'm busy! How am I not busy? Busy spacing out, busy being confused by you, busy thinking you have issues, busy figuring out how to get you admitted to a mental hospital painlessly!]","Pei Buxian: \"???\"","He suddenly realized that not hearing Qiao Chuchu's thoughts for the past decade or more had been a great loss.","He really wanted to know what kind of mindset this person had while carrying out her tasks.","Pei Buxian's phone suddenly rang.","He answered: \"Big brother.\"","Pei Yuan on the other end asked: \"How did things go with Xia Xuechun today?\"","Pei Buxian knew what he was asking about: \"I'm fine, but I'm at the hospital now.\"","\"? Are you hurt?\"","Pei Buxian: \"No, it's Qiao Chuchu who's hurt. She almost got hit by a car.\"","Pei Yuan was silent for a moment, then asked suspiciously: \"Did you push her?\"","Pei Buxian: \"? Of course not, it was Xia Xuechun's fault.\"","Pei Yuan paused, his tone notably darkening: \"I'll cancel the meeting right now and have all your other brothers come home.\"","Pei Buxian asked puzzled: \"Why?\"","Pei Yuan spoke in a low voice: \"What else could it be? Our sister almost got hit by a car, how could I possibly sit still? Get Xia Xuechun to come to the house, I want to understand exactly what happened!\""]},{"number":32,"title":"Chapter 32: My Seven Young Masters and Their Eighth Sister","paragraphs":["Pei Buxian hung up the phone with a puzzled expression just as a message popped up on his phone—","Pei Yuan: \"@everyone, come home immediately, there's a major situation at home.\"","Pei Che: \"Busy.\"","Pei Fengnong: \"I'm in a meeting. What's so urgent? Did Pei Buxian fall in love with Xia Xuechun?\"","Pei Youchuan: \"If it's just about that, I don't have time to go back right now. Besides, didn't we agree that if Pei Buxian falls for Xia Xuechun, we'd send him to a mental hospital? So just send him there.\"","Pei Ci: \"Which mental hospital? I can have my assistant send flowers to visit him.\"","Pei Mu: \"Same here.\"","Pei Buxian: \"...How badly do you all want me to fall in love with Xia Xuechun?!\"","Pei Youchuan: \"Oh my, Pei Buxian, you're still in the group? Since you're already in love with Xia Xuechun, you should be kicked out. Sorry about that!\"","System notification: [Pei Youchuan has removed you from the group chat.]","Pei Buxian: \"????\"","System notification: [Pei Yuan has added you back to the group chat.]","Pei Buxian: \"...This has nothing to do with me, stop making things up!\"","Pei Youchuan: \"Well, other than this, what urgent matter requires us to go back? We're very busy, we don't have time to waste here with you.\"","Pei Yuan: \"Qiao Chuchu almost got hit by a car, was unconscious in the hospital, and just got discharged. Can that get you to come?\"","...","...","...","The group fell silent for a minute.","The other five replied in unison: \"We'll handle our current business and be home in an hour.\"","Pei Buxian: \"? Weren't you all busy?\"","The five: \"We're only busy when it comes to you.\"","Pei Buxian: \"???\"","For some reason, he felt an inexplicable anger rising within him.","He turned around irritably to check if Qiao Chuchu was following.","Qiao Chuchu was lost in thought and accidentally bumped into his chest, looking up in confusion.","Her reddish-brown curls were slightly messy, making her look like a carefree witch from a fairy tale.","Pei Buxian: \"...\"","Qiao Chuchu looked at him puzzled: \"What's wrong?\"","Pei Buxian didn't say anything, just gave her an odd look for a moment before turning away.","Qiao Chuchu was bewildered and followed a few steps behind him. Suddenly, Pei Buxian came to his senses, pulled off his own scarf, and roughly wrapped it around her.","He bundled her up like a zongzi, covering her head and ears, then pulled up her hood before walking away without looking back.","Qiao Chuchu stood there with the warm scarf, feeling surprisingly touched.","[The sun must be rising from the west today! Pei Buxian actually knows to keep me warm? Last time when I fainted in front of him, he didn't even bat an eye.]","Pei Buxian paused his steps: \"Hurry up and follow me!\"","Qiao Chuchu snapped back to reality and quickly ran to his side: \"Coming!\"","Pei Buxian frowned impatiently, watching as Qiao Chuchu, wrapped up like a zongzi in his scarf, playfully ran toward him, flashing him a carefree smile.","His eyes brightened slightly, and the corner of his mouth twitched almost imperceptibly before he continued walking toward the parking lot.","A young girl waiting nearby for her test results was reading a novel on her phone, her voice melting with emotion: \"Every time I read Buxian's works, I feel like he puts such genuine emotion into his female lead.\"","Another young man nodded in agreement: \"He must have a girl named Qiao Chu in his life. The female lead in all his books is Qiao Chu.\"","The girl was shocked: \"In every book?\"","The young man nodded: \"Yes, the male leads may change, but Qiao Chu remains constant. She's the goddess of many readers!\"","Meanwhile, on the girl's phone, a passage from the novel read—","[After not seeing Qiao Chu for a long time, Zhang Shuo found that she hadn't aged at all, with her fluffy reddish-brown curls reaching down to her waist, always messy, with a Staedtler pencil sharpened needle-thin tucked behind her ear. Yet this appearance never looked unkempt; rather, it gave Zhang Shuo a strange thought.]","[If the Little Mermaid had legs, she must have looked just like Qiao Chu.]","[Except this little mermaid wasn't good at singing, but rather at drawing and fighting.]","Back at home, Pei Buxian silently watched as Qiao Chuchu went upstairs to rest.","He put down the West Highland Terrier and, after some hesitation, headed to the kitchen.","Little Xie, who was in charge of the kitchen, was surprised to see him: \"Mr. Seventh?\"","Pei Buxian said nothing, washed his hands, and started baking a cake.","Qiao Chuchu, staying on the second floor, caught a whiff of an indescribable sweetness.","She came thumping down the stairs: \"Is someone making dessert in the kitchen?\"","Little Xie was about to answer when Pei Buxian slammed the kitchen door shut with lightning speed and even locked it!","\"Don't tell her what I'm doing!\" Pei Buxian threatened Little Xie fiercely: \"Got it?!\"","Little Xie was startled, finding it strange, but nervously nodded anyway.","Qiao Chuchu walked to the kitchen door and tried to open it, but it wouldn't budge.","There was clearly the sweet smell of cake coming from inside.","She asked curiously: \"Is someone cooking in there?\"","Pei Buxian immediately tensed up.","Little Xie, being quick-witted, took out her phone and typed: [Don't worry, sir! Leave it to me!]","She went to the kitchen door: \"I'm sorry, Miss Qiao, I'm baking cookies right now. Would you like me to bring some to your room with tea later?\"","Qiao Chuchu walked away disappointed: \"No need, I don't really like cookies. Next time you make desserts, maybe consider making a strawberry cake, I'd really like that.\"","Pei Buxian froze, looking at the green grapes he had prepared.","He immediately threw the grapes into the trash bin!","Little Xie: \"?!\"","The grapes were innocent!","She whispered: \"Sir, unwanted fruit can be returned to the kitchen storage instead of being thrown away.\"","Pei Buxian was silent for a moment, then picked them up: \"I forgot.\"","Little Xie: \"...\"","He put them in a basket: \"Give them to Pei Youchuan, he's missing a few screws, he won't be able to tell the difference.\"","Little Xie: \"????\"","Why was this young master who couldn't even handle such simple things in the kitchen?","Was he trying to make a nuclear bomb?","She watched nervously as Pei Buxian took out strawberries and stepped forward: \"Let me wash those.\"","She was truly afraid he might throw the strawberries away too.","Pei Buxian coldly replied: \"I'll do it myself.\"","Little Xie: \"?\"","Pei Buxian carefully washed and cut the strawberries, skillfully making the cake.","Little Xie stood there watching in a daze the whole time.","Pei Buxian paused while piping cream and turned to give her a cold look: \"Stop staring at me.\"","Little Xie: \"...\"","She awkwardly turned around and took out her phone to post on Xiaohongshu.","She was a small internet celebrity blogger whose profile read: [Kitchen maid working for seven handsome young masters.]","She occasionally posted short stories about the seven Pei brothers, anonymously sharing their bizarre incidents.","Though many people questioned whether her stories were real, the unique content made her quite popular, with many followers waiting for her updates.","She typed frantically, with the title: [The autistic Seventh Young Master seems to be making a strawberry cake for his eighth sister who hasn't been home for years!]","[Everyone, can you believe it? The Seventh Young Master, who's always been lazy and reluctant to talk to people, suddenly burst into the kitchen and started baking a cake without a word. When the Eighth Miss smelled it and asked, he got super nervous and locked the kitchen door, not wanting her to know.]","[When the Eighth Miss came by, I lied about baking cookies (covering for the Seventh Young Master). The Eighth Miss left quite disappointed, mentioning that she'd like a strawberry cake sometime. The Young Master had originally planned to make a grape cake, but after hearing what the Eighth Miss said, he threw the grapes straight into the trash bin! (After I quietly reminded him, the Young Master picked them up and said to give them to the Third Young Master.)]","The post included a picture of the plump, large grapes sitting lonely in the basket."]},{"number":33,"title":"Chapter 33: Miss Xia Xuechun's Great Authority","paragraphs":["Comments quickly appeared under the blog post.","\"What?! My cloud-adopted Seventh Young Master actually bakes cakes? And gives them to Eighth Sister?!\"","\"Who would've thought this new Eighth Sister character would make such a powerful entrance, even getting my autistic seventh son to bake her a cake?!\"","\"Damn it, what's wrong with my third son, the athletic dark-skinned young master! You're giving green grapes to my third son! Blogger, I'm warning you, don't you dare give those green grapes to my third son! You're teasing me!\"","\"? Has the blogger forgotten their original setting? You established that the seven young masters have an eighth sister, but they don't get along with her. How could the dog-loving, cold, autistic Seventh Young Master possibly bake a cake for Eighth Sister? It's too fake, and besides, with all his money, would he really bake a cake himself?\"","Little Xie replied dismissively: \"For your information, Seventh Young Master not only baked the cake himself, but he even washed the strawberries himself! He wouldn't let me help at all, and besides, real people aren't bound by character settings. He can do whatever he wants, believe it or not.\"","This reply caused an explosion of responses!","\"My seventh son, who's too lazy to even open his mouth to drink water, actually washed strawberries himself?! My world is crumbling!\"","\"Is Eighth Miss beautiful?! Is Eighth Miss beautiful?! Is Eighth Miss beautiful?!\"","Little Xie thought for a moment and replied: \"Eighth Miss is extremely beautiful. I'd only seen her photos before, but in person, she's a hundred times more beautiful! Small face, big eyes, perfect figure, she doesn't look out of place next to the young masters at all, just like the Little Mermaid!\"","The fans responded even more enthusiastically.","In the same room, Pei Buxian remained oblivious, still focused on making the cake.","He spread a thick layer of chopped strawberries, and when it came to decorating, he unconsciously wrote \"Thank you for your hard work.\"","But these words were quickly erased, replaced with strawberries, and put on a tray: \"Little Xie.\"","Little Xie snapped to attention: \"Mr. Pei.\"","Pei Buxian handed her the cake: \"Give this to Qiao Chuchu.\"","Little Xie eagerly took it, unable to hide her excitement.","See? She knew it was for Eighth Miss, and those netizens had argued with her!","She flattered: \"Miss Qiao will surely be very happy.\"","But Pei Buxian frowned: \"Don't tell her I made it. Say you made it.\"","Little Xie froze: \"Why?\"","Pei Buxian put his hands in his pockets, his expression cold: \"Because I don't want her to know this is from me.\"","Little Xie couldn't quite understand: \"But... this is a cake you baked yourself, isn't it a bit of a waste for Miss not to know?\"","Pei Buxian's face darkened, losing patience: \"When I tell you to give it to her, just give it to her. You absolutely must not say this cake is from me! Understood?\"","Little Xie trembled in fear: \"Understood.\"","Pei Buxian turned to leave, but after a few steps, he angrily turned back to warn her: \"Even if Qiao Chuchu threatens you with a knife, you must not say I made it, understood?\"","Little Xie: \"??????\"","She watched in shock as Pei Buxian walked away.","Could it be poisoned?!","She posted: [What should I do, everyone! Young Master finished making the cake, but he wants me to give it to Eighth Miss, and he threatened me not to let it slip! Am I going to end up in jail!!!!!!]","\"Haha, I knew my son wouldn't disappoint me, did he put mustard in it!\"","\"? Is this funny? Could it be that Seventh Young Master wants to kill Eighth Miss? Could there be poison in there?\"","\"What would happen if you don't give it to her?\"","\"If you don't give it, you'd definitely lose this job. The blogger said she earns 30,000 a month. With that salary, if it were me, I'd definitely deliver it and deal with any consequences later.\"","\"Ahh, this is so conflicting! Waiting for updates!\"","Little Xie nervously carried the cake and tea to find Qiao Chuchu.","Pei Buxian hid in a corner to watch.","Little Xie placed the tray on the coffee table: \"Miss Qiao...\"","Qiao Chuchu looked puzzled: \"What is it?\"","Little Xie stood stiffly, presenting the tray: \"You worked hard today saving Mr. Pei's West Highland Terrier, so... this cake is for you.\"","Qiao Chuchu was surprised and delighted: \"Wow! What a beautiful strawberry cake, but weren't you baking cookies earlier? Did you buy this?\"","Little Xie looked uncomfortable: \"Before you get poisoned or threaten me with a knife, I made this.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","Little Xie laughed awkwardly: \"Try a slice?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","Who would dare to eat after hearing about poison and knife threats?","And why say such strange things?!","Despite these thoughts, Qiao Chuchu picked up the knife and cut a piece of cake to taste.","Little Xie's heart was in her throat!","Pei Buxian hid in the corner, holding his dog, watching Qiao Chuchu eat.","As she ate, her eyes lit up, and she looked at Little Xie.","Little Xie's face instantly turned pale: \"What's wrong? Are you feeling unwell?\"","\"No,\" Qiao Chuchu shook her head with a smile, her tone certain: \"You didn't make this cake.\"","Pei Buxian startled.","Little Xie froze: \"Why do you say that?\"","Qiao Chuchu lifted the plate, smiling knowingly: \"Because this is Pei Buxian's handiwork.\"","Pei Buxian: \"!\"","Little Xie was shocked: \"How did you know?!\"","Qiao Chuchu speared a strawberry with her fork, smiling triumphantly: \"I just know~\"","[Because when I was little, Pei Buxian baked me a cake for every birthday, so no matter how the cake changes, I can recognize the texture, the consistency of the jam, everything with just one bite.]","[And whenever I faced hardships outside, he would always bake me a cake.]","[This is Pei Buxian's unique cake flavor, and no matter how much time passes, I'll never forget it.]","Qiao Chuchu smiled, her gaze casually sweeping past Pei Buxian's direction.","Pei Buxian hugged his dog and dodged!","He pressed himself tightly against the wall, his ear tips turning pink, his chest heaving violently!","And due to his excitement, even his hands holding the dog were shaking!","He didn't know why he felt so happy.","But his damn lips kept curling upward!","Qiao Chuchu ate the cake while admiring its exquisite decoration.","[This guy, wanting to thank me but too shy to say it, hmph!~]","Pei Buxian pressed his lips together, his handsome face turning red.","Suddenly, angry footsteps echoed from the living room.","Xia Xuechun stormed up to Qiao Chuchu: \"Miss Qiao!!\"","As Qiao Chuchu turned her head, Xia Xuechun grabbed the strawberry cake from the table and smashed it in her face!","Qiao Chuchu: \"!\"","Little Xie: \"!\"","Pei Buxian: \"??\"","Xia Xuechun was furious, rolling up her sleeves and declaring righteously: \"Just because you're rich, you think you're better than everyone? You think being rich means you can bully us poor people?!\"","Qiao Chuchu didn't respond because cream had gone up her nostrils!!!","Another male voice slowly rang out: \"Miss Xia Xuechun.\"","Xia Xuechun froze and looked toward the source.","Pei Yuan and the other five Pei brothers looked down at her, their aura like dark clouds consuming the entire sky, making it instantly hard to breathe.","Pei Yuan smiled terrifyingly: \"You're quite bold, aren't you?\"","Xia Xuechun's eyes widened in shock.","Why... why were these people back?","Weren't they supposed to be at work???!"]},{"number":34,"title":"Chapter 34: Chuchu, I am the God of Big Slaps in Ancient Greece","paragraphs":["A deathly silence permeated the Pei family living room.","Pei Yuan stood at the entrance, his eyes blazing with fury.","Xia Xuechun's fingertips were still stained with strawberry cream, her hair disheveled from rushing over, looking both pathetic and awkward as she stammered, \"It- it was Miss Qiao who was unreasonable first, Mr. Pei, it wasn't my fault!\"","Pei Yuan let out a cold laugh.","Bullying his sister right in front of him, and she claims it wasn't her fault?!","As he stepped forward, Qiao Chuchu suddenly pounced on Xia Xuechun like a monkey!","She grabbed the cake from the floor and smashed it right into Xia Xuechun's face!","Pei Yuan: \"!\"","Pei Buxian: \"!\"","Everyone else: \"!\"","Qiao Chuchu quickly pinned Xia Xuechun to the ground, shrieking like a wild hen: \"Bet you didn't expect this - I'm the goddamn Greek goddess of beatdowns!\"","She grabbed the cake and stuffed it into Xia Xuechun's mouth!","Xia Xuechun couldn't cry out, but managed to flip Qiao Chuchu under her: \"Let me go!\"","Qiao Chuchu slapped her repeatedly: \"Hell no! I won't stop until I slap the shit out of you!\"","The seven brothers: \"?\"","Little Xie: \"?\"","Lin Qing arrived at the Pei family's front door with Lin Shen, holding flowers.","Lin Qing, holding the exquisite lily of the valley blooms, smiled sweetly as she introduced, \"Brother, trust me, Qiao Chuchu is such an adorable girl, you'll definitely like her when you meet her.\"","Lin Shen maintained his stern expression, nervously adjusting the creases in his coat without responding.","He had been in love with Qiao Chuchu for four whole years, of course he knew where her charm lay, but being adorable was just her most basic quality.","Lin Qing rang the doorbell, still enthusiastically introducing her: \"This adorable young lady has such a good temperament, she's kind, and most importantly, she's very interesting. You must be gentle, don't frighten her.\"","Soon after, a servant opened the door, exclaiming with delight: \"Miss Lin Qing?\"","Lin Qing nodded: \"I'm here to see Qiao Chuchu. Is the Eighth Miss in?\"","The servant smiled awkwardly, clearly hesitant about something: \"She is, but—\"","Lin Qing didn't wait for the servant to finish, brushing past: \"That's all I needed to know. This is my brother, we're here specifically to visit Miss Qiao!~\"","Lin Shen followed closely behind, maintaining his stern expression.","Although they hadn't met in three years, from Lin Qing's description, Qiao Chuchu hadn't changed at all.","Still sweet as ever when she smiled.","As the two walked side by side toward the living room, they suddenly heard a piercing scream: \"Where do you think you're running to!!!!\"","Lin Shen frowned as he saw a panicked girl with a ponytail rush into his arms!","The girl, tears in her eyes, smoothly glanced past Lin Qing's face and looked to him pleadingly: \"Sir, please save me!\"","Lin Shen's brow furrowed in disgust as he stepped back.","Why would she ask for his help when his sister was right there?","But clearly, this girl had ignored her fellow female, and was even spreading her arms to embrace him. Just as she was about to touch him, a dark figure suddenly appeared in front of him and kicked the girl flying!","Lin Shen was startled and looked at the dark figure standing before him.","Long reddish-brown hair dotted with cream, wearing a comfortable hoodie - before he could get a clear look, the red-haired girl body-slammed the ponytailed girl on the ground!","\"Flying crow attack!!\"","Xia Xuechun wailed: \"Ouch!\"","Qiao Chuchu grabbed her hair and started slapping both sides of her face: \"Shut up!\"","Xia Xuechun's breath caught, and she pressed her lips together pitifully, glaring at her through tear-filled eyes.","Though she didn't speak.","But Xia Xuechun's eyes were clearly full of defiance.","Qiao Chuchu pinned her down like a pig ready for slaughter during New Year's, arrogantly saying: \"Get up then, why can't you get up?\"","Xia Xuechun burst into tears: \"You're bullying me because you're rich!\"","Qiao Chuchu sneered: \"This isn't bullying.\"","She pulled out a mini frying pan from behind her waist that had appeared from who knows where: \"THIS is bullying.\"","Xia Xuechun: \"?!\"","Qiao Chuchu aimed at her head and \"BANG!\" brought it down!","Xia Xuechun passed out on the spot!","Qiao Chuchu stood up, flipped her hair, and coolly blew on the frying pan: \"Phew~\"","She tucked the frying pan into her pants, turned around, and was met with several dumbfounded faces.","The stunned Pei Yuan and his brothers.","The stupefied Pei Buxian.","The completely amazed Little Xie.","And...","Lin Qing holding flowers with a shocked expression.","And Lin Shen with disbelief written all over his face.","?","Lin Shen?"]},{"number":35,"title":"Chapter 35: First Love in the Deep Forest","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu got cream in her eyes and couldn't see clearly. She hurriedly rubbed them, but the more she rubbed, the blurrier her vision became, leaving her unable to see what was in front of her.","A handkerchief appeared before her: \"Here, wipe it off.\"","Qiao Chuchu was startled by this unexpected kindness. Through her blurred vision, she vaguely saw Lin Shen's concerned gaze.","[Am I hallucinating? I think I just saw Lin Shen?]","The Pei Brothers looked at Lin Shen with confusion.","Lin Qing also stared at Lin Shen in surprise.","Lin Shen shook his head, feeling somewhat strange.","Qiao Chuchu hadn't spoken, yet he heard her voice?","Finally, Qiao Chuchu cleared her eyes, only to meet Lin Shen's puzzled gaze.","She stumbled backward in shock, lost her balance, and landed right on Xia Xuechun's lap!","Xia Xuechun let out a painful \"Ow!\" and fainted again!","Qiao Chuchu couldn't believe it: [When I'm perfectly made up, I don't see anyone I know, but when my face is covered in cream and I'm not wearing any makeup, I run into my first love?!]","Lin Shen froze.","Everyone else was dumbfounded!","First love?!","Lin Qing was the most surprised, jabbing Lin Shen hard: \"What's going on with you—\"","She stopped mid-sentence, realizing she had just heard Qiao Chuchu's inner thoughts.","Lin Shen felt strange, vaguely sensing something wasn't right.","He... seemed to be able to hear Qiao Chuchu's thoughts.","And his sister apparently could hear them too.","Lin Shen looked toward the Pei Brothers.","Pei Yuan and Pei Buxian and the others stared at him with deep, dark gazes.","Oblivious to all this, Qiao Chuchu lowered her head awkwardly and said, \"I'll go wash my face.\"","She lifted Xia Xuechun with impressive strength, carrying her like a side of pork, and walked away with steady steps.","Lin Shen stared intently at her retreating figure.","Suddenly, Pei Buxian blocked his view.","Holding a dog, Pei Buxian's pale face broke into an eerie smile: \"Lin Shen, you can hear that voice too, can't you?\"","The atmosphere suddenly grew tense.","Auntie Wang and Little Xie, who had been there earlier, had disappeared at some point, leaving only the familiar faces in the living room.","Lin Shen asked puzzled: \"What voice?\"","Pei Buxian didn't wait for his acknowledgment and said directly: \"So you're our Pei family's eighth sister's first love.\"","He looked Lin Shen up and down critically: \"Qiao Chuchu must have been blind to fall for you.\"","Lin Shen: \"?\"","Lin Qing hissed and stood up to defend him: \"What are you saying, Pei Seven? My brother is gentle, wealthy, and not bad-looking. What's wrong with Qiao Chuchu falling for a big brother like him?\"","She turned to Lin Shen: \"I support you two being together. Qiao Chuchu will be my sister-in-law!\"","Pei Buxian's face turned blue: \"No way!\"","Lin Qing retorted fiercely: \"Why not? You're all sister complexes and now you want to drag your sister into this too? That's too much!\"","Lin Shen grew more confused: \"What are you all talking about?\"","Lin Qing explained: \"We're talking about the inner voices, the ones you heard from Qiao Chuchu in your mind.\"","Lin Shen couldn't believe it: \"Can you all hear them?\"","Lin Qing nodded: \"Of course we can all hear them, but only certain people can. We suspect that those who can hear Qiao Chuchu's thoughts are all destined for bad endings.\"","She pointed to herself: \"My fate was to go to prison for several years, and after getting out, I had a mental breakdown and committed suicide.\"","She then pointed at the Pei family members: \"These seven went bankrupt and died miserably on the streets.\"","Pei Yuan calmly continued: \"Since you can also hear Qiao Chuchu's thoughts, let me explain the current situation. After all, you're Lin Qing's brother, and from now on, we'll need to work together.\"","Lin Shen stood there shocked, looking at everyone's serious expressions, realizing this wasn't a joke.","He nodded very solemnly: \"Alright.\""]},{"number":36,"title":"Chapter 36: I No Longer Like You","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu finally managed to clean off the cream from her body, changed her clothes, hastily applied natural makeup, and walked down the stairs with particular elegance, trying to salvage her image.","Lin Shen looked up at the sound, his gaze meeting hers.","Her heart began racing wildly, though she maintained a composed facade as she descended.","[Stay calm, Qiao Chuchu! Even though this is your first love, you haven't confessed, he doesn't know you like him, so it's fine. You can walk up to him naturally and greet him. He won't be able to tell, it's fine.]","Lin Shen's eyes brightened slightly, the corners of his mouth turning up imperceptibly as he stood up involuntarily and walked toward Qiao Chuchu.","Pei Buxian narrowed his eyes viciously, the dark circles under his eyes appearing even more pronounced as he said sarcastically, \"If someone were a dog, their tail would be wagging right now.\"","Lin Shen ignored him, holding the flowers as his heart beat even more erratically.","Three years ago, he had left her after witnessing Qiao Chuchu's feelings for his brother firsthand.","And just now, he learned that Qiao Chuchu had only been completing tasks because she was forced by the system.","Now, he had heard Qiao Chuchu's true feelings.","They had feelings for each other.","He walked step by step to Qiao Chuchu, his eyes sparkling with tiny stars: \"It's been a while, Chuchu.\"","Upon closer inspection, Qiao Chuchu realized that Lin Shen and Lin Qing looked incredibly similar.","Lin Qing's features were sharper, breathtakingly beautiful.","While Lin Shen's features were softer, more profound, like a Western classical painting with perfectly placed light and shadow on his face.","He hadn't changed.","Still the same senior she remembered.","Qiao Chuchu's nervousness suddenly vanished, and she accepted the bouquet like a friend: \"Thank you.\"","[Although I was nervous earlier, when it came time to face him, I'm surprisingly calm now.]","[After all, he's just a boy I used to like. Looking at him now, my heart doesn't flutter anymore.]","Hearing this, Lin Shen's smile instantly froze.","Pei Buxian's eyes widened in surprise, and he burst out laughing.","The atmosphere suddenly turned strange.","Qiao Chuchu was puzzled: \"Seventh Brother, why are you suddenly laughing?\"","It wasn't just Pei Buxian laughing; the other brothers' faces were red from holding back their laughter, their shoulders shaking.","But Pei Buxian was the most amused, sitting cross-legged on the sofa with his dog, laughing meaningfully: \"I just thought of something funny.\"","Chuchu didn't understand and looked at Lin Shen: \"Please sit, Senior Lin Shen.\"","Lin Shen stiffly sat down beside her, giving her a confused look.","Lin Qing noticed her brother's odd mood and, eyes rolling, put an arm around Qiao Chuchu's shoulders to probe: \"I had no idea you knew my brother. How come you never mentioned it?\"","Qiao Chuchu held the flowers, feeling a bit embarrassed: \"When I met Senior, I didn't know he was Lin Qing's brother. We met at an art exhibition. Senior Lin Shen helped me a lot. I always struggled with light and shadow in my paintings, but after his guidance, my technique improved significantly. I'm like his little apprentice.\"","[After all, I wasn't interested in minor characters back then. Except for the protagonists and main supporting characters who appeared frequently, I didn't remember the names of other minor characters.]","Pei Buxian: \"Pfft!!\"","Qiao Chuchu looked at Pei Buxian in confusion: \"What are you laughing at now?\"","Lin Qing gave a forced smile: \"Never mind him. Your Seventh Brother has his mouth and bottom switched; he's talking out of his rear end now.\"","Pei Buxian: \"?\"","Lin Qing continued suggestively: \"So it seems you've known each other for a long time. Are you two...\"","\"No,\" Qiao Chuchu denied immediately: \"Senior Lin Shen and I are just senior and junior, nothing more.\"","She awkwardly glanced at Lin Shen before looking away.","[It would have been wonderful if the man I liked had liked me back, but he saw me doing those tasks, and the next day he went abroad. He didn't even block me, which was already giving me face.]","Lin Qing choked, thought for a moment, then said cheerfully: \"Oh right, my brother hasn't dated anyone yet. Why don't you two give it a try?\"","Qiao Chuchu was surprised: \"What?\"","Lin Qing excitedly said: \"You don't know what my brother's like. He's been a blockhead since childhood, only interested in painting. Both guys and girls have pursued him, but he never showed any interest. But I think you two would be perfect together! Right, brother?\"","Qiao Chuchu froze, nervously looking at Lin Shen.","Lin Shen's ink-dark gaze was fixed on her, seeming to have thousands of words to say, yet he didn't answer Lin Qing's question.","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","[Oh no, he's not thinking about how I pursued my brother again, is he? I can't let him think about that anymore, it's too embarrassing!]","She waved her hands in refusal: \"No need, no need. Senior Lin Shen is so handsome, he could find any girlfriend he wants. I'm not interested in dating right now.\"","She nervously rubbed her knees, trying to hide her unease.","[After all, I was hurt really badly. When Lin Shen saw that moment, I didn't even get a chance to explain before the system forced me into the hospital.]","[I've always wanted to explain everything clearly to Lin Shen, whether through handwritten notes, typing, or various hints. I wanted to tell him because I really, really liked him.]","[But he left for abroad without looking back.]","[That period was the hardest time of my life. When I wanted to jump off a building, the system controlled my body to stop me. When I tried to starve myself, the system forced my mind to keep me alive. My hair fell out in clumps, I couldn't sleep night after night, couldn't live, couldn't die, and was still forced by it to complete tasks, putting on a fake smile to act like a seductress.]","Everyone's expressions gradually became serious.","A life controlled by the system... was it really this painful?","Pei Buxian leaned close to Pei Yuan, muttering: \"I remember Qiao Chuchu's mental state was terrible for a while. We thought she was close to having a mental breakdown. Was this the reason?\"","Pei Yuan: \"...\"","Somehow, his heart ached.","He had never known Qiao Chuchu had gone through such painful times.","He remembered it clearly too, and had even had people secretly watch over Qiao Chuchu, fearing she might do something drastic.","But he hadn't imagined she had endured such torturous suffering in secret.","Qiao Chuchu became more lost in thought: [I not only ruined my brother's life, but I also ruined my own. It took me a year to forget Lin Shen, and now all those previous heart flutters are completely gone, but I still remember all the pain. Now I don't want anything except to protect myself.]","Lin Shen suddenly stood up from the sofa: \"Chuchu!\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","Lin Shen's brows furrowed: \"Actually, I've always—\"","\"Qiao Chuchu!\" Qi Xiaojia stormed toward Qiao Chuchu aggressively: \"You actually knocked out my friend, I'm going to call the police on you!!\"","Lin Shen's face darkened.","Lin Qing and the Pei brothers turned their knife-like gazes toward Qi Xiaojia in perfect unison.","Who did she say she was going to arrest?"]},{"number":37,"title":"Chapter 37: Qiao Chuchu: I Really Don't Care That I'm a Poor Student, Please Don't Involve Me in the Rat Race","paragraphs":["Qi Xiaojia stood trembling before Qiao Chuchu.","It took all her courage to stand there.","Because she had just seen Xia Xuechun lying in the break room with a huge bump on her head!","Shaking, Qi Xiaojia reproached, \"You have absolutely no respect for us!\"","Pei Yuan spoke with a sinister tone: \"Xia Xuechun was the one who first smeared cake all over Qiao Chuchu's face. And you're saying my sister doesn't show respect?\"","Qi Xiaojia was left speechless but countered, \"That doesn't mean Qiao Chuchu can knock her unconscious! What if something serious had happened to her?\"","Pei Buxian harshly retorted, \"So it was safe when Xia Xuechun smeared cake on my sister's face? What if she had suffocated? What if she had died from not being able to breathe?!\"","Qi Xiaojia choked up, her eyes instantly turning red, her voice trembling with tears: \"You always think you're right no matter what! You're just bullying people because you're rich and powerful!\"","Just as Qiao Chuchu was about to speak, Lin Shen cut in coldly: \"If we were really using our power to bully you, would you still be able to stand here talking to us like this?\"","Qi Xiaojia froze.","Lin Qing smiled aggressively from the side: \"My brother's right. Our Lin family isn't one to be trifled with. Would you like to find out?\"","Qi Xiaojia's face turned pale with fear. She stepped back and looked at Qiao Chuchu.","Qiao Chuchu sat in the circle of people, surrounded by brothers and sisters protecting her on both sides.","She didn't need to say anything; just sitting there calmly, she could win this war silently.","The more Qi Xiaojia thought about it, the more unfair it felt: \"Qiao Chuchu, are you just going to let people around you protect you instead of facing me like an adult?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"I don't plan to.\"","Qi Xiaojia: \"?\"","Qiao Chuchu said matter-of-factly: \"Everyone's helping me, so why should I waste my breath with you?\"","Qi Xiaojia was stunned, and in her anger, spoke without thinking: \"I heard from Auntie Wang that you only got into that prestigious foreign university because your brothers donated money. You're clearly different from hardworking people like me and Xuechun. You're just a parasite living off your family, waiting to be taken care of!\"","Everyone was stunned.","Auntie Wang, who had rushed over, heard Qi Xiaojia's words and collapsed to the ground.","Qi Xiaojia... had actually told Qiao Chuchu about the gossip she had shared about her!","She had specifically warned them not to repeat what she had said!!","Qiao Chuchu looked away, saw Auntie Wang clutching her chest, and couldn't help but laugh: \"Qi Xiaojia, privately discussing your employer's personal life - all three of you will be fired.\"","Qi Xiaojia lifted her chin proudly, \"So what if we're fired? There are plenty of jobs and good employers out there. We don't need you!\"","Qiao Chuchu smiled sarcastically: \"You don't seem to understand what I mean. What I mean is, not only will I fire you, but I'll also have my family use all their connections to let everyone know about your stupid actions.\"","She paused, then continued: \"This means that every wealthy family and large corporation that might want to hire Auntie Wang and you will see your black history of leaking employer secrets. Auntie Wang's monthly salary will drop from fifty thousand to just a few thousand.\"","Qi Xiaojia: \"What?!\"","Auntie Wang's face changed dramatically. She quickly ran to Qiao Chuchu, bursting into tears: \"Miss Eight, I'm so sorry, please don't fire me! I have a whole family to support! I know I was wrong, I'll never gossip again!\"","Pei Yuan: \"Too late.\"","Auntie Wang's breath caught as she turned to look at Pei Yuan.","Pei Yuan glanced at her sideways, as if looking at trash: \"If you dare to gossip about your employer's private life, you should be prepared to face the consequences. Pack your things and get out.\"","Auntie Wang begged desperately: \"Mr. Pei, please forgive me, Mr. Pei, I won't gossip anymore, I really won't gossip anymore, please don't be so harsh, Mr. Pei!!\"","Pei Yuan took out his phone to call security.","Security came and dragged Auntie Wang away.","Auntie Wang's legs were too weak to stand. She grabbed Qi Xiaojia tightly, almost wanting to strangle her: \"How could you be so loose-lipped?! I shouldn't have called both of you over! You've ruined me! You've all ruined me!!!\"","She looked like a criminal being dragged to execution in ancient times, full of resentment.","Qi Xiaojia trembled in fear, stumbling over her words: \"I-I didn't expect Qiao Chuchu to be so petty!\"","She commanded Qiao Chuchu with red eyes: \"Let Auntie Wang go right now! She's innocent!\"","\"Innocent?\" Qiao Chuchu sneered: \"Then how did you know about my family paying for my university education? Sure, it doesn't sound good that I got in this way, but my family donated an entire building, millions of dollars in American currency. Did you think I got it for free?\"","Qi Xiaojia choked: \"But-but we were just sharing gossip! Don't you ever share gossip?\"","Qiao Chuchu laughed: \"I'm not stupid enough to share secrets my friends tell me with their enemies. So Auntie Wang's fate is her own fault for having a loose tongue, and yours for being stupid.\"","Qi Xiaojia's face turned red as a pig's liver, tears welling up in her eyes as she protested: \"You-you're just using your money and power to bully Xuechun, to bully me, to bully Auntie Wang! You're garbage, a half-baked person, just a bloodsucker living off your family!\"","She grew more agitated: \"You don't care about education because you barely made it! When you face someone like me, you still feel inferior, you're jealous of me and Xuechun because I got where I am through my own abilities!\"","Qi Xiaojia almost tore her throat shouting: \"I'm standing here in front of you because of my real capabilities!!\"","Qiao Chuchu's mouth fell half-open, too shocked to speak: \"So you're standing in front of me with your real capabilities... as a temporary maid in my house?\"","Qi Xiaojia: \"?\"","The others let out light chuckles.","Lin Qing couldn't help but mock: \"I haven't seen such an idiot in a long time.\"","Qi Xiaojia was left flustered by the mockery, feeling even more humiliated: \"I'm just here doing temporary work, my real abilities aren't shown here!\"","Qiao Chuchu was unimpressed: \"So what? Is this the only thing in your life you can compare with me?\"","Qi Xiaojia insisted: \"Yes! Just based on this alone, my life already crushes yours to dust! What right do you have to bully us like this! You're nothing yourself!\"","Qiao Chuchu laughed, saying helplessly: \"Honey, when you try to mock someone about their education, you should first make sure they care about education as much as you do.\"","Qi Xiaojia was stunned by her words: \"What?\"","Qiao Chuchu explained calmly: \"The foreign university was something my family forced me to attend because not having a good education would shame our entire family. That wasn't my choice. I'm a manga artist, and all I need to do is make many readers love my manga. So even if you were a master musician at the highest level, it wouldn't threaten me at all.\"","She continued with increasing sympathy: \"You're shouting yourself breathless at me, but the damage you're causing me is less than what I get from a single criticism from my readers.\""]},{"number":38,"title":"Chapter 38: Joe Chu: I'm Just laying low at Work, not Dead","paragraphs":["Qi Xiaojia was stunned.","She had imagined countless ways to counter Qiao Chuchu's words, but she never expected that Qiao Chuchu simply didn't care about it at all.","Her mind raced as she lifted her chin: \"Well, even if you draw comics, you might not achieve anything, right? Because your studies are poor, you definitely can't create anything good!\"","Qiao Chuchu frowned and couldn't help but show a look of pity: \"Guess how much I make a month?\"","Qi Xiaojia hesitated for a moment, then tentatively whispered, \"Ten thousand?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"No, two hundred thousand.\"","Qi Xiaojia: \"?\"","Qiao Chuchu added smugly, \"Two hundred thousand is just the minimum.\"","Others: \"?\"","Two hundred thousand minimum?!","Qiao Chuchu looked at Qi Xiaojia's pale face with disdain: \"I've always hoped to become a manga artist since I was a child. I've heard all the ridicule you people throw at me, but I never cared because I know I was born for my dream, and I have indeed succeeded.\"","Qi Xiaojia: \"...\"","Qiao Chuchu pityingly patted her shoulder: \"The recent hit TV drama was adapted from my manga, and the merchandise sold out instantly. Speaking of which, you must have guessed which drama it is, right?\"","Qi Xiaojia's face turned green as she trembled while picking up her phone and unlocking the screen.","The screen displayed a beautiful manga wallpaper of a blonde beauty and a brunette handsome man.","Qiao Chuchu glanced at it and smiled brightly: \"Yes, the couple you have as your lock screen wallpaper? That's my work.\"","Qi Xiaojia: \"!\"","How could this be?!","Her favorite manga protagonists, her favorite manga artist!","It was Qiao Chuchu?!","Qiao Chuchu's gaze was sharp as a sword as she asked Qi Xiaojia: \"In the path I've chosen, I may not be at the top, but I'm certainly in the upper tier. Where do you rank in your life's path?\"","Qi Xiaojia felt like she had been struck by lightning, stiffening and unable to speak.","Qiao Chuchu spoke softly: \"I'm the same age as you, and I haven't mocked you for earning less than me, yet you come to ridicule me for not being as good at studies as you. Of course, you can continue to mock me; I am indeed a poor student, and you are indeed excellent in your studies. That's a fact, so you do you.\"","Qi Xiaojia opened her mouth, but she was left speechless.","The manga artist she had admired for years was Qiao Chuchu, and she had mocked Qiao Chuchu for being incapable, only to be outsmarted.","And Qiao Chuchu's attitude towards her... how should she put it?","It was a kind of disregard, as if she wasn't even worth considering.","It was like looking at a stray dog barking wildly!","All the rationality Qi Xiaojia had built up crumbled, and she couldn't help but sob, covering her face and running away!","Qiao Chuchu called out to her: \"Wait.\"","Qi Xiaojia tearfully looked at her.","Qiao Chuchu, hands in her pockets, said coldly: \"Call a moving truck to take Xia Xuechun away, and I'll cover the fare.\"","Qi Xiaojia bit her lower lip in humiliation, then ran off without saying another word.","The entire hall fell silent once more.","Qiao Chuchu returned to the sofa and took a sip of water when she suddenly felt everyone's eyes on her.","?","She looked around doubtfully and met Lin Qing's nearly obsessive gaze: \"Chuchu, you're quite commanding when dealing with problems. I feel like you've turned me gay.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","Pei Buxian, holding a dog, said in a daze: \"Qiao Chuchu, I never knew you had a brain.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"??\"","Pei Youchuan cleared his throat and turned away indifferently: \"I thought you were a softie, but you're actually quite tough when faced with threats. And you're a big name in the manga world, with published works. Why didn't you tell us?\"","The other brothers nodded in agreement.","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","【Of course I'm tough. Before I transmigrated, I was a penniless wretch.】","Everyone: \"?\"","A penniless wretch?","【After all, I started as an orphan with no one to adopt me, wearing clothes donated by kind-hearted people, attending schools funded by the state, and bullied by classmates because I was poor, ugly, and academically stupid. The only talents I had were drawing and sports, but I had no money for art supplies or to attend sports school. I couldn't afford to order dishes for lunch, and even a one-yuan pack of pickles had to be eaten sparingly. The only free pastime was crying quietly in the bathroom.】","Qiao Chuchu sneered and curled her lips: [When I had a fever, I had to work; during holidays, I had to work because taking a day off would cost me three hundred yuan, and working on holidays came with overtime pay. If Aunt Wang had introduced me to a job paying thirty thousand a month back then, I would have endured being slapped in the face by the employer, let alone argue.]","The brothers listened, their hearts aching as if being squeezed.","Lin Shen's gaze grew increasingly pained.","Only Qiao Chuchu's expression grew darker.","【But the poor me is dead. The current me must hold onto the happiness I have now!】","Qiao Chuchu checked the time and became alert: 【Isn't there a scene with Pei Fengnong today?】","Pei Fengnong, who had been lost in thought, looked at Qiao Chuchu in surprise.","Qiao Chuchu thought carefully: 【It seems that today, Pei Fengnong encountered the male lead, Ji Yanchuan, while racing. That idiot male lead was in a bad mood and deliberately caused trouble for Pei Fengnong, swerving into his path and causing an accident that landed Pei Fengnong in the hospital. That's when the feud between Ji Yanchuan and the Pei family began.】","The Pei brothers were astonished.","Lin Qing was even more shocked.","How dare that idiot Ji Yanchuan swerve into someone else's path?!","That guy can't even figure out how to breathe properly!","Lin Shen, meanwhile, stared at Qiao Chuchu in a daze.","So this is what it feels like to hear someone's thoughts and predict what will happen next.","Suddenly, both Lin Shen and Lin Qing's phones vibrated.","It was Pei Youchuan who had added them to a WeChat group.","Pei Youchuan: \"Let's communicate in this group. This way, we won't expose ourselves, and we can coordinate our plans for what's coming next.\"","Lin Shen frowned, not entirely agreeing: \"I don't understand why we can't just be upfront with Qiao Chuchu. Wouldn't it be better to discuss things with her?\"","At this, everyone gave him a big eye roll.","Lin Qing was the first to rebut: \"Brother, I get that you like Qiao Chuchu and want to confess your feelings to her, but you also have to understand us. We're all 'villainous side characters' in this story. If this world finds out we know our own endings, we might be erased by the world! Just like Qiao Chuchu.\"","Lin Shen: \"? Is Chuchu being erased by the world?\"","Pei Buxian: \"Speaking of erasure, Qiao Chuchu has died twice today. She has ten chances to be reborn, and now she only has seven left.\"","Everyone: \"?\"","Rebirth chances?","Pei Buxian: \"I was going to tell you all when I got back, but I got distracted baking strawberry cakes and dealing with Xia Xuechun's antics, so I forgot about it.\"","The group chat exploded!","Lin Qing scolded him: \"How could you forget something so important!\"","Lin Shen was deep in thought: \"So that means Chuchu has already died three times? How did she die the first three times? Why weren't you protecting her if she was in danger?\"","Pei Youchuan: \"Lin Shen, what tone are you using to talk to us? You hurt my sister so badly, and we haven't even settled that score yet!\"","Pei Che: \"Enough, you're hurting my eyes. Let Pei Buxian explain what kind of rebirth this is.\"","Pei Buxian: \"? How would I know? I just saw her escape from danger and say she used two lives. I can't see it, but I can confirm that as long as the male or female lead is present, Qiao Chuchu is at risk of dying.\"","Everyone: \"?\"","So that means...","Qiao Chuchu could very likely die today?"]},{"number":39,"title":"Chapter 39: Pei Feng Nong","paragraphs":["After confirming that Qiao Chuchu was highly likely to die tonight, everyone silently looked at her.","Qiao Chuchu seemed like a harmless, gentle-natured girl, the type who would feel wronged and cry just from accidentally bumping into something.","But beneath this seemingly fragile exterior lay an extremely resilient soul.","Lin Shen furrowed his brows tightly.","Life was so long, with countless unexpected events that could occur. If Qiao Chuchu wanted to live well, she had to conserve her resurrection chances as much as possible.","\"Let me protect her today,\" Lin Shen typed. \"I won't let her fall into danger.\"","Pei Fengnong shot him an annoyed glance: \"Get lost.\"","Lin Shen: \"?\"","Pei Fengnong rubbed his neck, stood up from the sofa, and spoke lazily, \"Pei Buxian, you're done with your task of keeping an eye on Qiao Chuchu, right?\"","Pei Buxian nodded.","Pei Fengnong glanced sideways at Qiao Chuchu: \"Then hand her over to me.\"","Qiao Chuchu was stunned as Pei Fengnong roughly grabbed her arm and pulled her off the sofa, causing her to stumble into his embrace!","Qiao Chuchu reflexively tried to throw Pei Fengnong over her shoulder!","But Pei Fengnong counterattacked by gripping her wrist!","Her resistance was futile!","Anxiously, she looked up and met Pei Fengnong's disdainful, carefree gaze.","He towered over her, holding both her wrists, as if admiring a toy, and let out a malicious chuckle.","\"Try again?\"","Qiao Chuchu felt humiliated and attempted to counterattack.","His strength was fierce, gripping her bones, strong and domineering.","Qiao Chuchu couldn't help but let out a muffled groan.","Lin Shen stood up: \"Pei Fengnong, you're hurting her!\"","Pei Fengnong gave Lin Shen an annoyed glance: \"She's my sister. Mind your own business.\"","Lin Shen's face darkened as he grabbed Qiao Chuchu's wrist: \"It is my business!\"","The atmosphere in the room froze!","Qiao Chuchu was caught between Pei Fengnong in front and Lin Shen behind her.","Qiao Chuchu, stuck in the middle, was utterly confused.","【Am I experiencing the legendary scenario of two men fighting over one woman? But honestly, watching it from the outside is amusing, but being in the middle of it is really annoying.】","Lin Shen and Pei Fengnong both subtly frowned but didn't let go of their grip.","Lin Qingle, on the sidelines, was enjoying the show: \"Two handsome guys fighting over a beautiful woman—who needs TV when you have drama happening right here!~\"","Pei Buxian wasn't pleased: \"Pei Fengnong, get Qiao Chuchu back. You can't be such a weakling that you can't even outmatch Lin Shen, the bookworm!\"","Lin Shen narrowed his eyes and tried to pull Qiao Chuchu into his embrace!","Qiao Chuchu: \"!\"","Pei Fengnong sneered and yanked Qiao Chuchu back!","Her arms were stretched taut, causing her to wince in pain: \"Let me go, both of you. If you really can't bear to, just chop me in half and take me home to cremate.\"","Lin Shen was taken aback and quickly let go: \"Did I hurt you?\"","But before Qiao Chuchu could answer, Pei Fengnong simply hoisted her onto his shoulder and walked away!","Lin Shen was shocked: \"Pei Fengnong!\"","Pei Fengnong didn't look back: \"If you're a man, drive and catch up.\"","Lin Shen was furious and turned to Pei Yuan: \"How can you let your sister be in such danger?!\"","Pei Yuan stood up, calm and composed: \"This is our rule. Whenever someone is in trouble, they must have Qiao Chuchu by their side, whether they take her with them or follow her. If it were your turn, we wouldn't stop you from taking Chu Chu either.\"","Lin Shen was anxious: \"But what if Qiao Chuchu dies? Can't we be more cautious, even if she has seven chances left?\"","Pei Yuan remained composed: \"We won't let her die. After all, it's not just Pei Fengnong who will be with Qiao Chuchu.\"","Lin Shen: \"?\"","Pei Yuan explained, \"We'll also be on the scene, but not yet. Go back to work for now. Tonight, when Pei Fengnong starts his race, we'll all be there.\"","Lin Shen: \"...And now?\"","\"Give the siblings some alone time,\" Pei Yuan said, hands in his pockets. \"You wouldn't want to intrude, would you?\"","Lin Shen frowned, clearly resistant: \"I don't think Pei Fengnong is treating Qiao Chuchu well.\"","Pei Yuan chuckled coldly: \"If your sister kept trying to flirt with you every time she saw you, you wouldn't be too friendly either.\"","Lin Shen's expression darkened: \"So, I should just stand by and watch Pei Fengnong bully Qiao Chuchu?\"","Pei Yuan: \"You could close your eyes.\"","Lin Shen: \"?\"","Pei Yuan patted his shoulder, speaking with a tone of wisdom: \"Lin Shen, I understand you want to mend your broken relationship with Qiao Chuchu, but her liking you is in the past. You didn't cherish that chance back then, so this opportunity is gone. I advise you to let go of that thought.\"","Pei Yuan smiled warmly, his eyes cold: \"After all, you're too old for my sister.\"","Lin Shen raised an eyebrow, not angry: \"In your eyes, no one is good enough for your sister.\"","Pei Yuan smiled like a fox: \"You got it.\"","Lin Shen: \"...\"","-","Qiao Chuchu fiercely yanked her hand away from Pei Fengnong's grip: \"Stop dragging me around, all of you! It's so annoying!\"","Pei Fengnong stopped, towering over her.","His massive frame enveloped her.","She turned her head away, pretending not to notice his imposing presence.","【Even though they say they hate me, they all treat me like this, pulling and tugging, restricting my freedom, ordering me around like I'm not even a person. So patriarchal.】","Pei Fengnong picked up his phone and searched on the browser: What is \"fatherly\"?","The first search result: \"1. Refers to someone having an old-fatherly vibe. 2. Someone who constantly wants to be 'dad' to others, always lecturing, overly masculine, self-centered, and a bit greasy.\"","Pei Fengnong fell silent, then set his phone down thoughtfully.","Qiao Chuchu walked past him toward the living room: \"Since Pei Buxian works from home, let him keep an eye on me. No need for you to get involved.\"","【I'll go to Pei Fengnong's racing track tonight. I'm not staying with him now.】","Pei Fengnong let out a barely audible cold snort.","Did she think he wanted to be with her?","He said, \"Tonight I have a friendly race. If you stay with me for a few hours and attend, I'll give you 50,000 in spending money. That club is members-only, so if you don't come with me now, you won't get in later.\"","Qiao Chuchu stopped mid-step and smoothly walked up to him, serious: \"Money isn't important. What matters is that I want to watch your friendly race.\"","Pei Fengnong: \"......\"","Truth be told, the grudge between him and Qiao Chuchu was deep.","He had once been a legendary F1 racer, winning first place in seven international races, and had become famous for his good looks, attracting fans outside the racing community.","But a week before a race a year ago, he had driven to pick up a drunken Qiao Chuchu. On the way, she had gone crazy and tried to grab the steering wheel. Just as they were about to crash, he had protected Qiao Chuchu by turning the danger toward himself.","As a result, Qiao Chuchu had only suffered minor injuries, while his arm had been shattered, requiring surgery and causing him to miss the race.","Before his arm had fully recovered, he had felt like dying. Now, with his condition improving, he could only indulge in rally racing to satisfy his cravings.","All the hard work he had put in over the past year had been ruined by Qiao Chuchu.","The more Pei Fengnong thought about it, the tighter his brows furrowed.","In the past year, he had lost so much, endured so much physical and mental pain, all because of Qiao Chuchu.","He hated her to the core, yet he suddenly realized that Qiao Chuchu had been forced into her actions. She too had her own reasons.","Should he forgive her immediately upon learning the truth?"]},{"number":40,"title":"Chapter 40: Secretly Caring for Qiao Chuchu Despite Pretending to Dislike Her","paragraphs":["Pei Fengnong fastened his seatbelt and glanced at Qiao Chuchu sitting in the backseat.","Qiao Chuchu glanced at him through the rearview mirror, then awkwardly looked away.","[I still remember a year ago when I was on a mission to grab Pei Fengnong's steering wheel, forcing him to miss the race and pushing his dark side even further. That mission was so over-the-top, it was ridiculous. He even announced his retirement from racing after that, never to compete again.]","Qiao Chuchu groaned and covered her face: [I ruined his chance at being a champion, how could he not hate me? And just now, I spoke to him so rudely. I was way out of line.]","Pei Fengnong tightened his grip on the steering wheel, his face darkening as he drove silently toward the company.","It wasn't until nightfall that Pei Fengnong finally brought Qiao Chuchu to the club.","She had only worn a thin jacket when she left, shivering every time she got in or out of the car. Even inside the club, she was curled up, trying to keep warm.","[Cold, cold, cold! How could I always forget to dress warmly?]","Pei Fengnong casually glanced at her and sent a location to Little Xie via his phone.","\"Bring Qiao Chuchu's thick coat to the club within thirty minutes.\"","Little Xie received the message and quickly packed Qiao Chuchu's coat, also preparing a bowl of ginger milk pudding, and had the Pei family driver take it to the club.","Her fans were constantly urging her to update: \"Blogger, what happened next with the strawberry cake made by the seventh young master?\"","\"Hurry up and answer, did the eighth young lady get poisoned by the seventh young master?\"","Even the trending searches had: #Seventh Young Master Allegedly Poisoned the Eighth Young Lady","Little Xie: ???","She quickly snapped a photo of the outside scenery on the platform and added a caption: [I was delayed by work earlier! First things first, the eighth young lady was not poisoned, the cake is safe!]","[And the eighth young lady guessed it was the seventh young master who made it the moment she tasted it, saying it couldn't be me who made it in such a playful tone.]","[The eighth young lady is really sweet, her smile is so beautiful, but before I could ask more, today's temp worker smeared strawberry cake all over her face...]","The post quickly gained traction, and the comments section soon had 99+ comments.","\"The eighth young lady could tell it was her brother's cake with just one bite?! This sibling relationship is so sweet! The brother wanted to give his sister food but didn't want her to know, and the sister could tell it was him with just one taste. Who else understands this kind of tacit understanding? But what's up with that sudden temp worker? She completely ruined a good moment!\"","\"I wouldn't dare smear cake on my boss's face even if I had a hundred guts! Unless my boss sexually harasses me.\"","\"??? Did the eighth young lady kill her whole family?\"","Little Xie replied: [No, it's because this temp worker lost the seventh young master's dog, which the eighth young lady found. Maybe the temp worker was scolded by the eighth young lady, so she came back to blame her, saying the eighth young lady only picks on the poor.]","\"????? Is she crazy? She lost her employer's dog and the employer found it herself, yet she still smeared cake on her??\"","\"Where did this lunatic come from? How did she even get a job at your place?\"","Little Xie replied: [Our assistant manager hired her and another girl. They also badmouthed the eighth young lady, and when the eighth young lady found out, she fired all three of them. The assistant manager left crying so hard, it was hilarious!]","\"The eighth young lady is awesome! That's a satisfying ending! I love it!\"","\"The eighth young lady is so cool, when will the blogger show us a photo of her back?\"","Little Xie didn't answer, putting away her phone and hurrying into the club.","The receptionist at the racing club stopped her: \"Do you have an appointment?\"","Little Xie politely replied: \"I was called by Mr. Pei Fengnong to deliver some clothes.\"","Qiao Chuchu, who had been standing on the first floor in a daze, was surprised to see Little Xie.","The beautiful receptionist sized Little Xie up and down, then picked up the phone: \"Please wait, I'll confirm.\"","Soon, she confirmed and gave a formulaic smile: \"Mr. Pei has asked you to wait for him on the third floor. Please use the emergency stairs, the elevator is only for VIPs.\"","Little Xie nodded obediently, carrying the thermos and clothes toward the elevator.","The two receptionists watched her walk away and chuckled: \"At such a young age, she's already working as a nanny. Doesn't she feel ashamed for her parents?\"","\"Exactly, she's fat, stupid, and short, like a big penguin.\"","Little Xie's steps faltered, and she self-consciously glanced at her slightly plump figure, pretending not to hear.","Suddenly, the bag with the coat was snatched from her hand.","Little Xie turned in surprise: \"Eighth Young Lady?!\"","Qiao Chuchu took the coat and didn't answer her, instead looking at the receptionists: \"You seem to enjoy talking about others a lot, so you must be very noble, right?\"","The receptionists' faces changed, and they panicked, shaking their heads: \"No, we're sorry.\"","Qiao Chuchu's gaze was sharp: \"What good is apologizing to me?\"","The receptionists were stumped, then nodded to Little Xie: \"Sorry!\"","Little Xie was overwhelmed: \"Thank you, young lady.\"","Qiao Chuchu gently patted her back: \"Come, let's take the elevator.\"","Little Xie was surprised: \"No, I'll just walk up.\"","\"What are you afraid of? You're part of the Pei family.\" Qiao Chuchu insisted, pulling her into the elevator: \"Besides, with me here, no one dares to bully you.\"","Little Xie's heart raced, sneaking a glance at Qiao Chuchu's fair hand.","The eighth young lady is so kind and doesn't have a princess complex, and she even stood up for her. She's amazing!","She decided she would definitely rave about this on Xiaohongshu and TikTok later!","Little Xie mustered up her courage and sweetly lifted the thermos: \"Eighth young lady, Mr. Pei Fengnong asked me to bring you a thick coat. I was worried you'd catch a cold, so I made you some ginger milk pudding. Would you like to try it later?\"","Qiao Chuchu was surprised: \"Pei Fengnong asked you to bring this?\"","Little Xie nodded enthusiastically, looking very sincere: \"Mr. Pei is very concerned about you.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","It was like a revelation. Pei Fengnong hadn't said a word to her since earlier, yet he still had Little Xie bring her a coat?","Just as she was thinking, the elevator doors opened.","Pei Fengnong and his friends walked in, and upon seeing Qiao Chuchu, his sword-like eyebrows furrowed, and his face immediately darkened.","But his friends were oblivious and greeted Qiao Chuchu warmly: \"Long time no see, Chuchu, you've gotten even prettier!\"","Qiao Chuchu smiled and returned the compliments, sneaking glances at Pei Fengnong.","Pei Fengnong's face was stern, and he deliberately turned his back to her.","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","[On the surface, he seems to hate me, but in reality, he still cares about me, right? He even had Little Xie bring me a coat. It seems like out of the seven Pei siblings, ten of them are tsundere.]","Pei Fengnong: \"?\"","He snatched the coat from Qiao Chuchu's hand.","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","The other guys chuckled at the scene: \"As expected of the older brother, even his sister carrying something is too much for him, he has to take it himself, right?\"","Pei Fengnong's face was expressionless: \"I'm just taking back my own clothes, I don't want them to be tainted by someone else.\"","Qiao Chuchu was stunned, and the other guys were also surprised: \"These are your clothes?\"","Pei Fengnong looked down his nose: \"Yes.\"","The guys' mouths twitched, utterly shocked: \"Fengnong bro, this is a pink, fluffy lady's coat. Is this really your taste?!\"","Pei Fengnong: \"?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"Pfft!\""]},{"number":41,"title":"Chapter 41: Weak Chicken Qiao Chuchu is Actually a King of Fighters in Front of the Male Lead","paragraphs":["Pei Fengnong looked awkwardly at the coat in his hand and frowned at Little Xie, saying, \"I told you to bring my coat, why did you bring Qiao Chuchu's coat instead?\"","Little Xie looked puzzled: \"Mr. Pei, didn't you tell me to bring—\"","\"Enough.\" Pei Fengnong's tone was sharp: \"Wrong is wrong.\"","Little Xie blinked, feeling wronged, and glanced at Qiao Chuchu, mouthing, \"I didn't bring the wrong one.\"","Qiao Chuchu suppressed a laugh and signaled Little Xie to stay calm.","【It's obvious that Pei Fengnong didn't want me to find out he had Little Xie bring something for me, so he's covering it up like this. I understand their personalities well—Pei Fengnong is like this, cold on the surface but warm-hearted, like a good older brother.】","Pei Fengnong stood with his back to Qiao Chuchu, his ears turning red.","Qiao Chuchu watched, and the smile on her lips faded.","【But I ruined the future of this good older brother.】","Pei Fengnong frowned, his ears quickly returning to their normal color. He walked out of the elevator, turned around, and stuffed the coat into Qiao Chuchu's hands, then left without looking back.","Little Xie nervously asked, \"Did I make Mr. Pei angry?\"","Qiao Chuchu shook her head: \"No, the reason he's angry is because of me.\"","Little Xie was surprised: \"Ah? Why?\"","Qiao Chuchu didn't answer, feeling lost as she walked to the rest area: \"Come with me.\"","Pei Fengnong stood in the corner, watching Qiao Chuchu's back.","He remembered Qiao Chuchu when she was seven or eight, playing video games with him, racing games.","\"When I grow up, I want to be a race car driver!\" she proudly declared. \"I want to be the best champion!\"","Qiao Chuchu was worried: \"Won't that be dangerous, brother?\"","\"No,\" he boasted. \"Because I believe I was born to be the first. I'll definitely be fine.\"","Not long after, Qiao Chuchu gave him a necklace.","The necklace was a strange design, one he had never seen before.","\"This is my design!\" Qiao Chuchu happily said. \"I designed it, then asked my godmother to help me have it made into a necklace, and we even had it blessed by a master!\"","The girl carefully put it on him: \"Let this necklace protect you! Bless you to stay safe and win every race!\"","Pei Fengnong took out an old necklace from his pocket.","The necklace was made of pure gold, and despite years of cleaning and maintenance, it still showed signs of age after more than a decade.","The chain was also broken.","After the car accident caused by Qiao Chuchu, he had torn this broken necklace off.","He didn't know why he still kept the necklace.","Maybe he was just used to taking it out from time to time.","Pei Fengnong was about to carefully put the necklace away when someone suddenly bumped into his shoulder!","The necklace fell to the ground with a clink.","He quickly bent down to pick it up, but a shiny leather shoe stepped on the necklace without hesitation.","Pei Fengnong's face darkened as he looked up and met a pair of deep, enigmatic eyes.","Ji Yanchuan.","Ji Yanchuan was dressed in a black overcoat, his hair slicked back with hair wax, his sharp features filled with disdain. He said lightly, \"Sorry for stepping on your necklace. I don't take detours.\"","Pei Fengnong laughed incredulously: \"What?\"","Ji Yanchuan seemed unwilling to talk to him any further and simply brushed past him.","Pei Fengnong said, \"Pick it up.\"","Ji Yanchuan stopped, turned his head haughtily, and signaled for an attendant to pick it up.","Pei Fengnong pushed away the attendant who wanted to help, pointed at the gold necklace on the ground, and said coldly, \"Pick it up.\"","Ji Yanchuan lowered his phoenix-like eyes and glanced at the old gold necklace: \"Such an ugly thing, and you still keep it. Seems your taste isn't much better.\"","Pei Fengnong's tone was cold: \"Did I ask you to comment on my taste? I told you to pick it up!\"","Ji Yanchuan turned around, his sneer full of contempt: \"Do you know who I am?\"","Ji Yanchuan's underling cleared his throat: \"This is Ji Yanchuan, CEO Ji!\"","Pei Fengnong's friend was speechless: \"Are you blind? This is Pei Fengnong, CEO Pei! Seven-time Formula 1 champion, the most badass race car driver. His net worth during races alone has reached 1.1 billion dollars. Ji Yanchuan, who's just living off his family's wealth, has the nerve to show off in front of our CEO Pei?\"","Ji Yanchuan's underling was momentarily stunned, murmuring in astonishment: \"This is that Pei Fengnong? My god... that's even more impressive than CEO Ji!\"","Ji Yanchuan's face darkened as he looked at Pei Fengnong.","Pei Fengnong remained expressionless: \"Pick it up.\"","Ji Yanchuan sneered, still unimpressed: \"I thought who it was, turns out it's Pei Fengnong, the younger brother of Pei Youchuan.\"","He continued, increasingly incredulous: \"Is your Pei family all so morally corrupt? After all, I heard your sister, Qiao Chuchu, has a sick obsession with all seven of you, doesn't she? Holding on to all of you like that?\"","Pei Fengnong's eyes darkened.","Ji Yanchuan laughed mockingly: \"How disgusting.\"","Pei Fengnong took a step forward, his eyes already filled with murderous intent: \"You're not picking it up, are you?\"","Ji Yanchuan challenged openly: \"No, because I never take detours, and I never bend down.\"","Pei Fengnong gave an ambiguous smile, grabbed his hair, and slammed him into the glass!","The glass shattered instantly!","Ji Yanchuan screamed in pain and tried to fight back.","Pei Fengnong effortlessly subdued him and threw him three meters away!","Ji Yanchuan crashed to the ground: \"Damn it!!\"","Pei Fengnong picked up the necklace, carefully put it away, and grabbed a decorative baseball bat, walking toward Ji Yanchuan.","His friend quickly stepped in to stop him: \"Fengnong, let it go, let it go! Don't hit him anymore! It'll get too big! After all, he's from the Ji family, give him some face!\"","Ji Yanchuan struggled to stand up, grabbed a nearby ceramic vase, and rushed over: \"You think you're so tough, huh?!\"","A shadow suddenly appeared from the darkness, delivering a spinning kick that sent the ceramic flying!","Pei Fengnong looked surprised.","Everyone was even more astonished: \"Whoa... Miss Qiao?!\"","Ji Yanchuan staggered back a few steps, shocked as he looked at the source.","Who was Miss Qiao?","Qiao Chuchu?","He focused his gaze and saw Qiao Chuchu in a perfectly standard spinning kick pose, slowly retracting her leg.","Clearly, that flying kick had come from her.","Ji Yanchuan was furious: \"Who the hell are you?!\"","Qiao Chuchu narrowed her eyes and charged at him: \"I'm your great-grandpa Qiao, born from a stone after Pan Gu created the world!\"","Her attack was fierce, like a rabbit kicking toward Ji Yanchuan: \"Did you bully my brother, huh?!\"","Ji Yanchuan dodged and started fighting back and forth with Qiao Chuchu!","Although Ji Yanchuan's fighting style was fierce, his movements were clumsy.","In contrast, Qiao Chuchu was agile and quick-witted, like a monkey, using the terrain to repeatedly suppress Ji Yanchuan.","Lin Qing, Lin Shen, and the Pei brothers arrived at the club and saw Qiao Chuchu fighting Ji Yanchuan at first glance.","Lin Qing: \"???! Holy crap, Qiao Chuchu actually knows martial arts?!\"","Lin Shen: \"...I never knew she could fight.\"","Pei Youchuan took off his glasses, his mouth wide open: \"Ji Yanchuan actually fought to a draw with Qiao Chuchu, this weakling?\"","Pei Buxian, holding a dog, shook his head repeatedly: \"I can't believe it, Qiao Chuchu is like a struggling kitten in front of us, but in front of Ji Yanchuan, she's like a street fighter?!\""]},{"number":42,"title":"Chapter 42: Qiao Chuchu's Talent is Quite Niche, and Includes the Eerie","paragraphs":["Pei Ci and Pei Mu spoke in unison: \"Qiao Chuchu, go for it! Don't embarrass the Pei family!!\"","Pei Che watched Qiao Chuchu jumping around, as smooth as butter, and nodded approvingly: \"It seems she exercises regularly.\"","The club manager's face turned pale, and he nervously approached them: \"Mr. Pei... and all the other Mr. Peis... could you please persuade your little sister to stop? This is all money we're talking about!\"","Pei Yuan immediately wrote out a check and handed it to the club manager: \"The Pei family will cover the damages caused by Qiao Chuchu. Is this enough?\"","The club manager's eyes nearly popped out when he saw the amount: \"Enough! More than enough!\"","Pei Yuan smiled: \"The extra money, please distribute it to the staff cleaning up the mess. Consider it a tip for their hard work. Sorry for the trouble.\"","The club manager looked at him like he was looking at the sun, shaking his head repeatedly: \"No problem, no problem. But... are you sure you don't want to stop her? She might get hurt.\"","\"No need,\" Pei Yuan said, watching Qiao Chuchu jumping around and Ji Yanchuan clearly starting to tire: \"It shouldn't be long before the winner is decided.\"","Qiao Chuchu leaped into the air and kicked down at Ji Yanchuan's shoulder!","Ji Yanchuan was like a volleyball slammed down, crashing hard into a pile of chairs!","Qiao Chuchu stood firmly on a table, hands on her hips, looking down mockingly: \"I've been practicing martial arts diligently for years, just for this moment.\"","Ji Yanchuan: \"... Damn it!\"","Qiao Chuchu smirked.","[Woohoo! I'm so cool! I love myself so much!]","Pei Fengnong: \"...\"","Little Xie's eyes lit up: \"Miss Qiao is so cool!\"","Qiao Chuchu jumped down from the table: \"Thank you!~\"","Ji Yanchuan was helped up from the ground, pointing at Qiao Chuchu: \"You dared to ambush me!\"","The person helping him whispered: \"Actually, she didn't ambush you. You just slipped and fell.\"","Ji Yanchuan ignored him and turned to Pei Fengnong: \"Pei Fengnong, is this your sister?!\"","Pei Fengnong leaned against the wall, casual and relaxed, a faint smile playing on his lips.","There was a sense of pride in his eyes that he didn't even realize: \"Yes, this is my sister.\"","Ji Yanchuan shook off the glass shards from his head: \"Your sister is like a shrew!\"","Pei Fengnong chuckled: \"And that's better than being a weakling like you.\"","Ji Yanchuan: \"What did you say?!\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"He said you're a weakling!\"","Ji Yanchuan glared at her angrily.","She smirked: \"My brother's right.\"","Ji Yanchuan: \"You dare talk to me like that?! Do you believe I—\"","Lin Qing cut him off: \"What do you want to do to my sister?!\"","Ji Yanchuan was stunned, shocked to see Lin Qing: \"Lin Qing?\"","The commotion stopped, and the entire hall quieted down.","Lin Qing strode over to Qiao Chuchu, putting an arm around her shoulders: \"She's my sister, and I've got her back.\"","Ji Yanchuan was incredulous, looking at Qiao Chuchu, then at Lin Qing, speechless: \"How many siblings does this girl have?\"","Lin Qing smiled falsely: \"So far, nine. Eight brothers and one sister.\"","Ji Yanchuan: \"?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","The staff: \"This Miss Qiao must be really good at picking her parents! Maybe she should write a book.\"","Ji Yanchuan glared at Qiao Chuchu, full of resentment but unable to express it, so he gritted his teeth: \"Since she's Lin Qing's sister, I'll give her some face.\"","Qiao Chuchu rolled her eyes: \"You don't have to give me face. You didn't even beat me; you're just angry because you can't do anything about it.\"","Ji Yanchuan: \"?\"","Qiao Chuchu raised an eyebrow: \"Am I wrong?\"","Lin Qing laughed, pinching Qiao Chuchu's cheek affectionately: \"No, Chuchu, you're right. This guy is just angry because he lost to you.\"","Ji Yanchuan retorted: \"I wasn't trying! I was just letting her win!\"","Lin Qing mocked: \"Really? Maybe you should take a look at yourself now.\"","Ji Yanchuan looked down at himself.","He was drenched in sweat, his forehead soaked.","In contrast, Qiao Chuchu only had a few beads of sweat on her nose.","Lin Qing scoffed: \"You put in the most effort for the weakest fight. Good thing I broke up with you; you're the biggest stain on my life.\"","Ji Yanchuan: \"...\"","Qiao Chuchu laughed along but suddenly felt something was off.","[Wait, isn't Lin Qing supposed to really like Ji Yanchuan? Why does it feel like she hates him now?]","But in an instant, Qiao Chuchu figured it out: [But that's good! Lin Qing is beautiful, rich, smart, and well-educated. She could have a harem of men if she wanted. Why would she cling to a loser like Ji Yanchuan and end up losing her life?]","Lin Qing laughed even harder.","She loved Qiao Chuchu because she was genuine.","Qiao Chuchu admired her not just in words but also in her thoughts, praising her to the skies!","She hugged Qiao Chuchu: \"Let's just stay in the lounge and watch them race, and maybe order some barbecue. What do you say?\"","Ji Yanchuan protested: \"No! I want to race this woman!\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","Lin Qing laughed angrily: \"Race cars? Ji Yanchuan, you're really reaching to save face. Qiao Chuchu doesn't even know how to drive a race car.\"","Ji Yanchuan glared at Lin Qing, his eyes sharp and venomous: \"Lin Qing, even though we had an engagement, it's over now. What right do you have to speak to me like that?\"","Lin Qing: \"?\"","Lin Shen stepped forward, his tone sharp: \"Ji Yanchuan, you betrayed Lin Qing first. She cut off all her male friends for you, and what did you do? You were hugging another woman at the hospital!\"","Ji Yanchuan's face changed, and he frowned guiltily: \"Were you following me?\"","He thought of something else: \"So that's why I got beaten up that day? You sent someone to do it?!\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"I did it.\"","Everyone looked at her in surprise.","She admitted it?","Qiao Chuchu put her hands on her hips, arrogant and bold: \"I beat you because you're a man who can't control his hands, his mouth, or his ass.\"","Ji Yanchuan was shocked: \"What did you say?!\"","Qiao Chuchu looked him up and down: \"You had an engagement with Lin Qing, yet you were hugging another woman at the hospital. I've seen your type before.\"","She sneered: \"But if I see it, especially if it involves my friends, I'll beat you up. Just like that night when you had a bloody nose.\"","Ji Yanchuan's jaw twitched in anger: \"That woman hugged me, but it had nothing to do with me! She just needed a hug!\"","Qiao Chuchu sneered: \"And I beat you because I care about Lin Qing. What's wrong with that?\"","Ji Yanchuan raised his hand to punch her!","Pei Fengnong grabbed his hand and twisted it hard: \"A weakling like you dares to lay a hand on my sister!\"","Ji Yanchuan winced in pain, unable to break free, looking around Qiao Chuchu.","To his left was Pei Fengnong.","To his right were Lin Qing and Lin Shen.","A crowd of people protecting her.","He was furious, shouting: \"Qiao Chuchu, if you've got the guts, race me in a car!!\"","Lin Qing sneered: \"Chuchu doesn't know how to race. I'll take you on.\"","Pei Fengnong also chimed in: \"I'll do it.\"","He glared at Ji Yanchuan: \"I'll make him kneel and call me dad.\"","Qiao Chuchu waved her hand, signaling everyone to step back: \"I'll do it.\"","Everyone looked at her in surprise.","Lin Qing quickly leaned in to warn her: \"Ji Yanchuan has been into racing since he was a kid. He's really good, and racing is dangerous.\"","Qiao Chuchu was confident: \"I know.\"","[After I got the system, it restricted me in everything I did, but every time I complete a task, I get a reward.]","[It doesn't give me money, beauty, or intelligence, but it makes me invincible in some niche areas. Coincidentally, one of those areas is racing.]","[My racing skills? I dare say I'm second to none.]","The people who heard her thoughts were increasingly amazed, their eyes widening.","Qiao Chuchu looked at Ji Yanchuan arrogantly and said, \"If we're going to play, let's play big. The loser has to run naked around the racetrack. Do you dare or not?\"","Ji Yanchuan's eyes narrowed, and without hesitation, he replied, \"I dare!\""]},{"number":43,"title":"Chapter 43: Grandpa Joe is Uneducated","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu changed into her racing suit, helmet in hand, and stood beside the race car.","Lin Qing, full of concern, helped her adjust her clothes: \"You must be extremely careful, you know. Don't be fooled by Ji Yanchuan's earlier foolishness; he's quite skilled in this area.\"","\"I know,\" Qiao Chuchu nodded seriously. \"I'll be cautious.\"","[After all, that idiot Ji Yanchuan got my fourth brother hospitalized. When he races with me, he definitely won't play fair.]","[But if it's not me racing against Ji Yanchuan, it will be my brother. I'd rather it be me; at least I can handle things more easily.]","Lin Qing let out a small \"wow\" and kissed Qiao Chuchu on the forehead. \"Good luck to you.\"","She then walked over to Pei Fengnong, patting his shoulder admiringly. \"I really envy you for having such a great sister, one who's willing to charge forward for her family.\"","Pei Fengnong silently watched Qiao Chuchu putting on her helmet, his face slightly pale.","The other brothers also looked uneasy. \"I wonder if she can handle this.\"","Pei Buxian whispered, \"She seemed so confident earlier; it should be fine, right?\"","Despite their words, they still nervously fidgeted with their own little things.","The referee announced, \"If you're all ready, get in your cars.\"","\"Wait a minute,\" Pei Fengnong stepped up to Qiao Chuchu, his tone stern. \"Are you sure you can do this?\"","Qiao Chuchu adjusted her helmet without hesitation. \"Of course!\"","Pei Fengnong's brows furrowed with deep concern. \"I...\"","He seemed lost, a wave of inexplicable frustration washing over him.","\"Really?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","[After all this time, all you can say is that?]","She chuckled helplessly and nodded. \"I'm sure I can.\"","Pei Fengnong hesitated for a moment before making up his mind. He reached out to take her helmet. \"Let me do it instead.\"","No matter what, he wouldn't let his sister risk her life.","If someone had to die, he'd rather it be him.","Qiao Chuchu quickly dodged, her tone filled with helplessness as it stretched out. \"Brother...\"","Pei Fengnong's hand paused.","Qiao Chuchu held his hand down. \"Trust me.\"","He was stunned.","Under the helmet, Qiao Chuchu's eyes were filled with a determination he had never seen before.","\"Trust me, I will win the championship and make Ji Yanchuan run naked around the track! Don't worry about me, okay?\"","Pei Fengnong: \"...\"","Not far away, Lin Qing watched the scene, her hands clasped together, her eyes full of admiration. \"She knows what's coming, yet she takes it all on herself. Even if it might cost her life, she still goes forward with such determination. It's incredibly romantic.\"","Pei Youchuan: \"? Qiao Chuchu could end up in the hospital from a car crash. Do you think that's romantic?\"","Lin Qing shot him an annoyed glance. \"Of course. You heard her thoughts earlier. If one person has to die, she's willing to be that person. Even if Qiao Chuchu has seven lives, the courage to risk one so casually isn't something everyone has.\"","Lin Qing pointed at Qiao Chuchu. \"There's a abyss ahead, and everyone else is unaware. Only she knows. Either she jumps, or her brother jumps. So she chooses to jump.\"","The Pei brothers finally caught on.","Lin Qing rolled her eyes at the slow-witted group. \"I should have made Qiao Chuchu our little sister.\"","Lin Shen: \"...\"","On the other side, Pei Fengnong took an old necklace from his pocket and placed it in Qiao Chuchu's hand. \"Take this with you this time.\"","Qiao Chuchu was surprised. \"This is the one I gave you—\"","\"Don't say anything,\" Pei Fengnong said sternly. \"Bring it back with you, and don't damage it.\"","Qiao Chuchu suspiciously examined it. \"But it seems to be broken. Are you trying to scam me?\"","Pei Fengnong: \"?\"","Qiao Chuchu chuckled. \"Just kidding!~\"","Pei Fengnong pulled a wry smile as he watched Qiao Chuchu get into the car, fastening her seatbelt layer by layer.","Ji Yanchuan was already waiting, his car positioned beside Qiao Chuchu's. He shot her a cold glance.","Qiao Chuchu flipped him off.","Ji Yanchuan: \"You can still back out and let your brother take your place. I've decided I don't want to bully a little sister like you.\"","Qiao Chuchu sneered. \"Little sister? Only those of my generation can call me that. What are you, exactly?\"","Ji Yanchuan: \"? Why are you so foul-mouthed?!\"","Qiao Chuchu giggled. \"What? Want to talk about manners with Grandpa Qiao?\"","Her tone was both taunting and sweet. \"Sorry, but Grandpa Qiao doesn't have any for you.\"","Ji Yanchuan: \"?!\"","Qiao Chuchu smiled sweetly as she rolled up her window, waving at him provocatively.","The referee walked between the two cars, holding a flag. \"Get ready!\"","\"Set!\"","\"Go!!\"","Qiao Chuchu shot forward like an arrow!","Ji Yanchuan followed closely, but he was still half a car length behind.","Pei Mu and Pei Ci exclaimed in unison, \"Wow! I thought Qiao Chuchu was just bragging, but she's actually serious!\"","Pei Youchuan was so surprised his mouth couldn't close. \"I always thought Qiao Chuchu was a weakling, but she's actually pretty cool right now!\"","Pei Buxian nodded repeatedly, holding a dog.","Pei Che and Pei Yuan were too nervous to speak, their eyes glued to Qiao Chuchu's car.","Lin Qing cheered excitedly, then suddenly thought of something, glaring at Lin Shen with frustration. \"You're so useless! You almost had a girlfriend, and now you've lost her. She liked her brother back then, so what? You're a man; you should have had the audacity to win her heart. And back then, Qiao Chuchu liked you too! It was mutual! Now you regret it, don't you?\"","Lin Shen's face was as green as a vegetable. \"I regret it. I regret it so much, I feel like my intestines are turning blue. I'm trying to win her back.\"","Lin Qing pouted. \"Forget it. You're just the white moonlight from Qiao Chuchu's youth. She's clearly not into you anymore. Go eat dust.\"","Lin Shen: \"?????\"","Pei Fengnong narrowed his eyes, watching Qiao Chuchu's bold style.","She was like a leopard, giving it her all, yet still exuding an air of ease and mastery. There was even a hint of showing off.","Qiao Chuchu remained calm, always keeping Ji Yanchuan half a car length behind.","Ji Yanchuan: \"Damn! How is she so fast!\"","A turn came, and the difference was clear.","Qiao Chuchu pulled ahead by an entire car length!","Ji Yanchuan: \"!\"","Qiao Chuchu glanced at the rearview mirror, sensing Ji Yanchuan's desperate efforts.","She couldn't help but laugh. \"Hahaha, didn't expect this cute exterior hides a wild player, did you?\"","When choosing her talent style, the system offered cautious champions, ordinary champions, and champions like crazy people.","She had decisively chosen the crazy one.","After all, when it comes to thrilling competitions, you need that reckless, carefree style!","Qiao Chuchu focused on the finish line!","The end was near!","She glanced at the rearview mirror and saw Ji Yanchuan had somehow veered off the track.","?","Qiao Chuchu suddenly became alert, looking to her left!","Ji Yanchuan's car slammed into hers!!","Qiao Chuchu quickly swerved to dodge, but it was too late. A powerful impact sent her flying, only to be yanked back by her seatbelt!","She felt her car flipping and rolling!","Finally, it came to a stop, hanging upside down.","Qiao Chuchu was dizzy, as if countless drills were piercing her brain.","She couldn't move, only able to emit muffled groans, her vision blurry as she looked out the window.","Pei Fengnong and the others rushed toward her in a panic.","Qiao Chuchu squinted and suddenly noticed the car was leaking gasoline.","Flames were already burning at the front!","She widened her eyes in terror!","\"Boom!!!!\""]},{"number":44,"title":"Chapter 44: 360 Desktop Cleanup Scream Master","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu screamed as she scrambled to her feet from the ground: \"It's going to explode! It's going to explode!!\"","The system floated leisurely in front of her: \"It's fine, it's already exploded. You're dead, roasted like a pigeon, fragrant and delicious.\"","Qiao Chuchu gasped for breath, finally realizing where she was after a long moment.","She was dead?","She was dead again?!","The system conjured a table piled high with items: \"Here, let's vent.\"","Qiao Chuchu kicked it over in one swift move: \"Damn it!!\"","The system then produced two more tables.","Qiao Chuchu instantly transformed into a 360-degree desktop cleaning master, screaming as she swept everything onto the floor in a fit of rage: \"Ahhhhh I'm going crazy!!!\"","After a while, she calmed down and made a decisive decision: \"I'm going to crash into that idiot and kill him!!\"","The system was unyielding: \"No.\"","She protested: \"Why not? If he can kill me by crashing, then I can kill him too, right?!\"","The system sighed: \"Host, crashing into someone and killing them is a crime. You'll go to jail, no matter how rich you are.\"","Qiao Chuchu laughed in anger: \"So, if I go to jail, he won't? Just because he's the chosen one, he can act above the law and be a legal rebel?!\"","The system: \"If you really died, he would indeed go to jail. But you're not dead. You'll go back, back to before he crashed into you.\"","Qiao Chuchu plopped down on the ground, her chest aching in anger.","Her breasts were still breasts, after all!","\"I don't get it, system. Does he think he's the emperor or something, just crashing into me like that?! Is he crazy?!\"","According to the script, Ji Yanchuan and Pei Fengnong's race was supposed to end with Ji Yanchuan overtaking Pei Fengnong just before the finish line, deliberately pressuring him, causing Pei Fengnong to swerve and get injured.","This time, she didn't give Ji Yanchuan a chance, dominating the entire race.","Yet this madman crashed right into her and killed her?!","Qiao Chuchu was utterly frustrated: \"He's not even the male lead, so why is he so arrogant?!\"","The system floated in front of her: \"Do you remember why I lied and told you this world is just a novel? Because the couple suppressing your fate have the personalities of the classic romance novel's male and female leads.\"","\"Ji Yanchuan, this man, is extremely patriarchal. Apart from being good-looking, his personality is a total mess—whiny, blind, and early romance novel heroes were like that, acting above the law, not allowing anyone to defy them. Once someone doesn't take his CEO act seriously, he loses it, throws a tantrum, and he's the kind of person who would do anything, even crashing into you, to get his way.\"","\"Xia Xuechun, on the other hand, is the type who completely submits to men. Don't let her talk of dignity and fairness fool you. In her mindset, men are meant to dominate, and women are naturally inferior. Her brother can yell at her, but she can't do the same to him. She'd dare smear a strawberry cake on your face but wouldn't dare do that to her brother.\"","\"In summary, Ji Yanchuan is a selfish jerk who doesn't respect women, and Xia Xuechun is someone who coldly washes the underwear of a scumbag but is still obsessed with this male dominance and can't break free.\"","Qiao Chuchu laughed in disbelief: \"And these morons are the chosen ones? So, is God blind or what?\"","The system: \"Host, you've experienced two extreme lives—one where you couldn't afford food or clothes, and another where you had everything and stood at the top of the pyramid.\"","\"Having experienced both, do you still think that good resources will blindly tilt towards kind, pure, and obedient people?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","She gradually calmed down.","The system said: \"I'll still use the male and female leads to explain. In this world, you shouldn't exist. You're in the way of the main couple, so they instinctively repel you. The male lead is fine, but you're in the way of the female lead a lot. With you around, her luck can't fully manifest, so be careful.\"","Qiao Chuchu nodded cautiously: \"I know to be careful, but I didn't expect it to be this extreme, with life and death at stake.\"","The system chuckled: \"Don't worry, host. I believe you'll survive until the end.\"","Qiao Chuchu's vision blurred as the scenery rushed past, and she found herself back in the driver's seat, her hands on the steering wheel.","There was only a short distance left to the finish line!","Qiao Chuchu stared at the rearview mirror.","Ji Yanchuan seemed to realize he couldn't overtake her and veered off the track, looking for another way.","Pei Fengnong grew nervous: \"What's he doing?!\"","Lin Qing muttered, \"This is bad. Ji Yanchuan has a terrible temper. He's probably going to crash into Qiao Chuchu!\"","Pei Yuan kept his eyes fixed: \"Is there any way to stop him?\"","Pei Fengnong quickly ran toward an idle racing car, about to get in, when Lin Qing screamed: \"Ji Yanchuan is crashing into her!!!\"","Pei Fengnong's mind went blank as he watched Ji Yanchuan speeding toward Qiao Chuchu!","Ji Yanchuan seemed to have floored the accelerator, heading straight for Qiao Chuchu's driver's side!","Suddenly, Qiao Chuchu performed an incredibly elegant drift, narrowly avoiding Ji Yanchuan's attack!","Pei Fengnong: \"!\"","The spectators erupted in cheers!","Ji Yanchuan missed and looked at Qiao Chuchu in disbelief.","Qiao Chuchu, wearing a helmet that obscured her face, raised her hand and gave him the middle finger.","Then, she crossed the finish line with a dashing manner.","The race was over.","Ji Yanchuan, furious, accidentally stepped on the accelerator, causing his car to crash into the roadside barrier!","Lin Qing jumped up in excitement: \"She won! Qiao Chuchu won!!!\"","Pei Youchuan wiped the sweat from his brow: \"Holy crap... I thought she was going to get killed.\"","Pei Che frowned: \"Could it be that she's been crashed into before, so she was prepared?\"","Their cheers suddenly faded as they realized the implications.","Pei Fengnong didn't think too much and rushed toward the finish line: \"Qiao Chuchu!!\"","Qiao Chuchu got out of the car, removed her helmet, and was still panting from the tension.","But she didn't care. She took out a gold necklace from her pocket, letting it sway in the wind as she cheered: \"I'm the champion!\"","Pei Fengnong was dazzled by her smile, standing still.","Under the bright lights of the track, Qiao Chuchu ran toward him.","Her curly hair danced in the wind, her eyes curved like crescents, and she opened her arms, rushing toward him.","He instinctively opened his arms to catch her.","But Qiao Chuchu passed by him and threw herself into Lin Qing's embrace!","Pei Fengnong: \"...\"","He stood there, dumbfounded.","Qiao Chuchu and Lin Qing hugged tightly: \"That was so thrilling!\"","【Although I was killed by Ji Yanchuan once, I still won!】","Everyone's smiles froze as they turned to look at Ji Yanchuan being pulled out of his car.","Despite the safety gear, Ji Yanchuan had taken a significant hit, lying on a stretcher, dizzy and disoriented.","Pei Buxian took a deep breath, put down his dog, and walked straight to Ji Yanchuan with a plastic bag.","Ji Yanchuan, barely conscious, saw Pei Buxian and frowned: \"What do you want?\"","Pei Buxian waved the black plastic bag in front of his face: \"This is fresh dog poop from my dog.\"","Ji Yanchuan: \"And...?\"","Pei Buxian smeared it all over his face: \"Here, enjoy!!\"","Ji Yanchuan: \"!!!!!!!!!!\""]},{"number":45,"title":"Chapter 45: Not Recommended to Watch While Eating (Sincere Face)","paragraphs":["Ji Yanchuan's face was smeared with stinky dog poop, and he let out a sharp, piercing scream from his throat!","\"Ah! Dog poop! It's in my eyes!\"","Pei Youchuan pulled Pei Buxian behind him and said sarcastically, \"Seventh Brother, we should at least be friendly, right? Didn't we already agree that the loser would run naked around the track? This dog poop is an extra item, and it comes with an extra charge.\"","Pei Buxian's dark circles under his eyes deepened with his rage. His tone was cold and biting: \"I can afford it.\"","Pei Youchuan forced a smile: \"But we still have to follow the agreed-upon rules.\"","He snapped his fingers, signaling the staff: \"Please help us take this guy's clothes off.\"","The staff at the racing club was shocked: \"But... Mr. Ji isn't feeling well right now.\"","Pei Youchuan seemed puzzled: \"What does his discomfort have to do with me? I'm not the one feeling unwell.\"","The staff's mouth twitched: \"But he can't run naked like this.\"","Pei Youchuan: \"It's fine, just put him on the ground.\"","The staff, confused, placed the stretcher on the ground.","Pei Youchuan didn't hesitate and started stripping Ji Yanchuan's clothes!","The staff: \"?!\"","Pei Youchuan laughed boldly as he undressed, \"Come on, we're all men here. Honor your bet and don't be shy! I'll help you take off your clothes!\"","Ji Yanchuan was powerless to resist: \"You guys, ah!\"","Pei Youchuan tore off his shirt with a mischievous grin: \"You were trying to run over my sister just now, weren't you?\"","Ji Yanchuan was stunned and struggled to open his eyes to look at him.","Pei Youchuan towered over him, tearing at his clothes with a smile full of menace: \"You're going to pay for that.\"","Ji Yanchuan was furious, but the stench of dog poop made him dizzy: \"I won't let you get away with this!\"","Pei Youchuan yanked off his pants: \"And I won't let you get away with it!\"","At the same time, Pei Che raised his hand and covered Qiao Chuchu's eyes: \"You don't need to watch any further.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...Lin Qing, do you want to cover your eyes too?\"","Lin Qing's laughter was barely contained: \"No need, I've seen every inch of that guy. No need to be shy. I even wanted to take a video, haha!\"","Lin Shen ordered: \"Lin Qing, put your phone away. Do you even dare to film this? Aren't you afraid of getting a virus?\"","Lin Qing was disappointed: \"Fine.\"","Qiao Chuchu, whose eyes were covered and couldn't see anything: \"...\"","Pei Youchuan finished undressing and lifted the stretcher: \"Someone else come over, let's take him for a lap around the racetrack!\"","Pei Fengnong stepped forward with a serious expression: \"I'll do it!\"","Qiao Chuchu closed her eyes, although she couldn't see, she could imagine the scene of Pei Fengnong and Pei Youchuan running with the naked Ji Yanchuan on the track.","It must be hilarious.","Because Lin Qing next to her burst into laughter: \"That little bastard Ji Yanchuan, he's too embarrassed to show his face, and he's covering it. Hahaha, it's killing me!\"","Pei Mu laughed so hard she couldn't stand straight: \"The best part is that there's still dog poop on his face. Even if he's covering his face, he doesn't dare to actually touch it. Hahahaha!\"","Pei Youchuan was full of energy as he ran with Ji Yanchuan: \"One-two-one! One-two-one! One-two-one! Shake it, boy!\"","Pei Fengnong ran behind, coldly staring at Ji Yanchuan.","Ji Yanchuan felt an overwhelming sense of humiliation wash over him. Covering his face, he raged impotently: \"I won't let you get away with this! Just you wait!\"","Pei Fengnong ignored him, completing the entire lap and then casually tossed Ji Yanchuan like trash!","Ji Yanchuan crashed to the ground, the cold ground seeping through him, and he looked up in fury: \"You—\"","His words cut off abruptly.","Because Pei Fengnong was looking down at him.","Pei Youchuan's smile had also disappeared without a trace.","The brothers stood like grim reapers over him.","Ji Yanchuan felt a chill run down his spine under their gaze: \"What else do you want?\"","Pei Fengnong's gaze was cold and sharp: \"Ji Yanchuan, you almost killed my sister just now.\"","Ji Yanchuan laughed angrily: \"I just wanted to hit her a little, give her a lesson. You're overreacting.\"","Pei Fengnong's face was expressionless, his aura deadly and almost blending into the night, his tone low and grave.","\"If it weren't for her skills, at that speed, she would have been dead at your hands.\"","Ji Yanchuan still didn't think he had done anything wrong, casually retorting: \"But she's not dead, is she?\"","Pei Fengnong's eyes narrowed, and he sneered: \"Good, very good. Since you say that, let's discuss it rationally.\"","\"My brother stripped you naked because you have to honor your bet. The loser should run naked. But you intentionally tried to hit my sister, and I'll settle that account slowly.\"","Pei Fengnong leaned down, his gaze intense: \"Let's see how this plays out.\"","Ji Yanchuan's eyelid twitched, and he glared at Pei Fengnong and Pei Youchuan as they left: \"What about your brother Pei Buxian smearing dog poop on my face? How are you going to settle that!\"","No matter how loudly he shouted, Pei Fengnong didn't look back, walking straight to Qiao Chuchu and grabbing her hand to leave.","Qiao Chuchu's vision suddenly cleared: \"? Is it over?\"","Pei Fengnong's face was cold: \"It's over, but don't look back. That guy still isn't dressed.\"","She pouted in disgust but couldn't help feeling a bit amused: \"I saw him crash, and I thought the punishment would be canceled.\"","Pei Fengnong's tone was icy: \"A bet is a bet. He has to face the consequences of losing.\"","Qiao Chuchu nodded, staring at Pei Fengnong's tall, straight back.","[It's strange. Even though I won, why do I feel like Fourth Brother is really angry? Did I say something wrong?]","Pei Fengnong stopped in his tracks, his face dark as he turned to face her.","His tightly furrowed brow could almost crush a fly, his eyes filled with a deep worry and anxiety.","She had just barely escaped death, yet she was still so lively?","Qiao Chuchu felt a chill run down her spine under his gaze: \"...\"","No way... Could it be that because I won, he's going to scold me? I remember he's not the kind of person who likes to use a style of education that involves constant criticism and pressure.","Pei Fengnong: \"?\"","He was just worried—","Forget it.","He wasn't worried.","Pei Fengnong took out his phone and transferred money to her: \"We agreed, you came with me to the race, so I'll transfer you 50,000. This time you won, so I'll transfer you 100,000.\"","Qiao Chuchu was pleasantly surprised: \"Then, just now your face was so dark, was it because you didn't want to give me the 100,000?\"","Pei Fengnong: \"?\"","She quickly put on a smile: \"Hehe, just kidding. Fourth Brother is super generous, he doesn't care about such a small amount of money!~\"","[Compared to money given to me out of nowhere, I prefer money I earn myself. It's more solid, and it gives me a sense of accomplishment!~]","Qiao Chuchu happily checked her phone messages, then suddenly thought of something: \"Fourth Brother, if I had lost today, would you have supported me running naked?\"","Pei Fengnong: \"I would have taken your place.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","In the warm natural light, Pei Fengnong wore a black matte leather jacket, his hair blown by the wind covering his eyes.","His narrow, peach blossom-shaped eyes reflected Qiao Chuchu's surprised face.","He had no expression, only a solemn and determined gaze, as if he had made a weighty promise.","\"I would have run naked in your place.\""]},{"number":46,"title":"Chapter 46: Is Qiao Chuchu Kidnapped","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu felt a warm current surge through her heart, as if she had just taken a sip of warm ginger soup on a freezing winter day, warming her from her chest to her limbs.","She couldn't help but curl her lips into a smile, her eyes becoming more focused.","Pei Fengnong stared at her for a moment, feeling uncomfortable and looked away, rubbing his nose: \"What about you?\"","He seemed unnatural: \"Why did you help me fight Ji Yanchuan?\"","In fact, his words were incomplete.","What he truly wanted to ask was, knowing that she might face danger, knowing that she might even die, why did she help him?","Qiao Chuchu answered without hesitation: \"Because you're my family.\"","Pei Fengnong was astonished: \"Huh?\"","She laughed carefree: \"And at that time, I saw you fighting with Ji Yanchuan, and I didn't even think, by the time I realized it, I had already kicked Ji Yanchuan away. I acted purely on instinct, like an animal.\"","Pei Fengnong lowered his eyelashes, recalling the moment, and a faint smile crept onto his lips: \"You do look like a monkey.\"","Qiao Chuchu protested: \"Hey!\"","Pei Fengnong looked at her and smiled, his brows relaxing, his smile as refreshing as a spring breeze: \"Can't I tell the truth?\"","This seemed to be the first time Pei Fengnong had smiled at her in seven years.","Qiao Chuchu was mesmerized and couldn't help but grin widely: \"Fine, I'll let it slide, who let you have special privileges today~\"","Pei Fengnong was stunned, thinking of the car accident a year ago, and his smile gradually faded.","Qiao Chuchu keenly sensed that something was off about his expression and awkwardly made an excuse to leave: \"I'm going to the restroom first.\"","She quickly ran towards the women's restroom on the first floor.","Pei Fengnong's brows furrowed as he watched her disappear from sight.","Pei Yuan had somehow appeared behind him: \"Have the two of you hit it off?\"","Pei Fengnong turned around in surprise, awkwardly shaking his head.","Pei Yuan's expectant gaze dimmed for a moment, which was also within his expectations: \"It's okay, take your time, we both need time.\"","Pei Fengnong lowered his eyes, his brow furrowing: \"I don't know how to resolve this, or how to convince myself. It's too complicated. I feel like I'll still reject her in the future.\"","-","Qiao Chuchu washed her hands and looked at herself in the mirror.","Numbers slowly appeared before her eyes, changing from 7 to 6.","She furrowed her brow.","It wasn't because she only had six lives left, but because... she could feel the resistance from her family.","The emotions between them were profound; they were a mix of the familial bond that had grown from years of companionship and the fractures caused by the disturbances of certain events.","The bond was strong.","The rift was deep.","She washed her face, looked up, and found herself surrounded by several burly staff members.","Both men and women stared at her through the mirror, looking like zombies.","Her heart skipped a beat: \"What do you want—mmmmm!!!!\"","Soon after, several staff members pushing garbage bins exited the women's restroom.","Pei Fengnong was still waiting at the end of the corridor.","He checked the time and glanced at the restroom, muttering impatiently: \"Why hasn't she come out yet?\"","His other brothers had gone upstairs to rest.","But he was a bit worried about Qiao Chuchu, so he stayed behind to wait.","Pei Fengnong leaned against the wall, his gaze inadvertently sweeping over the trash can.","A furry pink hem peeked out from the garbage bin.","He glanced away indifferently, but suddenly felt something was off: \"Wait, what's inside your bin?!\"","As soon as he spoke, the group pushed the garbage bin and rushed out!","Pei Fengnong immediately gave chase: \"Security! Sound the alarm! Call the police!\"","The front desk was stunned and quickly called the police.","But these people were clearly well-trained, smoothly loading the garbage bin into a van and speeding out of the checkpoint!","Pei Fengnong followed closely, getting into his car and flooring the accelerator!","Pei Yuan and the others heard the commotion and rushed to the second floor: \"What happened?!\"","The front desk was trembling: \"We don't know what happened, but Mr. Pei suddenly angrily asked what was inside the cleaning staff's garbage bin, and then they loaded it into a van and drove off!\"","Pei Yuan urgently asked: \"Did you see what was inside the garbage bin?\"","The front desk thought nervously: \"It seemed to be something pink, like a piece of cloth.\"","Little Xie, standing at the back of the crowd, gasped upon hearing this!","Everyone looked at her in confusion.","She nervously explained: \"Miss Qiao's coat is a pink fur one! Could it be Miss Qiao—\"","Pei Yuan's head exploded: \"It must be her! Hurry, chase after them!\"","The Pei brothers and the Lin siblings didn't delay, quickly getting into their cars and speeding off!","-","Ji Yanchuan sat curled up on the sofa, watching the cars rushing out, his gaze dark.","He still held his phone.","On the screen was a text message.","The goods have been collected and are on their way to the destination.","He was shivering with cold, but still managed to curl his lips into a smile: \"Serves you right...\"","That bitch humiliated him in front of so many people.","Now he would let her and her family experience real humiliation!","-","Qiao Chuchu was pulled out of the bin and slapped twice.","She woke up dizzily, barely able to resist before being roughly pinned down by several burly men and tied to a rectangular table!","Her hands were immobilized, only her legs were free.","Qiao Chuchu looked around, taking in the environment.","It seemed to be a factory.","The people who had kidnapped her were clearly well-trained, all wearing masks, holding equipment, and aiming multiple cameras at her.","Even a man had a camera around his neck and took a pill.","...","What were they going to do?","Why did they need so many cameras?!","Qiao Chuchu's body was tense, not a single muscle under her control.","She vaguely guessed what was going to happen, but she didn't dare to think too deeply, calmly saying: \"I don't care who hired you, I can double, no, triple your payment!\"","Her eyes widened, her voice trembling with all her composure: \"Ten million! I'll give you ten million, just let me go, I won't call the police, I promise!\"","No one responded.","The vast factory was eerily silent, except for her almost sobbing negotiation.","The man with the camera around his neck approached her feet, trying to pry her legs open.","She reflexively struggled, kicking him: \"Name your price! I'll pay! Just don't touch me! I can pay!\"","The man's rough hands pressed down on her ankle, giving a glance to the person beside him.","A woman stepped forward, slapping her hard!","Qiao Chuchu was caught off guard, her face being struck to the side.","She couldn't feel the pain, only the eyes and cameras staring at her.","Overwhelming despair engulfed her.","This ordeal was enough to make her desperate, but there were cameras from every angle capturing it...","Once the footage was taken, if she was exposed as a comic artist who had published many works, her reputation, her career...","The man straddled her, using his belt to slap her face: \"You think your chastity is worth something, bitch? Let me tell you, grandpa's here to fuck you, and after I'm done, my brothers will enjoy you too. Money won't save you, understand? So stop struggling, or I'll skip the condom and go raw.\"","The man arrogantly pulled out a condom from his pocket: \"You want to get pregnant with grandpa's baby?\"","Her face turned pale instantly.","No!","The man sneered: \"If not, then shut up.\"","Qiao Chuchu clenched her teeth, the sour and swelling sensation running from her molars to her jaw, and remained silent.","If.","If her remaining six lives could allow her to survive and escape these monsters, she would kill them! Kill the mastermind who hired them!"]},{"number":47,"title":"Chapter 47: Pei Fengnong, are your tears out of heartache or fear","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu clenched her teeth, her eyes fixed on the man like a predator ready to strike, examining every detail of his face, even the tattoo on his neck.","The man attempted to undo her pants, teasing her as he did so, \"What, not struggling anymore? Learning to behave?\"","Qiao Chuchu remained silent.","She just stared at him.","Sweat dripped from her forehead like rain, her chest heaving with rapid breaths, her eyes blazing with intense killing intent.","The man, unimpressed, began to pull down her pants, muttering, \"Damn, you're wearing quite a lot.\"","Qiao Chuchu turned her head to survey the room, taking note of every leering face, even those of the women among them.","Despite being of the same gender, they all looked at her with scornful eyes.","In despair, she closed her eyes, calming herself before continuing to watch the man preparing to assault her.","But just then, the sound of an approaching engine grew louder outside the door.","The man paused, \"What's that sound?!\"","A black G-Class SUV smashed through the roll-up door and barreled in!","Everyone's faces turned pale, \"Someone's broken in!\"","The off-road vehicle drove straight toward the crowd, knocking a few people flying, then came to a stop with a skillful drift!","The man pinning Qiao Chuchu down cursed and ran off, \"Fuck that!\"","He charged toward the SUV, and a man stepped out, wielding a baseball bat and swinging it fiercely at him!","Qiao Chuchu's eyes widened.","Pei Fengnong?!","Pei Fengnong had come to save her!","In the dim light, Pei Fengnong's eyes were bloodshot, like a beast, and he swung the bat fiercely at the man's head!!","Drenched in an aura of deadly ferocity, he wielded the baseball bat, defeating the swarm of attackers who rushed at him!","Wherever he went, people fell like dominoes!","A burly man charged at him with a knife.","Pei Fengnong knocked the knife out of his hand first, then picked up the fallen knife and stabbed it into the man's shoulder!!","The man froze, and Pei Fengnong swiftly sliced through his tendons, then delivered a brutal blow to his groin with the bat!","The man screamed in agony and passed out, \"Ah!\"","Pei Fengnong showed no emotion, half his face covered in blood, and he hadn't uttered a single sound since arriving.","He looked numb at Qiao Chuchu.","Qiao Chuchu was still lying on the table, her pants half-pulled down, her thermal pants still intact.","Everyone was down.","Except for the camera next to her.","Without a word, Pei Fengnong smashed one camera lens after another, then stomped on the man's neck camera, and delivered another fierce kick to the man's groin!","The man was already convulsing.","He ignored it, first buttoning up Qiao Chuchu's pants and freeing her hands.","Qiao Chuchu seemed to still be in a daze, slowly sitting up, \"Brother?\"","Pei Fengnong looked at her with concern, \"Yes.\"","She gradually came to her senses, her vision blurry, and she called out tentatively, \"Fourth Brother?\"","Pei Fengnong's eyes darkened, a wave of dense heartache rising within him.","But he still kept a cold and hard expression, his gaze as firm as an unbreakable wall, \"It's me, Qiao Chuchu, I'm your fourth brother. I'm late, I'm sorry.\"","Qiao Chuchu's tightly wound nerves snapped, and she cried as she threw herself into his arms!","Pei Fengnong swayed slightly, then without hesitation, held her tightly!","Qiao Chuchu cried loudly, \"I was so scared! I was so afraid! I was afraid they would torture me to death, everyone wanted to touch me! I was so scared, Brother! I was so scared! I was afraid of the pain, afraid of being tortured, I didn't know what I was going to go through!\"","Pei Fengnong felt his heart being wrung, a lump in his throat.","If he had been even a moment later...","He didn't dare to think, his hand resting on the back of her head, trying to stay composed, \"It's okay, it's okay, you're safe now.\"","Qiao Chuchu couldn't stop crying, \"I don't know, I'm so panicked, I'm sorry, Brother, don't abandon me, just let me hold on for a while, let me hold on for a while!\"","Pei Fengnong was taken aback, and his grip on her tightened even more.","Qiao Chuchu vaguely heard him repeating, \"I'm sorry, I'm sorry... I didn't protect you well... I'm sorry.\"","She nestled in his arms, feeling a warmth on her neck.","Drops of water fell.","Qiao Chuchu paused, wanting to look up, but Pei Fengnong held her head down, forcing her not to look up.","More warm drops fell on her neck.","Were these Pei Fengnong's... tears?"]},{"number":48,"title":"Chapter 48: An oath is an oath, and it must be fulfilled.","paragraphs":["After an unknown amount of time, the sound of police sirens echoed from outside.","Qiao Chuchu's eyes were swollen from crying, and she could barely open them. She looked toward the entrance and saw a group of police officers, along with Pei Yuan and others, rushing towards her: \"Qiao Chuchu!\"","She wanted to respond, but found herself too weak from crying: \"Brother...\"","Pei Yuan anxiously examined her from head to toe, then glanced around at the cameras and the group of burly men groaning on the ground. In an instant, he understood what almost happened.","Rage flared like wildfire, burning through his body, even his lungs felt scorched, but he quickly suppressed it, sweeping her into his arms: \"Come, I'll take you to the doctor.\"","She didn't resist, turning her gaze to Pei Fengnong.","Pei Fengnong quickly glanced at her before turning his head away.","Pei Youchuan approached Pei Fengnong at the same time, astonished: \"No way, you're crying? Qiao Chuchu getting hurt is one thing, but you, a grown man, crying over what?\"","Pei Fengnong's face changed, and he delivered a sharp elbow strike to Pei Youchuan: \"You're blind! I'm not crying!\"","Pei Youchuan: \"? Your eyes are swollen—\"","Pei Fengnong turned his back: \"No, they're not!\"","Qiao Chuchu hesitated for a moment, then stepped out of Pei Yuan's embrace: \"Just a moment.\"","She walked toward Pei Fengnong.","Pei Youchuan looked at her in surprise: \"Qiao Chuchu, why are you coming over? You should go rest.\"","Pei Fengnong, who had been facing away from Qiao Chuchu, stiffened at the words, suddenly snatching the black-framed glasses from Pei Youchuan and smoothly putting them on his own face!","Pei Youchuan: \"? What are you doing—\"","Pei Fengnong gave him another elbow strike: \"Shut up!\"","Pei Youchuan: \"......\"","Qiao Chuchu pretended not to notice their antics.","She sincerely thanked him: \"Fourth Brother, thank you for saving me.\"","Pei Fengnong, still with his back to her, didn't turn around, his tone cold: \"You're welcome.\"","Qiao Chuchu took out a gold necklace from her pocket: \"I'm returning this to you.\"","Pei Fengnong hesitated, then turned his head to look at her.","In that moment, Qiao Chuchu clearly saw Pei Fengnong's swollen eyes.","Despite the glasses, the redness around his eyelids and the bloodshot eyes were still evident.","Qiao Chuchu's nose tingled, but her lips couldn't help but curl up: \"Thank you for lending me the amulet. This time, it must have been your amulet that worked, which is why you managed to barge in at that crucial moment. I'm really grateful.\"","Pei Fengnong was stunned for a moment, a suspicious blush spreading across his cheeks. He grabbed the necklace firmly, his face still stern!","\"It wasn't the amulet that worked!\" He lowered his head, not looking at her: \"It was the GPS on your smartwatch, you fool!\"","Qiao Chuchu was taken aback, nodding with a smile through her tears: \"Alright!\"","【No matter what worked, the Fourth Brother who burst in at that moment was a hero.】","Pei Fengnong choked, his head lowering even further.","Pei Yuan walked up behind Qiao Chuchu, draping his black coat over her shoulders, his tone filled with concern: \"Let's go, I'll take you to the hospital.\"","She obediently nodded, getting into the car with Pei Yuan.","Pei Youchuan stood beside Pei Fengnong, arms crossed, teasing in a drawn-out tone: \"Did you hear that, Old Four? You're her hero~\"","Pei Fengnong tightly clenched the gold necklace, remaining silent.","Pei Youchuan, with a smile that hid a knife, followed behind Qiao Chuchu: \"Let's investigate who had such despicable intentions towards Qiao Chuchu. Once we find them, we'll deal with them.\"","Pei Fengnong nodded, glancing at the chaotic scene.","He had already pummeled those men.","But his mood didn't ease at all; instead, an indescribable heaviness lingered in his heart, refusing to dissipate.","Unless the mastermind behind this was found promptly.","Otherwise, he wouldn't feel at ease for a long time.","Two hours later—","Pei Fengnong stood in the hospital corridor, playing with the gold necklace that had just been hastily repaired.","His long fingers wrapped around the golden chain, his sharp gaze fixed on the pattern of the necklace, lost in thought.","Pei Buxian appeared like a ghost behind him: \"Can you stop playing with that broken necklace?\"","Pei Fengnong's movements halted, and he turned irritably: \"What are you ranting about now?\"","It was ten o'clock at night.","The VIP ward corridor was empty, with only the two of them present, the atmosphere extremely quiet.","In this serene environment, Pei Buxian, with his pale skin and faint dark circles under his eyes, looked like a resentful ghost.","It was infuriating.","Pei Fengnong rolled his eyes.","He loved his brothers, but he also hated them.","Because Qiao Chuchu had constantly harassed them, their already unhealthy minds had become increasingly deranged under her constant setbacks.","Under Qiao Chuchu's \"hard work,\" Pei Buxian had transformed from a little psychopath into a full-blown schizophrenic.","Seeing Pei Buxian like this made him feel a headache coming on: \"Speak if you have something to say.\"","Pei Buxian glared at him gloomily: \"Those guys won't reveal the mastermind. They claim they did it because they were captivated by Qiao Chuchu's beauty, so they decided to abduct her. The club clothes and room card were stolen. The police can't extract any information, and our leads are cut off.\"","Pei Fengnong's heart sank to the bottom.","He wasn't surprised.","No matter how bad the relationship between Qiao Chuchu and them was, she was still the well-known eighth daughter of the Pei family within their circle.","Only someone daring to confront them would dare to touch Qiao Chuchu.","Pei Fengnong narrowed his eyes, already having a good candidate in mind: \"I know who it is.\"","Pei Buxian: \"Ji Yanchuan, right?\"","He nodded.","Pei Buxian pulled out a small knife, decisively: \"Alright, I'll go kill him.\"","Pei Fengnong: \"? Are you crazy? Murder means jail time, and you might even get the death penalty!\"","Pei Buxian calmly gripped the knife, turning to leave: \"I know. Take care of my West Highland Terrier for me, I'm going.\"","Pei Fengnong grabbed him, furious: \"No! Stop being insane!\"","Pei Buxian met his gaze without expression: \"I'm not crazy. I'm serious.\"","Pei Fengnong: \"......\"","Pei Buxian stared straight at him: \"More than ten years ago, when Qiao Chuchu was almost raped by a group of boys in the warehouse, the seven of us made a vow together: we would never let Qiao Chuchu suffer any harm again.\"","\"Qiao Chuchu treating us poorly is one thing, and the debts she owes us should be repaid by her herself.\"","\"But the oath we made is an oath.\"","Pei Buxian's beautiful peach blossom eyes gleamed with unyielding determination: \"Oaths must be fulfilled.\"","Pei Fengnong's eyes darkened, and he said in a deep voice: \"Even so, there's no need for you to do it yourself.\"","\"Not doing it myself won't quench my hatred. And he'll come back.\" Pei Buxian's eyes widened, his voice soft as a whisper: \"Do I have to wait until he records a video of my sister being violated, spreads it online, and a bunch of perverted men save it, spreading it everywhere, critiquing my sister's suffering, the video like a cockroach that can't be eradicated, before I stab him to death?\"","Pei Fengnong was hit hard by the words, firmly stating: \"We have other options.\"","Pei Buxian didn't believe it: \"Besides hiring a hitman, what other options are there?\"","\"Lou Tingsi.\" Pei Fengnong was extremely confident: \"With his terrifying methods and connections abroad, he must have a way to find the mastermind.\"","Pei Buxian was stunned: \"But why would he help us? We're not on the same path. He's in dangerous business, while our family doesn't get involved in those things.\"","Pei Fengnong narrowed his eyes, pondering: \"Didn't you mention earlier that you feel Lou Tingsi might also be able to hear Qiao Chuchu's thoughts, right?\"","\"If that's true, then Lou Tingsi is on the same boat as us. He has the same goal as we do.\"","Pei Fengnong became more and more certain: \"As long as we confirm that Lou Tingsi can hear her thoughts, we can make a deal with him.\"","Pei Buxian picked up the phone without hesitation and dialed a number.","Pei Fengnong: \"? Who are you calling?\"","Pei Buxian didn't answer, and upon hearing the other side pick up, he directly said: \"Lou Tingsi, this is Pei Buxian from the Pei family. I have something to ask you, are you busy?\"","Pei Fengnong: \"??????\""]},{"number":49,"title":"Chapter 49: Lou Tingsi, Can You Hear Qiao Chuchu's Thoughts","paragraphs":["He said to test Lou Tingsi!","Not to directly expose the truth!","Pei Buxian completely ignored Pei Fengnong's shocked expression and calmly put his phone on speaker.","\"Can you hear Qiao Chuchu's thoughts?\"","As he asked this question, the other Pei brothers and the Lin siblings also came out of Qiao Chuchu's ward.","Pei Buxian followed up with another question: \"You, and your son, can both hear Qiao Chuchu's thoughts, right?\"","Everyone standing at the ward entrance was stunned!","Lou Tingsi was a seasoned veteran, someone who had been through gunfire and chaos!","Even if you suspect something, you can't just ask directly!","What if you're wrong? How are you going to explain it later?!","While they were all scrambling to figure out how to handle the situation, a light chuckle escaped from the phone.","\"So you've figured it out after all, Pei Buxian.\"","Everyone: \"!\"","Pei Buxian's expression darkened, but he wasn't surprised: \"Since you can enjoy the future predictions Qiao Chuchu brings you, you should also know that this world is trying to eliminate Qiao Chuchu. She is in constant danger of losing her life. To protect ourselves, we must protect Qiao Chuchu. So, I hope you can help me with something.\"","Lou Tingsi's voice still carried a hint of amusement: \"Go on, let's hear it.\"","Pei Buxian cut to the chase: \"Just a moment ago, my sister was kidnapped. The perpetrators tried to undress her, assault her, and film a multi-angle pornographic video. Their methods were vicious and professional. They've been caught, but they're sticking to the story that it was just a crime of passion. However, before my sister was kidnapped, she had a conflict with Ji Yanchuan.\"","\"Of course, you should also know that my sister lost two lives while saving a dog and Lou Yuejue earlier today.\"","\"And when she had the conflict with Ji Yanchuan, he 'killed' her once, causing her to lose another life. She was reborn and managed to defeat Ji Yanchuan.\"","\"After defeating Ji Yanchuan, she was kidnapped in the women's restroom of the club.\"","At this point, Pei Buxian calmly asked: \"Do you have a way to uncover the truth?\"","There was a brief silence on the other end of the phone, followed by the sound of a match being struck.","It seemed Lou Tingsi had lit a cigarette.","The people in the corridor gradually gathered around Pei Buxian, holding their breath in anticipation.","\"Thirty minutes,\" Lou Tingsi's tone had turned cold: \"Wait for my call.\"","The phone was hung up abruptly.","Pei Buxian put down his phone and looked at everyone.","No one present wasn't looking grim, wanting to say something but unable to find the words.","It turned out that besides them, there was someone else who could hear Qiao Chuchu's thoughts.","And that person wasn't just anyone—it was the ruthless and notorious father-son duo of the Lou family.","The Lou family might be dangerous, but they were known for their integrity and keeping their word.","But who would be next to hear Qiao Chuchu's thoughts?","Would more people join in?","And what kind of people would they be—good or bad?","An hour later—","On the same floor as Qiao Chuchu, two nurses in the inpatient department were quietly discussing the names on the medical records: \"I've seen so many double-barreled surnames, but this is the first time I've come across 'Weisheng.'\"","The other nurse lowered her voice: \"This one's a big boss too. I heard from the head nurse that she's been through five husbands. She's like a fixed big sister, with changing big brothers. And she's incredibly rich, incredibly beautiful. She's already over forty, but she looks like she's in her early thirties. There are waves of handsome guys and beautiful women coming to visit her, and they even fight for her attention!\"","The younger nurse sighed with envy: \"So rich, no husband, a rare surname, gorgeous, and pursued by a bunch of handsome guys. What a legendary life.\"","Another nurse hurried over to them and whispered a warning: \"Stop talking, the big boss is here.\"","The three nurses peeked from behind the nurse's station towards the end of the corridor.","A woman was sitting in a wheelchair, being pushed by a clean-cut young man.","Despite her illness, the woman's beauty was undeniable, like a proud red rose leaning lazily in her wheelchair.","The handsome man behind her seemed reluctant to push her, looking worried about something.","The woman leaned against the wheelchair, not even turning her head: \"Have you paid back the money I gave you?\"","Li Jiahao snapped back to reality and obediently nodded: \"Yes, thank you, Miss Weisheng. If it weren't for you, I wouldn't have been able to pay it back.\"","The woman frowned, her tone sharp: \"Are you stupid? Didn't I tell you I don't like being called Miss Weisheng? Either call me Miss Yucan or Mrs. Weisheng. What kind of title is 'Miss Weisheng'?\"","Li Jiahao quickly corrected himself: \"Sorry, Miss Yucan.\"","Weisheng Yucan closed her eyes: \"Prepare as we discussed for tonight.\"","Li Jiahao: \"...Yes.\"","His face turned pale as he pushed Weisheng Yucan along the VIP ward corridor for a stroll.","Qiao Chuchu woke up from a nightmare, panicking as she checked her body, then sighed in relief.","She had dreamed that those men had succeeded.","No matter how she struggled, she couldn't save herself. She felt her face turn purple from screaming, terrified out of her mind.","She suppressed her fear and looked around.","It seemed she was in a VIP ward at Pei Che's private hospital.","On the bedside table was a note in Pei Che's bold handwriting: [If you wake up, don't worry. We're at the police station. You'll stay here tonight. I've arranged for a professional nurse. Press the call button if you need anything.]","She put down the note and got out of bed.","She wanted some fresh air.","As she stepped out of the ward, she met another patient and looked at them.","At the same time, Weisheng Yucan lazily lifted her gaze and met Qiao Chuchu's eyes.","Qiao Chuchu, who had been feeling gloomy, was suddenly dazzled by the unexpected beauty.","Weisheng Yucan also narrowed her eyes, studying Qiao Chuchu's face for a while before looking away.","Even after looking away, she couldn't help but savor the moment.","It was rare to see such a charming girl even without makeup.","Her cheekbones were smooth, her face slightly chubby, full and non-threatening, but her eyes and eyebrows had a fox-like allure.","Qiao Chuchu also averted her gaze, inwardly admiring.","[What a beautiful and sexy person. It's like she's glowing.]","Weisheng Yucan was startled, weirdly touching her head.","How strange?","Why did it feel like a girl's voice was echoing in her mind?","And it was so vivid.","While she was still stunned, Li Jiahao accidentally met Qiao Chuchu's eyes and exclaimed in surprise: \"Qiao Chuchu?!\"","Qiao Chuchu was astonished: \"Li Jiahao?! What are you doing here?!\"","Li Jiahao's clean-cut face filled with anger as he quickly reported: \"Miss Yucan, this is the girl I told you about, Qiao Chuchu, the one who made me pay tens of thousands in compensation!\"","Weisheng Yucan slowly turned her gaze to Qiao Chuchu.","Qiao Chuchu looked at her in surprise, suddenly having a flash of insight.","Miss Yucan?","Weisheng Yucan?","She stared at the woman in the wheelchair, whose aura was dazzling, and couldn't believe it.","[Is this the Weisheng Yucan who was killed by Li Jiahao and Xia Xuechun?]","Weisheng Yucan: \"...?\""]},{"number":50,"title":"Chapter 50: Wei Sheng Yuchan, the Inborn Ruthless Female Boss","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu gazed at the woman's exquisite yet aloof features, her mind racing.","Weisheng Yucan, a Chinese national from M Country.","Born at the pinnacle of the social pyramid.","If the Pei family were at the top of the pyramid, then Weisheng Yucan was the rare deity standing on the very tip of it!","The specifics of the Weisheng family's business were not explicitly mentioned in the booklet provided by the system, but it seemed they dabbled in both black and white markets.","Weisheng Yucan was the only daughter in her family.","She had two older brothers and two younger brothers, yet her family, particularly her mother, held a strong preference for males.","As a result, Weisheng Yucan grew up being mistreated, subjected to constant mockery and scorn from her mother.","Despite this, she remained the most outstanding among all the heirs, with achievements far surpassing those of her favored brothers.","However, her excellence was not driven by a desire to prove herself to her family. Instead, she was a natural-born sadist who thrived on dominating others and watching them grovel for her favor.","Weisheng Yucan was bisexual, with a plethora of male and female suitors, most of whom sought her favor for personal gain, hoping to catch a glimpse of her affection.","She was a woman devoid of human empathy, with a blurred sexual orientation, ruling her small world like an empress.","After the death of her last husband, Weisheng Yucan decided not to marry again, content with seeking young, handsome men to satisfy her physical needs.","Upon encountering this character's backstory, Qiao Chuchu was deeply impressed.","Such a character archetype was typically reserved for males.","Weisheng Yucan's uniqueness made Qiao Chuchu fall for her at first sight.","Unfortunately, her demise was too abrupt, leaving a sense of regret.","Qiao Chuchu bit her lower lip, suddenly realizing:","[Why do I always fall for such twisted individuals? But life is so dull; liking a few twisted people isn't a big deal.]","Qiao Chuchu quickly adjusted her mindset.","[Let me think carefully... How did Weisheng Yucan meet her end? She seemed to die shortly after her introduction.]","Weisheng Yucan: \"...\"","Died shortly after her introduction?","[The cause was that she took a liking to Li Jiahao and offered him a substantial sum of money, demanding his virginity.]","Qiao Chuchu scratched her head in frustration: [Tsk, I can't say I understand the tastes of a big shot. Li Jiahao, this neighborhood boy, has no charm at all. It's like indulging in gourmet meals too often, so you crave some simple pickles to cleanse your palate.]","Weisheng Yucan nodded unconsciously, agreeing.","Indeed.","She had grown tired of handsome, muscular men with sweet-talking skills, and powerful tycoons had lost their appeal. Even the delicate, pampered \"puppies\" had become monotonous.","What she craved now was a desperate, twenty-something-year-old man, someone who had been forced into a corner, who harbored unspoken feelings for someone else but was too afraid to confess, someone who had to compromise for money, gasping beneath her.","The mental torment of regret, guilt, and self-loathing, intertwined with the body's honest reactions—just the thought of it was thrilling.","That's why she chose Li Jiahao, who was deeply in debt and had no way out.","Had she made a mistake?","Qiao Chuchu bit her lip tightly, pondering this plot: [Weisheng Yucan was like a fleeting supporting character, dying shortly after her introduction, and her death was rather perfunctory.]","[It seemed she had just recovered from a fever. Li Jiahao pushed her wheelchair for some fresh air outside the hospital when they coincidentally ran into Xia Xuechun, who was looking for her mother, and revealed her affair with a female tycoon.]","[Xia Xuechun, discovering that he had sold his body for money, was furious. The two argued and ended up on the road. Weisheng Yucan, feeling bored, made a few harsh comments and tried to leave, but was pushed by both Li Jiahao and Xia Xuechun. Still weak from her recent fever, she lost her balance and was hit by a car.]","Weisheng Yucan: \"...\"","Supporting character?","What did \"supporting character\" mean?","She wanted to delve deeper, but then realized and chuckled wryly.","She must have been delirious from the fever.","Her mind was playing tricks on her, imagining voices inside her head.","Perhaps she needed a brain CT to check if she had a tumor.","Weisheng Yucan grew increasingly irritated: \"Take me out for some fresh air.\"","Li Jiahao was reluctant: \"Sister Yucan, Qiao Chuchu bullied me before, which is why I owe so much money now.\"","His tone was resentful, clearly hoping Weisheng Yucan would reprimand Qiao Chuchu.","Qiao Chuchu snapped out of her reverie, sensing trouble.","[Oh no, Weisheng Yucan and Li Jiahao are in a patron-client relationship. If this little puppy of hers starts whining, won't she pull out a gun and shoot me?]","Weisheng Yucan: \"?\"","This hallucination was eerily vivid, responding to the conversation like an AI.","She shook her head, irritated, and glared at Li Jiahao: \"Come closer.\"","Li Jiahao was taken aback but hesitantly approached.","With a swift motion, she slapped him hard!","A crisp \"smack!\" echoed.","Qiao Chuchu was stunned!","Li Jiahao froze in the position of being struck: \"Why—\"","\"Does a dog dare to command its master?\" Weisheng Yucan's face remained expressionless, her tone calm and indifferent: \"Don't you know your place?\"","Although the name Qiao Chuchu was common, there was only one Qiao Chuchu in Lan City's wealthy circles.","She was the youngest daughter of the Pei family, their cherished princess.","Li Jiahao was nothing more than a stray dog she kept for amusement, yet he had the audacity to incite her to bully someone else's precious princess?","What if she needed to collaborate with the Pei family in the future? Wouldn't that affect her profits?","Her mood soured.","She snapped: \"Apologize!\"","Qiao Chuchu was taken aback, surprised to see Li Jiahao.","Li Jiahao was even more shocked: \"You want me to apologize to Qiao Chuchu?\"","Weisheng Yucan was even more astonished: \"So you want me to apologize to her?\"","Li Jiahao: \"...\"","A strange sense of grievance crept over him.","Wasn't he the one being pampered?","In such relationships, the pampered party was supposed to be untouchable!","Why did he have to apologize to Qiao Chuchu?","He lowered his head, reluctant to speak, his gaze filled with reproach.","Weisheng Yucan narrowed her eyes dangerously: \"Have you been a dog for too long that you can't even understand human speech?\"","Li Jiahao: \"...\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","[Hahahahahaha! I'm dying of laughter! Watching the big boss train her dog!]","Weisheng Yucan: \"?\"","Her hallucination was actually laughing.","And calling her \"big boss\"?","She closed her eyes, feeling uneasy.","Was she developing schizophrenia, starting to fall in love with herself and writing her own story?","Weisheng Yucan grew even more irritable: \"Hurry up and apologize!\"","Li Jiahao shuddered, his grievance evident as he reluctantly bent down to apologize to Qiao Chuchu: \"Sorry for disturbing you.\"","Qiao Chuchu struggled to hold back her laughter: \"It's fine, I'm not bothered. I just didn't expect you to ask someone to deal with me, only to end up getting slapped yourself! Hahahahahaha!\"","She couldn't hold it in anymore, laughing so hard she couldn't stand straight!","Weisheng Yucan watched her laugh joyfully, her lips curling into a smile.","This girl was so beautiful that even her laughter was pleasing to the eye, truly a feast for the senses.","In comparison...","She glanced at Li Jiahao.","This dog seemed a bit... trashy."]},{"number":51,"title":"Chapter 51: You Deserve Better, Not This Bad","paragraphs":["Yu Can rolled her eyes languidly: \"Why haven't you left yet?\"","Li Jiahao's face turned red with frustration, his resentful gaze sweeping between the two of them. Reluctantly, he pushed her wheelchair towards the elevator.","Qiao Chuchu suddenly snapped out of her daze.","【Wait! This sister might be in immediate danger! I need to stop her!】","She bravely stepped in front of Weisheng Yucan: \"Miss Weisheng!\"","Weisheng Yucan: \"......\"","Weird.","This girl seemed to be in sync with the hallucination in her mind.","Her hallucination told her to prevent her own death.","And this girl appeared right in front of her.","Qiao Chuchu took a deep breath, her fingers pointing at Li Jiahao: \"This guy has a girl he likes. He took out a loan of hundreds of thousands for her. As a gigolo, he's not loyal enough!\"","Li Jiahao: \"?\"","Qiao Chuchu earnestly advised: \"Please don't go downstairs with him. Find another handsome guy to accompany you. Call any male model or supermodel. You deserve better, not someone like him!\"","Li Jiahao: \"?????????\"","Weisheng Yucan paused, then burst out laughing.","She laughed so hard she bent over, clutching her stomach: \"Hahahaha, I've never heard anyone talk to me like that before.\"","Qiao Chuchu was baffled by her laughter: \"You haven't laughed in over a decade, and I'm the first person to make you laugh? That's a bit cliché, isn't it?\"","Weisheng Yucan laughed even louder.","For the first time, someone had said: She deserved better, not someone like this.","Everyone around her either flattered her or hated her, never telling her the truth.","If she liked something inferior, they praised her unique taste. If she liked something average, they praised her good judgment.","Her previous five husbands all conspired with their families to kill her in accidents, hoping to seize her fortune, but in the end, she turned the tables on them.","Even her mother insulted her, saying she was only fit to play with stray dogs.","This was the first, and only, person who had sincerely tried to dissuade her.","\"Got it,\" Weisheng Yucan finally stopped laughing: \"After I sleep with him, I'll find someone else.\"","Qiao Chuchu was left speechless.","【As expected of a big shot. She has to taste the man before she throws him away.】","She scratched her head: \"Alright, then sleep with him, but make sure to change after that.\"","Weisheng Yucan's gaze softened: \"Okay.\"","She waved her hand, signaling Li Jiahao to push the wheelchair.","Li Jiahao glared fiercely at Qiao Chuchu.","Qiao Chuchu glared back, sticking her tongue out for good measure.","Make you mad, make you mad!","Li Jiahao: \"......\"","He gritted his teeth and looked at Yu Can.","Weisheng Yucan smirked, as if reminiscing about something amusing, and remained silent for a moment.","Qiao Chuchu wanted to go back to sleep.","But—","The time and place were too similar to when Yu Can was supposed to die.","She decided to follow and check on her.","-","Xia Xuechun was listlessly squatting at the hospital entrance, waiting for her mom to get off work.","Her mind was filled with recent events.","It had been quite a run of bad luck.","She had finally found a good job, only to encounter her despised rival, Qi Xiaojia, who had ruined her job.","Not only had her job been lost, but Auntie Wang's job had also been messed up by Qi Xiaojia.","The Pei Family had made good on their threat, adding a black mark to Auntie Wang's housekeeping records.","Anyone who saw Auntie Wang's blacklisted history refused to hire her.","Auntie Wang couldn't find work and had to take jobs in places that didn't check her records or care about her past. But those jobs paid little and demanded a lot.","At the Pei Family, Auntie Wang had earned 50,000 a month, with bonuses during holidays. Now, she could only make a few thousand.","Auntie Wang and her family were furious, and they had stormed Xia Xuechun and Qi Xiaojia's homes several times.","She couldn't bear the pressure and had run away.","Xia Xuechun poked at the snow on the ground, creating hole after hole, feeling wronged and pitiful.","\"Heaven is so unfair. Someone like me, who lives seriously, can't even find a job, while those spoiled, twisted girls are born above me.\"","Xia Xuechun looked up at the sky, worried: \"Do I really have to find a very rich and excellent man, as my mom says, to step on girls like Qiao Chuchu?\"","She glanced inside the hospital unintentionally.","Just then, Li Jiahao pushed Yu Can out, bending down to flatteringly say: \"Sis Yu Can, I...\"","Yu Can ignored him: \"Shut up.\"","Li Jiahao fell silent, awkwardly looking up and meeting Xia Xuechun's gaze.","Li Jiahao: \"!\"","Xia Xuechun: \"......\"","Qiao Chuchu, crouching like a big toad against the wall: \"!\"","【Here it comes! The classic staring scene! The first love and the rich lady who paid off his debts face off. If this were a TV drama, the camera would flash back and forth, with dramatic music playing!】","Yu Can: \"?\"","She looked up and saw Xia Xuechun standing at the hospital entrance, dressed plainly, surprised to see Li Jiahao.","Li Jiahao also stared at Xia Xuechun in shock, his face turning green.","In an instant, Yu Can understood.","This must be Li Jiahao's beloved, right?","But why could she still hear Qiao Chuchu's voice in her head?","Did Qiao Chuchu install a life GPS in her brain?","She glanced around and noticed Qiao Chuchu's face.","Qiao Chuchu met her gaze and quickly hid behind the wall, completely unaware that her upturned red-brown strand of hair perfectly exposed her location.","Weisheng Yucan: \"......\"","Wait a minute?","Could she hear this girl's thoughts?!","Did that mean the hallucination about her death was real?!","Weisheng Yucan's breathing quickened as she quickly tried to piece things together.","Suddenly, a boy peeked out from behind Qiao Chuchu's bangs.","He was a mischievous Silver-haired Boy.","Weisheng Yucan: \"?!\"","Why was her brother here? And standing behind Qiao Chuchu?!","The Silver-haired Boy grinned and signed: 「This red-haired girl is following you.」","Yu Can gave a wary glance at the two beside her.","Xia Xuechun and Li Jiahao were still engrossed in their idol drama staring contest, not paying attention.","She quickly signed back: 「Stay away from her. I need to confirm something! Don't let her notice you.」","The Silver-haired Boy didn't care: 「She's covering her face. She hasn't noticed me.」","Qiao Chuchu peeked out cautiously, meeting Yu Can's gaze!","She let out a small yelp, wanting to escape, and turned right into the Silver-haired Boy's arms!","?","Qiao Chuchu backed up like a startled mouse, looking up!","Holy crap? A handsome guy! And why does this handsome guy look so much like Yu Can?!","Yu Can was speechless, glaring at the Silver-haired Boy.","You've been spotted!","The Silver-haired Boy, however, was staring at Qiao Chuchu like he'd seen a ghost.","Qiao Chuchu quickly apologized: \"Sorry, I didn't know anyone was behind me.\"","Oh my god, I just ran into a handsome guy's arms. So embarrassing.","The Silver-haired Boy's eyes sparkled with surprise. He took out his phone, typed a few lines, and handed it to Qiao Chuchu.","「I'm deaf and mute. I can't hear what you're saying.」"]},{"number":52,"title":"Chapter 52: Do You Know the Significance of a Deaf-mute Person Being Able to Hear","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu suddenly realized and started signing: \"I'm sorry I bumped into you; I didn't know you were behind me.\"","The silver-haired boy: \"!\"","He smiled as bright as the sun: \"You know sign language?!\"","Qiao Chuchu nodded: \"Yes, I know sign language and lip reading!\"","She felt a little secretly pleased inside: [Hahaha! I never thought the skills the system gave me would actually come in handy one day!]","She had maxed out all the skill experience she could accumulate.","But they were all obscure and practically useless.","She had thought she would never use them in her lifetime.","Who would have known that today, not only did she succeed in racing, but she even used sign language.","All that was missing was a gun to let her experience her sharpshooting skills.","Wait.","Why was she getting off track?","[Right now, I should be concerned about the safety of my beloved Yu Can! I need to keep an eye on whether she gets hit by a car! I don't have time to chat with a handsome guy!]","Qiao Chuchu waved at the silver-haired handsome guy: \"Goodbye.\"","The silver-haired handsome guy's mouth curved upwards, almost reaching his temples, as he watched Qiao Chuchu leave.","His eyes sparkled with greed, like a predator eyeing the most delicious prey, fixated on her retreating figure.","Then, with a sinister smile, he looked at Yu Can.","\"Sister,\" the silver-haired boy signed quickly with his porcelain-white hands: \"That woman's voice is echoing in my head!\"","He was as excited as a boy seeing Superman for the first time, his hands almost blurring with the speed of his signing: \"What's most amazing is that this is the first time I've ever heard a voice, and I can understand it!!\"","Yu Can: \"?\"","What?","Could her brother Weisheng Huailing hear it too?","She signed: \"What did you hear?\"","Weisheng Huailing was ecstatic: \"She said you're going to get hit by a car!\"","Yu Can: \"? Aren't you a little too happy about that?\"","Huailing didn't care, instead, he was thrilled: \"Do you usually hear people's voices in your head?\"","Yu Can frowned: \"No, her voice is her inner thoughts. I just guessed that. Not everyone can hear it, like these two beside me can't.\"","Huailing's eyes widened with excitement: \"So the only voice I'll ever hear is hers? If I tell her my name, can I even hear how my name sounds?\"","Yu Can: \"? That's only if she remembers you and mentions you in her thoughts.\"","Huailing grinned: \"Good.\"","Without hesitation, he walked towards Qiao Chuchu.","Yu Can: \"? Huailing? Weisheng Huailing!\"","She suddenly stood up, wanting to follow him, but a wave of dizziness hit her, and she plopped back into her wheelchair.","Li Jiahao and Xia Xuechun beside her were arguing louder and louder.","Xia Xuechun cried and covered her face as she left: \"I never thought you were like this. I thought you were a hardworking and ambitious Jiahao ge! You've disappointed me so much. You're no different from those money-hungry people!\"","Li Jiahao called after her: \"Xuechun!\"","Xuechun didn't look back.","Li Jiahao gritted his teeth and pushed Yu Can's wheelchair, chasing after her!","The dizzy Yu Can gripped the chair's handles: \"What are you doing? Using me as a booster?! Let go of me if you're going after her!\"","After saying that, her oxygen-deprived brain made her dizzy again.","Li Jiahao ignored her, shouting after Xia Xuechun: \"Xuechun! Wait, let me explain!\"","Xia Xuechun ran toward the road, crying: \"I don't want to hear it! You've changed. You're not my Jiahao ge anymore!\"","As she stepped onto the road, a car sped towards her!","Xia Xuechun froze!","Li Jiahao pushed Yu Can aside and rushed towards Xia Xuechun: \"Xuechun!!!\"","Yu Can's wheelchair was pushed forward, throwing her onto the road!","Yu Can was flung into the air!","All she could think was—","Qiao Chuchu's inner thoughts were true.","She—Weisheng Yu Can, the feared \"demoness\" in the industry, was about to be killed by two idiots!","Suddenly, a strong force grabbed her arm and pulled her into a hug!","She was a bit taller than the person holding her and instinctively hugged them back like a bear.","Yu Can froze, looking at the person she was holding.","Qiao Chuchu looked like a little hamster peeking out from her embrace: \"Are you okay, Yu Can jie?\"","Weisheng Yu Can was shocked: \"Qiao Chuchu?\"","Chuchu nodded obediently: \"Yes! It's me!\"","Weisheng Yu Can half-opened her mouth, suddenly becoming excited: \"You... how did you—\"","Qiao Chuchu calmly pressed her shoulder and said seriously: \"Sis, I told you earlier, Li Jiahao is bad luck for you!\"","[Luckily, I predicted this and was already waiting on the road. Otherwise, my favorite character would have been killed! What a pity that would have been!]","Yu Can couldn't believe it.","Although she didn't know exactly what was going on, she vaguely understood the situation.","Qiao Chuchu had changed her fate of dying.","Because Qiao Chuchu liked her... this character.","In comparison, Li Jiahao and Xia Xuechun were the ones who almost killed her.","She immediately looked at the two idiots.","Li Jiahao was still hugging Xia Xuechun tightly, completely unaware of what had almost happened. He was heartbroken: \"I'm sorry, Xuechun. I'll return the money right away. I won't do such things again to disappoint you. Please forgive me.\"","Xia Xuechun buried her face in his chest, crying: \"Jiahao ge... I feel so helpless, so scared...\"","Yu Can's murderous intent surged as she wanted to step forward.","Qiao Chuchu stopped her: \"Wait.\"","Qiao Chuchu took off her shoes: \"Leave it to me, sis.\"","Yu Can: \"?\"","Qiao Chuchu jumped up and smacked Li Jiahao on the back of the head with her shoe: \"You almost killed Yu Can jie!!\"","Li Jiahao winced and turned around: \"?!\"","Xia Xuechun immediately shielded Li Jiahao: \"Qiao Chuchu, I won't let you bully Jiahao ge!!\"","Qiao Chuchu immediately took off her socks, threatening fiercely: \"Xia Xuechun, let me tell you, I hit Li Jiahao with my shoe, but I'll hit you with my cotton socks. Don't think socks don't hurt—I hit, and you'll feel it!\"","Xia Xuechun: \"?????\"","Pei Youchuan and the other Pei brothers looked at Qiao Chuchu in shock: \"Qiao Chuchu, what are you doing?\"","The car that almost hit Yu Can was theirs.","As they braked, they saw Qiao Chuchu suddenly appear from the sky, save a woman, and then start taking off her shoes and socks.","The Pei family, the Lin family, and Lou Tingsi all looked at the woman Qiao Chuchu had saved.","?","Weisheng Yu Can?!","Qiao Chuchu brightened up when she saw them: \"Pei Youchuan, you're just in time. Take off your socks.\"","Pei Youchuan: \"? Why?\"","Qiao Chuchu didn't answer, putting her socks back on while threatening Xia Xuechun: \"Let me tell you, watch your words. Otherwise, I'll use Pei Youchuan's socks to slap your nose, making your sense of smell run away and never come back!\"","Xia Xuechun: \"...\"","Pei Youchuan: \"...\"","Lin Qing smacked his lips: \"Oh no, her words are starting to smell.\"","The others looked at Pei Youchuan: \"How bad must your feet smell?\"","Pei Youchuan gritted his teeth: \"I wear odor-resistant socks, and it's winter!!\"","Qiao Chuchu raised a finger: \"Winter can't stop my brother's true power!\"","The others: \"Pfft!!!\"","Pei Youchuan's mouth twitched violently as he walked to Qiao Chuchu's side: \"Fine, you're messing with me, huh? Well, big brother's got your back.\"","He took off his shoes: \"Big brother's got two socks and two genuine leather boots for you! Who dares to bully my sister!\"","He pointed the two shoes and socks at Li Jiahao: \"Is it you!!!\""]},{"number":53,"title":"Chapter 53: Pei Youchuan: Washing Underwear with a Cold Face","paragraphs":["Li Jiahao took a few steps back in panic, afraid of getting even a little bit of whatever was happening.","Xia Xuechun, too cowardly to stand her ground, hid directly behind Li Jiahao, staring at Pei Youchuan in shock, as if he were a complete fool.","Qiao Chuchu, on the other hand, was enjoying the spectacle, stepping closer to Pei Youchuan and giving him a thumbs up. \"Third Brother, it's always you. This effect is absolutely incredible.\"","Pei Youchuan smirked, leaning in close to whisper in her ear, \"Qiao Chuchu, I'm doing this for your sake in front of outsiders. You publicly humiliated me by saying my feet stink in front of everyone. Just wait until we get home, and I'll deal with you.\"","Qiao Chuchu remained silent.","She then grabbed his shoulder seriously, \"Put your socks and shoes back on, Brother. It's freezing out here; you don't want to catch a cold and end up with gynecological issues.\"","Pei Youchuan narrowed his eyes, \"Gynecological issues, huh?\"","Qiao Chuchu's lips twitched, \"Oh, I mean, heartache.\"","Pei Youchuan threw his shoes on the ground and put them on, smiling as brightly as a flower. \"It's fine, my heartache doesn't matter now. I believe someone else will share my heartache. Guess who that might be?\"","Without hesitation, Qiao Chuchu replied, \"Li Jiahao!\"","Pei Youchuan: \"?\"","Li Jiahao: \"?\"","She said with a serious face, \"Li Jiahao bullied me!\"","Pei Youchuan's eyes darkened as he whispered a warning in her ear, \"Qiao Chuchu, don't you remember what our relationship is now? I helped you because I didn't want others to laugh at our family, but I'm not the Third Brother who would blindly help you just because you're being bullied anymore.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"But you just helped me take off Ji Yanchuan's clothes.\"","Pei Youchuan, with a cold face, \"I did that reluctantly.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"And you just happily took off your shoes.\"","Pei Youchuan, still cold, \"I did that reluctantly too.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","[It makes sense, but I feel like he's got a bit of that \"washing underwear with a cold face\" vibe.]","Pei Youchuan: \"?\"","What does \"washing underwear\" mean?","Pei Yuan, lowering his voice, asked, \"What's 'washing underwear literature'?\"","Pei Buxian whispered an explanation, \"It's when the husband cheats, the wife knows, doesn't divorce him, and doesn't cause trouble for him, but she never smiles while washing his underwear again. From now on, she washes them with a cold face.\"","Pei Yuan: \"??\" Isn't she still washing the underwear?","Everyone thought about it for a moment, then looked at Pei Youchuan with sly smiles.","Hehe.","It does have that vibe.","Hehehe.","Pei Youchuan, feeling creeped out: \"...\"","Lin Qing, arms crossed, commented, \"What right do you have to talk about Pei Youchuan like that? The rest of you six are all the ones washing underwear with a cold face.\"","Lou Tingsi laughed out loud, \"Ha!\"","Pei Buxian, feeling provoked, retorted angrily, \"So what if we wash underwear with a cold face? Your brother would love the chance to do it with a cold face.\"","Lin Shen: \"??\"","Lin Qing shot back smoothly, \"It's fine. My brother has thick skin; he can smile while stealing your underwear to wash.\"","She smacked Lin Shen's back hard, \"What are you standing there for? Go! It's a great opportunity!\"","Pei Buxian, nervous, \"Pei Youchuan is guarding the goal!\"","Pei Ci cheered, \"Third Brother, guarding the goal with a cold face! Protect the crystal well!\"","Pei Youchuan: \"...\"","He got it!","But could they stop saying \"with a cold face\" already!","It feels like he's the pathetic dog who stays with a cheater despite being hurt!","Pei Youchuan blocked Lin Shen's path, \"None of your business, don't meddle.\"","Lin Shen raised an eyebrow, confident, \"Pei Youchuan, you're a bit confused about the main issue here. We should be dealing with Qiao Chuchu's problem right now, and besides...\"","He gestured towards Qiao Chuchu and Weisheng Yucan, \"Chuchu and Ms. Weisheng are waiting over there.\"","Weisheng Yucan, who had somehow rolled her wheelchair over to them, smiled sweetly, \"Don't mind me. I find it quite entertaining watching you all argue. Keep it up.\"","Lin Shen: \"...\"","Pei Youchuan: \"...\"","A few steps away, Qiao Chuchu looked puzzled, \"What have you been whispering about all this time?\"","Lin Shen sidestepped Pei Youchuan and walked towards her, \"I'll help you, Chuchu.\"","Pei Youchuan, like a wall, blocked him again, \"My sister, I'll handle it.\"","Pei Che scoffed, \"Childish. Do you really need to fight over such a trivial matter?\"","He walked straight towards Qiao Chuchu.","Lin Qing stepped directly in his way, \"What, you want to sneak around and take the rear?\"","Pei Che: \"? I'm going to help Qiao Chuchu.\"","Lin Qing smiled falsely, \"My brother already went.\"","Pei Che snorted, \"Your brother is already blocked.\"","Lin Qing didn't care, \"You're blocked too. Show some sportsmanship; after all, there are seven of you men. This is a solo match.\"","Lou Tingsi laughed, deciding to stay out of it with good sportsmanship, \"It's like a bunch of people fighting for the final trophy. It's getting more and more interesting.\"","Cut off a few steps away, Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","[What are they whispering about? Am I deaf or blind? I can't hear a single word.]","[Now I feel like they all want to come up, but none of them can.]","Xia Xuechun, seeing this, sneered, \"Qiao Chuchu, it seems like the people around you don't like you at all. They don't want to help you.\"","Chuchu grabbed a shoe to smack her!","Xia Xuechun stepped back in fright!","Qiao Chuchu looked down on her, \"I don't need their help. I'm just curious why they're having a meeting behind my back.\"","Xia Xuechun retorted, \"Really? Maybe they're discussing how to dump you!\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","[Oh no, maybe they really are discussing how to dump me!]","[Even if it's true, it's the consequence of my actions after binding with the system.]","[But even so, I still have to act cool in front of my arch-nemesis!]","Everyone paused, shocked to see Qiao Chuchu's back.","Qiao Chuchu quickly adjusted her mood and, with hands on her hips, retorted to Xia Xuechun: \"Let me tell you, even if these people abandon me, your sister Qiao can find an identical lineup to replicate it one-to-one. Know why?!\"","Qiao Chuchu tossed her hair, her bare foot stepping on the other, casually spreading her hands: \"Because your sister Qiao's charm is irreplaceable!!\"","Xia Xuechun: \"!!!\"","Her voice was deafening!","But the bustling street beside them was eerily quiet.","Qiao Chuchu turned her head.","Pei Youchuan and Lin Shen stared at her in stunned silence.","Everyone behind them was holding back laughter.","Lin Shen was the first to react, smiling lightly, \"Chuchu, it's not that we don't want to help you. It's just that we all want to help you, so we're fighting over it.\"","He smoothly moved towards Qiao Chuchu.","Pei Youchuan blocked him again, \"Qiao Chuchu, I'll handle it.\"","Lin Shen: \"...\"","Their eyes met, sparks flying.","Qiao Chuchu couldn't help but feel disdain: [What is this? Coming and going, my cool act is all messed up. By the time they finish fighting, it'll be summer. Do they think mosquitoes biting Xia Xuechun's bumps will contribute more than they do? I'll just do it myself! They're completely useless!]","Lin Shen: \"?\"","Pei Youchuan: \"?\""]},{"number":54,"title":"Chapter 54: The Silver-Haired Boy Wei Sheng Huai Ling","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu's gaze swept past Li Jiahao: \"Do you know you almost pushed Sister Yucan into the street just now? If it weren't for my quick reflexes, Sister Yucan would have been hit by a car and killed!\"","Xia Xuechun laughed out loud, shielding Li Jiahao behind her: \"I knew it, you're trying to extort again. How much do you want this time, a million?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"? What does it have to do with you if I'm talking to Li Jiahao? I'm just stating facts. If anyone's asking for money, it's not me!\"","Xia Xuechun pushed her: \"Then Jiahao Ge and that auntie's business is none of your concern either!\"","Yu Can's eyes widened like copper bells!","Auntie?","This girl called her auntie?!","She was furious, but Qiao Chuchu was even more outraged: \"Xia Xuechun, open your dog eyes and look carefully! Sister Yucan is as beautiful as a succubus, and you call such a beautiful woman 'auntie'? Are you polite?!\"","Yu Can: \"Wow.\"","Was she a succubus?","What a high compliment!","Xia Xuechun shrugged it off: \"Jiahao Ge said she's forty-two years old, and I'm twenty-four. Isn't it appropriate for me to call her auntie? I'm being polite. It seems that whatever we poor people say is wrong, right?\"","Qiao Chuchu sneered: \"Don't insult the poor. You're just emotionally stunted, like your EQ was buried with your ancestors.\"","Xia Xuechun's face darkened, and she grabbed a handful of snow from the roadside, throwing it in Qiao Chuchu's face: \"Watch your mouth!\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","Playing dirty, huh?","Fine.","She ordered: \"Pei Youchuan, smear your socks on her face!\"","Pei Youchuan rolled up his sleeves: \"You got it!\"","Just as Pei Youchuan charged forward, a silver-haired boy suddenly emerged from the shadows, carrying two buckets—one pink and one blue—filled with snow. He leaped up and delivered a perfect slam dunk!","Xia Xuechun and Li Jiahao were instantly covered in buckets, screaming in terror: \"Ah!!!\"","Pei Youchuan paused mid-step, surprisedly looking towards the silver-haired boy.","The silver-haired boy was tall and slender, glowing white in the winter snow. His silver hair slightly obscured his angry eyes as he turned to Qiao Chuchu and gestured: \"Are you okay?\"","Qiao Chuchu was stunned.","Why was it him?","Xia Xuechun, who had angrily removed the bucket, was also stunned.","What a beautiful boy!","Pei Youchuan: \"???? Who are you?\"","Lin Shen: \"...\"","Sitting in a wheelchair and observing the scene, Weisheng Yucan calmly smiled: \"This is my younger brother, Weisheng Huailing. He was born deaf and cannot hear you.\"","She smiled with a sense of victory: \"He came to help Qiao Chuchu because she helped me.\"","The Pei family: \"...\"","Lin Qing sighed, feeling troubled: \"Another handsome guy shows up, how am I supposed to choose my ship now?\"","Pei Buxian glared at her: \"Lin Qing, do you think Qiao Chuchu is some hot commodity that everyone falls for? Weisheng Huailing is just here to repay a favor.\"","Weisheng Huailing lowered his head, almost kissing Qiao Chuchu's face as he carefully inspected her: \"Let me see if you're hurt.\"","His gaze was as focused and earnest as a loyal dog's, but his hands were boldly cupping her face.","Qiao Chuchu was caught off guard, her face instantly reddening.","Pei Buxian: \"?\"","Lin Qing laughed: \"Ha! What a straightforward way to repay a favor, not involving any romantic feelings at all. As pure as the snow.\"","The brothers turned green with jealousy. Pei Youchuan was the first to react, pulling Qiao Chuchu back and warning Huailing: \"Don't get handsy!\"","Huailing tilted his head, looking like a confused little beast, and signed: \"I'm sorry, I can't hear.\"","He turned to Qiao Chuchu for help: \"Is your brother angry with me?\"","Qiao Chuchu shook her head and signed back: \"No, my brother isn't angry!\"","Huailing looked sad: \"But he looks scary at me. I'm a little scared.\"","Qiao Chuchu felt guilty and said to Pei Youchuan: \"He came to help me out of kindness. You're scaring him. Be nicer, okay?\"","Pei Youchuan was annoyed: \"How well does this guy even know you? He just met you and already got handsy. That's disrespectful, you know? He's clearly got some issues.\"","Qiao Chuchu rolled her eyes: \"What issues? Every time there's a guy around me, you all say he's got issues. Now Weisheng Huailing is Sister Yucan's brother, he's deaf and mute, and he just came to help me. Can't you be nicer, at least smile?\"","Pei Youchuan: \"...\"","Huailing was still pitifully staring at him.","Gritting his teeth, Pei Youchuan forced a smile and shook Huailing's hand: \"Thank you for saving my sister.\"","Huailing enthusiastically shook back.","Pei Youchuan smiled, mouthing the words: \"Stay away from my sister.\"","Deaf people should be able to read lips, right?","Huailing paused, then smiled.","His lips curled into a classic villainous grin from the movies, then he quickly reverted to an innocent expression, blinking innocently.","Pei Youchuan's eye twitched.","This guy was taunting him!","He was right; the guy was deliberately acting cute and pitiful.","His grip involuntarily tightened.","Huailing winced in pain.","Qiao Chuchu quickly intervened: \"Brother! You're hurting him!\"","Pei Youchuan snapped back to reality and let go.","Huailing pitifully cradled his reddened hand, guarding it like a kicked puppy, taking small steps toward Qiao Chuchu.","A gust of cold wind blew, lifting his silver hair, and his teary eyes drooped, exuding a sense of fragility.","Pei Youchuan's eyes almost popped out!","Small steps!","Such a tall guy taking small steps!","He was so furious he nearly exploded, yanking Qiao Chuchu behind him and glaring at Weisheng Huailing.","Come on.","Try the small steps again.","I'll kick you so hard you'll get embedded in the wall.","Weisheng Huailing's eyes flickered with a hint of darkness as he stared at Pei Youchuan without speaking.","Suddenly, a group of black-suited men emerged from the shadows and dragged Li Jiahao away!","Xia Xuechun was shocked: \"Ah! What are you doing?!\"","Li Jiahao struggled for a moment before being forcefully shoved into a luxurious business car: \"What are you—mmph!\"","The car slammed shut and drove off without looking back.","Xia Xuechun was in shock: \"What's going on?!\"","She anxiously glanced at Huailing, wanting to ask for help, but knowing they wouldn't assist her, she quickly scanned the QR code to rent an electric bike, crying as she chased after the car: \"Jiahao Ge! Let go of Jiahao Ge!!!\"","Xia Xuechun's cries for Jiahao Ge gradually faded into the distance, disappearing from their sight.","Qiao Chuchu: \"What's going on?\"","Why were they suddenly taking someone away?","She looked at everyone in confusion: \"Shouldn't we call the police?\"","Pei Youchuan was indifferent: \"Xia Xuechun must have already called the police. We don't need to do anything; she's crying and chasing after them.\"","Pei Buxian: \"Let's just wish her luck.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","Weisheng Yucan smiled: \"Let's get back to business.\"","Everyone's attention was drawn back.","Yu Can leaned back in her wheelchair, smiling warmly: \"Thank you, Qiao Chuchu, for saving my life. I think if it weren't for you, I would have definitely been hit by a car. Whether I would have died or not, getting injured was certain. Thanks to you, I was saved.\""]},{"number":55,"title":"Chapter 55: Lin Qing: I made my brother play mind games, and in the end, my brother connected heart to heart","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu quickly waved her hands: \"It's nothing, just a small favor. You don't have to worry about it.\"","Although the system had told her that this was a real world, she still felt that her life and the lives of those around her were like a novel designed to pave the way for someone else's romance.","【If it weren't for me, Weisheng Yucan would have really died. Originally in the plot, Yucan's death was also very contrived. She would have collapsed on the road, her head hitting the ground, and the wheel directly crushing her skull. Her head would have been flattened. Just imagining that kind of death is horrifying.】","【A beautiful and powerful figure, dying so tragically and so unnecessarily. It's all just a plot device.】","【Most importantly, after Weisheng Yucan's death, the Weisheng family inexplicably began to decline, and was mysteriously acquired by the male lead, Ji Yanchuan.】","【It's as if the legendary Weisheng family was forcefully dumbed down, voluntarily giving away their advantages, one by one, all falling victim to Ji Yanchuan's aura.】","【The male lead, Ji Yanchuan, became the world's first global billionaire, nourished by the Weisheng family, the Pei family, the Lou family, and several other powerful figures. Xia Xuechun became the global billionaire's cherished wife, and also a renowned philanthropist, sponsoring many small animals and people in poverty-stricken areas. She was hailed as spreading love across the world and became a sensation online!】","【It's really the male and female leads being born useless, with all the greatness coming from the supporting characters paving the way!】","【But now that I've saved Weisheng Yucan's life, the plot for the Weisheng family should be fine, right? After all, the most powerful member of the Weisheng family, Sister Yucan, has been saved by me.】","The Pei family instantly became alert.","Was Weisheng Yucan also part of the plot?!","Then Weisheng Yucan must also be able to hear Qiao Chuchu's thoughts?!","They looked at Weisheng Yucan and her siblings, Weisheng Huailing, with caution.","Weisheng Yucan's expression remained calm, still smiling warmly at Qiao Chuchu.","Weisheng Huailing also looked at Qiao Chuchu with genuine sincerity, showing no signs of being able to hear her thoughts.","Even Yucan signed to Huailing: \"This girl saved me. I was almost hit by a car just now, and she helped me.\"","Huailing's eyes lit up, and he became even more grateful, signing to Qiao Chuchu: \"Thank you for saving my sister. You are really excellent and amazing!\"","Qiao Chuchu felt a little happy: \"It's nothing, no need to be so polite.\"","Yucan smiled: \"Chuchu, I see you two get along well. Why don't you go out for dinner and a movie with my brother? Let him properly thank you on my behalf.\"","Pei Youchuan was shocked: \"A deaf-mute person watching a movie? Can he hear the dialogue?\"","Yucan gently rebutted: \"Can't deaf-mute people watch movies? Besides, your sister can hear, so it's fine. Whether my brother can hear or not doesn't matter, as he's just accompanying Qiao Chuchu on my behalf.\"","She looked expectantly at Qiao Chuchu: \"Right, Chuchu?\"","Lou Tingsi cleared his throat and stepped out from the crowd: \"Chuchu, my son was very traumatized today. You know he almost got into a car accident, and he really wants to see you. I also heard that you were involved in a kidnapping earlier. How about you come to my house tonight and stay with my son, or I can have my son stay at your place. That kid sleeps very quietly.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","【Stay with Lou Yuejue?】","Weisheng Yucan seized the opportunity: \"Oh, Chuchu, I almost forgot. This time for a movie and dinner might be a bit too late. Why don't you come to my house and stay? Do you like small animals? I have cats, dogs, and everything at home. It's a good chance for us to get to know each other better.\"","She gestured to Huailing: \"Invite Qiao Chuchu to our house to play! Don't you want to play with Qiao Chuchu?\"","Huailing nodded vigorously, poking Qiao Chuchu's shoulder and signing eagerly: \"Come to my sister's house and stay with us siblings. I just came back from abroad today, and tomorrow a Chanel salesperson is coming to my sister's house with clothes and bags. Whatever you like, just point at it, and my sister can give it to you.\"","Qiao Chuchu was overwhelmed with gratitude: \"No, no, it was really just a small favor. You don't have to be so polite.\"","Having been in the wealthy circle for so many years, she still hadn't gotten used to their extravagant ways of making friends.","Yucan's eyes curved into crescents: \"What do you mean, just a small favor? You saved my life! Come to my house. My brother doesn't have many friends, and there are very few people who can communicate with him through sign language! ~\"","Lou Tingsi chimed in sarcastically: \"Is Weisheng Huailing's circle of friends small? I believe even if his friends are not deaf-mute, they can sign as fluently as casting spells. After all, who wouldn't want to curry favor with the crown prince?\"","Weisheng Yucan's smile stiffened, her eyes narrowing like a cat as she looked at Lou Tingsi: \"Lou Tingsi, it's been a long time. Why are you speaking so sarcastically? Is there something I did to upset you?\"","Lou Tingsi chuckled: \"I just mentioned that my son isn't feeling well and needs Chuchu's company, and Sister Yucan immediately wanted Chuchu to stay at her house. Isn't this clearly trying to steal my person?\"","Weisheng Yucan smiled charmingly: \"Oh, I'm sorry to make you feel threatened, but no matter how much you talk, it won't stop me from stealing her.\"","Lou Tingsi's gaze suddenly sharpened.","Lin Qing, like a rabbit, perked up her ears in alert!","Why were they all suddenly trying to steal her?!","She quickly stepped forward: \"Chuchu, you've been through so much today. You must be very tired and might have nightmares tonight. Why don't you come to my house? I'll stay with you. Girls always feel more relaxed together, and if you have a nightmare, I can comfort you.\"","After saying that, she nudged Lin Shen hard.","Speak up!","If you don't, she'll be gone!","Reminded by his sister, Lin Shen became nervous and stepped forward: \"Chuchu.\"","Qiao Chuchu stared at him in confusion.","He took several deep breaths, nervously saying: \"I'm sorry for leaving you three years ago without giving you a chance to explain, or giving myself a chance.\"","As he spoke, the sky fittingly began to drizzle with snow.","Qiao Chuchu felt something was off.","At the same time, Lin Shen took out his wallet, opening it to reveal her photo.","\"Three years ago, I left this place, but it was only to escape. However, during these three years, I have never forgotten you.\"","Lin Shen looked into her eyes, speaking with utmost sincerity: \"I still like you.\"","\"Will you give me another chance to pursue you?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"......\"","Lin Qing: \"......\"","Lou Tingsi: \"......\"","Weisheng Huailing approached his sister curiously: \"What is he saying? I didn't understand his lip movements.\"","Weisheng Yucan: \"He's confessing to Qiao Chuchu, saying he's liked her for three years and hopes she'll give him a chance.\"","Weisheng Huailing: \"?\""]},{"number":56,"title":"Chapter 56: If I Could Do It All Over Again, Would You Love Me","paragraphs":["In a scene where everyone could hear the confession, the atmosphere was so awkward that no one could bring themselves to speak first.","The snow was falling harder and harder.","In the midst of the swirling snow, a poignant BGM echoed in everyone's ears—","\"If you could start over, would you love me~\"","\"Love brings joy but also torment~\"","\"The love river we once walked together, now drowned in my tears, has become a river of pain~~\"","Lin Shen stood in front of Qiao Chuchu, his eyebrows furrowed, his eyes filled with deep affection.","It was as if he were the singer pouring his heart out.","Qiao Chuchu swallowed hard, glancing at the deliveryman who had stopped nearby to play the old song on his speaker.","The deliveryman finished his delivery, hopped on his scooter, and sped off into the distance.","Leaving only the echo of the song: \"If you could start over, would you love me~~\" fading into the distance.","She was so embarrassed that she could have dug an Elsa Ice Palace with her toes, silently adding in her mind: **[No.]**","**[If I could do it all over again, I wouldn't want to fall in love with anyone. It's just too painful.]**","Lin Shen's gaze instantly dimmed, his eyelashes drooping, looking like a big golden retriever who had been let down.","Weisheng Yucan signed to Huai Ling: \"She's rejecting him in her heart.\"","\"I can hear it,\" Huai Ling signed back, smiling slyly. \"And I understand.\"","Yucan raised an eyebrow, glancing at Qiao Chuchu, then at Huai Ling, who was smiling with a mischievous glint in her eye. He let out a meaningful \"Oh~\"","Qiao Chuchu was still racking her brain, trying to figure out how to refuse him.","Lin Shen suddenly spoke: \"Qiao Chuchu, you don't have to think about it.\"","She looked at him in surprise.","He smiled bitterly: \"I was too hasty. Leaving for three years caused a lot of damage to our relationship. I don't want to force you, and pursuing you is my own business. I don't need an answer from you right now. I have time to wait.\"","His dim eyes were once again lit with tiny sparks: \"Three years ago, I left you, but I never forgot you for a single day. I know my own answer, and now I just need to wait for yours.\"","Qiao Chuchu's heart skipped a beat as she stared at him.","**[Yes, Lin Shen is such a wonderful person. Talented but not arrogant, respectful to everyone, and his gentleness and persistence are his trademarks. That's why I once genuinely liked him.]**","Lin Shen's eyes sparkled, and the corners of his mouth gradually lifted.","Lin Qing watched this scene in a daze.","Wow.","So heartwarming.","But does anyone remember her original goal was to get Qiao Chuchu to stay at her house?","Now that Lin Shen's confession had failed, wasn't that completely out of the question?!","Lin Qing grabbed Qiao Chuchu's shoe: \"Lend me!\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","Lin Qing raised her hand and smacked Lin Shen on the shoulder: \"You're so useless!\"","Lin Shen: \"?! What are you doing?!\"","Lin Qing, full of frustration, scolded and hit him: \"The timing was wrong, the time was wrong, the place was wrong! And you went off-topic!\"","Lin Shen backed away, shouting at her: \"Lin Qing, don't push me to hit you!\"","Lin Qing was furious, chasing after him: \"I let you use your brain, and you ended up connecting with her heart! And you failed at that! What am I supposed to do now?!\"","Qiao Chuchu watched in shock: \"Why is Lin Qing so angry?\"","Pei Youchuan, enjoying the chaos, said: \"Nothing much. She just got dumped by her boyfriend a couple of days ago, and she's been like a ticking bomb ever since. Stay as far away from her as possible, or she might bite.\"","Lin Qing's voice echoed from a distance: \"Pei Youchuan, stop sticking your nose in!\"","She stomped over to Qiao Chuchu, shouting to prove herself: \"Look, I'm perfectly calm, I'm not angry at all!!!\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"......\"","Lin Qing gritted her teeth: \"I should have known all men are useless!\"","She grabbed Qiao Chuchu's hand: \"Qiao Chuchu, come stay at my place. I'll call over some sexy male models to keep you company, and they'll dance for you. Super hot!\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","Lou Tingsi walked up, giving Lin Qing a dark look: \"What's this? My son, Lou Yuejue, really wants Qiao Chuchu to help him. He's been crying himself to sleep.\"","Lin Qing: \"? Your son handles a gun better than I do, and you're saying he's scared of nightmares?\"","Lou Tingsi smiled: \"Miss Lin Qing, you're joking. Guns can't be taken into dreams.\"","Weisheng Yucan walked directly over to Qiao Chuchu, gently persuading her: \"Chuchu, my sister really wants a chance to repay you. How about giving her a chance? Come stay at my place tonight, okay?\"","Pei Youchuan was displeased: \"Why are you acting like Qiao Chuchu has no home? She's going to stay with us.\"","Lin Qing held onto Qiao Chuchu's hand tightly, afraid she'd refuse: \"Male models are so much fun, way more interesting than your grumpy brothers. If you don't like men, I can get women instead. Either way, just come stay at my place.\"","Weisheng Yucan: \"Come to my place. Tomorrow, I'll have all the top brands send over their latest collections. Pick whatever you like.\"","Lou Tingsi sincerely invited: \"Chuchu, my son really likes you as a sister. He doesn't have a mother, you know. Help me, his father, out.\"","Weisheng Yucan scoffed: \"If your son doesn't have a mother, just remarry. Is it that hard for you to find a wife? And you, an old man, inviting a twenty-something girl to your place? Isn't that a bit inappropriate?\"","Lou Tingsi, his smile not reaching his eyes, replied: \"First of all, my son can go to Qiao Chuchu's place. I won't remarry. I don't like women.\"","Lin Qing laughed at him: \"Ha! Don't like women but still have a kid? Do you think we don't know how reproduction works?\"","Lou Tingsi smiled sweetly: \"My son is a test-tube baby. Any problems?\"","Lin Qing: \"......\"","Lin Shen: \"......\"","Weisheng Yucan: \"......\"","The Pei family: \"......\"","Lou Yuejue is a test-tube baby.","Which means that the thirty-four-year-old Lou Tingsi is still...","Everyone thought of the same word, their lips curling in a knowing smile.","Lou Tingsi, his smile sharp like a knife, gritted his teeth: \"Whatever you're thinking, stop right there.\"","Qiao Chuchu looked completely unperturbed.","**[What could they be thinking? Surely not that Lou Tingsi had a son but is still a virgin, right?]**","Lou Tingsi: \"?\"","Everyone burst out laughing!","Lin Qing couldn't straighten up from laughing: \"Oh my god, that's hilarious hahahahahahahahahahaha!\"","Pei Youchuan laughed so hard he almost fell over: \"Hahahahahahahahahahahaha!\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","**[What are they laughing at? That Lou Tingsi is a virgin dad? Is that weird?]**","Lou Tingsi clenched his teeth, smiling at Qiao Chuchu: \"Miss Qiao, my head hurts.\"","Qiao Chuchu was puzzled: \"Why ask me? I can't cure headaches.\"","Everyone couldn't hold back their laughter: \"Hahahahahaha!\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"......\"","In this world that mirrored the novel's setting, it wasn't strange at all for both men and women to be virgins.","**[Even my seven brothers don't have any romantic experiences. I bet even the eldest, Pei Yuan, still has his first kiss.]**","The Pei brothers suddenly stopped laughing."]},{"number":57,"title":"Chapter 57: Li Jiahao Falls from the Sky","paragraphs":["Lin Qing laughed so hard she stomped her feet: \"Holy crap, hahahahahahahahaha!\"","She walked up to Pei Youchuan, her excitement barely contained even though she lowered her voice: \"You weren't bragging about how manly you are? Was that all in your dreams? No wonder you don't let your sister date—looks like you guys don't date either.\"","Pei Youchuan: \"......\"","The other brothers blushed furiously and glared at Qiao Chuchu.","Their dignity was completely shattered!","How did she know about their private lives?!","Was it just because they hadn't had girlfriends?!","Qiao Chuchu was still lost in thought: [But it doesn't matter, anyway. Every handsome guy here is a hidden resource for Xia Xuechun. Even the ones not in the script are probably still virgins, with a love life as clean as freshly fallen snow.]","The men all frowned in disgust.","Disgusting!","Xia Xuechun isn't even worthy of them!","Qiao Chuchu looked into the distance, her mouth curling into a sly smile.","[However, if the female lead wasn't Xia Xuechun and instead was a very charming female character who was deeply loved by a group of men, I'd totally be into that.]","[I'm a fan of male rivalry! If it weren't for the rule that the female lead can't have a harem, my manga's female lead would have a harem, filling it with handsome men for my daughter, feeding my readers until they're satisfied!]","[A group of handsome men fighting over one woman, scheming against each other, getting jealous—it's so exciting! ~]","Everyone's expressions changed as they glanced at Qiao Chuchu's smirking face.","They each had their own thoughts, silently observing the gleeful Qiao Chuchu.","She looked like a squirrel hiding a treasure, her eyes sparkling with visions of such stories.","Lin Qing, who had only read novels during her teenage years, laughed even more meaningfully, witnessing everything.","In fact, she also liked the kind of stories Qiao Chuchu was describing.","But now, she preferred to watch the innocent little rabbit, completely unaware, caught in the vortex of being fought over.","The men around her were all top-tier, dangerous wolves, aggressive players when it came to emotions.","When these wolves tore into the little rabbit, what kind of tears would those smiling eyes shed?","Lin Qing swallowed hard, unable to resist speaking up: \"Qiao Chuchu, choose one.\"","Qiao Chuchu snapped out of her thoughts: \"Choose what?\"","Lin Qing rubbed her hands together mischievously: \"Choose a home, choose where you'll stay.\"","Pei Youchuan immediately grasped Chuchu's wrist protectively: \"She doesn't need to choose—she's coming home with us. Lin Qing, stop stirring up trouble!\"","Lou Tingsi placed his hand over his heart: \"Chuchu, I don't know what you like, but how about this—spend a day with my son, and I'll give you a motorcycle. You know how to race, right? I can get you a custom one.\"","Lin Shen also felt the tension rising: \"Chuchu, come stay at my place. I can check if your drawing skills have improved.\"","Weisheng Yucan gave Weisheng Huailing a quick glance!","Close the door!","Release my brother!","Weisheng Huailing stood in front of Qiao Chuchu with watery eyes: \"Chuchu, can you come stay at my house? Give my brother and me a chance?\"","He then took out his phone, typed something, and played the voice message: \"Give me a chance, brothers. I want her.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","Pei Youchuan's anger flared instantly: \"? What do you mean you want her? What identity are you claiming to take her?\"","Lou Tingsi chuckled: \"Don't act so innocent, Huailing. I know you secretly smoke and drink.\"","Lin Shen's sense of crisis grew stronger: \"Chuchu, come with me!\"","Pei Buxian, with a stern face, tried to snatch her: \"Qiao Chuchu, come home!\"","Lou Tingsi grabbed Qiao Chuchu by the arm!","Huailing grabbed her other arm!","Lin Shen grabbed her wrist!","Qiao Chuchu: \"???????????\"","[What's going on? Why are they fighting over me?!?]","Just as she was about to speak, a loud bang echoed through the air—","\"BOOM!!!\"","Everyone was startled and instinctively pulled Qiao Chuchu behind them.","Qiao Chuchu was squeezed behind a wall of men, all towering between 6'1\" and 6'3\".","...","She couldn't see anything!","Could these tall guys respect her height, please!","She pushed her way through them and stood in the middle, looking toward the source of the noise.","Across two lanes of traffic, a car was dented, with blood seeping out like twisted vines, flowing down the windshield.","A man lay sprawled on the roof, his arms outstretched, twisted in an unnatural position, his head resting on the window, his gaze fixed on their direction.","Qiao Chuchu stood frozen.","Who jumped off a building?","She grabbed her phone, trying to zoom in with the camera.","Pei Yuan stopped her: \"Don't look. It'll give you nightmares.\"","Qiao Chuchu was a bit dazed: \"But that outline... it looks like...\"","\"Li Jiahao,\" Lou Tingsi announced calmly after zooming in on his phone, seeing the man's deathly expression. \"He's already dead.\"","Qiao Chuchu's ears were suddenly filled with a deafening roar.","Li Jiahao?","The same Li Jiahao who was just lively and full of life?","Everyone's expressions changed as they looked toward Weisheng Yucan.","Weisheng Yucan and Huailing both zoomed in on their phones, confirming Li Jiahao's death, then shook their heads regretfully.","\"What a pity. I helped him pay off hundreds of thousands in debt, and he went and killed himself. All that money wasted,\" Weisheng Yucan said, putting away his phone, a satisfied smile on his lips. \"Such a shame.\"","Weisheng Huailing showed no emotion, coldly staring at Li Jiahao's body, his gaze sharp like a blade.","The Pei brothers exchanged glances, their eyes filled with unspoken messages.","Lin Qing and Lin Shen looked at each other, their faces grim.","Lou Tingsi, however, seemed unfazed, pocketing his phone and glancing at the Weisheng siblings.","Qiao Chuchu stood in front of everyone, watching as the police quickly arrived and moved Li Jiahao's body, covering it with a white sheet.","Her mind went blank.","[Li Jiahao, a supporting male character who was supposed to live a mundane life, is dead?!?]","[Was it murder? Or suicide?]","[Who are those black-clad men?!?]","[Why has the plot changed so drastically?! Someone who wasn't supposed to die is now dead.]","Qiao Chuchu grew increasingly panicked: [Is it because I saved Weisheng Yucan that Li Jiahao died? But this is way too fast!]","[Though the system did mention that the supporting characters now have the power to change their fate.]","The \"supporting characters\" raised their eyebrows, watching the crowd gather across the street, their eyes gleaming with hidden intentions.","The so-called \"power to change fate\"—wasn't it Qiao Chuchu herself?","Weisheng Yucan, Huailing, and Lou Tingsi looked at Qiao Chuchu, their eyes openly filled with ambition.","Lin Qing and Lin Shen frowned, staring at Qiao Chuchu with determination.","The seven Pei brothers kept a wary eye on these families, defending their territory.","Each person had their own hidden motives, gazing at Qiao Chuchu's back.","She stood in the light, in front of all of them, her silhouette framed by a golden halo.","Qiao Chuchu turned to look at them.","Her eyes, reflecting the light, and her red nose gave the impression that she had been crying.","\"I want to go home.\"","Everyone was momentarily stunned, then, coming to their senses, nodded in unison."]},{"number":58,"title":"Chapter 58: The Microbe Family","paragraphs":["Outside of the Wei Sheng Family, the remaining three families all lived in the same area.","Qiao Chuchu was listless. After getting out of the car, she went straight back to her room.","Pei Yuan walked up to Lou Tingsi and asked directly, \"You said you'd tell us who kidnapped Qiao Chuchu after we saw her, but we were interrupted by the Wei Sheng Clan when we met her. Now you can tell us, right?\"","The other brothers of the Pei family gathered around to listen.","Lou Tingsi, with his hands in his pockets, said lazily, \"I found out, and I didn't find out. It's indeed an organization that specializes in this kind of work. I didn't find any connection between Ji Yanchuan and them. Ji Yanchuan didn't transfer money to them, and they didn't have any overseas remittances. It's likely that Ji Yanchuan found someone to handle it indirectly, without leaving any traces.\"","At this point, Lou Tingsi shrugged nonchalantly, \"People in our circle never get their hands dirty. Obviously, Ji Yanchuan is also wary of you.\"","Pei Yuan's gaze darkened, \"Give me the contact information of that bunch of scumbags.\"","\"I've already sent someone to clean up,\" Lou Tingsi said with a fox-like smile, \"I'm quite adept at this kind of thing. Besides, since I've joined you, I should show some sincerity.\"","Pei Yuan narrowed his eyes, \"What if you let them slip?\"","\"Ha!\" Lou Tingsi laughed disdainfully, \"I'll have evidence to prove I didn't let them go. Moreover, Qiao Chuchu's life is much more important. She's the key to my son's and my survival.\"","Pei Yuan said coldly, \"True. If you harm Qiao Chuchu, you're digging your own grave.\"","He continued to ask, \"Was Li Jiahao's case done by Weisheng Yucan?\"","Lou Tingsi's eyes flickered, and he said with a chuckle, \"The reports said Li Jiahao committed suicide. He even called his family and wrote a suicide note before he died. So, I suggest we don't doubt it.\"","\"But there's one thing,\" Lou Tingsi said confidently, \"I'm sure the siblings of the Wei Sheng Clan can hear Qiao Chuchu's thoughts.\"","Pei Yuan: \"...\"","Lou Tingsi smiled, but his eyes didn't reach his smile, \"The Wei Sheng Clan is the most prominent among our families. Their family of five is ruthless and decisive, leaving no loose ends. Each of them is a god in their own territory. They despise each other's personalities and ways of handling things, always mocking each other when they meet, but they appear extremely united in front of outsiders.\"","Lou Tingsi's smile turned cold, \"If they want to take Qiao Chuchu and find us in their way, they might just kill us. So, it's advisable not to confront them head-on. Maintain surface relationships; otherwise, we'll all be dead, and this game will lose its meaning.\"","Pei Yuan narrowed his eyes, \"Even with your power, do they dare to kill you?\"","Lou Tingsi sighed, expressing his helplessness, \"Having too much is always tempting. Just like Qiao Chuchu holding the script of our lives, she has many scripts, and she remembers all the details of every character. She holds our lives in her hands.\"","As Lou Tingsi spoke, his interest grew, and his tone inevitably rose, \"Protecting her should be our top priority. Be careful of the Wei Sheng Clan; you never know what they might do.\"","Pei Yuan's face darkened as he thought of Weisheng Yucan's cunning demeanor and Weisheng Huailing's enigmatic smile. He clenched his fists in worry.","The worst scenario he feared had happened so soon.","More people had appeared who could hear Qiao Chuchu's thoughts.","And these people were unpredictable, unknown in their allegiances, and undoubtedly dangerous.","-","Weisheng Huailing stood by the window, engrossed in a comic book.","Someone lightly patted his shoulder.","He turned around to see four men standing behind him.","All dressed in sharp suits, impeccably dressed, and exuding an extraordinary aura.","He smiled casually, sitting on the windowsill and swinging the comic book in his hand.","\"Qiao Chuchu's comic. It's pretty good.\"","Weisheng Yucan slightly raised her head and said to the three men beside her, \"I've already told you everything. What are your plans?\"","Elder Brother's tone was cold, \"I don't believe it.\"","Second Brother sneered, \"What era are we in? Still believing in such feudal superstition? You're not going to start fasting and chanting like Fourth Brother, are you?\"","Fourth Brother played with his prayer beads and taunted, \"Third Sister, you should stop messing around with men. Love and affection are not for you. Look at you, indulging in pleasure, and now you're so delusional you're hearing things.\"","Yucan didn't care, \"I know you don't believe me, but both I and Little Five can hear Qiao Chuchu's voice. Even Little Five, who has never heard a voice before, could directly understand her when her voice reached his mind. It's nothing short of a medical miracle.\"","Huailing signed, his eyes and brows filled with satisfaction, \"Her voice is very pleasant. I look forward to hearing her think my name.\"","Elder Brother sneered, \"Then let's do a little test. Kidnap her here and scare her a bit.\"","Yucan asked curiously, \"How do we scare her?\"","Elder Brother said calmly, \"Ask her if she thinks Li Jiahao's death is related to us. Force her to report it and test her character. At the same time, check if she's really as you say—if her thoughts can be heard by us 'supporting characters.'\"","Yucan's eyes lit up, and she smiled contentedly, \"Huailing.\"","Huailing had been reading their lips and roughly understood what they meant.","Yucan ordered, \"Go do it.\"","Huailing smiled happily and left.","-","Qiao Chuchu woke up from her sleep, vaguely realizing she was sitting in a chair.","Her head was covered by something.","Was it a dream?","She wanted to remove the black hood over her head, but her hands were bound by ropes.","Qiao Chuchu was stunned and tried to pull hard!","She couldn't move!","She became more terrified, her drowsiness instantly disappearing. She struggled with all her might on the chair!","Her hands and feet were trapped.","She was restrained!","Qiao Chuchu's breathing suddenly became rapid as she thought of the incident today where she almost got assaulted.","Was it that gang again who wanted to rape her?","But they had already been caught!","Could it be that the person behind the scenes was seeking revenge?","A deep male voice sounded, \"Stop moving. Just answer the questions properly; we won't do anything to you.\"","Qiao Chuchu opened her mouth.","The man cut her off coldly, \"Don't ask stupid questions like who we are or who sent us.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","[What the hell! What kind of life do I have?! My day has been so full of misfortune! I've done plenty of good deeds too!]","The man was stunned and shook his head.","What was that noise?!","Weisheng Yucan sat across from Qiao Chuchu, smiling faintly as she looked at her shocked brothers on either side and signed, \"Can you hear her thoughts, right?\"","Huailing teased his brothers.","The three men were shocked, staring at the tightly bound Qiao Chuchu.","They really could hear her.","Second Brother cleared his throat, suppressing his surprise, \"I'll ask you. Was Li Jiahao killed by Weisheng Yucan?\"","Qiao Chuchu was puzzled, \"You can't say that without evidence.\"","Second Brother was displeased, \"I'm asking you!\"","Qiao Chuchu trembled, \"Of course not! The reports said he committed suicide. Although the logic doesn't add up, I wouldn't slander someone. Maybe someone else killed him.\"","A dagger suddenly pointed at her throat!","The cold, sharp pain pierced through her skin!","Second Brother threatened her sinisterly, \"Think again, carefully.\"","Qiao Chuchu was feeling wronged, \"Brother, I really don't think so. I don't know the details, and I wouldn't speculate about someone without evidence. Sister Yucan even gave him money, who would give money and then kill someone? She's not that stupid!\"","Yucan: \"...\"","Qiao Chuchu felt exhausted, \"I have no evidence, and neither do you, but I believe you're a good person. Please let me go!~\"","[What's wrong with this guy?! I've already said I don't know, yet he keeps asking! Do you think I'm a petty person who would falsely accuse someone without evidence?!](I really want to jump up and smash the chair over his head, like a superman, and kick him up into the tree branches!)","Second Brother: \"?\""]},{"number":59,"title":"Chapter 59: Wei Sheng Yuchan and Her Four Useless Brothers","paragraphs":["Second Brother glared dangerously at Qiao Chuchu, narrowing his eyes.","From a young age, he had never been scolded by anyone.","He exerted force with the knife in his hand, trying to provoke a bleeding wound.","Suddenly, a hand emerged from the shadows, flicked open the dagger in his hand, and firmly grasped it.","Second Brother followed the dagger's trajectory and met Huai Ling's furious gaze.","Huai Ling angrily signed, \"If you can't handle it, get lost!\"","Second Brother was stunned and laughed angrily, \"She cursed at me.\"","\"So what if she cursed at you?\" Huai Ling mocked, sizing him up and down. \"Are you untouchable?\"","Fourth Brother twirled the beads of his Buddhist rosary and casually interjected, \"Brother, what my younger brother said is right. Why are you throwing sand while playing? Isn't this kind of thing normal?\"","Some people may appear to be your friends, but in secret, they might even kill you. It's not uncommon at all.","Fourth Brother looked interestedly at Qiao Chuchu, \"Isn't this kind of transparent thought also a good thing?\"","He continued signing, \"Besides, can you control what others think? Can you guarantee you don't curse in your mind? Moreover, she doesn't know who you are. If she knew, she probably wouldn't curse at you.\"","Second Brother was somewhat swayed but still felt uneasy, turning to Weisheng Yucan and Elder Brother.","Weisheng Yucan sneered disdainfully, \"You're such a trash. Can't even handle such a small matter. You kidnapped her, she's obedient on the surface, but curses you in her heart. What's the problem with that?\"","Second Brother: \"Did she curse at you?\"","Yucan shook his head, his eyes and brows brimming with pride, \"Her thoughts have always been praising me. Otherwise, she wouldn't have saved me.\"","Second Brother looked at Weisheng Huailing, \"Did she curse at you?\"","Weisheng Huailing's expression was grim, \"She praised me for being good-looking.\"","Second Brother: \"...\"","That was probably the cheapest compliment. None of the five of them were ugly.","He felt frustrated and looked at Elder Brother.","Elder Brother directly rolled his eyes at him.","Second Brother: \"...\"","Fine.","He had indeed been a bit over the top just now.","From a young age, everyone around him had treated him with utmost respect, not even daring to speak loudly. It was the first time someone had dared to curse at him.","He felt a bit guilty and tried to wipe away the red marks on Qiao Chuchu's neck.","Qiao Chuchu shuddered!","[Oh my god! What is this guy doing?! Why is he suddenly touching me with his hands! Pervert, don't touch me!!]","Weisheng Lin quickly retracted his hand.","...","This is so annoying.","Using a knife to threaten doesn't work.","Touching her doesn't work either.","Qiao Chuchu's breathing quickened, and she felt like dying: [I never thought that in these past twenty-some years, these two days seem to have used up all the kidnappings of my life! A bunch of people coming to kidnap me.]","She couldn't figure it out: [And who exactly kidnapped me without alarming me, my brother, or my family's security? Could it be some legendary professional assassin? After all, this world does have professional killers.]","Weisheng Huailing grinned, twirling the small knife in his hand, smiling ambiguously at Qiao Chuchu.","Weisheng Lin: \"?\"","He suddenly realized, \"You're not falling for her, are you?!\"","The older brothers and sisters all looked meaningfully at Weisheng Huailing.","Huai Ling's smile didn't reach his eyes, \"No.\"","He walked behind Qiao Chuchu, placing his hand on her shoulder, feeling her body reflexively shudder.","He smiled wickedly, \"She is the only voice I can hear in this world.\"","\"Her role for me is just her voice.\"","With that, Huai Ling quickly pressed the dagger against Qiao Chuchu's cheek!","Qiao Chuchu let out a gasp of surprise!","Huai Ling, like a snake, slowly pressed against her other cheek.","Qiao Chuchu wanted to dodge, but the dagger at her neck still forced her to stay.","She could only be forced to turn towards him, but he seemed to be waiting for her to come closer, directly pressing his cheek against hers.","She wanted to dodge, but the other side of her face was firmly pressed by the cold blade, making it difficult for her to breathe.","She could only endure the disgust and keep her cheek pressed against the stranger's.","Huai Ling pressed tightly against her, his smile widening, continuing to hold her with the blade's back.","Qiao Chuchu trembled even more, shrinking closer to him.","Weisheng Yucan: \"...\"","It was as if he was witnessing a python slowly driving a little rabbit into a trap.","Qiao Chuchu's heart was utterly broken: [Pure pervert! So disgusting! How dare he force me to get so close to him!]","[Luckily, this guy smells nice, with a light and elegant scent. At least he's a scoundrel who maintains personal hygiene. If it were the stench of a disgusting old man, I'd probably vomit right away.]","[...Maybe I should vomit now, throw up all over him! Let's see who gets the better of whom!]","Weisheng Huailing: \"...\"","Weisheng Yucan was amused and laughed, \"Hurry up, before this guy decides to throw something dirty on us, let's get to the main point.\"","Weisheng Lin nodded, stepping on Qiao Chuchu's chair, \"I ask you, did you see Weisheng Yucan today?\"","Qiao Chuchu was puzzled, \"Yes, I saw her.\"","Weisheng Lin sneered, \"Then how was her attitude towards you?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"It was... pretty good.\"","[Why are they asking me these questions? Every sentence revolves around the Weisheng family. Could they be rivals?]","Weisheng Lin chuckled softly, \"I know you saved Weisheng Yucan's life today. You're quite warm-hearted.\"","Qiao Chuchu's voice trembled with fear, \"Whether my heart is warm or not, I'm not so sure anymore. After all, if you kill me, I'll be cold-hearted.\"","\"I won't kill you,\" Weisheng Lin teased, \"You saved Weisheng Yucan, she must be very grateful to you, with no defenses against you. How about this, you help me with a favor, and I'll let you go today, never to come back. What do you say?\"","Qiao Chuchu was suspicious, \"What favor?\"","Weisheng Lin: \"Help me kill Weisheng Yucan.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"What?!?\"","She couldn't accept it, \"Why don't you ask me to get rid of the Tang Monk and his disciples?!\"","Weisheng Lin: \"...\"","Weisheng Yucan: \"...\"","Huai Ling: \"...\"","Weisheng Lin's mouth twitched, feeling very speechless, \"All I want is Weisheng Yucan's life. Will you do it or not?\"","Qiao Chuchu hesitated for a moment, tentatively asking, \"If I do it, will you let me go now?\"","Weisheng Lin: \"Of course.\"","Qiao Chuchu didn't hesitate, \"Then I'll do it!\"","Once I'm safe, I'll immediately warn Sister Yucan that someone wants to kill her. For now, I need to save my life. Even if I have a chance to be reborn, I can't waste it. After all, this world is trying to kill me too. I have to survive until the end!","Oh?","The five of them raised their eyebrows.","She has a chance to be reborn?","The world is trying to kill her?","Weisheng Lin finally became interested, \"How do I know you're not just perfunctory with me, lying to me? Once you get the chance, you might tell Weisheng Yucan.\"","Qiao Chuchu was extremely sincere, \"I definitely won't say anything! You were able to kidnap me without a trace, you must be professionals. If I say anything, wouldn't that be asking for trouble?\"","[Grandpa, I'll drive straight to Yucan's house as soon as I'm out! Warn her about your plans! I don't believe that with Yucan's intelligence and decisiveness, she can't catch you. Then Grandpa Qiao will play \"Summer\" by Kikuchi on the suona at your grave!]","Weisheng Lin: \"...\"","Yucan sister's intelligence and decisiveness?","Is Qiao Chuchu exaggerating so much about Yucan?","They silently looked at Weisheng Yucan.","Yucan placed her hands on her chest, proudly nodding to everyone.","Yes, it's her.","She is the smart, charming, and decisive female boss, Sister Yucan, in Qiao Chuchu's heart.","Weisheng Lin laughed angrily, continuing to scare Qiao Chuchu, \"I tell you, I'll be monitoring your relationship with Weisheng Yucan. As soon as you tell Weisheng Yucan, we'll know.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"Ah... don't worry, I definitely won't say anything.\"","This is a bit tricky. If I'm being monitored with Sister Yucan, who can I turn to?","Although there are five big bosses in the Weisheng family, the smartest one is Sister Yucan.","[The others are weak as scum, I don't know if they'll understand me, maybe they'll even kick me out.]","[After all, it's Weisheng Yucan and four useless brothers.]","Weisheng Lin: \"?\"","Weisheng Huailing: \"?\"","Fourth Brother, twirling the Buddhist prayer beads: \"?\"","Elder Brother, watching coldly from the sidelines: \"?\""]},{"number":60,"title":"Chapter 60: Microbial Silk: I Want to Hear Qiao Chuchu Call My Name in Her Heart","paragraphs":["Weisheng Yucan, seated in the VIP section, raised her hot water cup silently in a toast to Qiao Chuchu.","Qiao Chuchu, completely unaware, began to daydream like a naive rookie.","【It's not like I'm wrong about those four, after all, after Weisheng Yucan died, they all seemed to lose their intelligence one by one, each taking turns to throw themselves at Ji Yanchuan.】","【The specifics aren't clear in the plot, just a vague description, but overall, after Weisheng Yucan's death, the Wei Sheng Clan started to create trouble one after another.】","【First Old Five, then Fourth Brother, Old Three, and finally Old One.】","【Old One seemed to have some substance, but by then, all his brothers were dead, leaving him a lone commander, eventually dying from being utterly humiliated by the male lead.】","Old One: \"?\"","He was humiliated to death?!","His brothers teased him with amused glances.","Usually, he was a cold, icy mountain of a man, unapproachable by anyone, yet it turns out he had quite the temper, enough to be humiliated to death! ~","Hahahahahaha! ~","Qiao Chuchu squinted, 【Old Five tried to run Ji Yanchuan over, but was counterattacked and killed by Ji Yanchuan.】","Weisheng Huailing: \"?\"","His brothers teased him again.","Weren't you a top mercenary? Weren't you supposed to complete any tricky task for your employer stealthily? How could you get counterattacked while trying to run someone over?","Weisheng Huailing: \"......\"","【Fourth Brother seemed to have fallen in love with Xia Xuechun, planning a kidnapping romance, but was discovered by Ji Yanchuan. The two fought on a cliffside, and Fourth Brother lost his footing, falling off the cliff and smashing to pieces.】","Weisheng Huailing suddenly brightened up, looking joyfully at Fourth Brother.","His brothers also sneered at Fourth Brother.","Weren't you a cold, Buddha-like figure? Weren't you a vegetarian who practiced Buddhism? How could you fall for a woman Ji Yanchuan was interested in? Isn't that laughable?","Fourth Brother's mouth twitched, his nose almost twisting in anger.","Was he that pathetic? Dying for love?","Qiao Chuchu continued thinking: [Second Brother's death was more dramatic. With his brothers and sister dead, he followed the clues to investigate, uncovering that Xia Xuechun had killed his sister and Ji Yanchuan had killed his brother. Since these two were a couple, he took matters into his own hands, with a resolute and unyielding heart, seeking revenge, severely injuring Xia Xuechun and Ji Yanchuan. However, in the end, the couple was rescued, and Second Brother was beaten to death by their timely reinforcements.]","Weisheng Lin: \"......\"","His brothers' expressions changed as they looked at Weisheng Lin.","It was something the righteous and loyal Weisheng Lin would do.","Very tragic.","They gave him a thumbs up.","Weisheng Lin blushed, mumbling as he turned his head away.","He was just very concerned about the family's honor!","Old One's face turned even greener.","Looking at it this way, among them, only his death was the most humiliating.","Qiao Chuchu felt the dead silence in the air and inwardly fumed.","【In any case, no matter what happens to me, I will not harm the members of the Wei Sheng Clan! They are just living their own lives, so why should I hurt them!】","【Moreover, Yu Can and Huailing are both quite nice, I won't do anything ungrateful!】","Everyone was astonished, their eyes on Qiao Chuchu instantly filled with unnoticeable approval.","Weisheng Yucan's eyes flashed with killing intent: \"You heard it, right? We are all supporting characters meant to be stepping stones for Ji Yanchuan. Our endings are all death. I won't let all my efforts be handed over to someone else.\"","Weisheng Lin scoffed: \"Just kill Ji Yanchuan and Xia Xuechun, the masterminds, directly, isn't that enough?\"","Huailing shook his head: \"I sent people to deal with Xia Xuechun, but all my men got injured.\"","Everyone: \"?\"","Huailing explained: \"They said it was eerie. The daggers they threw backfired and injured themselves.\"","Yu Can smiled, her eyes flashing with anger: \"They are the protagonists, and we, along with Qiao Chuchu and others, are the supporting characters. Before the 'ending' arrives, they will survive because the protagonists have a halo. That's why when you go after them, you end up dead.\"","Weisheng Lin laughed in anger: \"After living so hard for so many years, I thought I was the crown prince, but now you're telling me I'm a villainous supporting character in the protagonist's story? What's the point of our existence?\"","Fourth Brother: \"Sacrifice.\"","Everyone frowned.","Fourth Brother strung his Buddhist beads on his wrist, expressionless: \"Our clan exists to sacrifice for Ji Yanchuan, making him stronger.\"","...","They all sank into gloomy expressions.","Old One's eyes gleamed: \"Xia Xuechun and Ji Yanchuan can't be killed, at least not now. Qiao Chuchu is the key to us controlling everything. Keeping her close is safer for us.\"","Yu Can: \"Qiao Chuchu's brothers and the Lin siblings, as well as the Lou father and son, are all very attached to her. I suspect they can also hear her thoughts.\"","Weisheng Lin was shocked: \"So, there's a bunch of people fighting over this one woman?\"","Old One said sternly: \"Then kill them and take Qiao Chuchu.\"","Weisheng Huailing suddenly became alert: \"No! Those are her family and friends!\"","Yu Can nodded, also opposing the idea: \"Qiao Chuchu saved my life. She would save yours too. Are we going to bite the hand that feeds us?\"","Old One crossed his legs, lazily glancing at Qiao Chuchu with his phoenix-like eyes: \"Then leave her alone, but we need to get close to her. After all, we need to know when we're going to meet our end.\"","Weisheng Lin sighed: \"We don't have time to get close to her every day. I'm busy enough as it is.\"","Fourth Brother shrugged: \"Then make a plan, and we'll deal with the rest later.\"","Weisheng Yucan nodded: \"Send her back.\"","Huailing agreed, walking behind Qiao Chuchu and gesturing to Second Brother: \"I want to hear my name.\"","Weisheng Lin: \"?\"","Huailing blinked expectantly: \"Make her silently think my name.\"","Qiao Chuchu, in this dead silence, was almost falling asleep.","【What's going on? Why is there no movement at all? Just tell me if you're going to kill or spare me!】","Her shoulders were once again placed on by a pair of hands.","Qiao Chuchu jumped in fright, becoming alert.","Weisheng Lin spoke in a low voice: \"Qiao Chuchu, do you know who Weisheng Yucan's brother is?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"......Yes.\"","Weisheng Lin: \"Think it in your heart, don't say it out loud.\"","【......Weisheng Huailing?】","Weisheng Huailing's eyes widened, his cheeks instantly turning an unnatural red, the veins on his neck faintly visible, his fingertips trembling.","It was his name!","His name!","He understood!","His brothers looked at him with disgust, feeling he had reached some kind of peak of excitement.","...What a strange fetish.","Weisheng Lin's eyes rolled, he grinned wickedly and said to Qiao Chuchu: \"That's Weisheng Huailing, remember, stay away from him.\"","Weisheng Huailing: \"?\"","He quickly knocked Qiao Chuchu unconscious, angrily questioning Weisheng Lin: \"What are you doing?!\""]},{"number":61,"title":"Chapter 61: The \"Favorites\" of the Big Shots Officially Take Office","paragraphs":["Weisheng Lin wore a mischievous grin, clearly enjoying his prank: \"I was just teasing you two.\"","Huai Ling grabbed him by the collar!","Yu Can frowned: \"Huai Ling, hurry up and take him back! Don't wait for her to wake up again! And erase their surveillance footage, don't leave any traces.\"","Huai Ling shot a fierce glare at Weisheng Lin, untied Qiao Chuchu's ropes, and carried her away.","Weisheng Lin laughed gleefully: \"Look at him, acting like such a sourpuss. Teasing him is as fun as teasing a dog.\"","Yu Can looked disgusted: \"Stop picking on Little Five all the time.\"","Weisheng Lin shrugged nonchalantly: \"He's the youngest in our family, and a boy at that. Who else am I supposed to pick on?\"","The fourth brother spoke with a knowing tone: \"You claim to bully your younger brother on the surface, but in reality, you'll avenge us after we're gone. Weisheng Lin, you're quite the decent guy, huh?\"","The eldest brother smirked.","Weisheng Lin blushed, mumbling in embarrassment: \"Well, that's because I'm tougher than any of you. What do you know?\"","Yu Can, hearing this, couldn't help but laugh: \"After hearing Qiao Chuchu's account of our endings, I suddenly realized that as long as we're together, we're happy.\"","Everyone looked at her.","Yu Can mused: \"If it weren't for Qiao Chuchu, I would have died today, and you all would have in the future. But it was Qiao Chuchu, and she was willing to help me, which is why we have this chance to turn things around. I need to thank her, so I won't harm her family or friends, and neither should you.\"","The other three lowered their eyes, lost in thought.","Weisheng Lin was the first to speak up: \"Don't worry, Third Sister. I'll treat her well too. The next time I see her, I'll get to know her properly and never be harsh with her again.\"","Everyone looked at him in surprise.","The fourth brother was the most astonished: \"Wow, I never thought Weisheng Lin's dog mouth could spit out ivory.\"","Weisheng Lin: \"?\"","-","Huai Ling placed Qiao Chuchu on the bed and applied some blood-activating and bruise-healing ointment to her wrists.","He turned on the bedside lamp and gestured toward her.","\"Hello, I'm Weisheng Huailing. It's a pleasure to meet you.\"","He smirked, confident: \"I look forward to seeing you again.\"","Qiao Chuchu snuggled under the blankets and fell into a deep sleep.","When she woke up with a start and sat up in bed, it was already morning.","Qiao Chuchu sat dazedly, looking around the room and examining her hands.","There were no signs of being bound, and the room was empty.","Had last night's ordeal been a dream?","Qiao Chuchu picked up her phone and checked the outdoor surveillance from last night.","No one had entered or left, and she hadn't been kidnapped.","...","It really was a dream.","Qiao Chuchu let out a long sigh of relief, feeling much better.","Thank goodness it wasn't real; otherwise, she'd be utterly disgusted, especially since there was a creep getting up close and personal with her.","\"Knock knock knock.\" The door was gently knocked, and Little Xie's voice followed: \"Miss Qiao, are you up?\"","Qiao Chuchu responded, then rolled back into bed: \"Come in.\"","Little Xie pushed the door open, followed by a stream of well-dressed salespeople wheeling in several clothing racks.","Qiao Chuchu sat up in bed, bewildered, as they filed in.","The racks were filled with the latest seasonal collections from top brands.","Each salesperson smiled at her: \"Excuse us, Miss Qiao, we're here to deliver the latest season's collection on behalf of Madame Weisheng.\"","Qiao Chuchu was stunned: \"Madame Weisheng?\"","The salesperson smiled: \"Yes, we've brought models with similar body types and skin tones to try on the clothes for you.\"","Qiao Chuchu clutched the blanket, flustered, as several girls of the same height as her walked in, dressed in the outfits, and lined up in front of her.","The salesperson smiled like a flower: \"Please choose, Miss Qiao.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"I don't need—\"","\"Madame Weisheng said that if you can't decide, we'll just give them all to you. If you don't like them, you can give them away or throw them out. But you must choose at least four, for good luck and good fortune.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?????\"","So forceful?!","She looked at the models and hesitated: \"Then I'll take this one, this one, this one, and this one.\"","The salesperson smiled: \"Very well.\"","She clapped her hands, and another batch of models walked in.","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","How many people are waiting in my house for me to look at?!","After selecting a pile of clothes, the salespeople finally left.","But another group arrived, this time with bags.","\"Miss Qiao, these are the bags selected by Mr. Weisheng Huailing. Please take a look.\"","Qiao Chuchu's eyes widened.","All of them were made of crocodile leather.","And there were several colors of the LV Sahara.","She noticed the key detail: \"Wait, did Weisheng Huailing send these bags?\"","The staff smiled: \"Yes, if there's no problem, we'll place these bags in your wardrobe.\"","Little Xie led them into the wardrobe, where they arranged the bags before leaving.","Left alone, Qiao Chuchu sat on the bed, utterly bewildered: \"...\"","She first went to wash up, then walked into the wardrobe, where her already full room was now filled with beautiful crocodile leather bags.","Under the natural light of the cabinet, they all sparkled.","Little Xie knocked on her door again: \"Miss Qiao, someone sent you flowers.\"","Qiao Chuchu stepped out of the wardrobe to see Little Xie approaching with a bouquet of black and white flowers.","The bouquet, besides the full and delicate white roses, also included several Chanel perfume boxes interspersed, all in black and yellow, exuding a high-end vibe.","She unfolded the card to find elegant running script.","[Wishing you a new day where you forget all the unpleasantness and have a happy day every day! — Lou Yuejue, always supporting you.]","Qiao Chuchu was surprised: \"Lou Yuejue sent these flowers?\"","He was such a gentle child?","Little Xie suddenly remembered something: \"Oh, right!\"","She placed the bouquet aside and picked up a stack of shoeboxes from the door, piling them high like a small mountain, wobbling as she brought them to Qiao Chuchu: \"These are from Miss Lin Qing and Mr. Lin Shen.\"","Qiao Chuchu was even more shocked: \"...And shoes?\"","Clothes, bags, flowers weren't enough.","There were even shoes?","Little Xie nodded: \"All in your size! Miss Lin Qing and Mr. Lin Shen picked them out for you early this morning.\"","Little Xie giggled: \"But Miss Lin Qing said that Mr. Lin Shen picked out flats, while she chose heels, so they're easy to tell apart.\"","Qiao Chuchu took the boxes and opened one to reveal a pair of Valentino's nude pink high heels.","Little Xie exclaimed: \"So beautiful! You'll look stunning in them!~\"","Qiao Chuchu liked them too, quickly opening the second box.","It was a pair of Gucci's chunky loafers!","Little Xie was delighted: \"These must be from Mr. Lin Shen! They said they'll be busy with work and might not have much time to hang out with you, so they sent you these gifts to make you happy!\"","Little Xie was genuinely happy for her: \"Are you happy?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","Looking at the overflowing gifts, a strange fear crept over her: \"Can I say I'm scared?\"","Little Xie: \"?\""]},{"number":62,"title":"Chapter 62: The Fearful Xie","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu's fear stemmed from the fact that she was supposed to be dead. With the plot back on track, there was no place for a dead person like her.","But she didn't die. Not only did she disrupt the flow of the story, but a group of supporting characters who were doomed to suffer in the novel had all come to gift her presents.","She truly felt like the beloved pet of a family.","Apart from the joy, there was an overwhelming sense of horror.","Did she deserve so many people gifting her presents?","Qiao Chuchu pondered deeply but soon dismissed her worries, deciding not to overthink.","Why worry about so many things? If everyone was kind to her, she would be kind to them in return. She would strive to help them escape their fates as supporting characters, allowing them to live well and enjoy life!","Suddenly, Little Xie's phone rang.","Little Xie's phone screen had a cracked corner, and the touch sensitivity wasn't great. She tapped the screen several times with force to open WeChat and see what was written. When replying, she had to tap several more times to send the message.","Qiao Chuchu couldn't help but notice her actions: \"Is something wrong?\"","Little Xie shook her head: \"Mr. Pei San asked me to prepare his special dinner tonight.\"","Immediately after, her phone rang again.","Little Xie glanced at it, realizing it wasn't someone she could answer for. She quickly hung up.","One of the rules at the Pei Family was that when the employer was present and one had work to do, personal calls couldn't be answered. Calls could only be taken after finishing work and leaving the employer's hearing range.","Yet, the phone kept ringing.","Little Xie had to keep hanging up, but as soon as she did, it rang again within a minute. This repeated multiple times, making Little Xie sweat profusely. She wanted to silence the phone but was afraid Mr. Pei or others might call at that moment, so she had to glance at it and then hang up.","Qiao Chuchu was busy unpacking gifts: \"Go ahead and answer the call.\"","Little Xie panicked and shook her head: \"No need, Miss. It's just a call from my family. It's nothing.\"","She helped Qiao Chuchu unpack the boxes, her heart pounding. She glanced at Qiao Chuchu out of the corner of her eye, fearing she might get angry.","It was only because Miss Qiao was easygoing. If it were any of the Pei brothers, a single glare would have been enough to get her fired.","Yes, the Pei Family paid well, but the Pei family members were like that—no room for error.","They didn't care if you were tired, busy with work, or even if you had a personal life, were sick, or anything. If you didn't meet their expectations, they could dismiss you on the spot.","In other words, the Pei brothers never liked wasting time on trivial matters of strangers. Once you did, you were out.","She was the only one among her batch of fellow housekeepers who hadn't been fired yet.","Little Xie nervously tidied up the gifts.","After a while, the phone vibrated again.","She picked it up and saw, on her cracked screen, the word \"Mom.\"","Qiao Chuchu sighed: \"Go ahead and answer it. What if it's something important?\"","Little Xie's face turned pale. She could only pick up the phone: \"Sorry, Miss. I'll be right back.\"","Little Xie left for a short while, then nervously ran back to Qiao Chuchu: \"Miss Qiao, I'm done. Let me unpack for you. You can rest.\"","Qiao Chuchu sat on the sofa, glancing at the half-exposed phone in Little Xie's pocket: \"Why is your phone broken? Can you even read messages fully with it like this?\"","It wasn't that she was nitpicking, but her brothers were indeed difficult to deal with. Of course, the salary at their house was also high, with the extra part serving as a mental compensation fee for the housekeepers.","After all, those seven brothers each had their own quirks. They were picky and had low tolerance for mistakes.","Little Xie nervously looked at her: \"It's fine, Miss Qiao. My phone works fine.\"","Qiao Chuchu didn't think so: \"The top left corner is cracked. You had a hard time replying just now. It's bound to break sooner or later. If you delay anything, my brothers won't care about your reasons. They'll just fire you.\"","Little Xie's face turned increasingly pale: \"...\"","She knew the bad tempers of the other seven employers.","She had once seen Pei Yuan demand a cup of coffee, but the housekeeper was busy and delivered it ten minutes late. Pei Yuan immediately had her pack her things and leave, not giving anyone a chance to improve.","If she got fired over a broken phone, she would lose her good job, and finding another one would be troublesome.","Little Xie nervously twisted the hem of her apron: \"Miss Qiao, there are only me and another housekeeper working at home right now. We can't leave. I'll buy a phone as soon as I have time. Please don't tell the Pei brothers, okay? The New Year is coming soon, and I can't lose my job. I can assure you I definitely won't delay my work. The Pei brothers' messages, I'll definitely see them!\"","Qiao Chuchu was surprised. She didn't expect Little Xie to be so nervous after her simple reminder.","She explained: \"I didn't mean to tell my brothers.\"","Little Xie bit her lower lip, squatting on the ground looking at her with a wronged and pitiful expression, still in fear.","Qiao Chuchu, feeling helpless, changed the subject: \"Your mom kept calling you. Is something wrong?\"","Little Xie awkwardly twisted her fingers: \"Today is my birthday. She wanted me to have something nice to eat.\"","Qiao Chuchu was surprised: \"Then why don't you take the day off and go home? If my brothers don't approve, I can let you go now.\"","Little Xie shook her head vigorously: \"It's almost New Year, right? Mr. Pei said that if we don't go home, we get triple overtime pay. I earn three thousand a day now. I don't want to go home. I want to make money!\"","Her voice was tinged with disappointment: \"So please don't tell the Pei brothers about my broken phone. I really won't delay my work.\"","\"I already said I wouldn't tell,\" Qiao Chuchu stood up and said indifferently, \"You handle it. I'm going out.\"","Little Xie panicked: \"Where are you going, Miss? Mr. Pei said you need to report when you go out. Mr. Pei Buxian is coming back this afternoon and told me to make sure you don't go out.\"","Qiao Chuchu rolled her eyes.","Another attempt to monitor her, huh?","She walked to the wardrobe, changed into a simple outfit, grabbed her bag, and left: \"I'll have the driver take me. That's my report to my brothers. Don't worry.\"","Little Xie watched Qiao Chuchu leave, feeling like a deflated balloon.","She labeled Qiao Chuchu's shoes and placed them neatly in the wardrobe, tears welling up in her eyes.","She didn't know much about Qiao Chuchu; the employer's profile only had a blank space for her.","After these few days of interaction, she found Miss Qiao easy to talk to, but she was also wary.","After all, the Pei Family had three people who seemed nice on the surface: Pei Youchuan, Pei Mu, and Pei Ci.","They appeared gentle and kind, deceiving many people. Only when their true nature was revealed did others realize they were also ruthless characters.","The Pei Family was a wealthy clan. How could a young lady raised in such a family not have some quirks?","She finished her work, took out her broken phone, and snapped a photo of the discarded shoeboxes, typing forcefully on the screen.","[My phone is broken. It's hard to reply and type, but I don't have time to take leave and buy a new one. Then the eighth young lady saw it and asked if it would affect my work.]","[The worst part is, while tidying up the eighth young lady's shoes, my mom kept calling. We can't answer personal calls during work. I had to keep hanging up, but she kept calling. I think the eighth young lady is getting annoyed.]","[Sobbing... I'm so scared the eighth young lady will fire me. What will I do if I get fired?]"]},{"number":63,"title":"Chapter 63: Praying for Xiao Xie's Blessing through Shamanic Dance, Hoping the Eighth Young Lady Doesn't Open Her","paragraphs":["Little Xie wiped her tears while sending the message out.","Soon, the comment section was flooded with over 99 comments.","「Go buy it, ask Little Shi to deliver it for you!」","Little Xie was crying in the housekeeping staff's breakroom, replying:【No, our staff's packages can't be delivered here. If they find out, I'll definitely get fired.】","「...I don't quite understand. If you get fired, so what? Is it that hard to find a job? Aren't you a college graduate? Why do you have to humble yourself and work such a job? What's the difference between that and being a servant? Why not find a more respectable job?」","Of course, before Little Xie could respond, her fan group had already stepped in to counter:「The blogger earns 30,000 a month, with five insurances and one fund included. Can you guarantee she'll earn 30,000 elsewhere?」","「The Qing Dynasty has been gone for how many years now? It's not like she's serving on her knees every day or working in the red-light district. She's earning an honest living, so why call her a servant?」","「I'm working myself to death every day, feeling like I'm about to collapse, and I don't even earn as much as the blogger! Mortgage, car loan, daily expenses, even medical bills—where isn't money needed? To just say 'get fired' so lightly, you make it sound so easy!」","「Do you know the blogger's family situation? How dare you judge so arrogantly? Are jobs divided by high and low status?」","「Blogger, if you lose your job, send me your address, I'll take your place. [Dog face]」","「Don't worry, I'll take your place too. I already have seven young masters and one beautiful Miss Eight to support!」","\"Everyone, stop stimulating the blogger. She mentioned she's from a single-parent family, her dad died in an accident when she was young. Her grandma took the compensation money and kicked her and her mom out. She was raised by her mom alone. Her mom, with no education, worked hard to raise her. Now her mom can't do physical labor anymore and only earns a few thousand a month by working in the kitchen, peeling vegetables. They don't even own a house and live in rented places, relying entirely on the blogger to support the family.\"","「That's right, the blogger is very filial. She once said she took this housekeeping job because it pays well and is stable. She doesn't need to work her way up; she can earn right away. She wants to save money to buy a house for her mom, so her mom doesn't have to live in rentals and keep moving around. She also wants her mom to live a bit easier.」","「So what do we do now? If the blogger performs poorly, Miss Eight will definitely be unhappy.」","「Has Miss Eight explicitly said she's firing you? Can't you plead your case?」","「You must be a new fan. The blogger once documented that a colleague was about to get fired, and she cried pleading for mercy, but it didn't work. Second Young Master fired her, and he had no time to listen to our poor people's sob stories. Pleading is a big taboo; it's better to leave with dignity.」","「Isn't Miss Eight said to be very beautiful and easy to talk to? Pleading should be fine...」","「It feels a bit scary. From our perspective, it's an exotic glimpse into the daily lives of the top young masters. But from the young masters' perspective, the blogger is just a diligent mouse moving things around. If the mouse doesn't do its job well, they'll just replace it. How could they care about the mouse's fate?」","Little Xie was sobbing uncontrollably but dared not cry out loud, burying her head.","If she really got fired, where could she find a job like this?","The housing prices in Lan City are so high, and she still needs tens of thousands to afford a decent down payment.","What should she do?!","-","Qiao Chuchu entered the room carrying a white paper bag: “Little Xie?”","Little Xie was no longer in her room.","She dialed Little Xie's phone: “It's me, come to my room.”","Little Xie mumbled in acknowledgment, and Qiao Chuchu hung up, placing the newly bought phone on the table.","Just moments ago, she had urgently sent her driver to take her to the mall to buy a new phone for Little Xie, along with a stylish phone case and a self-adhesive dust-free screen protector.","It would serve as Little Xie's birthday gift!","In the breakroom, Little Xie hung up the phone, her breath quickening.","Through teary eyes, she sent another message:【Miss Eight is calling me to see her now. Wish me luck.】","A group of curious netizens quickly gathered under this post.","「Ahhhh, I'm so nervous! I'm already nervous for the blogger!」","「Don't let the house collapse, my Miss Eight! I got into this because of her! I don't like smelly men, wahhhh, please don't let Miss Eight fire the blogger!」","「Wait, if the blogger really gets fired, I won't be able to see the Cloud Young Masters anymore?! Miss Eight, please don't fire the blogger, ahhh!」","「Help! One sister just reminded me, if the blogger gets fired, I won't see my seven husbands anymore! Miss Eight, have mercy! I'm your sister-in-law you've never met!!」","「Me too, I'm also a sister-in-law! Miss Eight, let go of the blogger! Or replace the blogger with me!!」","「Help! Miss Eight, show great kindness and spare the blogger! Don't delay me from cloud-raising my seven sons!」","「Dancing a ritual dance in the blogger's comment section to exorcise evil and pray for blessings!!」","Little Xie took a deep breath, bracing herself like a warrior, and walked into Qiao Chuchu's room.","The delicate fragrance hit her face, making her nose tingle and her heart ache: “Miss Eight, you called for me.”","Qiao Chuchu was sitting in a single sofa, busy replying to messages, not even glancing up: “Mhm, come here.”","Little Xie walked up to her, sniffling.","If Miss Qiao was going to let her go, she would plead her case, even if it meant taking a pay cut!","As she was imagining this, a white bag suddenly appeared in front of her: “Open it and see.”","Little Xie was stunned, obediently taking it and pulling out the contents.","It was an iPhone.","She looked at Qiao Chuchu in disbelief: “This is...?”","Qiao Chuchu smiled at her: “A birthday gift for you.”","Little Xie: “?!”","Qiao Chuchu explained: “The iPhone 15 Pro Max, the latest model right now. I didn't know what color you liked, so I got white. And since you have a lot to handle, I got the 1TB version. I also bought AppleCare+, so if the screen ever breaks, you can get a new one at the official store for just a few hundred. Open it and take a look!~”","Little Xie's head was buzzing, and by the time she came to her senses, her tears were already falling in big drops.","Her voice trembled: “Is... is it really for me?”","Qiao Chuchu was even more surprised: “Of course, why are you crying?”","Little Xie's mouth puckered, and she couldn't stop crying: “I never expected to receive a phone from Miss, and such an expensive one at that. I've never bought a phone over four thousand...”","She lowered her head, taking out a phone case from the bag, crying: “Wahhh, the phone case is so festive, and it even says 'Get Rich'!”","Little Xie opened the phone box, taking out the phone. The cold, new device even fogged up from the warmth of her hands: “It's so new it's even steaming!”","Qiao Chuchu couldn't help but laugh: “It's because of the winter weather, it won't do that in summer. I also bought you a dust-free screen protector, so you can do the installation yourself.”","Little Xie's face was scrunched up from crying: “This is the best birthday gift I've ever received, thank you, Miss!”","Qiao Chuchu smiled contentedly: “I'm glad you like it.”","“I really, really like it!” Little Xie held the phone, crying: “I love it so much!!”","Seeing her so exaggerated, Qiao Chuchu couldn't help but chuckle.","Little Xie's reaction completely exceeded her expectations.","She thought Little Xie would just be pleasantly surprised, but instead, she was crying her eyes and nose out.","She smiled and said: “I just called the butler to ask about your situation.”","Little Xie: “!”","So she was still going to fire her?!","Was this phone the final warmth before the cold?"]},{"number":64,"title":"Chapter 64: The Eighth Young Lady Who Steps Out as MVP is Hard to Dislike","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu spoke calmly and steadily, \"The housekeeper mentioned that although you haven't been here for long, you are familiar with the temperaments of my brothers, and you are quick to react and adapt. People like you are truly rare.\"","Little Xie looked completely baffled.","Qiao Chuchu smiled gently, \"After Auntie Wang left, the position of deputy housekeeper has been vacant. I think you have a strong ability to adapt, and you should have no problem handling this job. The monthly salary will be raised from 30,000 to 50,000, but the work will be much more tiring. Are you willing?\"","Little Xie's eyes widened instantly, and she sat up straight in disbelief, \"Really?!\"","Qiao Chuchu nodded, \"Of course, I've noticed how hardworking and serious you are. You remember everyone's habits and quirks, and you place food with great care. You never complain, and even in the past two days since I returned, you've already figured out my personality and remembered my little habits. People like you deserve to be in the position you belong in.\"","Little Xie's heart was racing with excitement!","Miss Qiao is too kind!","Just as she was about to agree, she hesitated, \"But... will Mr. Pei agree?\"","After all, the relationship between Miss Qiao and the Pei brothers is complicated.","She was afraid it was all just a false hope.","Qiao Chuchu thought for a moment and found it reasonable.","She hadn't made any decisions for the family since her falling out with her brothers, and she wasn't sure if her words still carried weight.","She decided to call Pei Yuan directly, \"I think I can make this small decision, but if you're unsure, we'll just have to try it out.\"","After a while, the phone was answered, and Pei Yuan's serious voice came through, \"I'm in a meeting. What is it?\"","Qiao Chuchu pressed the speakerphone, \"I want to promote Little Xie to deputy housekeeper. She's very diligent and works hard. I think she can handle it. What do you think?\"","Pei Yuan: \"...\"","Little Xie held her breath, nervously holding it.","Pei Yuan took a deep breath, his tone clearly displeased, \"Qiao Chuchu, I stepped out of the meeting to take your call, and this is what you have to say? Can't you make such a small decision on your own?\"","Qiao Chuchu shrugged helplessly, \"You know my position in the Pei Family. What if my words don't carry weight?\"","Pei Yuan became even more annoyed, \"Anyone who doesn't listen to you, fire them! End of discussion!\"","The call ended abruptly.","Qiao Chuchu triumphantly waved her phone, \"Congratulations, you've made it. I'll inform the head housekeeper, and you'll start as deputy housekeeper from today.\"","Little Xie gasped, her eyes welling up with tears again!","Mom! She's been promoted!!","This sudden fortune came out of nowhere!","She threw herself into Qiao Chuchu's arms for an exuberant hug, \"Thank you, Miss Qiao!!!\"","Qiao Chuchu was knocked back onto the sofa but patted her on the back, \"Go on, take a half-day off and have lunch with your mom. Come back after, and share this good news with her.\"","Little Xie nodded through her tears, suppressing the urge to kiss Qiao Chuchu, and happily left with her phone.","Back in the staff lounge, she changed her phone and excitedly logged into her account, only to find that her last post had gone viral!","\"Not a fan, but I'm dying to know the follow-up. Did she get fired or not? When will the blogger answer?\"","\"Save me, our entire dorm is waiting for the follow-up on Miss Qiao!\"","Even a poll was started in the comments: \"Vote here if you think the blogger will be fired.\"","\"Vote here if you think the blogger won't be fired.\"","The votes for being fired were higher than those for not being fired!","Little Xie was overjoyed and replied, \"The follow-up is here! I've been promoted!! Check out my latest post! I'll post it right now!\"","She excitedly took a photo of her phone box and case, her hands trembling as she typed.","\"First, let me tell you all! I've been promoted! Not only that, but Miss Qiao also gifted me a new phone as a birthday present! An iPhone 15 Pro Max, with AppleCare+ in case I drop it, and even a phone case and dust-proof screen protector!\"","\"I was really nervous, crying in the staff lounge, thinking Miss Qiao was going to fire me. But when I entered the room, Miss Qiao handed me a bag and told me to open it. Inside was a brand-new phone, and she smiled and said it was a birthday gift for me!\"","\"Can you imagine, everyone? That moment felt like I saw an angel!!\"","\"Then Miss Qiao praised me for working hard and being able to handle some of her and her brothers' quirky habits, and she offered to promote me to deputy housekeeper! And now I'm the deputy housekeeper!\"","\"Oh, and Miss Qiao even called Elder Young Master to ask if he agreed, but he scolded her, saying she shouldn't bother him with such a small matter.\"","\"Woohoo, I've never used such an expensive phone before, and she's given me a promotion and a raise. How can there be such a wonderful young lady? I'll be her loyal fan forever!\"","The comments exploded!","\"What?! She actually promoted you and gave you a raise?!\"","\"The blogger mentioned that the deputy housekeeper earns 50,000 a month. So now the blogger is making 50,000 a month? Including benefits? I'm so jealous I'm crawling on the floor!\"","\"New Year's is coming soon, and I wish everyone a happy New Year, except for the blogger [smiling]\"","\"Ahhh, I want to be Miss Qiao's dog too, ahhh!!\"","\"Who understands? Most of the blogger's previous posts were about the handsome young masters' quirky behavior, but as soon as Miss Qiao appeared, it was all sorts of beauty and charm. Indeed, girls are all gentle and lovely!\"","\"I just read the blogger's previous posts, and it felt like a gathering of handsome but strange guys, not very appealing. But as soon as Miss Qiao appeared, she struck a chord in my heart—I was just worried about a potential flop earlier! From now on, I'm Miss Ba's loyal fan!\"","\"I've decided to give up on Young Master Seven and start 'cloud-raising' Miss Qiao! Miss Qiao will be my daughter from now on!\"","\"I'm the one who loves my daughter the most. As soon as Miss Qiao appeared, I fell in love with the Eighth Young Lady! My little mermaid baby, sob sob sob!\"","\"I thought I'd just quietly stan a relatively niche character like Miss Qiao, but as soon as she appeared, she was the MVP, and immediately went viral, it seems she's destined to be popular and can't help but shine.\"","Little Xie: \"?\"","On the trending list?","She opened Weibo and was shocked to see familiar words trending.","#Who on earth is lucky enough to have such a lovely lady!#","Someone had compiled her story into a collection!","The daily life of the seven brothers clearly became warmer after Miss Qiao appeared.","The heat was only increasing!","The top comment read, \"Whether it's real or not, please, I'm begging you, give me another episode. I can't take it anymore. I feel like there are ants crawling on me, I'm trembling all over, I can't breathe. Just one more episode, please, I'm begging you. I swear I'll never touch this kind of thing again, I can't hold back anymore!\"","There were even more people copying and pasting the comment below!","Little Xie: \"...\"","Her story about the seven young masters and Miss Qiao seemed to have gone viral!","And the main character... seemed to be Miss Qiao!","-","In a business car, a man opened his phone and received a notification.","#Who on earth is the eighth young lady from this wealthy family?!#","His cold eyes gleamed with interest as he rarely clicked on such a push notification, flipping through a few pages, the playful and cheerful voice echoing in his mind.","Qiao Chuchu.","His finger lightly stroked the words \"Miss Eight\" as he spoke in a deep voice, \"Zhang Jun.\"","The secretary in the passenger seat responded, \"Yes, Boss.\"","The man flipped through one story after another, \"Have someone send an invitation to the Pei Family, inviting Miss Qiao Chuchu to a luxury cruise. Don't mention it's my idea.\"","The secretary nodded, \"Understood.\""]},{"number":65,"title":"Chapter 65: The Luxurious Cruise of Qiao Chuchu and Pei Youchuan","paragraphs":["“Qiao Chuchu, have you ever been on the largest and most luxurious cruise ship in the world?! It's about to set sail in Lan City, and this is an opportunity not to be missed!”","“Skydiving on the deck, surfing, even rock climbing—a variety of thrilling entertainment facilities await!”","“KTV, bars, movie theaters—you name it, it's all there. Whatever you want to do, you can do it! A three-day journey, enjoying a life cut off from the world on the open sea!”","“I've already arranged a suite for you. You can bring your brothers to stay in the presidential suite; it can easily accommodate all eight of you!”","“What? Your brothers are busy? Well, then it's even less of a problem for you, a little girl, to go alone. Pack your suitcase and go have fun!!”","-","Qiao Chuchu stood bewildered in the VIP waiting area, staring at the towering luxury cruise ship not far away.","Three days ago, Auntie Zhao from the Zhao Family found her and said thank you for saving Grandpa Zhao at the banquet. She gave her a family ticket for the luxury cruise, insisting that she must go and have some fun.","—“With the New Year just around the corner, now is the time to relax! I know you've been on every cruise imaginable, but trust me, this one is packed with big shots. You might even meet your true love!”","At that moment, just as she was about to decline, Pei Youchuan appeared out of nowhere like a ghost: “True love, huh?”","Auntie Zhao was delighted: “Youchuan, you're free today?”","Pei Youchuan nodded and sat down next to Qiao Chuchu: “I worked overtime the past few days to finish my work, so I took a few days off. I have time to accompany Chuchu and have some fun.”","Qiao Chuchu glanced at him sideways.","More like he had time to keep an eye on her.","Auntie Zhao was in high spirits: “Chuchu just said you all didn't have time, but here you are! Are you interested in the luxury cruise? You can bring your friends along; this ticket includes eight spots and a presidential suite. But if you bring friends, they'll need to book their own rooms.”","Pei Youchuan smiled: “Sure, thanks Auntie Zhao. Qiao Chuchu and I will go together.”","Auntie Zhao's eyes crinkled with joy: “I'll send you the link, and you can fill in your details online. Just bring your ID when you go.”","She winked at Qiao Chuchu: “There will be plenty of eligible bachelors there, so maybe you'll find a boyfriend to have some fun with!”","Pei Youchuan's gaze, cold and piercing, fell on Qiao Chuchu's cheek.","Qiao Chuchu sincerely but half-heartedly agreed with Auntie Zhao: “Yes, Auntie Zhao, I'll be sure to look around.”","Auntie Zhao patted her cheek and reminded Pei Youchuan: “Make sure to help your sister choose carefully. Your parents are no longer with us, so you need to consider this more.”","Pei Youchuan smiled, but his eyes didn't: “Don't worry, Auntie Zhao.”","He gently tucked a stray hair behind Qiao Chuchu's ear and said softly: “It seems my little sister has grown up to the age where she can start dating. As her older brother, I must help her choose wisely.”","Qiao Chuchu snapped back to the present, standing in the waiting hall, looking at Pei Youchuan who was playing with his phone.","Although it was winter, since they had been outdoors for barely five minutes, Pei Youchuan was dressed lightly.","He wore a simple black loose jacket, a plain white T-shirt, dark blue washed denim straight-leg jeans, and had a relaxed wolf-tail hairstyle. Around his neck hung a black over-ear headphone, giving him a lazy and casual vibe, clearly here for a vacation.","She couldn't help but feel a little jealous and pouted.","【Indeed, good-looking people look good even in a sack.】","Pei Youchuan: “?”","He glanced at Qiao Chuchu out of the corner of his eye, noticing that she was staring at him.","He raised an eyebrow, put on his headphones, and pretended to watch a video.","Qiao Chuchu seethed: 【Even the way he puts on headphones is so attractive. I just don't get it. We're both humans, so why does he have to be so handsome and charming?】","Pei Youchuan cleared his throat and started to pose.","Was crossing his legs attractive?","Qiao Chuchu: 【Wow! Those long legs!】","Pei Youchuan leaned back on the sofa, deliberately tilting his head slightly to reveal his jawline.","Qiao Chuchu: 【Give me that jawline to make knife-cut noodles!】","Pei Youchuan couldn't help but smile.","Qiao Chuchu: 【Damn, he looks good even when he smiles while looking at his phone!!!】","Pei Youchuan pursed his lips, feeling a slight heat in his ears.","So, Qiao Chuchu secretly complimented him in her heart when they were together.","Qiao Chuchu sighed: 【Too bad. Such a handsome face, but the soul inside is such a jerk.】","Pei Youchuan: “?”","A young and handsome boy walked up to Qiao Chuchu, nervously asking: \"Hi, little sister, can I have your WeChat?\"","Qiao Chuchu was taken aback but didn't want to refuse, so she took out her phone and let him scan her QR code.","The boy was secretly delighted, glancing at her from the corner of his eye: “I've actually been watching you for a while.”","She was flattered: “Thank you!”","【This seems to be the first guy to ask for my WeChat in my life!】","She showed her QR code, but suddenly a big hand covered her phone.","Pei Youchuan appeared like a mountain, standing beside her, one hand pressing on her QR code, the other in his pocket, silently looking at the boy.","The boy was at a loss, looking up at Pei Youchuan.","Pei Youchuan was a full head taller than him, looking down at him with an air of superiority, saying nothing.","The atmosphere was deathly silent.","The boy gradually became flustered: “I-I'm sorry.”","He hurried away.","Qiao Chuchu: “......”","【The duck that was about to be in my mouth flew away?】","She asked Pei Youchuan in a daze: “What are you doing?”","Pei Youchuan disdainfully glanced at her: “You're really hungry. You'll eat anything.”","Qiao Chuchu: “?”","Pei Youchuan snorted, returning her phone to the home screen: “Auntie Zhao said that as your older brother, I need to help you vet your boyfriends. That guy didn't pass my test.”","He leaned back on the sofa, casually crossing his legs: “He's so skinny that a fly farting could blow him three kilometers away. How could he possibly hold you in his arms?”","Qiao Chuchu: “......”","【It even rhymes?】","【Ah, I wasn't really trying to add his WeChat. I just wanted to experience what it feels like to be asked for my WeChat.】","Qiao Chuchu felt a bit regretful and rubbed the ground with her foot.","【After all, I've never even received a love letter my whole life. So many people have complimented me on my looks, but during my teenage years, not even a shy boy approached me. It's a bit of a small regret.】","Pei Youchuan popped a piece of gum into his mouth and slowly chewed.","Who said she didn't have any suitors?","When he was in school, he had the key to Qiao Chuchu's locker and burned love letters like they were joss paper, stack after stack.","There were also quite a few persistent pursuers, but after a simple conversation, they didn't dare to pursue her anymore.","In short, none of the men who liked her had any guts.","After he graduated, he handed the locker key over to the next brother.","Pei Buxian was in the same grade as Qiao Chuchu, so he kept an eye on her until graduation.","Pei Youchuan scoffed, but then something crossed his mind, and the satisfaction on his face suddenly disappeared.","Other brothers wouldn't do things like this. At most, they might feel a bit jealous.","But they did it so smoothly, so effortlessly, almost as if it required no thought.","Why?","Even now, even though they had turned away with determination, as soon as they realized that the Qiao Chuchu who hurt them wasn't acting out of malice, they eagerly came back, coldly washing their underwear.","Why?","Pei Youchuan became more and more irritated, nervously tapping on his phone.","“Youchuan?!”","A surprised voice rang out, and Pei Youchuan looked up to see a familiar face.","The man smiled happily at him: \"You're joining in too.\"","The knot in Pei Youchuan's heart was instantly dispelled, and he took the initiative to invite, \"What a coincidence, Song Mingzhen, let's have a drink together tonight, I'll treat you.\"","Song Mingzhen nodded, still holding his girlfriend's hand: \"Then I'll take my girlfriend along, what about you? How many people are you bringing?\"","Pei Youchuan was momentarily stunned and looked at Qiao Chuchu who was standing beside him.","Qiao Chuchu lowered her head.","\"Don't look at me, don't look at me, don't look at me, don't look at me! I'm an introvert, I don't like drinking parties, I don't like drinking parties! Don't take me, don't take me, don't take me, don't take me!\"","Pei Youchuan: \"......I'll go myself.\"","Qiao Chuchu let out a sigh of relief, feeling a little bit secretly pleased: [I can sit quietly in the presidential suite tonight, enjoy the view of the sea, and draw comics! Yay!!!]","【Just today we're not following the story plot, so I can relax a bit!~】","Pei Youchuan glanced at her.","Her little expression of secret delight instantly turned serious, and she pretended to be sorrowful as she gazed out the window.","【Pei Youchuan hates to see me happy the most. The moment I'm joyful, he likes to tease me. I can't let him know I want him to leave, or else he'll drag me out for drinks.】","Pei Youchuan raised an eyebrow and snorted.","Did she think she understood him so well?","How childish."]},{"number":66,"title":"Chapter 66: Some thoughts cannot be spoken or pondered.","paragraphs":["While thinking this, Pei Youchuan's gaze was as deep as the endless night sky, enveloping the oblivious Qiao Chuchu within it.","He completely ignored Song Mingzhen and the others.","Song Mingzhen's girlfriend activated her gossip radar and whispered, \"Is he the third young master of the Pei family?\"","Song Mingzhen sighed, \"Yes, he's now the CEO of that popular mobile game company. Rich, capable, and handsome—it's hard not to admire him.\"","His girlfriend's eyes lit up with excitement as she followed Pei Youchuan's gaze toward Qiao Chuchu, \"Then, is this girl his...\"","\"The eighth adopted sister of the Pei family,\" Song Mingzhen glanced at Qiao Chuchu, \"Don't look at her. She seems to have some issues, likes playing incest games, and is a bit crazy.\"","\"Ah?\" His girlfriend was surprised, \"She doesn't look like it.\"","She darted her sly gaze back and forth between the atmosphere surrounding Pei Youchuan and Qiao Chuchu.","Pei Youchuan kept his eyes fixed on Qiao Chuchu.","Qiao Chuchu, if she turned her head, could meet his deep gaze.","But she didn't.","She looked at flowers, water, boats, her phone—anything but the person beside her.","His girlfriend's lips curled into a smirk, her tone becoming suggestive, \"Aren't they both into each other?\"","Song Mingzhen: \"...Of course not. Pei Youchuan is a firm believer in lifelong bachelorhood.\"","His girlfriend became even more excited, \"So, is he staying chaste?!\"","Her voice was so loud that it startled both Qiao Chuchu and Pei Youchuan, causing them to look at her.","Song Mingzhen was shocked and quickly covered his girlfriend's mouth, \"I told you to stop reading those Hai Tang novels! Let's go!\"","His girlfriend's eyes sparkled as she looked at Qiao Chuchu, but she was forcefully dragged away.","Qiao Chuchu watched the couple leave, then suddenly noticed the intense gaze beside her.","She turned her head and met Pei Youchuan's cold, piercing eyes.","Qiao Chuchu shivered, \"What are you staring at?\"","Pei Youchuan's face was expressionless, \"What if I am?\"","Qiao Chuchu was momentarily speechless, then remembered she couldn't beat him, so she just gave up.","【What if I am? What if I am? Congratulations, you've provoked the most cotton-soft person in the world! Provoking me is like not provoking at all!】","Pei Youchuan paused, then smiled, \"You don't need to wait for me tonight if we're drinking.\"","She rolled her eyes, \"Mmm.\"","【Who's waiting for you? I'm not that idle. Not only am I not waiting, I'll take two sleeping pills and sleep straight through. Even if you're dancing on my grave, I won't care.】","Pei Youchuan: \"?\"","He was already in a bad mood, and hearing this made him even more irritated. The gloomy feelings lingered in his chest, refusing to dissipate.","Before long, night fell.","The cruise ship sailed on the sea, and Pei Youchuan sat inside the KTV room, turning his emotions into alcohol, drinking bottle after bottle with a group of men.","Pei Youchuan raised his glass, swaying, \"Cheers!!\"","Song Mingzhen was so drunk his tongue was slurring as he grabbed Pei Youchuan's hand, puzzled, \"I'm just curious, why are you still single? So many girls like you, why don't you take a look?\"","Song Mingzhen pointed to the Little Sister singing in a short skirt, \"Don't you like her?!\"","Pei Youchuan didn't even lift his head, \"No.\"","Song Mingzhen was speechless, \"You haven't even looked, how do you know you don't like her? Sing a love song with her, and you'll like her, trust me!\"","Pei Youchuan was impatient, \"Are you a pimp or something? Does not fucking dating mean you'll die?\"","Song Mingzhen was speechless, forcing Pei Youchuan's face to look at the Little Sister, \"Look closely. I don't believe you're indifferent!\"","The Little Sister held the microphone, looking at them, shyly smiling.","Song Mingzhen shouted, \"Is she pretty?!\"","Pei Youchuan's eyes were glazed.","Song Mingzhen shouted again, \"Are you still indifferent?!\"","Pei Youchuan stared straight into the Little Sister's eyes and shook his head, \"No.\"","His words were drowned out by the background music: \"Not everything can be held in your hands. Some things are like ice, they melt the moment you touch them.\"","Song Mingzhen gestured to the Little Sister.","The Little Sister quickly ran over, happily looking at Pei Youchuan.","Pei Youchuan suddenly stood up, towering like a mountain in front of the Little Sister.","The Little Sister, at a loss, held the microphone.","Pei Youchuan reached out his hand.","The Little Sister blushed with anticipation.","Pei Youchuan snatched the microphone from her hand and held it to his mouth!","\"Give me a song by Phoenix Legend, 'All You Need is Love'!\"","Little Sister: \"......\"","Song Mingzhen: \"......\"","Others: \"......\"","Song Mingzhen quickly reacted, \"Alright, it's perfect for a duet. Let the Little Sister sing with you.\"","Pei Youchuan swayed onto the stage, \"No need!\"","He pointed at himself, \"I can sing the female part in a falsetto!\"","Song Mingzhen: \"......\"","Little Sister: \"......\"","Others: \"......\"","Not long after, Qiao Chuchu, focused on drawing in her room, received a call from the hotel front desk.","It wasn't an employee but Song Mingzhen's girlfriend.","After introducing herself, she apologized, \"Miss Qiao, did I disturb your rest?\"","Qiao Chuchu shook her head, \"No, what's the matter?\"","The voice on the other end was embarrassed, \"Well, your brother has gotten everyone drunk and won't let anyone leave. He's even forcing my boyfriend to sing old love songs with him.\"","Qiao Chuchu's mouth twitched, \"Singing love songs?\"","His girlfriend sighed, \"Yes, my boyfriend is already on the floor, and since no one is singing with him, he's singing alone. He says he can sing the female part in a falsetto.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"......\"","\"So, can you come and help? We can't persuade him at all.\"","Qiao Chuchu was speechless but agreed, \"Okay.\"","She quickly headed to the KTV.","Isn't Pei Youchuan only supposed to drink when he's unhappy? Today, they're on a luxury cruise, so why would he be unhappy?","She arrived at the karaoke room, where a group of girlfriends were anxiously waiting outside, ready to take their boyfriends home. Seeing her, they all brightened up, \"Miss Qiao, you're finally here!\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"......\"","She felt like the dormitory auntie (dormitory manager) holding the keys, waiting to let the college students in.","She forced herself to approach the door, ready to push it open.","Song Mingzhen's girlfriend handed her a microphone, \"Please buy us some time. We'll take our boyfriends away.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"......Can't we reason with Pei Youchuan?\"","The girlfriend's eyes widened in shock, \"Do you reason with a drunk person?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"......No.\"","She pushed the door open.","Pei Youchuan, unaware of her arrival, was still choosing songs, his back to her, \"I want to sing 'Dangerous but Alluring.'\"","Song Mingzhen was in a terrible state, lying on the ground, mumbling, \"I don't know if it's alluring, but I definitely feel dangerous right now.\"","Pei Youchuan didn't care, singing while standing on the stage, his voice breaking as he belted out, \"Why is the most alluring the most dangerous, why does love make people incomplete~~\"","Qiao Chuchu stood behind him with the microphone, her expression as if she had eaten excrement, signaling the girls to quickly take their boyfriends away.","Pei Youchuan, when drunk, loved to act out and was stubborn, as stubborn as ten donkeys!","Let's get this over with quickly."]},{"number":67,"title":"Chapter 67: Not All Questions Have Answers","paragraphs":["Song Mingzhen sat up, squinting at Qiao Chuchu: \"Did I... dream? I saw Miss Qiao.\"","His girlfriend leaned down to pull him up: \"Miss Qiao came to help you out. She's taking your place to sing the love song. Hurry up and leave!\"","Song Mingzhen's eyebrows furrowed into a knot: \"She's such a sis-con. Can she even sing well? If she sings badly, Pei Youchuan will get angry!\"","Meanwhile, Pei Youchuan, completely unaware, sat on a barstool with his eyes closed, singing passionately: \"My heart has been waiting for you for so many years, love that doesn't overflow but almost drowns me! It's an inexplicable, contradictory deadlock~\"","He pointed at Song Mingzhen: \"Sing for me!!!\"","A melodious female voice rang out: \"If I didn't notice, it would be a deception~\"","Pei Youchuan froze, shocked looking towards the source.","In the dim light, Qiao Chuchu wore simple home clothes, with a soft, loose yellow cardigan casually draped over her shoulders. Her hair was pinned up with a pencil, and a few strands of hair fell lazily on her cheeks.","She sang slowly: \"I'm sorry, for blurring the lines between trust and love.\"","Both Song Mingzhen and his girlfriend were stunned.","Holy crap...","She can really sing!","And it's freaking amazing!","Pei Youchuan put down the microphone, stunned as he listened to her sing.","Qiao Chuchu stepped closer to him, bathed in light: \"Why is the most enchanting the most dangerous, why does love make people incomplete.\"","Pei Youchuan tilted his head, a bit puzzled.","It was strange. Qiao Chuchu was the one approaching him.","But he felt like he was being drawn into her singing.","Qiao Chuchu stood in front of him, \"You are really special in my eyes, but unfortunately, you're not in my dreams. Love is an inexplicable, contradictory deadlock.\"","Pei Youchuan picked up the microphone, joining her in the final chorus.","\"Love is an inexplicable, contradictory, deadlock.\"","He squinted, reaching out to touch her face: \"I think I... saw Qiao Chuchu...\"","Qiao Chuchu, still a bit out of breath, gave him a slightly reproachful look.","She had run over.","Worried that her older brother would cause trouble.","She was about to speak when Pei Youchuan's eyes glazed over, his head drooping—","He fell into her arms.","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","He was full of energy just now, and the moment he saw her, he pretends to faint?","She grumbled as she lifted Pei Youchuan and carried him back to the room.","The idiot was drenched in alcohol!","Qiao Chuchu grabbed a pair of scissors, aiming at Pei Youchuan's chest, ready to cut off the alcohol-soaked parts.","She quickly made her move!","A hand suddenly grabbed her wrist!","Qiao Chuchu looked up in shock, meeting Pei Youchuan's deep, cold gaze: \"What are you doing?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"? You weren't asleep?\"","Pei Youchuan's eyes were clear and sharp: \"You stabbed me with the scissors.\"","Qiao Chuchu fell silent.","She withdrew her hand.","His white T-shirt had a small patch of blood.","Qiao Chuchu scratched her head: \"No wonder the feel was off. I thought you were wearing a push-up bra inside.\"","Pei Youchuan: \"......\"","He looked around hazily: \"Are you trying to seduce me again?\"","Qiao Chuchu was stunned, her aura flaring up: \"I'd rather seduce your grandma's leg! What are you talking about?! I brought you back because you were drunk, do you know how heavy you are?!\"","Pei Youchuan seemed dazed, realizing slowly, \"So... the one singing earlier really was you, not just a hallucination from drinking too much?\"","\"Of course, it was me.\" Qiao Chuchu dropped the scissors and left: \"You can take off your clothes yourself, I'm going back to my room.\"","Her wrist was suddenly grabbed.","Qiao Chuchu frowned and turned back.","Pei Youchuan was sprawled on the bed, \"Don't go.\"","He beckoned with his finger, grinning: \"Come closer, I have a secret to tell you.\"","Qiao Chuchu was a bit intrigued.","Everyone says that people speak the truth when they're drunk. Maybe Pei Youchuan wants to share some gossip!","She happily leaned her head close to his ear: \"What's the secret?\"","Pei Youchuan's deep, hoarse voice whispered in her ear: \"Actually, Xia Xuechun is very similar to you. We all think so, but no one told you.\"","Qiao Chuchu's eyes widened in shock, looking at him: \"Are you blind?\"","\"No, I'm not blind.\" Pei Youchuan shook his head, \"You two don't look alike, but when she gets stubborn, it's like you're standing there being unreasonable.\"","\"But when you two are compared, Xia Xuechun doesn't stand a chance.\"","Pei Youchuan clutched his chest, speaking from the heart: \"Because only you, when you get stubborn, are both annoying and adorable.\"","Qiao Chuchu was stunned, a question slipping out: \"What if I died, how would you feel seeing Xia Xuechun?\"","Pei Youchuan was startled, his eyes turning red.","\"I don't know how I would feel.\"","Tears filled his eyes: \"I just know I would be in pain, regretful, and want to make amends.\"","His tears, like falling stars, dropped heavily onto the pillow: \"There's another secret. I was the one who threw away your love letters.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"? What love letters?\"","Pei Youchuan sat up, tears in his eyes as he looked at her: \"Back in school, you got a lot of love letters. I didn't like them, so I burned them all.\"","Qiao Chuchu's eyes widened: \"You burned them?! Why did you burn them?!\"","Pei Youchuan flinched, his mouth trembling as he cried like a child: \"Why are you yelling at me?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","She had no idea her stack of love letters had been burned!","She was furious, counting off on her fingers: \"That time I was chasing after you guys, right? I already had a complex love life, right? We were constantly arguing, you started disliking me, distancing yourselves, and then secretly burned my love letters? Why?!\"","Pei Youchuan didn't speak.","First, he wiped his tears, then calmly took off his clothes, revealing his toned abs to Qiao Chuchu.","... What a drunk, helpless, sexy black-haired hunk.","But Qiao Chuchu had no time to admire: \"Did the others agree to this too?\"","\"Yes.\" Pei Youchuan threw his clothes on the floor, his tone growing sour: \"I wasn't the only one who burned the letters. After I graduated, Pei Fengnong took over, then Pei Ci, Pei Mu, and finally Pei Buxian.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"? Why?\"","Pei Youchuan looked at her, his eyes already filled with dominance: \"There's no reason. We just wanted to do it. What we brothers want to do, no one can stop us.\"","\"Like this.\"","Pei Youchuan suddenly grabbed her hand, flipping the situation around, pinning Qiao Chuchu beneath him!","Qiao Chuchu: \"!\"","Pei Youchuan straddled her waist, brushing his hair back, his muscular body fully visible from this angle.","His eyes were deep, like the waves of a dark sea, carrying something she couldn't understand, threatening her fiercely: \"Qiao Chuchu, I'm warning you, I won't be adding you on WeChat. Don't you dare add me, understood?\"","Holding scissors ready for self-defense, Qiao Chuchu: \"... Why did the topic suddenly jump from love letters to WeChat friends?\"","Pei Youchuan smirked, his gaze lingering on her lips for three seconds.","Then, he reached out and pinched her cheek hard.","Qiao Chuchu yelped in pain: \"Ouch!\"","Pei Youchuan seemed to have some kind of perverse pleasure, rubbing her cheek red before finally grinning triumphantly, revealing a small tiger tooth: \"See you tomorrow, little sis.\""]},{"number":68,"title":"Chapter 68: Pei Youchuan: Losing Control After Drinking, the Nature of Personality","paragraphs":["...Headache.","It felt like a gold miner was chipping away at gold inside his head.","Pei Youchuan groaned and sat up in bed, looking around.","...This was Qiao Chuchu's room.","How did he end up here?","As he thought about it, his expression changed, and he quickly checked himself.","His pants were still on, but where were his clothes?!","He stumbled off the bed, shouting, \"Qiao Chuchu!!\"","Qiao Chuchu was sitting on the sofa drawing when she heard footsteps thundering toward her like an elephant. Before she could even look up, her chin was grabbed!","Pei Youchuan pinched her chin and scrutinized her neck carefully, as if searching for something.","She irritably pulled away. \"Are you still drunk?!\"","Pei Youchuan stepped back, staring at her intently. \"Where's my shirt?\"","Qiao Chuchu was baffled. \"On the floor in your room.\"","Pei Youchuan turned and went to his room, finding his shirt exactly where she said.","He quickly put it on and returned to Qiao Chuchu, his expression frantic. \"Why was my shirt on the floor?\"","Qiao Chuchu was speechless. \"How should I know? If your shirt was on the floor, you must have taken it off yourself.\"","Pei Youchuan hugged himself, panic written all over his face. \"Why would I take my shirt off?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"? How would I know why you took your shirt off?\"","She sipped her hot water with disdain.","【And it wasn't just taking off his shirt. He also straddled me like a creep! Commanding me not to add anyone on WeChat!】","【He even admitted that he burned all the love letters I received during my teenage years, and when I asked why, he just got angry.】","【And then he started crying before me. Clearly, he was just venting his bad mood on me.】","Pei Youchuan: \"...\"","The memories finally flooded back, ten minutes too late.","——\"Actually, Xia Xuechun is a lot like you. We all think so, but no one ever told you.\"","——\"Back in school, you got a lot of love letters. I didn't like it, so I burned them all.\"","——\"No reason. We just wanted to do it. No one can stop us, our brothers.\"","He flipped Qiao Chuchu onto her back, straddling her waist, looking down at her from above.","Under the dim table lamp, Qiao Chuchu's panicked eyes glistened like rippling water.","In that moment, he really wanted to make her cry, to see those watery eyes spill over with tears, whimpering as she called him \"Third Brother.\"","He suppressed the urge with great effort, glaring at her threateningly. \"Qiao Chuchu, I'm warning you. I won't be adding any WeChat friends, and you better not either. Got it?\"","Pei Youchuan was utterly horrified by the memory. \"What the hell did I do?\"","Qiao Chuchu sipped her tea and smirked. \"You were just acting out drunk. You even dragged someone else's boyfriend to sing love songs with you, boasting that you could sing in a falsetto.\"","Pei Youchuan: \"?\"","His memory rewound again, recalling Qiao Chuchu holding a microphone and singing with him.","When he saw her, he thought he was dreaming and reached out to touch her face.","\"Damn!!\" Pei Youchuan suddenly howled, grabbing his hair. \"Ahhhhhhh, just kill me now!!!\"","He darted back to his room like a monkey, quickly showered, changed into fresh clothes, and bolted out the door!","Just before leaving, he warned Qiao Chuchu, \"Forget last night! No one is allowed to talk about it!\"","Qiao Chuchu watched him with the same look she'd give a monkey escaped from the zoo. \"I've already forgotten.\"","Pei Youchuan sighed in relief and turned to leave.","But—","He turned back to warn her again. \"The part about not adding strangers on WeChat is settled between us. Forget everything else!\"","With that, he slammed the door shut.","Sitting on the sofa, Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","Her seven brothers were on the verge of going full villain, with only Pei Buxian and Pei Che showing clear signs of latent villainy.","Pei Youchuan didn't seem like he was going dark; he seemed more like he was going feral, like a seagull flapping around and slapping tourists.","In the original storyline, he wasn't that dark either; he was a lively character around Xia Xuechun.","He took her on roller coasters, skydiving, and for ice cream.","When Xia Xuechun was in a bad mood, he rented a helicopter to show her the entire city's night view, setting off the most dazzling fireworks that almost filled half the sky...","Wait a minute.","Qiao Chuchu suddenly realized with a puzzled hiss.","She now understood that the things Pei Youchuan did with Xia Xuechun were all things he had done with her before they fell out.","It was Pei Youchuan who took her to see the night scenery when she was in a bad mood, secretly brought her to ride the roller coaster that her eldest brother forbade, shared ice cream with her, and set off fireworks that lit up the entire sky.","After she died, Pei Youchuan actually repeated all the things they had done together with Xia Xuechun?!","So, she was just a tool to train a bunch of handsome side characters into the perfect fit for Xia Xuechun.","Qiao Chuchu picked up a mirror and looked at herself sadly. \"Ah, aside from money, beauty, extraordinary intelligence, and a shameless spirit, I have nothing.\"","She grinned cheekily and happily ran out the door.","Time to go have fun!~","-","Weisheng Wenzhan's secretary followed him diligently, holding a tablet. \"Mr. Wei, as you requested, Ms. Qiao and her family have been arranged in suites on the same floor as yours.\"","Weisheng Wenzhan nodded.","He knew Qiao Chuchu was on this ship, but he had been too busy until today to make time to approach her.","He stepped onto the spiral staircase and began to climb.","Qiao Chuchu was holding the railing, descending the spiral staircase, when she inadvertently glanced at Weisheng Wenzhan.","She widened her eyes in surprise.","Weisheng Wenzhan sensed her gaze and met her eyes, raising an eyebrow imperceptibly.","And just like that, they met.","Weisheng Wenzhan narrowed his eyes, his gaze unwavering, like a wolf's. He walked steadily, maintaining eye contact with her.","Qiao Chuchu stood frozen, staring at the approaching man.","His skin was as pale as snow, dressed in a perfectly pressed black suit, his proportions impeccable. He wore an expensive watch, exuding an aura of dominance and detachment from the mundane.","He was strikingly handsome, with fox-like narrow eyes and a red, slightly curved smile that seemed to tempt without fully doing so.","A wolf king.","He truly was a wolf king!","She felt almost suffocated by his presence, yet her gaze couldn't tear itself away, sticking firmly to his face.","They passed each other.","Weisheng Wenzhan coolly averted his gaze.","Qiao Chuchu's eyes remained fixed on his profile, watching him leave.","Weisheng Wenzhan's secretary was unnerved, muttering softly, \"Why is Ms. Qiao staring at you like that?\"","Weisheng Wenzhan didn't care. \"Don't worry about it.\"","Many people had stared at his face intently before.","Qiao Chuchu stared blankly at his retreating back, then opened her phone and tapped on her comic.","On the cover, a cold, handsome man looked down with disdain, his eyes filled with aloofness and solemnity.","This was the comic protagonist she had created through her imagination, a popular character whose merchandise sold like hotcakes and who had even collaborated with various food brands. A devoted, handsome comic son.","And he looked exactly like the man who had just walked by!","It was as if her comic character had come to life!","She was so excited she almost cried:【My son!】","Weisheng Wenzhan: \"?\""]},{"number":69,"title":"Chapter 69: As an author, it's enough to just watch from afar as my paper children and daughters are happy.","paragraphs":["Weisheng Wenzhan paused in his steps and turned to look at Qiao Chuchu.","Qiao Chuchu, seeing him turn around, felt even more elated!","【Ah, my son is looking at me, it's me, I'm your mom! The one who wants you to be with Manman!】","She glanced around: 【Where's my Manman? Is my Manman with you?】","Weisheng Wenzhan: \"......\"","What son.","What Manman.","Who is this Manman she's talking about?","Annoyed, he turned and walked into the building, lowering his voice: \"Give me Qiao Chuchu's file.\"","His secretary handed it over, adding in a hushed tone: \"Qiao Chuchu's real name on her ID is Qiao Chu, but few people know her real name, so everyone calls her Qiao Chuchu.\"","\"She lost her biological parents at the age of three, and her foster parents at ten. Although her household registration is still under the Qiao family, everyone knows she's actually the eighth daughter of the Pei family. After her guardians died, she lived with her brothers, but things fell apart when she developed an abnormal affection for them. She moved out and only recently returned.\"","Wenzhan: \"? Abnormal affection?\"","The secretary nodded seriously: \"In short, she likes her brothers, and not just one—she wants all seven of them. She often threatens to kill herself to force her brothers to submit to her. So far, she's attempted suicide by overdosing on sleeping pills three times and alcohol poisoning twice.\"","Weisheng Wenzhan: \"......\"","He glanced at Qiao Chuchu, who had stealthily followed him.","At first glance, she seemed like an innocent peach, but she turned out to be a little psycho.","\"Too bad,\" Weisheng Wenzhan sighed, browsing through Qiao Chuchu's file on his tablet.","The secretary was puzzled: \"What's too bad?\"","Weisheng Wenzhan: \"She's too stupid.\"","If she were from their family, she would have built a magnificent cage, tied her seven brothers inside, starved them, and only fed them when they were on the verge of collapse. After a year or two, they would have fallen for her.","Besides, who cares about liking or not liking? Keeping their bodies was what mattered.","His finger slid across the screen, stopping at Qiao Chuchu's work.","Several comics appeared on his screen.","One of the male leads looked... very familiar.","Almost like a self-portrait of himself.","And in this \"self-portrait,\" the man was holding a seductive blonde woman.","... They looked like a pair of extremely glamorous, Mary Sue-esque lovers.","He frowned and looked at Qiao Chuchu, who was sitting across from him.","They were in the self-service breakfast area.","Qiao Chuchu had found a spot where she could easily watch him, sipping her soy milk while pretending not to look at him.","She thought she was being very subtle.","In reality, she was as sly as a little hamster planning an escape, clearly feeling guilty.","He suddenly understood the meaning behind the term \"son.\"","Weisheng Wenzhan's face darkened as he directly sat at the table across from Qiao Chuchu.","Their tables were right next to each other, so Qiao Chuchu would see him as soon as she looked up.","Likewise, her every move was now within his view.","Qiao Chuchu used her soy milk as a cover to glance at him, her lips curling up to her temples!","【Look at that nose, those eyebrows, that face, that body, that aura! Just like my son!】","【Such a stern, cold, and powerful figure, yet secretly a lovesick fool who can't live without my daughter. On the surface, he seems indifferent, but in reality, he's ready to give his life for her. With him being this handsome, I can only imagine how beautiful my daughter must be when she appears!】","【Ugh, I really have to thank Aunt Zhao for giving me that ticket, allowing my fictional character to come to life right in front of me!】","【I want to go up and talk to him, but... nah.】","Qiao Chuchu bit her lip, deep in thought: 【I'm me, my son is my son, and my daughter is my daughter. We're all separate individuals. I can't interfere in their lives, after all, they don't know me. I'm just the author who created them.】","Weisheng Wenzhan: \"......\"","That made sense.","He almost thought he was a character created by Qiao Chuchu in her comics, rather than a real human born from his mother.","Qiao Chuchu suddenly let out a lewd chuckle.","【Hehehehe, I just want to watch him and my daughter be happy from afar. Hehehehe...】","Weisheng Wenzhan: \"?\"","At that moment, a young woman approached him: \"Excuse me, can I add you on WeChat?\"","Qiao Chuchu suddenly tensed up: 【No, don't add her WeChat in front of me! Otherwise, my son won't be pure in my heart anymore!】","Weisheng Wenzhan rejected her without hesitation: \"Sorry.\"","The woman nodded regretfully and walked away.","Wenzhan coldly glanced at Qiao Chuchu.","Qiao Chuchu let out a long sigh of relief: 【Thank goodness, my son is still my son.】","Weisheng Wenzhan: \"......\"","He hadn't even considered adding her. He never spoke to unimportant people.","Qiao Chuchu, however, stood up pale-faced, her fragile heart on the verge of collapse: 【I think I should leave. What if this handsome guy has a girlfriend or a wife who doesn't look like my daughter? I might just faint on the spot.】","She lowered her head and prepared to leave.","But then, a voice she knew all too well came from across the table: \"Mr. Weisheng?\"","Qiao Chuchu looked up in surprise.","Ji Yanchuan stood beside Weisheng Wenzhan, smiling politely: \"What a coincidence, are you here for fun too?\"","Weisheng Wenzhan recognized him, and a flash of killing intent passed through his eyes as he slowly smiled: \"Yes, and you, Young Master Ji?\"","Ji Yanchuan smiled brightly: \"I've been in a bad mood lately, so I came out for a stroll.\"","As he spoke, he inadvertently glanced at Qiao Chuchu, his gaze suddenly locking onto her—","\"Crazy woman?\"","Weisheng Wenzhan, following his gaze, naturally looked at Qiao Chuchu.","Qiao Chuchu ignored Ji Yanchuan and stared directly at Weisheng Wenzhan: \"Are you... from the Wei Sheng Clan?\"","Ji Yanchuan scoffed.","This crazy woman was actually trying to talk to someone from the Wei Sheng Clan?","Didn't she know the Wei Sheng Clan was famous for being cold, arrogant, and unapproachable?","She was in for a rude awakening.","But the next moment, Weisheng Wenzhan stood up and extended his hand to Qiao Chuchu: \"Yes, I am the eldest brother of the Wei Sheng Family, Weisheng Wenzhan.\"","Ji Yanchuan: \"?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"!\"","She was struck like lightning and nearly fell backward!","Wenzhan reacted quickly, catching her in his arms: \"Are you okay?\"","Qiao Chuchu, as pale as death, leaned on his arm and shook her head: \"I'm fine, I just thought of something sad.\"","【Pain! So much pain!】","【I thought it was fate, that my son was passing through my world, but this man who looks exactly like my son... is that unlucky bastard who died from anger, Weisheng Wenzhan!】","Weisheng Wenzhan: \"???\"","Qiao Chuchu, overwhelmed with sorrow, grabbed his hand: \"Have you had an electrocardiogram?\"","Weisheng Wenzhan: \"?\"","Qiao Chuchu, full of grief, continued: \"Have you had a heart ultrasound? A coronary angiography? A brain CT?\"","Weisheng Wenzhan's face turned green, struggling to suppress his urge to pull away: \"No.\"","Qiao Chuchu gripped his arm: \"Go get one.\"","With a motherly concern, she said: \"Don't push yourself too hard. If you have a stroke or a heart attack from anger, you might just die.\"","Weisheng Wenzhan forced a smile, grinding his teeth: \"I'm already angry, but whether I die from it... that's another matter.\""]},{"number":70,"title":"Chapter 70: Microbiological Wen Zhan twists the melon without checking if it's sweet or not","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu stood up straight, her heart aching: \"It's okay, I know why you're angry.\"","Weisheng Wenzhan perked up: \"Oh?\"","Qiao Chuchu stepped in front of him, blocking Ji Yanchuan: \"Stay away from my son—this gentleman!\"","Weisheng Wenzhan: \"...\"","Ji Yanchuan was stunned, looking at Weisheng Wenzhan in disbelief: \"Mr. Weisheng, are you really going to let this crazy woman go wild in front of you? She's not quite right in the head, and you never know when she might kick you.\"","Qiao Chuchu chuckled: \"Don't worry, Grandpa Qiao's sole will always stick to you.\"","Ji Yanchuan's face darkened: \"Crazy woman, don't push your luck!\"","Qiao Chuchu retorted without hesitation: \"I can be even worse, want to try?\"","Ji Yanchuan: \"...\"","He clenched his fists, his eyes filled with killing intent.","He had tried to have someone deal with Qiao Chuchu but failed. Originally, he had decided not to pursue it further and let her off the hook.","But now, this woman was still provoking him in front of him!","Looking for death, huh!","Qiao Chuchu felt Ji Yanchuan's murderous intent and stared back without fear.","[I never intended to interact with the rest of the Weisheng family, considering they're all ruthless characters. But now, this gentleman who looks just like my son is the very same Weisheng Wenzhan who was driven to death by anger. Can I just sit back and do nothing? Can I let my daughter live as a widow?!","[I can't!]","[Besides, Ji Yanchuan may look decent now, but I still remember clearly how he drove my son to death.]","[Ji Yanchuan showed Weisheng Wenzhan photos of the four deceased members of the Weisheng family, deliberately shocking him by recounting how his siblings died.]","[Weisheng Wenzhan was already on the verge of collapse, having taken over his siblings' work after their deaths, working non-stop for seven days without even a moment to sleep. With Ji Yanchuan's provocation, he was driven to death!]","Weisheng Wenzhan's eyes darkened, glancing sideways at Ji Yanchuan.","Alright, he thought Ji Yanchuan was just an arrogant fool, but it turns out he's also a malicious manipulator who knows how to hit people where it hurts.","He loves dealing with villains the most.","Just as he was thinking, Qiao Chuchu suddenly gestured for him to come closer: \"Come a bit nearer, will you?\"","Wenzhan frowned imperceptibly.","No one had ever summoned him like this before.","But he still endured his patience, bent down and pressed his ear closer.","Qiao Chuchu whispered mysteriously: \"Mr. Weisheng, stay away from this Ji Yanchuan, don't do business with him, and don't talk to him. Just be polite on the surface. He has bad intentions, and his character is terrible. His family are all driven by greed—they're really bad! And he's bad luck for you, he'll ruin your finances!\"","Weisheng Wenzhan: \"...\"","Is this her way of persuading him openly?","Interesting.","He said with interest: \"So, you can tell fortunes?\"","Qiao Chuchu nodded seriously: \"A bit. I can read faces. Have you heard about Sister Yu Can's car accident? I predicted it, so I saved her.\"","Weisheng Wenzhan's lips curled into a lazy smile: \"Oh? Then tell me, what do I look like?\"","Qiao Chuchu didn't hesitate: \"Like you're about to die.\"","Weisheng Wenzhan: \"?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"Ah, no, like someone people would die for!\"","[I can't let him know he'll be driven to death by Ji Yanchuan next year, or he won't be able to enjoy his New Year.]","Weisheng Wenzhan: \"...\"","He already can't.","Ji Yanchuan stood across from the two, watching them.","The two of them together created a strange yet harmonious pairing.","Weisheng Wenzhan, though older, didn't look it at all. His skin was tight and wrinkle-free, like a pale vampire who had just crawled out of a coffin, exuding a mature and powerful aura.","Standing at about six feet three inches, dressed in a sharp suit, he stood next to Qiao Chuchu, slightly leaning down to listen to her.","Due to the height difference, and unwilling to bend too low, it was Qiao Chuchu who had to stand on tiptoe to get closer to him.","The two leaning against each other, like a royal couple who had seen it all, listening to the naive secrets of a spoiled young lady.","Ji Yanchuan watched them with increasing displeasure: \"Mr. Weisheng, let's have breakfast together.\"","He glanced at Qiao Chuchu: \"Just the two of us. I have business matters I'd like to discuss with you.\"","Qiao Chuchu looked nervously at Weisheng Wenzhan, whispering: \"He's here because his family sent him. Trust me, this project won't end well, it's all a trap. Of course, whether you believe me or not is up to you. Please think carefully.\"","Believe me! He'll harm you! Even though he can't kill you now, he'll collaborate with his family, luring you step by step into a trap! He's got the male lead halo! Once you're involved, you're doomed!","Weisheng Wenzhan's lips curved slightly, but he didn't respond.","Qiao Chuchu prepared to leave: \"I'm leaving first.\"","\"Wait.\" Weisheng Wenzhan took out his phone, showing her his WeChat QR code: \"Exchange contact details.\"","Ji Yanchuan: \"?\"","Weisheng Wenzhan actually initiated a contact exchange?!","What charm does this crazy woman have?","He glared at Qiao Chuchu unhappily.","Qiao Chuchu was stunned, a bit apologetic: \"No, thanks.\"","Weisheng Wenzhan: \"...\"","Ji Yanchuan: \"??\"","Does she know how rare it is for Weisheng Wenzhan to ask for someone's WeChat?","She actually refused?!","Weisheng Wenzhan's eyes darkened, a hint of displeasure flashing through.","No one had ever turned him down before.","He calmly put his phone away, his smile already distant: \"Alright.\"","Qiao Chuchu gave an apologetic smile.","What's the point of adding each other if we're not going to talk?","Unfortunately, she was good at scolding but not praising, and she didn't know how to make her refusal sound smoother, so she awkwardly waved: \"I'm leaving first.\"","[I don't want to get involved too much. I just want to be close to my son's life, but stay away from his daily affairs.]","Ji Yanchuan sneered, staring at her retreating back: \"Hmph, how ignorant. Mr. Weisheng, shall we... eh? Where are you going?\"","Qiao Chuchu had walked a few steps away when she suddenly felt a broad figure looming behind her.","She reflexively shrank her neck, and her phone was snatched away.","Weisheng Wenzhan walked in front of her, held her phone up to her face for facial recognition.","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","Weisheng Wenzhan opened her WeChat, scanned the QR code, added her as a friend, and handed the phone back to her: \"Thank you.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","Weisheng Wenzhan brushed past her decisively.","She stared in shock at his back, then at her own WeChat.","[Refusing to add WeChat and still getting forced to? Is this the legendary Weisheng family, where they get whatever they want? Even if it's a bitter melon, they'll still take a bite?]","Weisheng Wenzhan took his phone and added a note for Qiao Chuchu, not even turning back.","He never cared whether the melon he twisted off was sweet or not.","He just wanted the melon by his side.","She had been calling him her son for half an hour, and he had endured it without saying anything, but when it came to adding WeChat, she refused him.","Hmph.","Qiao Chuchu had no choice but to put her phone away. As she turned around, she accidentally met Pei Youchuan's cold gaze.","He stood at the entrance of the restaurant, accompanied by a few male friends, not sure how long he had been standing there."]},{"number":71,"title":"Chapter 71: Do you know, Wen Zhan, that Qiao Chuchu is a siscon","paragraphs":["Pei Youchuan's gaze pierced through the noisy crowd, like a silver-tipped spear aimed straight at Qiao Chuchu's face.","If this were a fantasy world, Qiao Chuchu felt her protective transparent barrier was already beginning to shatter.","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","Pei Youchuan had just told her that she was not allowed to add anyone else on WeChat.","And then, she was caught red-handed adding someone on WeChat.","What is bad luck?","This is bad luck.","Qiao Chuchu couldn't help but feel uneasy, pondering what might happen next.","Pei Youchuan was a smooth operator, and he would never let her get away with adding someone on WeChat and then deleting them.","But some small tricks were definitely on the table.","[Although we agreed not to add outsiders on WeChat, I couldn't handle this special situation, as I might have to see the Wei Sheng Clan members frequently in the future.]","Qiao Chuchu scratched her head: [But what kind of status do I have to be able to see the Wei Sheng Clan members frequently? They are all extremely famous big shots.]","As she was thinking, Pei Youchuan spoke a few words to the person next to him and then parted ways, heading towards Weisheng Wenzhan.","Weisheng Wenzhan and Ji Yanchuan were in the VIP lounge.","This luxury cruise ship's buffet breakfast was divided into three levels, and only the wealthy and powerful could appear in this breakfast restaurant. The VIP area was even more exclusive, reserved for guests staying in presidential and deluxe suites. The door was equipped with facial recognition, and only guests staying in those suites could enter.","This area offered superior service compared to other breakfast restaurants. Out of the entire luxury cruise ship, only ten families had the privilege to enjoy this area. Coincidentally, only two families were present here at the moment.","Pei Youchuan passed through the automatically opening sensor door and sat in a position parallel to Weisheng Wenzhan.","Qiao Chuchu felt something was off and peered through the blurry glass at Pei Youchuan's figure.","Weisheng Wenzhan glanced at him coolly.","Pei Youchuan ordered a few breakfast items and then turned back, waving in Qiao Chuchu's direction.","Qiao Chuchu thought he wasn't calling her and looked around.","Pei Youchuan's eyes flashed with a hint of anger, and he pointed at her, mouthing, \"You.\"","Qiao Chuchu entered the VIP area with doubts. The moment she stepped in, the area isolated the noise of children crying, screaming, and people chatting outside.","It was uncomfortably quiet.","She obediently sat down in the booth.","Pei Youchuan's face was adorned with a casual and carefree smile: \"Didn't eat breakfast yet?\"","Qiao Chuchu gave him a strange look: \"No.\"","[Bro, you were just yelling at me like a seagull, and now you've suddenly turned into a model of brotherly kindness. It's making me feel really uncomfortable.]","Pei Youchuan: \"...\"","Weisheng Wenzhan's lips curled upward: \"Young Master Ji.\"","Ji Yanchuan, who was speaking nonstop across from him: \"Hmm?\"","Weisheng Wenzhan's face carried a distant smile: \"Let's eat.\"","Ji Yanchuan was surprised: \"But I haven't finished.\"","Wenzhan's smile didn't reach his eyes: \"Eat first, I'll consider it when I get back.\"","Ji Yanchuan's brows furrowed slightly.","That meant he wasn't interested.","He smiled: \"Alright.\"","Ji Yanchuan shot a glare at Qiao Chuchu with his peripheral vision.","What, not only did she badmouth him to Weisheng Wenzhan, but she also had to barge in during his business negotiations?","He glanced at Weisheng Wenzhan, who was quietly eating, and then at Qiao Chuchu, who seemed uneasy.","Since there were only the four of them here, he decided to let loose.","He smiled: \"When I was in school, I heard some interesting stories.\"","Weisheng Wenzhan looked at him.","He picked up his black coffee, smiling meaningfully: \"I heard that the eighth daughter of the Pei family was pursuing her seven older brothers.\"","Qiao Chuchu, sipping hot water: \"Pfft!\"","Pei Youchuan shot a cold glare at Ji Yanchuan: \"Try spreading that rumor again.\"","Ji Yanchuan laughed: \"Pei Youchuan, you don't need to defend your sister like that. This isn't a rumor; it's a secret many people in our circle know.\"","He smiled at Weisheng Wenzhan: \"Mr. Weisheng, have you heard about this?\"","Weisheng Wenzhan's lips carried a thought-provoking smile as he looked at Qiao Chuchu with interest: \"No.\"","Qiao Chuchu wiped the water stains off the table, feeling the intense gazes of the two men, and began to feel uneasy.","[Ji Yanchuan, with your mouth, are you even the male lead? You look more like a gossipy old lady from the village!]","Ji Yanchuan laughed: \"I'm really curious, Qiao Chuchu, what kind of mindset led you to pursue the seven brothers who raised you with great care? Don't you find it disgusting?\"","Pei Youchuan slammed the table and stood up!","Qiao Chuchu retorted without backing down: \"Because I like pushing the boundaries of what society defines.\"","Pei Youchuan: \"?\"","Weisheng Wenzhan: \"?\"","Ji Yanchuan: \"?\"","She leaned back on the sofa, exuding confidence, and crossed her hands: \"They are seven handsome men who treat me well. When I'm sick, they take care of me diligently. They know my likes and dislikes by heart and pamper me every day. How can I not love them?\"","\"When I'm broke, they go out of their way to raise money for me, even putting their lives on the line. When I'm rich, they fear they can't give me enough, buying me houses, cars, and clothes.\"","\"When I want something, I just glance at it, lift my chin, and it's mine.\"","Qiao Chuchu smiled seductively, lazily crossing her legs: \"But the thought of them leaving me to be with others, whether they are men or women, and sharing the love they give me, makes me furious.\"","\"So I made my move.\"","Qiao Chuchu sighed, somewhat regretful: \"I thought I would see my brothers struggle, torn between morality and desire, lost and restrained, liking me but not daring to say it, and ultimately wanting to devour me. But they just don't feel the same way. All my efforts were in vain.\"","Pei Youchuan's gaze deepened as he stared at Qiao Chuchu, his Adam's apple moving up and down.","Weisheng Wenzhan rested his chin on his hand, watching Pei Youchuan's reaction with interest.","Only Ji Yanchuan was left in the dark.","He had deliberately mocked Qiao Chuchu, but she had admitted it so gracefully that it made him look like the instigator.","Qiao Chuchu stood up and walked over to Ji Yanchuan: \"My plan failed, and I've already apologized to my brothers. If you're trying to provoke my sense of morality or make me feel ashamed, I'm sorry to tell you, I have no morality, and I don't feel ashamed.\"","She smiled with hidden daggers: \"If I had morals, I wouldn't have pursued my brothers. I'm a pervert, and I want seven handsome men. Only more, never less.\"","She leaned down, her hands resting on the table: \"Do you have anything else to say?\""]},{"number":72,"title":"Chapter 72: The Surface is a Brother, but Secretly a Man","paragraphs":["Ji Yanchuan's mouth twitched, and he spoke sarcastically, \"You're really honest, aren't you?\"","Qiao Chuchu replied with a smile, \"Yes, my biggest virtue is honesty. Unlike you, your mother was a mistress who got herself into the family, and your father hid it from his then-legal wife.\"","Ji Yanchuan's expression gradually faded.","Qiao Chuchu's eyes were full of mockery. \"You, who are the product of moral decay, dare to laugh at others for lacking moral integrity?\"","Ji Yanchuan raised his hand to attack her!","Qiao Chuchu slapped his hand down on the table!","\"Clang!\" The loud noise startled the waitstaff.","Qiao Chuchu stood over Ji Yanchuan, pressing him down, speaking slowly and deliberately, \"Your own father is a philandering scoundrel, and you, during your engagement, were entangled with other women. You're just a potential scoundrel yourself.\"","Ji Yanchuan's breathing became rapid, like a cat whose fur had been ruffled, too angry to speak.","She smiled triumphantly, \"Look around at the rest of us here. Who else is the child of a mistress like you? What makes you think you're qualified to mock me?\"","\"Wake up.\"","\"Given your father's character, if you were a girl, you wouldn't even be here.\"","Qiao Chuchu straightened up and left with a cold laugh, \"I'm outta here.\"","Her back was proud and aloof, but inside, she was screaming, *【I'm the cold, ruthless villainess who’s back from the dead to groom the male supporting characters!】*","*【It turns out that the image you project to the world is entirely up to you!】*","*【I’m freaking amazing!!】*","*【Mock me for being a psychopath? Then I’ll show you a psychopath! As long as I have no morals, no one can use them to manipulate me!!】*","*【I won this verbal battle. Ji Yanchuan will probably cry himself to sleep tonight.】*","*【And me?】*","*【Ha!】*","*【My breasts have never been blocked in my entire life!】*","*【I’m out!】*","She strode out through the automatic doors, tossing her hair back as she walked away with grace.","Pei Youchuan: \"......\"","Weisheng Wenzhan: \"......\"","They hadn't expected that Qiao Chuchu, with just a simple turn, had so many internal monologues hidden within.","Pei Youchuan watched Qiao Chuchu's retreating figure with a hint of regret.","If he had known she was this eloquent, he would have saved this scene for the Spring Festival Gala.","The two men turned their gaze toward Ji Yanchuan.","Ji Yanchuan's face was ashen. \"Mr. Weisheng, I've lost my appetite. I'll take my leave first.\"","He stood up and left.","Pei Youchuan's heart tightened as he peered out the window.","Was Ji Yanchuan going to cause trouble for Qiao Chuchu?","He still had things to take care of.","Pei Youchuan pulled a telescope out of his pocket and locked onto Qiao Chuchu's retreating figure.","Qiao Chuchu went left.","Ji Yanchuan went right.","Ji Yanchuan showed no intention of going after Qiao Chuchu.","After hesitating for three seconds, Pei Youchuan decisively stood up to leave, only to meet Weisheng Wenzhan's penetrating gaze.","Weisheng Wenzhan lounged comfortably in the sofa, legs crossed, hands in his pockets, smiling as he watched him, \"Using a telescope to spy on your sister, huh? You're well-equipped.\"","Pei Youchuan's urgency was instantly replaced with a surge of anger, and he stood still.","Weisheng Wenzhan broke the silence first, \"Do you have something you want to say to me?\"","Pei Youchuan raised an eyebrow, \"Why do you ask?\"","\"I saw you when I added Qiao Chuchu's WeChat,\" Weisheng Wenzhan took a sip of his coffee, \"You were glaring at me.\"","Pei Youchuan's eyelid twitched, his breathing steadied, and he spoke lightly, \"It can't be helped. My sister is beautiful, comes from a good family, and there are too many bad people out there. As her brother, I have to scrutinize every man who gets close to her. If my gaze offended you earlier, I'm sorry.\"","He grinned, \"I meant it on purpose.\"","Weisheng Wenzhan smiled along, \"Pei Youchuan, CEO of Beidou Company, your mobile game company has done remarkably well, with top rankings in both domestic and international revenue streams. You're quite the young achiever.\"","His eyebrows arched, his posture relaxed, \"But are you out of your mind? Talking to me like this.\"","Pei Youchuan: \"?\"","Weisheng Wenzhan tilted his head, sizing him up, his smile turning cold, \"Even if you are from the Pei family, I've heard about your family's methods, but I, Weisheng Wenzhan, am not someone to be trifled with. Show some respect when speaking to your elders.\"","\"Otherwise...\"","He chuckled merrily, \"I might just have to... deal with your sister—\"","Pei Youchuan grabbed him by the neck and slammed him onto the sofa!","\"Don't you dare think about my sister!\" Pei Youchuan, like a panther with explosive strength, fiercely tightened his grip around his throat, \"She's not someone you can touch!!\"","The waitstaff hurried over to intervene but hesitated to touch the VIPs. \"Sir, please calm down! Be friendly!\"","Pei Youchuan shook off the onlookers, grabbed Weisheng Wenzhan's collar, and growled, \"Weisheng Wenzhan, I don't care who you are, but we're both men, and I can see it. You're twenty years older than her! Stay away from her!\"","Weisheng Wenzhan, unfazed, let himself be hoisted by the collar, and smirked, \"Why the rush? I wasn't talking about myself. I don't waste time on romantic entanglements. I was just playing matchmaker for my brother.\"","Pei Youchuan froze.","Weisheng Wenzhan blinked, \"You know, Weisheng Huailing, who's even a year younger than Qiao Chuchu.\"","He smiled confidently, \"My brother fell head over heels for Qiao Chuchu at first sight and wants to marry her.\"","Pei Youchuan's head buzzed, \"I won't allow it!\"","Wenzhan calmly retorted, \"You won't allow it because my brother is deaf and not fully capable, or because you wouldn't allow it for any capable man?\"","Pei Youchuan: \"?\"","Weisheng Wenzhan leaned forward, his gaze sharp as a poisoned blade, smiling at him, \"Qiao Chuchu just said that she gets angry thinking about you eventually being with someone else, but I don't think that's what she really feels, because if she were truly angry, she'd act like you do.\"","Pei Youchuan's eyes flashed with murderous intent, his fingers tightening, on the verge of a homicidal frenzy.","Wenzhan laughed even more gleefully, his tone full of amusement, \"On the surface, you're scrutinizing men who approach your sister, but in reality, you're driving away all intruders. The tug-of-war between rationality and desire—it's just a bit of spice in an otherwise dull life.\"","\"Now I understand what Qiao Chuchu meant by 'interesting.'\"","Weisheng Wenzhan stared at him openly, smiling, \"On the surface, you're her brother, but in the shadows, you're a man.\"","Pei Youchuan's face drained of color, but he clenched his teeth, like a lion defending his territory, \"Don't waste your breath on me. If you dare hurt her, I'll take you down with me. You may be Weisheng Wenzhan, but we both only have one life!\"","Weisheng Wenzhan looked puzzled, \"Why do you assume I'd hurt her?\"","Qiao Chuchu called him her son in her mind, and he never expressed any dissatisfaction.","He had been more than indulgent with her.","Pei Youchuan sneered, \"Anyone who doesn't meet the Weisheng family's expectations disappears. Should I continue?\"","Weisheng Wenzhan's smile vanished instantly, glancing at the surrounding waitstaff.","The waitstaff scattered quickly, pretending not to have heard anything.","Weisheng Wenzhan sighed, genuinely puzzled, \"You know, with the Pei family being so powerful, I wonder why there are only a few of you left now?\"","Pei Youchuan narrowed his eyes but didn't answer.","Wenzhan smiled kindly again, \"Don't worry, I won't do anything to Qiao Chuchu. She's quite important to me.\"","Pei Youchuan: \"?\"","He grabbed a fork from the table.","Weisheng Wenzhan raised an eyebrow, unperturbed, \"Such strong possessiveness yet you still restrain yourself. If I were you, I would have already claimed my place.\"","Pei Youchuan's eyelid twitched, his disgust evident, \"Don't think our family is as twisted as yours.\"","Weisheng Wenzhan didn't get angry, \"Do you want to know what's truly twisted?\"","He suddenly lunged forward!","Pei Youchuan prepared to counterattack, but saw Weisheng Wenzhan's hand slide forcefully across the fork!","Blood splattered across both their faces!","Pei Youchuan staggered back, shocked, looking at Weisheng Wenzhan, who was holding his hand.","Blood was gushing from his carotid artery.","Weisheng Wenzhan didn't even flinch, pulling out his phone to video call Qiao Chuchu.","Pei Youchuan's face changed, rushing to grab the phone, \"Don't call her!\"","Qiao Chuchu, who had been playing with her phone, answered instantly, \"What's wrong, Mr. Weisheng?\"","Weisheng Wenzhan held his phone, a drop of blood still lingering at the corner of his eye, as he raised his hand, revealing his wrist dripping with fresh blood, to show Qiao Chuchu.","\"Could you come back to the private room for a moment? Your brother injured me.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"!\"","She was shocked, her gaze shifting away as she noticed Pei Youchuan standing behind Weisheng Wenzhan.","He still held a fork stained with blood, looking utterly lost as their eyes met: \"Qiao Chuchu...\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\""]},{"number":73,"title":"Chapter 73: Wen Zhan: Watch my thousand-layer tactics. Qiao Chuchu: Thousand layers Where are the thousand layers","paragraphs":["Ten minutes later.","Qiao Chuchu stood at the door of the infirmary, jumping up to slap Pei Youchuan on the back of his head: \"Are you crazy?!\"","Pei Youchuan closed his eyes from the blow, lowering his head and enduring silently.","Qiao Chuchu was so angry that she started slapping him wildly: \"Are you crazy? Are you crazy? Are you crazy? Are you crazy?!\"","Pei Youchuan obediently took the hits, but looked at her unconvinced.","Qiao Chuchu's hands were shaking with anger: \"I was only gone for a little while, and you hurt someone! Are you a nuclear bomb or something? It doesn't matter if it's Weisheng Wenzhan inside, even if it were a dog, you shouldn't hurt it!\"","Pei Youchuan looked resentful: \"He deliberately ran into me! He came with the intention of cutting his carotid artery! He's not well-intentioned, he's trying to seduce you, acting pitiful to get close to you!\"","Qiao Chuchu's head was buzzing: \"He's seducing me?\"","Pei Youchuan nodded vigorously!","Qiao Chuchu looked at him in disbelief: \"In your mind, does every man seduce me? Except you, every man in the world seduces me. Am I a goddess or something?!\"","Pei Youchuan was stunned, his eyes suddenly turning red. Without thinking, he blurted out: \"How could I seduce you? Besides the two of us, there are still six brothers in our family!\"","After saying this, Pei Youchuan's face suddenly darkened, and he tightly closed his mouth.","Qiao Chuchu didn't understand what he meant: \"I didn't know I had seven brothers. Out of seven, you're the most impatient!\"","Pei Youchuan sneered: \"Yes, I'm impatient, I'm not good, Weisheng Wenzhan is good, you think he's perfect!\"","Qiao Chuchu was incredulous: \"? How can you two even be compared?\"","【What a fool! You're my third brother! What does it matter if Weisheng Wenzhan is dead?! I'm worried that you'll be retaliated against by Weisheng Wenzhan's family. Their family is ruthless, without a moral bottom line in the script's setting!】","【I'm already worried that Pei Youchuan will be killed by the plot, and now he's going against the big boss of the Weisheng family?! What if there's a twist in the story? Will I have to cry at his funeral?】","【He doesn't understand my heart at all, and he's accusing me for no reason. He's sick!】","Pei Youchuan: \"?\"","His anger instantly disappeared, and he stared at her in astonishment.","Qiao Chuchu suddenly calmed down.","【Oh, no, Weisheng Wenzhan can't die either. He's just like the male lead in my comic, he's my son. After all, he's a living son-like character, and I have to protect him too.】","Pei Youchuan: \"??????\"","Son?","Is Weisheng Wenzhan her son from the comic?!","At that moment, the secretary inside the infirmary came out: \"Miss Qiao, Mr. Weisheng is better now. He wants to see you.\"","Qiao Chuchu nodded and walked in.","Pei Youchuan followed closely behind, but the secretary stopped him: \"Mr. Weisheng only wants to see Miss Qiao.\"","Qiao Chuchu glanced back at Pei Youchuan and signaled: \"It's okay, wait for me here.\"","【I saved Weisheng Yucan's life, so maybe I can help Pei Youchuan out of this mess.】","Pei Youchuan: \"...\"","Damn it!","He had fallen for the Weisheng family again and even owed Qiao Chuchu a favor.","Why couldn't he learn his lesson? Weisheng Huailing, who could run in tiny steps, definitely had a brother who could act pitiful!","-","Qiao Chuchu pushed the door open: \"Mr. Weisheng?\"","【My big son, let your mom take a look at you.】","Weisheng Wenzhan, hearing the words \"my big son,\" couldn't help but twitch the corner of his mouth slightly.","He gestured for her to sit beside him: \"Sit.\"","Qiao Chuchu awkwardly waved her hand: \"I'll just stand.\"","【First, you're a big boss, and my brother hurt you, so I need to apologize for him. Second, you look exactly like the male lead in my comic, sitting next to you, I can't handle it.】","Weisheng Wenzhan's gaze was deep: \"If you want to apologize, then sit beside me. Let's talk properly.\"","Qiao Chuchu was stunned. Seeing that he wasn't joking, she reluctantly sat down: \"My brother—\"","\"I don't intend to pursue your brother's matter,\" Weisheng Wenzhan calmly placed his hand beside her. \"You don't need to use Weisheng Yucan's favor to cover for me. She is her own, and I am my own.\"","Qiao Chuchu was shocked.","【Wow, as expected of a big boss, he knows what I'm thinking. Does he have telepathy or something?】","【But if he doesn't want this or that, what does he want?】","Qiao Chuchu glanced at Wenzhan's hand beside her leg and took a deep breath.","【Does he want me?!】","【No way, no way, no way. Just hearing this would make me collapse. How could I sign books for my readers in the future?】","She was so anxious that she started picking at her hands: 【But Weisheng Wenzhan isn't my son, he just looks the same. He's a real person, I can't project my thoughts onto him.】","【But... I can't help it!】","【Help me, I finally understand what it means to have someone similar to a loved one!】","Weisheng Wenzhan: \"...\"","So noisy.","He had only said one sentence, and Qiao Chuchu's thoughts were like a floodgate opening.","He rubbed his temples: \"My hand is injured, and I need someone to take care of me temporarily, help me with some small tasks, since my secretary is too busy.\"","Qiao Chuchu came back to her senses, surprised: \"That's the request?\"","Weisheng Wenzhan nodded, purposely asking: \"Yes, otherwise, what did you think?\"","Qiao Chuchu let out a sigh of relief: \"Then you should have said so earlier. You scared me. I thought you—\"","Her words stopped abruptly as she changed the topic: \"Wait here.\"","Qiao Chuchu directly dragged the wary Pei Youchuan inside: \"Brother, Mr. Weisheng has decided to forgive you. As long as you take care of his daily life, you two can make up!\"","Pei Youchuan: \"?\"","Weisheng Wenzhan: \"? Qiao Chuchu, I said it's you.\"","Qiao Chuchu was confused: \"Why me? I didn't stab you.\"","Weisheng Wenzhan: \"...\"","\"If you want me to forgive your brother, you have to take care of me.\"","Qiao Chuchu was incredulous: \"Why? Is it because I'm a woman? Is that it? Is that it?\"","Her expression gradually turned disdainful: \"Are you that kind of cheap man?\"","Weisheng Wenzhan: \"...\"","Of course not.","He just wanted to hear her thoughts and naturally bring her closer to him, even living together.","Otherwise, why would he go through all this trouble?","The secretary quickly stepped forward: \"Miss Qiao, it's like this. Our Mr. Weisheng thinks you graduated from a prestigious university, and he happens to like that school, so he believes you two have common topics.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"But my degree was bought.\"","The secretary's mouth twitched: \"But it's... a very famous university.\"","Qiao Chuchu seriously explained: \"Yes, it's famous, so it's very expensive. I donated a teaching building.\"","The secretary's eyes widened: \"Then you must have been an excellent student?\"","\"Also bought,\" Qiao Chuchu said flatly. \"It's hard to change one's nature. I'm a terrible student, don't doubt it.\"","The secretary: \"...\"","\"But!\" Qiao Chuchu pushed Pei Youchuan forward: \"My third brother's degree is real. He graduated with a master's from MIT! A genuine top student!\"","She proudly put her hands on her hips, looking at Weisheng Wenzhan: \"What do you think? It's hard not to be impressed, right?\"","Weisheng Wenzhan's face remained expressionless: \"I also went to MIT.\"","Qiao Chuchu's eyes lit up: \"Then you two have even more in common. Double the joy! Yay!!~\"","Weisheng Wenzhan: \"...\"","Pei Youchuan: \"...\"","The secretary: \"...\""]},{"number":74,"title":"Chapter 74: Wei Shengwenzhan: Today I experienced for the first time what it means for a duck to fly away just as it reaches your mouth.","paragraphs":["Weisheng Wenzhan was very unhappy.","He was supposed to have Qiao Chuchu by his side, so how did it turn into Pei Youchuan?","He took a deep breath and carefully said to Qiao Chuchu, \"Well, since your brother is the one who caused my injury, he might suddenly go crazy around me. To prevent that from happening, whenever your brother is taking care of me, you must stand by my side.\"","Pei Youchuan was displeased. \"My sister Qiao Chuchu doesn't know how to take care of people. She can't even pour a cup of water. What is she doing standing by your side? Showing off how many people you have to boost your ego?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...Brother, I can pour water.\"","Pei Youchuan glared at her. \"You can't!\"","Weisheng Wenzhan smiled calmly. \"Or perhaps, when you two siblings stand by my side, I'm the one adding the presence to you.\"","Pei Youchuan thought about it and realized it might be true.","He quickly went from reluctantly unwilling to reluctantly willing.","He negotiated, \"Only when I'm around. My sister has to paint; she can't be around you all the time.\"","Qiao Chuchu was surprised. \"Wow, you even know I have work to do.\"","【Knowing I paint, you still make trouble, drink and make me pick you up, and even cut your wrist, causing Weisheng Wenzhan to get a tetanus shot. I heard tetanus is a shot in the butt, I wonder if the big boss Weisheng is afraid of getting a shot in the butt.】","Weisheng Wenzhan: \"......?\"","Pei Youchuan, who had been looking displeased, suddenly smirked. \"By the way, Mr. Weisheng, you got a tetanus shot. I heard it's a shot in the butt. I wonder if it hurts, hehe~\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"!\"","【Pei Youchuan is just as nosy as me!】","Pei Youchuan smiled smugly.","Weisheng Wenzhan narrowed his eyes dangerously. \"You can try it and see.\"","He suddenly grabbed a fork that Pei Youchuan had used and, like a leopard, swiftly stabbed Pei Youchuan's hand!","Pei Youchuan couldn't dodge in time, and his hand instantly bled profusely. \"!\"","His wound was longer and deeper than Weisheng Wenzhan's, covering his entire hand.","Weisheng Wenzhan's lips curved in delight. \"Go get a tetanus shot, Pei Youchuan. Then you'll know if it hurts.\"","He slowly turned to Qiao Chuchu. \"Remember to hold your brother down, so he doesn't jump up in fear of the needle.\"","Qiao Chuchu was dumbfounded. \"But if that happens, you two will be even, because he stabbed you once, and you stabbed him once. One on the palm, one on the wrist. Your wrist wound didn't hit the artery, just like my brother's, it just looks scary.\"","Weisheng Wenzhan: \"?\"","Pei Youchuan, dripping with blood: \"?\"","Weisheng Wenzhan laughed angrily. \"Qiao Chuchu, are you trying to deny it?\"","Qiao Chuchu trembled, both timid and reasonable. \"Sorry, but I think you two really are even. But my brother can pay for his own tetanus shot since he was the one being rude first.\"","Pei Youchuan: \"?\"","She lowered her eyes and glanced at Weisheng Wenzhan with her peripheral vision. \"If you're not satisfied with the compensation, we can continue to negotiate. After all, my brother was the one who started it, so you can have him continue to serve you.\"","Weisheng Wenzhan narrowed his eyes, his deep, long pupils filled with unreadable intentions.","The secretary holding a tablet nearby shivered violently.","Oh no!","Mr. Weisheng is angry!","Qiao Chuchu was unaware, her head lowered, not daring to look at Weisheng Wenzhan.","A pale hand suddenly pinched her cheek, forcing her to look up.","Qiao Chuchu winced in pain as her eyes met Weisheng Wenzhan's dangerous gaze.","Pei Youchuan quickly stepped forward. \"Weisheng Wenzhan, let go of her!!\"","The secretary acted quickly and held Pei Youchuan back. \"Mr. Weisheng, I can probably hold him for a minute and a half! Please hurry!!\"","Qiao Chuchu was confused.","Wenzhan pinched her cheek and leaned down closer to her.","A faint sweet peach scent wafted over.","Qiao Chuchu was a bit distracted and glanced at the table next to her.","There was a pack of peach-flavored soft candy with juice inside.","It was all gone.","Did he eat the whole pack?","Her cheek hurt, and she looked back into Weisheng Wenzhan's eyes.","His aura was overwhelming as he looked her up and down, his tone meaningful. \"The duck that lands in my mouth never flies away, but today, it grew legs.\"","Qiao Chuchu's mouth was pinched into a pout, and she was a bit confused, her speech unclear. \"Is my brother a duck?\"","\"No,\" Weisheng Wenzhan chuckled, his gaze even more dangerous. \"The food is someone else, the first person to make me go home empty-handed.\"","\"But it's not the food's fault,\" Weisheng Wenzhan stared into her eyes, speaking slowly. \"It's my lack of caution, leaving a loophole for the food to take the lead.\"","Qiao Chuchu still didn't understand.","【Who is he talking about?】","【Could it be that he's interested in my brother?!】","Qiao Chuchu's eyes widened like saucers. 【No way, my comic is a BG story!!】","Weisheng Wenzhan's lips curved up as he leaned closer to her ear. \"Don't worry, I'm not interested in your brother. You don't need to overthink. I'm just giving you a heads-up. You made me unhappy, even though it's my fault.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...Then do you want to watch funny videos with me?\"","Weisheng Wenzhan: \"?\"","She took out her phone with a sincere expression. \"I just saw a few funny videos. How about I share them with you?\"","Weisheng Wenzhan: \"??\"","He chuckled again, his smile enigmatic. \"I'm already happy.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","【What the heck, one minute he's happy, the next he's not. Is he a blowfish? Angry and puffy, not angry and deflated.】","Weisheng Wenzhan's lips curled in a cryptic smile as he patted her head. \"You're right, Qiao Chuchu. What happened between me and your brother is indeed my fault. We're even.\"","He walked past her, leaving behind a faint scent of freshness and peach sweetness.","Qiao Chuchu was stunned. \"Wait.\"","Wenzhan turned to look at her.","She pointed at the peach-flavored soft candy on the table. \"Do you like peach-flavored soft candy?\"","【Please tell me you do!】","【My comic's son loves peach-flavored stuff!! It's his charm point! I set that up as his charm point!!】","Weisheng Wenzhan raised his chin, looking down at her. \"I ate them.\"","Qiao Chuchu's face turned red instantly, her eyes lighting up with excitement. \"That's so coincidental.\"","Weisheng Wenzhan tilted his head, his smile enigmatic. \"You like them too?\"","She nodded vigorously!","Wenzhan comfortably stuffed his hands in his pockets and stood at the door, speaking softly, \"I like biting into the soft outer shell of the candy and tasting the even softer, flowing center. Because the outside is already so soft, the inside is even softer, almost like I'm bullying the candy, which relaxes me.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"......\"","【......No wonder he's a big boss. First, there's Yu Can who gets tired of men and switches to Li Jiahao to cleanse her palate, and now there's Weisheng Wenzhan who enjoys peach-flavored soft candy with a juicy center.】","Weisheng Wenzhan smiled even more happily. \"I'm leaving now, Miss Qiao. Aren't you going to say goodbye?\""]},{"number":75,"title":"Chapter 75: Qiao Chuchu, you've changed, you've become unfeeling towards giegie.","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu snapped out of her daze and waved her hand obediently: \"Goodbye!\"","Wen Zhan let out a soft chuckle at the corner of his mouth, his gaze lingering on her face for a moment before he turned and left decisively.","The secretary quickly let go of Pei Youchuan and caught up with Weisheng Wenzhan.","Qiao Chuchu hurried over to Pei Youchuan's side: \"Quick, let's get your wound bandaged, and you'll need a tetanus shot too.\"","Pei Youchuan's hand was still dripping with blood, and he ignored her, his gaze darkening as he stared at Weisheng Wenzhan's retreating back.","Wen Zhan suddenly turned his head to glance at him.","Pei Youchuan's face darkened, and he smoothly wrapped his arm around Qiao Chuchu's shoulders: \"Ah, I feel dizzy.\"","Qiao Chuchu quickly supported him: \"You're dizzy just from losing this much blood? You don't look like a weakling to me.\"","Pei Youchuan: \"?\"","He leaned down closer to her, unwilling to let it go and asked, \"Weren't you very fond of me before? Every time I got hurt, you would bandage my wounds with a Band-Aid, blow on them, and even shed tears. Why are you so indifferent now that your brother is hurt like this?\"","Weisheng Wenzhan raised an eyebrow, stepping into the transparent elevator, his gaze fixed on the two of them at the end of the corridor.","Qiao Chuchu frowned: \"I've already told you that I'm different now. I was confused before, but I won't continue doing those immoral things anymore.\"","Pei Youchuan's face darkened, his tone turning cold: \"Do you think it's immoral to bandage my wounds after I'm injured?\"","She sighed: \"No.\"","【The immorality lies in my true intentions behind the bandaging. Before, I did it with the task of seduction in mind, but now I don't need to seduce anyone.】","【Besides, we're already in the medical room. If you need someone to help bandage, just call them in. I can't be more professional than the medical staff.】","Pei Youchuan gazed at her.","A year ago, he had injured himself while playing sports. Qiao Chuchu sat across from him, holding his hand with her fair fingers.","She carefully disinfected his wound with tweezers: \"Does it hurt?\"","He remained silent, resistant.","Qiao Chuchu held his hand to her mouth, her watery eyes fixed on him, and gently blew on the wound.","The pain eased a bit.","She openly seduced him, her eyes sparkling with a dangerously flirtatious light, tears falling in big drops: \"I'm sorry for you, Brother Three.\"","\"Let me hold your hand until the bleeding stops.\"","That day, he didn't speak or refuse, just silently watched her until the wound finally stopped bleeding.","Pei Youchuan snapped back to the present, his breathing a bit rushed, his Adam's apple moving as he looked at Qiao Chuchu beside him.","Qiao Chuchu was barefaced, dressed for comfort in a large T-shirt and wide-legged pants, completely different from the exquisitely dressed woman of the past. Her expression as she supported him was as calm as if she were carrying a lifeless body.","His gaze was somewhat dazed, then suddenly alert, as he looked at the transparent elevator across the way.","Weisheng Wenzhan stood in the elevator, his gaze cold and sharp, filled with a dangerous edge.","Pei Youchuan suddenly smirked, leaned down, and swept Qiao Chuchu into the room.","Wen Zhan: \"?\"","The door of the health room slammed shut with a bang!","The man's strength was evident, clearly not wanting any interruptions.","The secretary also witnessed this scene and asked for instructions: \"Mr. Wei?\"","Weisheng Wenzhan was displeased: \"Leave.\"","The secretary nodded and finally released the button holding the elevator door open.","The elevator slowly ascended.","The temperature in the medical room also suddenly rose.","Qiao Chuchu was pinned under Pei Youchuan, shocked and staring at him in astonishment.","Pei Youchuan repeated his old tricks, straddling her, using his blood-stained hand to sweep back his hair: \"I didn't mean to, I just got too dizzy.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"......Then why don't you get off?\"","【I think he's deliberate. How could he fall so smoothly onto the bed?】","【But he's usually so righteous, like a total jerk, so he probably wouldn't do something like this to me. He's probably not deliberate. I shouldn't think the worst of him.】","【After all, if he were interested in me, he would have been unable to resist when I was seducing him before.】","Qiao Chuchu snapped back to reality, glaring at him with disgust: \"Why are you still not getting off?\"","Pei Youchuan looked down at her with an air of righteousness: \"I'm dizzy, I can't move.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","She grabbed his waist and threw him onto the bed: \"Ha!\"","Pei Youchuan: \"?????\"","Qiao Chuchu triumphantly shook her head: \"Although I can't beat you, I can still sneak attack you. Feeling any dizzier now?\"","Pei Youchuan raised an eyebrow, leaning comfortably against the bed, his fox-like eyes gleaming with cunning: \"No dizziness, but with you leaning over me like this, I feel like you're trying to force me to submit again.\"","Qiao Chuchu was momentarily stunned, realizing she was in a position leaning over Pei Youchuan.","She quickly rolled off the bed, her entire body radiating repulsion and innocence: \"Don't misunderstand me! I've already quit being a pervert, I have no feelings for you anymore. I'll wait for you outside while you get your shot!\"","Pei Youchuan: \"......\"","Qiao Chuchu strode out quickly.","Pei Youchuan let out an annoyed soft click, placing his hand on the back of his head.","This is so annoying.","However...","Thinking of Weisheng Wenzhan's green face, he smirked triumphantly: \"Forget it, since I've already won, I might as well get the shot!\"","Qiao Chuchu fetched a doctor to treat Pei Youchuan's wound.","She went to the corridor to wait.","Her phone suddenly rang.","Weisheng Wenzhan: \"There's a ball tonight on the rooftop. Would you be my dance partner?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"......\"","Even here, there's a ball to attend?","She politely declined: \"I don't have an evening gown, let's skip it.\"","Weisheng Wenzhan: \"I'll buy one for you.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","She asked: \"Do you know my size?\"","Weisheng Wenzhan: \"I will find out.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?????????\"","Weisheng Wenzhan: \"There will be many of my acquaintances at tonight's banquet. Your brother injured my hand, and I really can't ask anyone else to dance with me. I don't want my partner to feel slighted. I think you'll understand.\"","Qiao Chuchu hesitated a bit.","Hmm...","She still didn't want to.","She wanted to keep her distance from Weisheng Wenzhan, but this issue was indeed Pei Youchuan's fault.","Family always has to cover for each other.","She hesitated: \"I'll ask my brother, if he agrees, I'll go. I can't guarantee anything.\"","Weisheng Wenzhan was silent for a moment: \"If your brother doesn't agree, that's fine. You can just accompany me for one dance. I hope your brother can forgive my rudeness.\"","Qiao Chuchu was alarmed: \"No, no, absolutely not, my brother won't be angry. Your request is very normal, please don't think that way. It's him who was rude, causing you trouble.\"","Weisheng Wenzhan: \"Your brother doesn't like me. I don't think he'll agree, even though he injured me.\"","\"It's fine, I don't have to dance. Although this might make the host of the ball feel I'm not giving face.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"......\"","She closed her eyes: \"I agree.\"","Weisheng Wenzhan replied instantly: \"Great, I'll be at your door at 7 PM sharp. The evening gown will be delivered to your room soon.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"......\"","Why did she feel like this guy was slowly setting her up?","But one of life's biggest misconceptions is that he might like me.","She shouldn't be so self-absorbed.","\"Qiao Chuchu?\" A female voice called out beside her.","Qiao Chuchu looked up in surprise to see a girl in a fine suit standing in front of her, sizing her up with a smile: \"It really is you. Why are you dressed like this here? I didn't recognize you at first.\"","Qiao Chuchu's good mood instantly plummeted.","The girl in front of her had a head of red-brown voluminous curls, her face glowing with the popular H Country standard watery glow, standing under the light like she was waxed, even a fly landing on her face could do figure skating.","This girl was Qiao Yue.","The daughter of her biological father's younger brother, also her cousin.","Qiao Yue now piled up her apple cheeks, staring at her wide-legged pants and loose large T-shirt outfit, smiling with hidden meaning.","Clearly, Qiao Yue thought her attire was sloppy and not as good-looking as her own, secretly enjoying the moment."]},{"number":76,"title":"Chapter 76: Pei Youchuan: How Did I Get Such a Clever, Waterlogged Sister","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu: \"......\"","She really didn't like the Qiao family.","Because the Qiao family didn't like her mother.","When her mother married her father, it was her father who stole the household register to get married.","And after the marriage, her father quickly moved the household register out to break free from the control of the Qiao family.","The reason why her grandmother didn't like her mother was simple.","Because her mother was full of vitality and independence, a famous painter, and she had a fiery temper, with a stubborn and fiery personality, like a cherry bomb in Plants vs. Zombies.","Her grandmother tried to suppress her, saying she had no parents and wasn't fit to be the wife of a wealthy man. Her mother not only silenced her grandmother but also dumped her father on the spot.","But her father was a love-struck fool, constantly pleading with her mother, eventually winning her heart, and they got married quickly, giving birth to her.","After her parents died in a car accident, her grandmother was heartbroken and wanted to dig up her mother's grave, claiming her mother had cursed her father to death.","She had just transmigrated at that time and was furious upon hearing this, jumping up to bite a chunk of flesh off the old lady's hand!","The moment she attacked, it was also witnessed by Pei's Mother and her brothers.","This marked the beginning of her new life. Although she bore the Qiao surname, the Qiao family had become her lifelong enemies.","She had a grandmother and a grandfather, so she couldn't be formally adopted by Pei's Mother.","Thus, she was only verbally adopted by the Pei family. To prevent regrets, Pei's Mother wasn't one to be trifled with. She strategically invested in the Qiao family's company, becoming the largest shareholder, holding the reins of power and constantly threatening the Qiao family with money and business.","Pei's Mother had explicitly warned them, \"Whether Qiao Chuchu is poor or rich, you are not to lay a finger on her.\"","Currently, the largest shareholder of the Qiao company is Pei Yuan, and the second largest is Pei Che.","The eldest and second brothers have inherited Pei's Mother's legacy, subtly threatening the Qiao family, but this doesn't stop the Qiao family from trying to cozy up to her.","Especially Qiao Yue.","Qiao Yue is the same age as her but a few months younger, making her her younger sister.","She has always been jealous of her, envious of her living in the Pei family, surrounded by handsome brothers, and of her wealth, living a life of pampered royalty.","Qiao Yue even once naively said, \"Why didn't my parents die? If it were my parents, I could take your place!\"","After saying this, Qiao Yue received a double whammy from her parents and a sharp taunt from Pei's Mother: \"Sweetie, don't say your parents are dead, even if your whole family is dead, I wouldn't take you.\"","Pei's Mother proudly smiled at Qiao Yue: \"If Chuchu's parents were still alive, she would be my prospective daughter-in-law, and my seven sons are hers to choose from, as many as she wants. There's no way it would be your turn.\"","From then on, Qiao Yue harbored a grudge against her and Pei's Mother.","She even felt Qiao Yue had become a bit pathological.","Because Qiao Yue had been imitating her since childhood.","Qiao Yue was very beautiful, with perfect bone structure and striking features, absolutely stunning in a glamorous, sexy style.","But she insisted on pursuing a childish look, not knowing when to stop, getting injections until her face looked like a bun, and now even her hair color had to match hers.","Qiao Chuchu found it painful to look at.","She had once advised Qiao Yue to leverage her stunning beauty, but Qiao Yue believed she said that out of fear of her brothers being stolen, telling everyone that Qiao Chuchu had a crisis, couldn't stand anyone resembling her.","So she never advised her again.","Qiao Chuchu was in no mood: \"You're here to play too?\"","Qiao Yue's eyes curved: \"Yes, I came with my parents, we're staying on the third floor, what about you?\"","The higher the floor, the more expensive the room.","Qiao Chuchu: \"I'm on the top floor.\"","Qiao Yue's eyelids twitched, her fake smile faltering: \"I heard you failed to seduce your brothers and were kicked out. I didn't expect you to be back on the top floor again?\"","Qiao Chuchu sneered: \"Qiao Yue, I'll say it again, the money I earn can also get me a top-floor suite.\"","The difference between her and her brothers' income was that she earned 200,000 a month, while any one of her brothers could earn that much in the blink of an eye.","But that didn't mean she was inferior; she took good care of herself.","Qiao Yue chuckled lightly, clearly not believing her: \"If you say so, but whenever you want the stars or the moon, your brothers buy them for you. Even your excellent education was bought, so what's the big deal about staying in a presidential suite?\"","Qiao Chuchu was speechless: \"You keep bringing up my education in front of me, isn't it because you saw me attending that university and wanted to go too, but your grades weren't good enough, and your dad didn't have enough money to donate a building, so every time you see me, you have to bring it up. Find a new line, I can recite it by heart.\"","Qiao Yue's smile suddenly disappeared; she clenched her teeth and cursed: \"Shit——\"","\"Yo~ Still cursing in Seh-bah!~\" Qiao Chuchu said with her hands in her pockets, mocking: \"Clearly someone who's had too many injections in H Country, your cursing is quite different, do you still remember how to curse in China?\"","She stepped forward: \"Your face is so thick that even a needle poked all night wouldn't reach the end.\"","Qiao Yue: \"?!\"","Qiao Chuchu turned her head away irritably: \"There's no man you want here, only someone who sees you and wants to insult you a bit, so stay away from me, or I'll pull out your newly planted eyelashes and stuff them in your ears.\"","Qiao Yue's cheeks flushed with anger, and she stammered, \"You, just you wait, I'll come back to find you!!!\"","She stomped away in her high heels.","Qiao Chuchu was speechless.","So annoying, she had wanted to relax a bit during the downtime in the main plot, and she runs into the Qiao family.","She turned irritably and met Pei Youchuan's sly gaze.","He opened the door just a crack, smiling like a wagging husky: \"Not bad, Qiao Chuchu, it's been years, and your trash-talking skills haven't diminished, but even improved. I purposely didn't come out to disturb you, watching your performance, which was pretty stable.\"","He walked over to her, happily pinching her cheeks, rubbing them back and forth, and even his deep voice had a slight lilt to it: \"How did I, Pei Youchuan, get such a clever sister? Third Brother is truly proud of you!\"","Qiao Chuchu's face was all distorted, she mumbled: \"There's a ball tonight, Weisheng Wenzhan invited me, and I agreed.\"","Pei Youchuan's smile suddenly vanished, his angry roar came crashing down: \"Are you out of your mind!!!\"","Qiao Chuchu was momentarily at a loss for words, then picked up her phone: \"What can I do, he said it like that.\"","Pei Youchuan snatched the phone, flipping through their chat records from start to finish.","The more he read, the more his hands trembled!","This bastard had calculated every word!","He sneered: \"Fine, I'm going too.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"? What for?\"","\"Isn't he willing to compromise for a dance?\" Pei Youchuan shoved the phone back into her hands: \"I'll dance with you until the ball ends, let him stare until his eyes pop out, let him give up, understand that you're mine!!!\"","Qiao Chuchu had a black question mark face: \"???? What are you talking about?\"","Pei Youchuan dragged her, limping outward, saying, \"Just the time it takes to get a damn injection, and someone's trying to sneak in. You're not allowed to wear that piece of crap dress he bought. I'll buy you one! Buy a whole pile to crush him!\""]},{"number":77,"title":"Chapter 77: What Matters Most Is That We Three Have a Great New Year","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu sat in front of the makeup mirror, watching herself gradually transform into a stunning beauty under the hands of the stylist.","The stylist said, \"Alright, Miss Qiao, how do you feel about it?\"","The stylist had skillfully accentuated her best features, focusing on her most beautiful eyes and lips. The black matte gown she wore gave her an ethereal, misty lightness, delicate yet not seductive.","Qiao Chuchu happily stood up, holding her skirt: \"Thank you, you did a great job.\"","She picked up the cash red envelope she had prepared in advance: \"This includes not only the styling fee but also a little extra as a New Year's gift. You've worked hard, happy New Year.\"","The stylist was pleasantly surprised.","The envelope looked thick, clearly indicating that Qiao Chuchu had added quite a bit extra.","What a generous lady!","The stylist accepted the red envelope with both hands, her voice filled with joy: \"It's not hard at all. It's mainly because your eyes are as beautiful as gems. Such beautiful eyes are rare, so it was easy to work with them. Be careful, let me help you walk!\"","The stylist carefully supported her arm, escorting her all the way to the door of the makeup room.","Suddenly, the door was pushed open, and Qiao Yue stormed in, wearing a sleek black evening gown.","\"I've been waiting in line for so long, it should be my turn soon, right?\"","Her eyes swept across the room and landed on Qiao Chuchu. Her displeased expression turned into a moment of astonishment: \"Qiao Chuchu, what are you doing here? Are you also attending the ball tonight?\"","Qiao Chuchu didn't answer, merely brushing past her coldly and leaving.","As the door closed, she clearly heard Qiao Yue's angry command to the stylist: \"Hey, stylist, make sure you make me look even more beautiful than that woman just now, do you hear me?!\"","In the penthouse suite, Weisheng Wenzhan and Pei Youchuan had finished changing and emerged from their respective rooms.","Both wore impeccably tailored, perfectly pressed black suits. Pei Youchuan had a black shirt underneath, and his peaked lapel suit accentuated his already bold demeanor.","Weisheng Wenzhan, on the other hand, wore a white shirt with a waistcoat, completing the three-piece ensemble. Though their heights were almost the same, their temperament (personal aura) was vastly different.","One exuded a calm yet undeniable presence, while the other, despite the deliberate restraint of his black suit, couldn't hide his wild spirit.","They both stood at the elevator entrance.","Weisheng Wenzhan glanced at Pei Youchuan's side and didn't see Qiao Chuchu, so he didn't ask further.","Pei Youchuan, with his hands in his pockets, looked straight ahead: \"The evening gown I gave my sister, she didn't wear it.\"","Weisheng Wenzhan wasn't surprised: \"Did she not wear it, or did she not see it?\"","\"She didn't see it,\" Pei Youchuan replied with a cold laugh: \"It was a halter neckline with a deep back and a slit that almost reached the butt. I saw it and tore it up immediately. I didn't consider whether you'd feel bad about it or not. Send me the invoice for the dress, and I'll compensate you.\"","Weisheng Wenzhan smiled indifferently: \"It's just a piece of clothing, no need to compensate.\"","Pei Youchuan also smirked, his tone sarcastic: \"Yeah, a piece of clothing isn't expensive, but at your age, giving a young girl a deep-back dress? That's not giving a gift, that's sexual harassment.\"","Weisheng Wenzhan didn't get angry, his tone calm: \"It was a misjudgment on my part. The dress was chosen by my third sister. She personally prefers sexy styles, and the fabric was as minimal as possible. My secretary bought it, and I didn't check the design. I apologize if it made you uncomfortable; that wasn't my intention.\"","\"But...\" Weisheng Wenzhan added with a meaningful tone: \"Would a brother have possessive feelings towards his sister's exposed skin?\"","Pei Youchuan was baffled: \"What?\"","Weisheng Wenzhan looked straight ahead, his lips curling into a subtle smile: \"Yu Can usually likes to wear very sexy clothes, but even if she shows a lot, in front of me, she's just a family member I've grown up with. I never get angry because of what she wears; I usually respect her preferences.\"","Wenzhan glanced at Pei Youchuan, gently reminding him: \"You're being too concerned, it's easy to give yourself away. Remember to control yourself.\"","Pei Youchuan: \"...\"","On the surface, he remained calm, but inside, his fists were clenched tightly, and a vein was visibly throbbing on his forehead.","\"Ding!\" The elevator arrived.","Qiao Chuchu, holding her skirt, was about to step out when she suddenly encountered the two men: \"Oh, you two are together!\"","Both men looked at her, momentarily stunned.","Qiao Chuchu lifted the hem of her skirt and spun around happily: \"How do I look?\"","Weisheng Wenzhan, like a cat, lazily narrowed his eyes, his tone rising: \"Not bad.\"","She beamed with joy, turning to Pei Youchuan: \"What about you?\"","Pei Youchuan snapped out of his daze, realizing he had been momentarily captivated.","He cleared his throat, his face expressionless: \"Just average.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"Are you blind? I look stunning!\"","Wenzhan stepped into the elevator, calmly addressing her: \"Yes, your brother has terrible taste. You're clearly very beautiful.\"","She grinned foolishly: \"Mr. Weisheng has great taste!\"","Pei Youchuan, displeased, stepped into the elevator and pulled Qiao Chuchu closer to him: \"Don't stand so close to Mr. Weisheng, you'll leave your perfume on him.\"","Wenzhan didn't mind: \"It's fine. I'll be spending the evening with Miss Qiao anyway, so it's normal to pick up her scent.\"","Pei Youchuan sneered: \"No, Qiao Chuchu is my date. You can only borrow her for one dance.\"","Though he had no intention of giving her that dance.","Weisheng Wenzhan's eyes flickered with a subtle light as he leaned closer to Qiao Chuchu, his voice soft and gentle: \"I thought we agreed that you'd be with me the entire evening. Are you going back on your word? Hmm?\"","Qiao Chuchu suddenly felt a sense of pressure!","She shivered: \"No, it's just my brother who disagrees. I promised you, and I meant it.\"","Pei Youchuan: \"?\"","Weisheng Wenzhan smiled, offering his arm: \"Then please take my arm, Miss.\"","Qiao Chuchu, feeling Pei Youchuan's gaze on her, reluctantly took Weisheng Wenzhan's arm.","Pei Youchuan's lips curled into a cold smile: \"Tch.\"","Qiao Chuchu stood there, feeling uneasy, aware that Weisheng Wenzhan was watching her.","When she looked up, she met Weisheng Wenzhan's deep, penetrating gaze.","Even when their eyes met, Weisheng Wenzhan's gaze didn't waver, enveloping her in a... strange kind of look.","It was a look of affectionate love.","Like someone looking at their favorite food.","Qiao Chuchu was bewildered by the gaze.","Weisheng Wenzhan's expression relaxed, as if he had found some amusement.","Qiao Chuchu felt a chill run down her spine.","【The Weisheng family members are indeed all so weird.】","【He looks just like my son, but his temperament is so hard to figure out. And isn't he supposed to be expressionless? Why is he always smiling at me?】","【Please stop smiling at me, I'm scared!】","Weisheng Wenzhan's lips twitched slightly, and he slowly withdrew his smile.","All of this was observed by Pei Youchuan.","He closed his eyes, rubbing his forehead in frustration.","Lou Tingsi was right; the Weisheng family members really can hear thoughts.","Qiao Chuchu was calling Weisheng Wenzhan \"son\" in her mind, and Wenzhan was tolerating it, even using it to toy with Pei Youchuan.","Pei Youchuan was getting annoyed.","He should have brought Pei Che or Pei Buxian instead; either of them could have handled Weisheng Wenzhan.","Suddenly, his sleeve was tugged.","Qiao Chuchu, wearing a black lace glove, pulled on the corner of his sleeve, looking up at him and mouthing: \"Are you angry?\"","Pei Youchuan didn't speak, his gaze falling on her other hand, which was linked with Weisheng Wenzhan's arm.","His face darkened, and he directly grabbed her free hand and wrapped it around his arm.","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","Weisheng Wenzhan: \"?\"","Pei Youchuan, with a look of \"let's all die together,\" pulled Qiao Chuchu closer to him, his expression blank: \"Let's all focus on having a good New Year's celebration.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","Weisheng Wenzhan: \"...\""]},{"number":78,"title":"Chapter 78: Two Chopsticks Clamped a Black Tangyuan","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu wanted to let go.","Pei Youchuan immediately grabbed her wrist!","She felt this was strange and instinctively tried to pull her hand away from Weisheng Wenzhan.","Weisheng Wenzhan held her hand and smiled warningly, \"Don't even think about leaving.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","As soon as the elevator doors opened, she found herself on the arm of one man on her left and another on her right, while she stood in the middle, looking utterly bewildered as they stepped out of the elevator. Instantly, they drew a lot of attention.","\"Hey! Look at that!\"","\"Two handsome guys holding onto her at once? What kind of luck does this girl have?\"","\"What are you saying? The little beauty is just as gorgeous. I think she stands out just as much in the middle of those two!\"","\"Can someone tell me what the relationship is between these three?\"","\"One boyfriend and the second boyfriend, obviously!\"","\"The world has finally gone mad in the way I always wanted! Where do I pick up my own handsome guy?\"","\"With that height difference, it's like a pair of chopsticks holding a black dumpling. I'm getting hungry just looking at it.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"??????\"","She tried to pull her hands back, but the two men held onto her tightly, not letting her go.","Qiao Chuchu, looking utterly defeated, said, \"Let go, will you? Everyone's talking about the three of us. You two might not care about your reputation, but I do!\"","Weisheng Wenzhan remained unfazed. \"We agreed, and if anyone lets go, it should be him.\"","Pei Youchuan sneered. \"Sorry, Wei Zong, I'm still feeling dizzy from the blood I lost earlier. I need someone to help me walk.\"","Weisheng Wenzhan: \"I can have my secretary help you.\"","Pei Youchuan feigned regret. \"No, I'm allergic to strangers.\"","Weisheng Wenzhan's eyes narrowed, and he smirked. \"Fine, then let's just stay like this.\"","Pei Youchuan forced a smile. \"Yeah, let's stay like this.\"","The two men picked up the pace, striding quickly toward the ballroom!","Qiao Chuchu, caught in the middle, had to practically run to keep up: \"Hey, hey, slow down! I can't keep up!\"","The two men ignored her and simply lifted her up by her arms!","Her feet left the ground, and she was carried through the air like that!","Qiao Chuchu: \"?????????\"","Qiao Yue and the Qiao family were waiting at the entrance of the ballroom.","Qiao's Mother carefully inspected Qiao Yue. \"When you meet Mr. Weisheng, don't be too forward. You need to be enigmatic to catch his attention. There are so many people trying to curry favor with him, so you must be very natural.\"","Qiao's Father nodded. \"Yes, if Weisheng doesn't pay attention to you, try to get Pei Youchuan's attention. Among the seven in the Pei family, he's the most naive and should be easier to handle.\"","Qiao Yue nodded confidently, \"I understand, Mom and Dad.\"","Just as she finished speaking, a group of people stormed past them and into the ballroom.","The Qiao family: \"?\"","What just whooshed past us?","The secretary quickly followed and arrived at the registration desk. \"Weisheng Wenzhan, Qiao Chuchu, and Pei Youchuan have arrived.\"","Qiao Yue: \"?\"","Qiao Yue's parents: \"?\"","Was Weisheng Wenzhan and Pei Youchuan in that weird group that just rushed past?","Qiao Yue couldn't believe it and hurried after them, only to see the woman being held in the middle.","Qiao Chuchu was gently placed on a seat, with the two men on either side of her, looking like two imposing gatekeepers.","But clearly, the two gatekeepers were not happy. After setting Qiao Chuchu down, they glared at each other with hostility.","Qiao's Mother caught up and exclaimed in shock, \"Is that girl Qiao Chuchu?\"","Qiao's Father's face twitched. \"How did Qiao Chuchu end up with Weisheng Wenzhan? It seems they have a good relationship.\"","Qiao Yue clenched her teeth tightly, her fists balled up. \"She's the eighth daughter of the Pei family, so it's normal for her to know Weisheng Wenzhan. What's not normal is how close he is to her.\"","Qiao Chuchu felt an itch on her cheek and pointed to it. \"I feel like there's something on my face. Did I get cat hair on it when I was petting the cat earlier?\"","Weisheng Wenzhan leaned down close to her and carefully examined her face.","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","[Too close!]","Weisheng Wenzhan raised an eyebrow slightly but ignored her reaction and continued his inspection.","Pei Youchuan pushed him aside. \"Can you even find anything?\"","He cupped Qiao Chuchu's face and leaned down to take a closer look. \"Yes, don't move.\"","Qiao Chuchu clearly felt the cat hair being removed and blinked her eyes, meeting Pei Youchuan's gaze.","Pei Youchuan finished removing the hair and happened to lock eyes with her.","When their eyes met, he paused for a moment, then his gaze shifted downward to her lips. He subconsciously licked his own lips and then stepped back decisively.","Weisheng Wenzhan watched from the side, smirking mockingly at Pei Youchuan.","Pei Youchuan: \"...\"","The trio was too eye-catching.","Qiao Chuchu sat on the sofa, with two successful young men standing on either side of her. It was impossible not to notice them.","Qiao Yue's face had turned green.","Fifteen minutes later, the ball began.","The melody of the violin filled the air, and Weisheng Wenzhan extended his hand to Qiao Chuchu. \"May I have this dance?\"","Qiao Chuchu was momentarily dazzled by his smile and took his hand, walking with him to the dance floor.","Wenzhan's warm hand rested on her slender waist, and he praised without reserve, \"You look beautiful right now.\"","Qiao Chuchu wrapped her arm around his shoulder, a bit shyly lowering her eyes. \"Thank you.\"","Weisheng Wenzhan raised an eyebrow and gazed into her watery eyes. \"I suddenly understand how your brother feels.\"","Qiao Chuchu was puzzled and spun around. \"What feeling?\"","Weisheng Wenzhan pulled her back into his arms, his tone light. \"Nothing.\"","Pei Youchuan, holding a glass of red wine, watched the dancing couple on the dance floor, then downed the wine in one gulp.","A nearby girl also gritted her teeth in jealousy. \"What did I do to deserve this? I have to watch my male god dancing with another girl during the New Year? He never dances!\"","Pei Youchuan looked at her with confusion.","The girl's friend also complained, \"That's right! Who doesn't know that the Weisheng family members never dance? This is the first time I've seen the CEO dance.\"","Pei Youchuan: \"?\"","Does Weisheng Wenzhan usually not dance?","Then why did he say that not having a dance partner would be embarrassing and make people think he was being rude?","Pei Youchuan looked at the striking couple on the dance floor and crushed his wine glass with a \"crack\"!","This bastard had planned everything!","As soon as the music stopped, Pei Youchuan couldn't wait to approach Weisheng Wenzhan, his tone dark. \"Qiao Chuchu, go play somewhere else. I need to talk to Wei Zong.\"","Qiao Chuchu felt confused and looked at Weisheng Wenzhan.","Weisheng Wenzhan nodded at her. \"Go ahead, Chuchu. Have some champagne.\"","Qiao Chuchu was a bit worried. \"Can you two not argue?\"","[What if I come back and find the two of you both injured?]","Pei Youchuan was furious and snapped, \"We won't!\"","Weisheng Wenzhan also smiled. \"No, don't worry.\"","She felt strange but took a few steps back, looking at the two men over her shoulder.","But the two men clearly had no intention of talking until she left.","In the end, Qiao Chuchu walked away with a belly full of questions."]},{"number":79,"title":"Chapter 79: Qiao Chuchu: I Calculated Everything but Didn't Expect Someone to Want to Kill Me","paragraphs":["Pei Youchuan got straight to the point: \"Weisheng Wenzhan, you deliberately approached Qiao Chuchu, didn't you? Because you can hear her thoughts.\"","Weisheng Wenzhan's eyes darkened as he naturally picked up his wine glass: \"What thoughts? I don't understand.\"","Pei Youchuan's eyes narrowed: \"I've already figured it out, Weisheng Wenzhan. Stop pretending. You can hear Qiao Chuchu's thoughts!\"","Wenzhan chuckled and shook his head in disdain: \"I'm sorry, but I have no idea what you're talking about.\"","-","Qiao Chuchu stood on the deck, feeling the sea breeze and gazing at the moonlit sky.","It was cold, but it made her feel open and free, as if all her worries had vanished.","In fact, she was different now. Without the system, she was free and could live her life to the fullest, enjoying every moment!","She looked around and found the area empty.","She whispered to the moon: \"This year, I'm going to work hard!\"","Suddenly, someone grabbed her waist and with a powerful force, threw her overboard!!","Qiao Chuchu: \"?!\"","She splashed into the cold sea!","All her survival instincts kicked in as she surfaced, gasping: \"Damn it! Who threw me in here?!\"","The railing was empty.","But the ship was still moving.","She struggled to swim toward the ship, shouting: \"Help! Somebody, help!!!\"","The ship grew farther away, and the icy water made her body stiffen.","Her skin touched the freezing sea, and her limbs soon became too stiff to move. She could only drift passively.","No!","It was too cold!","She couldn't swim anymore!","The rolling waves pushed her farther and farther away. Qiao Chuchu struggled forward, shouting for help: \"Help! I'm in the sea!!!\"","The ship moved further away, and she floated in the icy water. Suddenly, her leg cramped!","Qiao Chuchu's body sank underwater, taking in a gulp of seawater.","She tried to massage her cramping leg, but her heavy dress made it impossible. She flailed in the water, her survival instincts kicking in, but the dark, empty sea around her spelled her doom.","She knew she was going to die. There was no saving this.","Qiao Chuchu's body bobbed up and down as she mustered her strength to shout in fear: \"I'll be back in a second, you murderer! Sleep tight tonight, you hear me?!\"","With that, she ran out of strength, closed her eyes, and sank into the cold, flowing sea.","The water was bone-chillingly cold. Her body struggled for oxygen, but gradually, her limbs stopped moving. She sank deeper into the depths.","-","Qiao Chuchu suddenly sat up on the ground!","She gasped for air, the lingering pain of drowning still fresh. She coughed and looked around.","What she saw was no longer the sea but the system floating in front of her.","The system circled her and sighed: \"Can't you take it slow for once? How long has it been since your last death?\"","She was still in shock, hugging herself. Her limbs felt cold: \"I was murdered.\"","Qiao Chuchu shivered, realizing: \"I didn't even see what the person looked like or what they were wearing.\"","The system sighed: \"Well, as someone who's meant to die, getting murdered is part of the deal. You should be more cautious.\"","Qiao Chuchu was dumbfounded: \"Then why didn't you warn me earlier that someone wanted to kill me?\"","The system checked the data: \"When we were still linked, I didn't see anyone with a 'kill intent' toward you. Clearly, it's something that happened after we unlinked. Maybe you should recall who you've pissed off?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","Her list of enemies was long.","Just on this ship, there was Qiao Yue, her parents, and Ji Yanchuan.","She pressed: \"Can't you see who did it?\"","The system regretfully replied: \"No, we've unlinked, so you'll have to figure it out yourself.\"","The scenery around Qiao Chuchu changed, and she reappeared at the ballroom entrance.","The number in front of her blurred from 6 to 5.","She held her champagne, feeling dazed as she looked around.","She was right at the ballroom entrance, about to step out.","Pei Youchuan and Weisheng Wenzhan were talking at a nearby table.","Pei Youchuan was glaring, issuing some kind of warning.","Weisheng Wenzhan responded with ease.","Qiao Chuchu instantly understood.","This was the moment: right after she danced with Weisheng Wenzhan, and Pei Youchuan told her to leave.","Then she went outside and was thrown into the sea.","Which meant the killer had been watching her the whole time.","Qiao Chuchu downed her champagne in one go and, holding up her dress, started walking around the ballroom, looking for anyone suspicious.","Pei Youchuan was still interrogating Weisheng Wenzhan: \"I've figured it out, Weisheng Wenzhan. Stop pretending. You can hear Qiao Chuchu's thoughts!\"","Weisheng Wenzhan lazily smiled: \"I'm sorry, but I have no idea what you're talking about.\"","【Who just killed me?!】","Both men startled and looked toward the voice.","Qiao Chuchu, holding up her dress, elegantly walked past the guests. Her gaze was calm and piercing, so beautiful it was hard to look away.","Her eyes scrutinized every smiling face.","【I went to the deck to admire the moon, and some sneaky bastard threw me into the sea!】","【Did you think I was a javelin or something?!】","【If I didn't have a chance to respawn, I'd be a freaking water ghost right now, you know that?!】","Pei Youchuan: \"...\"","Weisheng Wenzhan: \"...\"","The two exchanged glances, their expressions turning grim as they walked toward Qiao Chuchu.","But Qiao Chuchu lifted her dress and headed toward the corridor: 【I need to lure the killer out. I have to stand here again, wait for them, and then take them down in one strike.】","Pei Youchuan and Weisheng Wenzhan exchanged glances, both looking tense.","This was too risky.","After all, she was just a fragile girl.","Qiao Chuchu first went to the VIP lounge.","Inside was a decorative golf club.","She picked it up, weighed it, and tucked it into her low-cut evening gown.","Pei Youchuan: \"?\"","Weisheng Wenzhan: \"?\"","Qiao Chuchu continued walking, passing a security guard: \"Do you have a gun? Lend it to me.\"","The black security guard hesitated, looking at her face, then took out a stun gun.","He knew she was a VIP, so he handed it over.","Qiao Chuchu took it: \"Thanks.\"","She headed toward the deck, silently cheering herself on!","【Last time, I trusted the wrong person, got thrown into the cold sea while admiring the scenery. This time, I've got a golf club hidden in my dress and a stun gun in hand. I'm going to take back everything I lost!】","【I am the queen!】","Pei Youchuan: \"...\"","Weisheng Wenzhan: \"Your sister's a bit of an idiot, isn't she?\"","Pei Youchuan: \"...\"","In a dark corner, unnoticed by anyone, a silver-haired boy peeked out. Dressed as a waiter in gray and white, his eyes burned with intensity as he watched Qiao Chuchu's silhouette.","Weisheng Huailing's eyes flashed with killing intent.","No one would harm his voice."]},{"number":80,"title":"Chapter 80: Qiao Chuchu is a person with a strong inner core, and she rarely shows weakness.","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu, holding up her skirt, stepped onto the deck and gazed at the shimmering sea in the distance.","Pei Youchuan and Weisheng Wenzhan quietly climbed up to the upper deck, finding a corner where they could keep an eye on Qiao Chuchu.","Weisheng Huailing, agile as ever, climbed onto the railing and assumed a position where he could provide backup, cautiously scanning the surroundings.","He had just surveyed the area and noticed that, aside from his sneaky brother and Pei Youchuan tailing Qiao Chuchu, there was no one else around.","He had come here because his brother had been deliberately getting close to Qiao Chuchu, and he wanted to see what his brother was up to—whether he was trying to steal Qiao Chuchu away.","But the moment he boarded the ship, he heard Qiao Chuchu say someone was trying to kill her.","Thank goodness he had come.","Pei Youchuan and Weisheng Wenzhan huddled together, sneaking glances at Qiao Chuchu’s back.","Pei Youchuan suddenly thought of something and glanced sideways at Wenzhan: “I thought you couldn’t hear her thoughts?”","Weisheng Wenzhan remained expressionless: “At this point, there’s no need to lie. Of course, if I hadn’t heard that someone was trying to kill Qiao Chuchu, I wouldn’t have admitted it.”","Pei Youchuan: “...You’re really honest.”","Weisheng Wenzhan snorted and looked at Qiao Chuchu: “I never expected her to be so emotionally stable in a crisis, given how delicate she looks. I thought Qiao Chuchu, having been spoiled by you all these years, would burst into tears at the first sign of trouble and come running to you for help.”","Pei Youchuan fell silent, his gaze fixed on Qiao Chuchu under the moonlight.","She stood on the deck, holding her skirt, her expression serious, as if she were about to step onto a battlefield.","His heart suddenly felt heavy: “Qiao Chuchu has always been someone with an incredibly strong inner core. She handles a lot of things on her own, as if it’s second nature to her.”","Weisheng Wenzhan looked at the young woman under the moonlight, finding it hard to imagine: “Like what?”","Pei Youchuan’s eyes flickered with a hint of pain and affection he hadn’t even noticed: “After our parents died, our entire family was bullied at school. Even the dogs would pick on us. We fought back, but it didn’t help much. Guess what Qiao Chuchu did?”","Weisheng Wenzhan: “? What did she do?”","“She collected a bunch of dog poop, mixed it with dirt, filled a backpack with it, and threw it in the faces of the bullies!”","Pei Youchuan recounted the story vividly, unable to suppress a laugh at the memory: “When the principal scolded her, she pulled out a handful of the poop-dirt mixture and smeared it on his face. When the dean came to reprimand her, she pulled out a water gun and squirted him with dirty water.”","Weisheng Wenzhan’s eyes widened, and he couldn’t help but chuckle: “Did it work?”","Pei Youchuan nodded, holding back laughter: “Oh, it worked. The bullying did decrease because, even though Qiao Chuchu couldn’t beat them physically, she was incredibly cunning and her methods were... well, literally dirty.”","Weisheng Wenzhan’s lips twitched into a smile: “Didn’t she find it disgusting?”","“Of course she did.” Pei Youchuan was struggling to keep a straight face: “But she said as long as she got the result she wanted, she didn’t care. She’d come home covered in wounds, not shedding a tear, and just hole up in her room to refine her ‘dirty arsenal.’”","Weisheng Wenzhan couldn’t help but laugh at the thought: “You must have really liked her back then.”","Pei Youchuan: “...”","Liked her? That was an understatement.","After their parents’ death, their lives had plunged from heaven into hell.","All the household staff had been let go.","They didn’t know how to do anything.","Qiao Chuchu, who taught them how to cook, how to take care of themselves when they were sick, who chased bullies with a bag of live earthworms and tossed cockroaches into their clothes, was their sun.","She never shed a tear in front of outsiders, but when she argued with them, she’d cry uncontrollably.","They always got to see her most vulnerable side.","The more Pei Youchuan thought about it, the worse he felt.","He was starting to feel like he had wronged Qiao Chuchu.","So what if she had tried to take a step forward? So what if she had embarrassed him in front of a client, costing him billions? So what if she was greedy, wanting not just one man but all seven brothers to be with her?","How could those wounds overshadow the time they had spent relying on each other?","Pei Youchuan’s expression grew increasingly solemn as he looked at Qiao Chuchu’s sorrowful profile.","Qiao Chuchu sighed softly: 【What a beautiful scene.】","She mused to herself: 【The sea, a luxury cruise ship, a designer dress, the sea breeze—if this were a movie, I’d be waiting for my male lead. Instead, I’m waiting for a murderer.】","Weisheng Wenzhan narrowed his eyes: “She seems much more melancholic than you described earlier.”","Pei Youchuan pursed his lips in frustration: “Maybe it’s because of the trauma she’s endured over the years that she’s so sad now.”","Weisheng Wenzhan nodded in agreement: “She’s still just a young girl. It’s normal for her to be scared.”","Pei Youchuan’s tone darkened: “I’m the strongest fighter in our family. I’ll be the first to rush in and protect her.”","Meanwhile, Weisheng Huailing stared at Qiao Chuchu’s back, wishing he could send her his thoughts.","Qiao Chuchu, you don’t have to be afraid. I’ll rush in to protect you!","Three pairs of eyes lurked in the shadows, watching Qiao Chuchu bathed in moonlight.","But Qiao Chuchu pulled a golf club from her chest and grinned wickedly: 【But it’s fine. Whether it’s the male lead or a murderer, it’s all the same. If it’s the male lead, I’ll have a heart-to-heart with him. If it’s a murderer, I’ll knock him out with one swing! Hahahahaha!】","Pei Youchuan: “...”","Weisheng Wenzhan: “...”","Weisheng Huailing: “...”","Qiao Chuchu gripped the golf club, her ears pricked for any sound.","A faint door closing echoed in the distance.","Qiao Chuchu’s heart tightened as she gripped the handle: 【He’s here!】","The three men tensed up immediately.","Very light footsteps approached, getting closer and closer.","Just as they were about to reach Qiao Chuchu, she spun around and swung the club: “Take this!”","The man thudded to the floor: “Ah!”","As he tried to get up, Qiao Chuchu zapped him with a stun gun: “Ha!!”","The man’s body went limp, convulsing on the ground!","Qiao Chuchu pounced on him, hoisted him up, and sprinted toward the railing, hurling him overboard: “Ora!!”","The man splashed into the water: “Aaaaaah!!!”","The entire sequence was executed flawlessly.","Weisheng Huailing: “...”","Pei Youchuan, who had been about to intervene: “...”","Weisheng Wenzhan, checking the time: “Wow, that didn’t even take a minute.”","They all stood frozen, watching Qiao Chuchu lean on the railing like a queen, looking down at the man with a smirk: “Come on! Pop your head out of the water and let me see what you’re made of!”","The man in the water struggled to surface, his face pale from the cold: “Help—uh—help!!”","Qiao Chuchu squinted, then gasped in surprise: “Qiao Qihang?”","Qiao Qihang was Qiao Yue’s father.","The person trying to kill her was Qiao Yue’s father?","She nimbly flipped onto the railing, sitting on it with a look of surprise: “So it’s you. I thought it was Ji Yanchuan trying to kill me.”","Qiao Qihang flailed in the water, struggling: “I’m going to die! It’s too cold!!”","Qiao Chuchu shrugged, lounging on the railing: “Don’t worry. In a little while, your legs will cramp, and you’ll drown. No one will even know you’re gone.”","Qiao Qihang didn’t respond.","He was already choking on water: “Help—help! I can’t—my legs are cramping!!”","Qiao Chuchu watched him with a smile of satisfaction: “If you’re going to try to kill someone, you should first experience what it’s like to be killed. Don’t you think, Qiao Qihang?”","【Feel what it’s like to be unable to save yourself, to grasp at nothing, your lungs burning with pain, the cold and fear intertwining as you sink to the darkest depths of the ocean with your heavy body.】"]},{"number":81,"title":"Chapter 81: Weisheng Huailing: Returning from Overtime to Listen to Chuchu's Thoughts and Play","paragraphs":["Qiao Qihang's body floated up and down in the water: \"I didn’t mean to kill—gurgle—you—gurgle—\"","Qiao Chuchu sat gracefully on the railing, her hands lightly supporting her as she smiled gently.","Qiao Yue and Qiao's Mother suddenly rushed out from inside the ship: \"Dad!!\"","Qiao Yue held a lifebuoy and threw it into the sea: \"Grab this, Dad!\"","The yellow lifebuoy shot through the air like a meteor. Qiao Qihang mustered all his strength to grab it and pull it over himself.","Qiao Yue breathed a sigh of relief.","Qiao's Mother, however, was furious. She stormed toward Qiao Chuchu, raising her hand to push her off the railing!","Qiao Chuchu flipped down from the railing and kicked Qiao's Mother in the face!","Qiao's Mother fell to the ground with a thud: \"Ouch!\"","Blood streamed from her nose!","Seeing her mother injured, Qiao Yue swung her hand at Qiao Chuchu!","Qiao Chuchu dodged nimbly, grabbed Qiao Yue’s hair, and slammed her head against the railing before tossing her into the sea!","Qiao Yue: \"Ah!\"","Qiao's Mother: \"My daughter!\"","Qiao Chuchu moved as agilely as a wild mountain creature: \"Don’t just stand there, you’re next!\"","She picked up Qiao's Mother and hurled her overboard!","Both of them fell into the water with a splash, screaming in panic: \"Help! Help!\"","Pei Youchuan was stunned.","He knew Qiao Chuchu was vengeful, but he had no idea she could be *this* vengeful.","Weisheng Wenzhan and Weisheng Huailing raised their eyebrows with interest, their eyes gleaming with a greedy curiosity.","Weisheng Wenzhan chuckled: \"Heh, now this is entertaining.\"","Weisheng Huailing watched Qiao Chuchu’s back.","Not only could he hear her thoughts, but her temperament also suited his taste perfectly.","She truly was special!","Qiao Chuchu stood under the moonlight, the sea breeze gently lifting her skirt, giving her an air of elegance.","She calmly grabbed two spare lifebuoys from the deck and tossed them into the water.","Qiao Yue and Qiao's Mother swam toward the lifebuoys, struggling for a while before finally securing them.","Qiao Yue screamed hoarsely: \"Are you insane, Qiao Chuchu? You’re trying to kill us!!\"","Qiao Chuchu leaned on the railing, looking down at them with an air of superiority: \"You wanted to kill me, so you sent Qiao Qihang to do the job. After I drowned, my brother Pei Youchuan wouldn’t be able to find me, and there’d be no evidence to prove you were behind it.\"","The three members of the Qiao family froze, guilt flashing across their faces.","Qiao Qihang was the first to defend himself: \"Don’t slander us! I was just passing by! You’re the one who suddenly went crazy!\"","Qiao Chuchu rested her chin on her hand, glancing down at the three of them: \"Is that so? I suggest you tell the truth. Even with those lifebuoys, you’ll die of hypothermia in the winter sea.\"","Qiao's Mother panicked: \"No! You can’t do this! There are cameras here!\"","Qiao Chuchu sneered: \"Didn’t you disable the cameras? They’re not even showing a red light. Isn’t this the trap you set for yourselves? Did you forget?\"","The Qiao family’s hearts sank.","She had noticed that too?!","Pei Youchuan glanced at the camera and indeed saw no red light.","He suddenly felt that Qiao Chuchu seemed unfamiliar.","After seven years apart, she had become even sharper and more perceptive.","Weisheng Wenzhan’s lips curled with interest as he quietly observed the scene.","Weisheng Huailing: \"...\"","He couldn’t hear a word, nor could he read their lips.","The Qiao family shivered in the water, their words stumbling: \"We—we really didn’t mean to kill you! Don’t accuse us!\"","Qiao Yue’s face had turned pale: \"Aren’t you going to get someone to pull us out?!\"","Qiao Chuchu lazily propped her chin on her hand, offering no response.","**[I really want to ask them why they tried to kill me, but the answer isn’t important.]**","**[What’s important is how I can make sure these people never try to kill me again, or I might end up dead for real.]**","**[I’ve managed to avoid most accidental deaths, but if someone’s actively trying to kill me, I won’t stand a chance.]**","Just as she was thinking this, a patrolman arrived and was shocked to see the three in the water: \"Oh my, how did you end up in there?!\"","The trio looked at the patrolman with relief.","Qiao Chuchu remained calm: \"They fell in. I saved them.\"","She smiled at Qiao Qihang: \"Right?\"","Qiao Qihang trembled, unable to speak.","Qiao Chuchu’s gaze turned cold: \"Right?\"","Qiao Qihang’s breath hitched, and he gritted his teeth: \"Right.\"","They couldn’t afford to offend Qiao Chuchu.","At least not openly.","If things escalated and the Pei Family got involved, it would be a disaster. They might even find out about his murderous intentions.","Qiao Chuchu smiled brightly, walking past the patrolman, her smile vanishing the moment she turned away.","**[I absolutely cannot let myself be killed again.]**","Qiao Chuchu walked into the cabin, her expression grave.","In her previous life, she had witnessed a murder while at work.","Two restaurant owners across the street had gotten into a dispute, and a few months later, one of them killed the other’s entire family of four.","It wasn’t a crime of passion—it was premeditated.","There were too many premeditated murders. If Qiao Qihang tried to kill her once, he’d try again.","She had to find a way to protect herself.","Outside, Pei Youchuan’s face was stern as he picked up his phone and sent a message to Pei Yuan: **「Qiao Chuchu was almost killed by Qiao Qihang just now.」**","Pei Yuan: **「?」**","Pei Youchuan returned to the ship with his phone: **「We’ll handle it. Don’t let Qiao Chuchu know.」**","Weisheng Wenzhan watched Pei Youchuan’s enigmatic figure and picked up his phone to notify the group: **「Someone tried to kill Qiao Chuchu, and they succeeded once. She has five lives left. Once they’re gone, she won’t revive again.」**","Weisheng Lin: **「?」**","Weisheng Yucan: **「?」**","Weisheng Huailing: **「He won’t get another chance.」**","Weisheng Wenzhan frowned: **「?」**","Weisheng Huailing: **「I’m right across from you.」**","Wenzhan was startled and looked across the deck.","Under the silvery moonlight, Weisheng Huailing stood with his hands in his pockets, coldly watching the Qiao family being pulled from the water.","His icy gaze locked onto Qiao Qihang, like a snake coiling around his neck.","Qiao Qihang felt the chilling stare and looked up, meeting Weisheng Huailing’s eyes. He shivered and snapped, \"What are you looking at?!\"","Huailing tilted his head slightly as the sea breeze lifted his hair, revealing his androgynous, beautiful face.","He smiled mysteriously and walked away.","-","After the party, Qiao Chuchu returned to her suite, her anxiety still lingering.","The fear of being murdered clung to her.","She had experienced many types of death, but being intentionally killed was a first.","The terror of losing control over her life, the constant feeling of being watched—it was like a car slowly crushing her little finger.","She paced back and forth in her room, biting down on the side of her index finger, unable to calm down.","**[What should I do? Kill him? No, I can’t do that. I can fight, but I can’t kill, unless it’s self-defense.]**","**[Tell my brother?]**","**[Forget it. They don’t like me. Even if I tell them, they’ll probably think I’m causing trouble.]**","**[But I could lure Qiao Qihang into committing a crime. If I have solid evidence, I can bring him to justice.]**","Qiao Chuchu’s palms were drenched in sweat, no matter how much she wiped them. She leaned against the wardrobe in frustration: \"This is so annoying!!!\"","Weisheng Huailing jolted in surprise.","He was sitting inside Qiao Chuchu’s wardrobe, peeking through the crack, catching the pleasant scent of her shampoo.","He leaned closer, inhaling deeply, and smiled contentedly.","Deciding to come here right after work was definitely the right move!","He got to hear so much of her voice!","What a win!"]},{"number":82,"title":"Chapter 82: Humans Are Far More Terrifying Than Ghosts","paragraphs":["Weisheng Wenzhan raised his hand and placed it over the gap in the closet.","Just a cabinet apart.","But it felt warm.","Suddenly, there was a knock on Qiao Chuchu's door.","She frowned and looked toward the entrance.","Pei Youchuan's deep voice sounded: \"Are you still awake?\"","She was startled, her anxious mood easing slightly: 【Why is Pei Youchuan here?】","【But it’s good that he came. I’m too unsettled right now. I don’t even dare to sleep alone in my room. I keep feeling like someone is watching me from behind.】","Huai Ling: \"...\"","She’s quite perceptive.","Qiao Chuchu sat on the bed, directly facing the gap in the closet: \"Come in.\"","Pei Youchuan pushed the door open and saw Qiao Chuchu sitting listlessly on the bed.","It was already midnight.","He asked knowingly: \"What’s wrong? Are you upset?\"","Qiao Chuchu gave him a helpless look: \"How did you know I wasn’t asleep?\"","Pei Youchuan hesitated for a moment, then said sternly: \"I heard you pacing back and forth. It was noisy.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","She laughed in exasperation: \"Alright, then I’ll stop. You can go back to sleep.\"","\"No, I can’t sleep anyway.\" Pei Youchuan sat down beside her: \"Why don’t you tell me why you can’t sleep?\"","Huai Ling’s brow furrowed.","He could roughly understand what they were saying.","But he had investigated—there was a deep rift between the siblings, and they hadn’t lived together for years.","This Pei Youchuan didn’t seem as indifferent to Qiao Chuchu as the information suggested.","He seemed to care about her quite a bit.","Huai Ling pursed his lips warily.","If the people around her cared for her so much, he would have to work twice as hard to stand out.","He nervously glanced at Qiao Chuchu again.","Pei Youchuan also looked at Qiao Chuchu with some tension.","Chuchu’s mood was heavy, and she didn’t want to speak.","【What can I say?】","【That someone wants to kill me? But I don’t have any evidence.】","【I can’t exactly say that I died once and came back to life, only to find out that the entire Qiao Qihang family wants me dead, can I?】","Pei Youchuan’s expression grew darker as he listened: \"Qiao Chuchu, whatever you want to say, you can tell me. I’ll believe you.\"","She was startled and met Pei Youchuan’s gaze.","Pei Youchuan’s beautiful eyes locked onto hers, as if waiting for her to say something.","She opened her mouth, but another thought flashed through her mind.","【If Pei Youchuan had a secret, he wouldn’t tell me either.】","【After all, I’ve caused so much trouble over the years. Pei Youchuan has been hurt by me more than once or twice.】","She forced a bitter smile: \"I just... got scared by a horror movie. You know how afraid of ghosts I am.\"","Pei Youchuan’s eyes instantly dimmed: \"Is that so?\"","His tone turned cold: \"Then go to sleep. I’ll stay here with you.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","Pei Youchuan ignored her, turned off the main light, and switched on the bedside lamp. Under the warm yellow glow, he sat by her bed: \"Sleep.\"","She was baffled: \"What are you doing?\"","Pei Youchuan said matter-of-factly: \"Like when we were kids, I’ll help you fall asleep.\"","Qiao Chuchu was stunned as Pei Youchuan pushed her down onto the bed without another word!","Qiao Chuchu: \"!\"","Pei Youchuan squeezed her to the inner side of the bed, half-lying down, his tone firm: \"Close your eyes.\"","Qiao Chuchu blinked in confusion, the fear in her heart suddenly dissipating: \"I don’t need—\"","\"Don’t say you don’t need it. If you can’t sleep, I can’t sleep either.\" Pei Youchuan frowned: \"Don’t you know I have insomnia? The slightest noise outside wakes me up.\"","Qiao Chuchu was shocked: \"You, the guy who falls asleep the moment your head hits the pillow, have insomnia? I remember your alarm clock woke up the whole house, and you were still sleeping like a log.\"","Pei Youchuan’s face darkened, displeased: \"Just close your eyes already. Don’t make me lose my patience, or I’ll loop a horror movie to scare you!\"","Chuchu choked back a retort and reluctantly closed her eyes.","【Time really changes people. Even Pei Youchuan, the carefree guy who could fall asleep instantly, has insomnia now.】","Pei Youchuan: \"?\"","【But having someone here is nice. I don’t have to be scared anymore, hehe!】","Pei Youchuan: \"...\"","At least she managed to save face.","His warm hand rested on the back of hers, gently patting as he hummed a tune: \"The boat’s lantern glows, the moss-covered rocks bear new patterns, the drizzle whispers, and the returning swallows won’t wait for anyone...\"","Hearing his deep, soothing voice, she nestled closer to him, feeling at ease.","Pei Youchuan’s warm hand covered hers, patting softly.","She gradually relaxed, and drowsiness began to take over.","【So warm, just like when we were kids.】","Pei Youchuan’s heart trembled as he looked down at Qiao Chuchu.","She was still the same as when she was a child, her appearance unchanged, just grown up proportionally.","When she was six, Qiao Chuchu had been pranked by Pei Mu and Pei Ci, shown a terrifying ghost image that scared her so much she couldn’t sleep at night. She had knocked on his door, clutching her blanket.","\"Mom and Dad are away on a business trip. Third Brother, can you sleep with me? I’m so scared.\"","She held her blanket and promised: \"I won’t touch you at all!\"","Back then, he found it strange: \"Why me?\"","The little girl pitifully replied: \"You’re strong and full of yang energy. Ghosts won’t possess you.\"","So, Qiao Chuchu lay beside him, covered in her purple blanket.","He fell asleep instantly.","Qiao Chuchu poked him awake: \"Third Brother, I still can’t sleep. Can you make some noise? Even snoring would do. I feel like there’s someone under the bed, someone in the closet, and you’ve turned into a ghost.\"","...","He was angry.","Not at her, but at Pei Ci and Pei Mu.","He sighed and patted the back of her hand: \"Mom used to pat me like this to help me sleep. I’ll sing for you too. Will that help you sleep?\"","Qiao Chuchu’s eyes lit up: \"Thank you, Brother! I’ll do whatever you say tomorrow!\"","He snorted, patting her hand as he sang.","Qiao Chuchu flattered him: \"You’re the best singer among my brothers. Thank you, Third Brother. You’re working hard.\"","He scoffed: \"What if you didn’t thank me? Would I just ignore you?\"","The little girl grinned at him: \"I was afraid you’d think I’m a bother, hehe~\"","He snorted: \"I’m your brother. If you ask, I’ll help.\"","Pei Youchuan snapped out of his memories and looked at the now-sleeping Qiao Chuchu.","Back then, her hand was so small, his palm could completely cover hers.","Now, her hand was still small, and his palm could still cover it completely.","He stared blankly: \"You used to rely on me the most, saying I was strong and made you feel safe. Whenever you were scared of ghosts, you’d come to me first. I didn’t need to hear your thoughts because you’d tell me what you were afraid of.\"","\"Now, you’ve gone through something even scarier than ghosts, but you don’t tell me anything.\"","\"I can only learn about your fears and worries from your thoughts... and the distance you’ve put between us.\"","Pei Youchuan sat there for an hour, making sure Qiao Chuchu was sound asleep, then turned off the bedside lamp and left with a heavy heart.","Huai Ling silently emerged from the closet, walked over to Qiao Chuchu, and took out a disinfecting wipe from his pocket. He gently wiped the back of her hand.","He patted it with satisfaction.","Clean!","Huai Ling carefully took out a necklace from the pocket at his collar.","The pendant was a teardrop-shaped blue Paraiba.","He smoothly placed it around Qiao Chuchu’s neck and admired it under the moonlight.","It suited her perfectly!","He cautiously tucked a note he had written into her hand and signed to her: 「My sister said that when you meet a girl you want to pursue, you must bring a gift. This Paraiba is something I carefully selected, bought with my first paycheck.」","Weisheng Huailing smiled: 「I hope the gemstone and the new day bring you joy, because every time I hear your voice, I feel happy.」","He left Qiao Chuchu’s suite and turned around, bumping into Weisheng Wenzhan, who was wearing pajamas.","Wenzhan looked at him with a knowing gaze, as if he had long known Huai Ling was hiding in Qiao Chuchu’s room, and signed: 「What are you doing?」","Huai Ling: 「Giving Qiao Chuchu a necklace.」","Wenzhan: 「? Is she awake?」","Huai Ling shook his head.","Weisheng Wenzhan: 「? So you gave it to her while she was asleep? Do you know how creepy that is? No one will like you for doing something like that.」","Huai Ling maintained a distant smile and signed back: 「Stay away from her, Brother.」","Weisheng Wenzhan: \"?\"","Weisheng Huailing stepped forward, looking at him with an innocent smile. \"I'm very dissatisfied with your decision to approach her without permission, which is why I rushed over. Don't do it again next time.\"","Huailing blinked her moist eyes. \"Her matters should be handled by me and my sister.\"","Weisheng Wenzhan narrowed his eyes. \"You don't trust my taste? Do you think I would like someone like Qiao Chuchu?\"","Weisheng Huailing smiled. \"I believe you. I'm just reminding you.\"","\"Alright,\" Weisheng Wenzhan replied with a fake smile. \"Then you're mistaken.\"","Huailing: \"?\"","A hint of mockery flashed in Weisheng Wenzhan's eyes. \"Listening to her thoughts is such a fun thing. I can't let you have all the fun, especially since you don't know how important I am to her.\"","Weisheng Huailing's face gradually darkened.","Weisheng Wenzhan chuckled teasingly. \"She drew a manga with me as the prototype. She's very satisfied with my looks. I'm much more important than you. When you manage to get your own manga, then we can compare.\"","Huailing staggered back, her expression as if she had been struck by lightning.","Weisheng Wenzhan turned around gracefully, his smile deepening.","This is too amusing.","Teasing Huailing is just as effective as teasing Pei Youchuan—it always hits the mark.","He thought of something and turned back to ask, \"What kind of jewelry did you give her?\"","Weisheng Huailing was still in shock. \"...Paraiba.\"","Weisheng Wenzhan nodded, smiling mysteriously. \"Then I'll give her something even more expensive.\"","Huailing: \"!!!!!\""]},{"number":83,"title":"Chapter 83: Pei Youchuan Furious: Who Sent Qiao Chuchu Jewelry in the Middle of the Night","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu was awakened by a series of urgent knocks on her door.","Outside, two women were screaming at the top of their lungs: \"Don't stop me! I just want to ask, don't you dare stop us!!\"","For a moment, she thought it was all a dream, but as the voices grew louder and more insistent, like a swarm of bees buzzing in her ears, she realized there was indeed a commotion outside.","Qiao Chuchu got out of bed and opened her bedroom door, just in time to see Pei Youchuan walking by while pulling on his clothes.","His messy curls framed his face, and he casually threw on a sweater, covering his toned, bare chest. His well-defined abs flashed before her eyes for a brief moment.","She was suddenly wide awake.","[Damn, those abs are so good-looking, and they belong to my brother? What a waste!]","Pei Youchuan: \"?\"","He quickly poked his head out of the sweater and gave her a puzzled look.","Qiao Chuchu immediately changed her expression: \"I slept really well last night, thanks, Third Brother.\"","Pei Youchuan let out a cold laugh: \"When something happens, you still come to your brother, huh? So, how do you think your brother is doing?\"","She gave him a thumbs-up: \"Super handsome!\"","Pei Youchuan raised an eyebrow: \"How about my physique?\"","Qiao Chuchu didn’t hesitate: \"Absolutely amazing!\"","Pei Youchuan smiled: \"Does your brother have any flaws?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"Not a single one!\"","Pei Youchuan was slightly pleased: \"What about my personality?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"Extremely annoying!\"","Pei Youchuan: \"?\"","Pei Youchuan stared at her.","She stared back.","Pei Youchuan’s face gradually fell, and he stepped forward, pinching her cheeks tightly: \"You’re the annoying one!\"","Qiao Chuchu winced in pain, her words muffled: \"Ow ow ow!\"","Pei Youchuan’s gaze shifted, noticing a dazzling Paraiba gemstone around Qiao Chuchu’s neck.","Her fair skin was accentuated by the silver chain and the pure blue gemstone, making her glow even brighter.","Strangely, it hadn’t been there when she went to bed last night.","Pei Youchuan grabbed the gemstone: \"Did you buy this?\"","Qiao Chuchu was also puzzled: \"Huh? When did I put this on? I didn’t buy it, and I didn’t wear it either.\"","After saying that, she began to doubt herself.","[I don’t think I wore this, right? Staying up late has made my brain fuzzy.]","[Last night, to match my black dress, I wore the red diamond, and I already put it back in my jewelry box.]","Qiao Chuchu suddenly thought of something and rushed to her vanity, opening the jewelry box.","The sparkling red diamond was safely nestled inside, and her cold body instantly warmed up.","That red diamond was worth over a hundred million and was a gift from Pei Yuan for her eighteenth birthday. If it had been swapped out, she’d be in big trouble!","She let out a long sigh of relief: \"It’s fine, my red diamond is still here.\"","Pei Youchuan chuckled in exasperation: \"Do you think the issue here is the red diamond?\"","He glanced at her bed and noticed a gemstone certificate and a gift box on the nightstand.","There was also a note on the bed.","Pei Youchuan narrowed his eyes and ordered Qiao Chuchu: \"Go see what’s going on at the door.\"","Qiao Chuchu nodded and headed toward the door.","Pei Youchuan quickly picked up the note on the bed.","\"As long as I’m here, you’ll never have to worry about your safety, because I’m your guardian angel.\"","He let out a disbelieving laugh and snapped a photo of the note, sending it to the group chat: \"Who sent this?\"","\"After one night, Qiao Chuchu suddenly has a Paraiba around her neck. It wasn’t there when I put her to bed at midnight, but when I woke up, she had it on, along with this note. Who sent this?!!!!!\"","His hands were trembling with anger.","Some creep had snuck into her room and, like a total weirdo, put a necklace on Qiao Chuchu while she was asleep!!","What else had he done?!","What else had this person done while Qiao Chuchu was sleeping?!","Pei Che: \"? Who sent it?\"","Pei Fengnong: \"? @Pei Mu @Pei Ci, was it you two pulling a prank again?\"","Pei Mu: \"? We’re way past the age for pranks. It wasn’t us!\"","Pei Ci: \"Yeah, it wasn’t us! What about Pei Buxian? He’s into creepy stuff like this. @Pei Buxian, explain yourself.\"","Pei Buxian: \"It wasn’t me!!!!!!!!\"","Pei Youchuan was furious: \"What about Pei Yuan? Did Pei Yuan send it?\"","Pei Che: \"Pei Yuan was hospitalized yesterday with viral meningitis. His fever just broke last night, and he’s still weak. He probably hasn’t even looked at his phone.\"","Lin Qing: \"Am I the only one noticing that Pei Youchuan was putting Qiao Chuchu to sleep?\"","Pei Youchuan: \"That’s not the point! The point is this necklace that appeared out of nowhere!\"","Lin Qing: \"@Lin Shen, was it you, brother? Are you playing the yandere card?\"","Lin Shen: \"...Sneaking onto a luxury cruise ship and stealthily putting a necklace on Qiao Chuchu? Do you think I’m some kind of secret agent? I’m more inclined to suspect Lou Tingsi.\"","Pei Fengnong: \"@Lou Tingsi\"","Pei Che: \"@Lou Tingsi\"","Pei Mu, Pei Ci: \"@Lou Tingsi\"","Pei Buxian went berserk: \"@Lou Tingsi, come out and explain!!!!!!\"","Lou Tingsi: \"I’m honored to be suspected, but I’m sorry to disappoint. I’m not that twisted. If I were to give a gift, I wouldn’t do it sneakily. That’s more like something you’d do to eliminate a rival.\"","The group chat fell silent for a moment before erupting into chaos again.","\"Then who was it?!\"","\"Pei Mu, Pei Ci, just admit it! You two are always pulling stunts like this!\"","\"It really wasn’t us, damn it! It must’ve been Pei Buxian! He’s been going off the deep end lately!\"","Pei Buxian sent a voice message, his voice hoarse with frustration: \"I already said it wasn’t me!! Who the hell did this?!!!!!\"","Lin Qing: \"...I feel like I’ve stumbled into a mental asylum, but I feel worse for Qiao Chuchu. She’s at the center of it all.\"","Lin Shen: \"Pei Buxian, maybe you should get your mental state checked.\"","Pei Buxian: \"All I want to know is who snuck into Qiao Chuchu’s room and gave her that necklace!!!!\"","Lou Tingsi: \"What about Weisheng Huailing?\"","\"?\"","A flurry of question marks quickly filled the chat.","Lou Tingsi: \"Weisheng Huailing is a mercenary, and a top-tier lone wolf at that. I’ve heard he can infiltrate even the most heavily guarded places without a trace.\"","Lin Qing: \"That guy who looks like a fresh-faced idol but is actually deaf and mute???\"","Lou Tingsi: \"Weisheng Huailing only looks like an idol. Underneath that pretty face, he’s covered in muscles and scars. Plus, he’s obsessed with gemstones. I send him jewelry every year, and he told me that since he can’t hear, he loves to look at rare, sparkling things.\"","The group chat fell into a dead silence.","Finally, Lin Qing broke it: \"So he gave Qiao Chuchu a sparkling gemstone? Meaning he gave the person he loves the thing he loves most?!\"","Lin Qing: \"Ahhh, I’m here for it! I can ship it, I can ship it, I can ship it!!!\"","The group chat went silent for a moment before exploding.","Everyone lashed out at Lin Qing: \"If you like Weisheng Huailing so much, why don’t you take him away?\"","Lin Qing: \"Ha, as if he’d go for me. It’s obvious he’s into Qiao Chuchu. Besides, my tastes have changed. I’m into soft, cute boys now. I’m not into aggressive types like him.\"","Lin Shen: \"...You’re shipping Qiao Chuchu and Weisheng Huailing? What about me?\"","Lin Qing: \"Bro, let’s be real. Qiao Chuchu herself is like a soft mochi ball. She’s surrounded by all these aggressive men. Someone as gentle and devoted as you doesn’t make for an exciting ship.\"","Lin Shen: \"? I’m someone Qiao Chuchu used to like.\"","Pei Buxian: \"Oh yeah, used to.\"","Pei Mu: \"Oh yeah, used to.\"","Pei Ci: \"Oh yeah, used to.\"","Pei Fengnong: \"Used to.\"","Pei Che: \"Used to.\"","Lin Qing: \"Used to.\"","Lou Tingsi: \"Used to.\"","Lin Shen: \"...\""]},{"number":84,"title":"Chapter 84: Pei Youchuan: Playing Dumb on the Path of Deception","paragraphs":["Pei Youchuan was so angry he couldn’t speak.","He should have known it was Weisheng Huailing all along!","Weisheng Wenzhan could hear thoughts, and by the same logic, Weisheng Huailing could too.","Weisheng Wenzhan had explicitly said that his brother had taken a liking to Qiao Chuchu and wanted to make a connection.","But who would’ve thought Weisheng Huailing would sneak into Qiao Chuchu’s room?!","Pei Youchuan glanced at Qiao Chuchu, who was crouched by the door, eavesdropping on the commotion outside.","Her eyes darted around, and she absentmindedly fiddled with the gemstone necklace around her neck, straining to hear the voices outside.","“It seems like Qiao Qihang has disappeared,” Qiao Chuchu whispered to him. “Qiao’s Mother and Qiao Yue think I’m behind it, and now they’re shouting and making a scene outside.”","She frowned. “Do you think they’re trying to frame me? Pulling a disappearing act on purpose?”","Pei Youchuan didn’t answer. Instead, he looked down at the note in his hand.","“As long as I’m here, you’ll never have to worry about your safety, because I’m your guardian angel.”","He let out a bitter laugh, walked over to Qiao Chuchu, and removed the necklace from her neck. “This necklace was something I put on you. I only meant for you to try it on to see if it’d be suitable for a client, but I forgot to take it off.”","Qiao Chuchu didn’t question it much and let him take it.","Pei Youchuan’s face darkened as he placed the necklace back into the gift box and shielded her behind him. “Step back.”","Chuchu took a few steps back.","Pei Youchuan opened the door just as Qiao Yue and Qiao’s Mother were about to barge in.","The moment they saw the two of them, they lunged at Qiao Chuchu like wild beasts, screaming, “Qiao Chuchu!!!!”","Pei Youchuan shoved them both away!","Qiao Yue and Qiao’s Mother stumbled back, staring at Pei Youchuan in shock.","He towered over them, his eyes cold and menacing. “Get out.”","Qiao Yue trembled, but she still managed to retort, “My dad’s gone missing, and it’s definitely your doing!”","Pei Youchuan scoffed. “Show me the evidence, or you’re just slandering us.”","Qiao Yue and Qiao’s Mother were too stunned to speak. They glared at Qiao Chuchu, who was standing behind Pei Youchuan, their eyes wide with fury.","Pei Youchuan blocked their line of sight. “Didn’t you hear me? Get out.”","Qiao Yue’s lips quivered, and tears welled up in her eyes as she cowered under Pei Youchuan’s gaze. “Your family is nothing but trouble!!”","She covered her face and ran off, sobbing.","Qiao’s Mother, left with no choice, threw out a final threat before leaving. “Just you wait! We’ll find the evidence of your family’s wrongdoing!”","The staff members apologized profusely to Pei Youchuan. “We’re so sorry. We tried to stop them, but there was nothing we could do.”","Qiao Chuchu peeked out from behind Pei Youchuan. “Do you think her dad really disappeared?”","Pei Youchuan stuffed his hands into his pockets, silently watching the two retreating figures. He ignored the staff’s apologies, his eyes darkening with suspicion.","Ten minutes later, he found Weisheng Huailing running on a treadmill in the gym.","Weisheng Huailing’s silver-white hair was tied back with a sports headband, and he wore a simple white tank top, looking every bit like a celebrity from the entertainment industry.","But his arms were crisscrossed with scars, which he made no effort to hide, leaving them exposed as he focused on his workout.","A group of girls had gathered around, ogling his muscular arms and his strikingly handsome face.","Pei Youchuan approached with the gift box in hand and swung it at Weisheng Huailing’s face!","Weisheng Huailing caught the box in mid-air!","The girls gasped, turning their attention to Pei Youchuan.","Whispers and exclamations filled the air.","“Oh! Another handsome guy!”","Their eyes lit up as they glanced back and forth between the two men.","Pei Youchuan walked straight up to Weisheng Huailing. “Let’s talk.”","Huailing stepped off the treadmill and smiled at him.","Pei Youchuan led him to a corner. “Name your price. How much do you want?”","Weisheng Huailing raised an eyebrow, looking genuinely puzzled, and typed on his phone: *“Do you think I need money?”*","Pei Youchuan narrowed his eyes. “I won’t let you get close to my sister like this.”","Weisheng Huailing blinked, his smile turning even more charming as he typed: *“Do you think you can stop me?”*","Pei Youchuan: “?”","Weisheng Huailing continued typing: *“If you give the necklace back to me, I’ll put it on her again. I didn’t do anything last night—I just put the necklace on her. Don’t worry, I value myself too much to give away my first kiss so easily. I’ll only kiss her if I really want to.”*","*“So if you return the necklace, I’ll give it to her again.”*","Weisheng Huailing held up his phone with a grin: *“But if I give it to her again, I won’t just be watching her—I’ll be kissing her.”*","Pei Youchuan swung a punch at him!","Huailing dodged effortlessly, letting Pei Youchuan’s fists hit empty air. He even had the time to type while dodging, then flipped backward onto a high platform, showing Pei Youchuan his phone.","*“I’m here to join the family, not to break it apart. Why can’t you accept me?”*","He tilted his head, typing: *“Don’t you like the idea of having a capable brother-in-law like me?”*","Pei Youchuan gritted his teeth. “You’re full of it!!!”","Weisheng Huailing shrugged nonchalantly: *“Whether you like it or not, you can’t stop me. Just like those high-profile figures with top-notch security—they’re guarded down to their underwear, but I still managed to collect my payments.”*","He typed happily: *“You don’t like my job? That’s fine. I can quit. Whatever Chuchu likes, I’ll open for her. I’ll treat her well.”*","Pei Youchuan laughed bitterly. “You’ll treat her well? Do you even like her? You’ve only met her once!”","Weisheng Huailing swung onto a horizontal bar, smirking: *“I like hearing her thoughts. I like hearing her call my name. I want to hear her call it for the rest of her life.”*","Pei Youchuan: “...”","Huailing typed casually: *“And we can always fall in love after marriage. She’s my only living treasure, just like my jewelry. I belong to her, and she belongs to me. Isn’t that perfect?”*","Pei Youchuan: “? Treasure?! Qiao Chuchu is your living treasure?”","He was furious. “You’re asking for a beating!!”","He leapt at Huailing!","Huailing, hanging upside down, noticed Qiao Chuchu and Weisheng Wenzhan approaching.","His eyes lit up, and he deliberately jumped off the bar, meeting Pei Youchuan’s incoming fist!","Pei Youchuan’s punch landed on his shoulder!","Huailing stumbled back and fell to the ground, tears instantly filling his eyes.","Pei Youchuan: “?”","How did he manage to hit him?","Wasn’t this guy supposed to be agile?","...Wait a minute!","This is a trap!","Pei Youchuan sensed something was off and looked toward the entrance.","Qiao Chuchu noticed the commotion and saw Weisheng Huailing sitting on the floor. She quickly walked over.","Pei Youchuan: “!”","He glanced at Weisheng Huailing.","Huailing sat on the ground, tears welling up in his eyes, biting his lower lip and looking pitifully at him.","Pei Youchuan smirked.","Playing dirty, huh?","Fine!","He’d play along too.","Pei Youchuan slammed his head into the horizontal bar!","*“Bang!”*","His eyes rolled back, and he collapsed to the ground.","Qiao Chuchu: “? Third Brother!!”","She rushed to Pei Youchuan’s side, staring at the rapidly swelling red bump on his head, then turned to Weisheng Huailing in confusion.","Weisheng Huailing, still with tears on his face, was dumbfounded!","Was Pei Youchuan really copying his dirty tricks?!","A flash of anger crossed his eyes, but he quickly shook his head at Qiao Chuchu, signing: *“I don’t know what happened. Brother suddenly ran into the bar. It’s not my fault.”*","Pei Youchuan lay on the ground, stars spinning in his eyes.","Ugh... he was about to throw up.","But it was worth it.","He’d seized the opportunity—no way he’d let that scheming guy outplay him!","Pei Youchuan weakly grasped Qiao Chuchu’s hand, murmuring, “Qiao Chuchu, don’t blame Huailing... he’s innocent. He didn’t mean to.”","Weisheng Huailing: “????”"]},{"number":85,"title":"Chapter 85: Weisheng Huailing: Mood is Like a Roller Coaster of Ups and Downs","paragraphs":["He’s really putting on an act!","Pei Youchuan is as strong as a bear, yet he’s pretending to be so fragile!","Though Weisheng Huailing thought this in his heart, he still nervously glanced at Qiao Chuchu, afraid she might misunderstand.","But Qiao Chuchu looked utterly confused.","[How strange. I clearly saw Pei Youchuan crash into the pillar like he was on roller skates. Is he mentally unstable? And he’s telling me not to blame Weisheng Huailing?]","Pei Youchuan: “?”","Weisheng Huailing quietly let out a sigh of relief and put on a sweet smile.","Hehe, trying to pull a fast one but ending up with the short end of the stick. What an idiot, hehehe.","Pei Youchuan: “...”","So, he crashed for nothing, huh?","But the next moment, he felt a gentle touch on the sore spot on his head.","He looked up in surprise, meeting Qiao Chuchu’s concerned gaze.","Qiao Chuchu wasn’t looking at him but was focused on the big bump on his head: “It’s so big. It must hurt a lot.”","Her eyes were filled with worry: “Are you okay?”","Pei Youchuan: “...”","His face turned red: “I-I’m fine, just a bit dizzy.”","Qiao Chuchu sighed.","[Is it because I’ve been pushing them too hard with tasks that they’ve developed self-harming tendencies?]","She reached out to support him: “Come on, I’ll take you to see a doctor.”","Pei Youchuan was flustered but obediently let her help him up.","Qiao Chuchu wrapped her arm around his waist.","Pei Youchuan stiffened!","Qiao Chuchu said with concern: “You can lean half your weight on me, but not all of it, or you’ll break my bones.”","Pei Youchuan’s cheeks burned, and he nodded.","The tips of his ears were so red they looked like they could drip blood.","Suddenly, Huailing stepped in front of Qiao Chuchu, defensive: “We just met. Aren’t you going to have dinner with me?”","Qiao Chuchu frowned, a bit helpless: “I’m sorry, Huailing. My brother is hurt. I need to take him to the hospital.”","Huailing pouted, gesturing wildly: “He crashed into it on purpose! You saw it, didn’t you?”","Qiao Chuchu shrugged: “So what if it was on purpose?”","Huailing: “?”","Qiao Chuchu signed: “I don’t care if it was on purpose. What matters is that he’s hurt, and besides, he’s not mentally stable.”","Huailing laughed, growing more frustrated: “As if I’m mentally stable either!”","Qiao Chuchu: “?”","[Why is Weisheng Huailing acting so weird today? Or has he always been this strange?]","Weisheng Huailing’s face darkened: “I flew here specifically to see you, Qiao Chuchu.”","He sounded a bit hurt: “I missed you!”","Qiao Chuchu was startled and blurted out: “You missed me?”","Huailing understood her words and nodded earnestly.","Qiao Chuchu: “...”","[But I didn’t miss him. Did sending that bag make him think we’re close? Maybe I should return it.]","[No, returning it would be rude. I’ll buy him a car instead, something of similar value to the bag.]","Weisheng Huailing: “?”","She wants to return the bag?","He thought that by sending her a bunch of beautiful crocodile leather bags, she’d like him, feel some affection, or at least think of him occasionally.","But it turns out it was all just his wishful thinking?","Pei Youchuan sneered from the side.","Did he really think a few pieces of jewelry would win Qiao Chuchu’s heart?","Qiao Chuchu has seen the world. She doesn’t lack money, bags, or jewelry.","Such petty gestures could never capture her heart.","How naive.","Pei Youchuan smirked triumphantly.","Weisheng Huailing noticed his expression, veins bulging on his forehead, murderous intent flashing in his eyes.","Weisheng Wenzhan had been watching the drama unfold from the sidelines.","First, Pei Youchuan got angry, then Weisheng Huailing. The rivalry between these two clingy men was quite entertaining.","Huailing’s face turned slightly green as he reluctantly looked at Qiao Chuchu.","He thought that by giving her such thoughtful gifts, she’d at least think of him a little.","But she didn’t even spare him a thought.","Fine.","He’ll buy more! Better things! Things she can’t resist! Things that’ll make her feel like she can’t live without him!!","Weisheng Huailing’s eyes reddened at the corners as he stepped aside: “Go ahead.”","He lowered his head, avoiding Qiao Chuchu’s gaze: “Your brother is more important than me.”","Qiao Chuchu blinked.","[Well, that’s true. He is my brother, after all.]","Weisheng Huailing: “...”","Pei Youchuan grinned foolishly, already forgetting the pain in his head.","But Qiao Chuchu suddenly remembered something: “Oh, right.”","She took out her phone: “Let’s add each other on WeChat!”","Huailing’s eyes darkened, but he didn’t refuse. He picked up his phone and added her as a friend.","But what good would adding her on WeChat do?","He could hear her thoughts, and she wasn’t thinking of him. Everything she was doing was just polite social interaction.","Suddenly, he received a picture from Qiao Chuchu.","It was a finely detailed portrait.","The boy in the painting had silver-white hair, wore a white coat, and had a red scarf around his neck. He stood in the snow, holding a cute little snowman, smiling at him.","Weisheng Huailing blinked in shock.","Was this painting of him?","He looked at Qiao Chuchu in surprise.","Qiao Chuchu smiled shyly: “I thought you had the vibe of a manga protagonist, so I spent the last couple of days drawing this portrait of you. I’m still working on one of your sister, but yours is finished.”","She tapped the spot on the painting where his cheek was: “But I just noticed today that you have a dimple, which isn’t in this painting. I’ll add it later!”","Her eyes sparkled with excitement: “To make the painting of you even more perfect.”","Huailing was stunned, holding onto his phone as if it were a treasure: “How long did you spend on this?”","Qiao Chuchu thought for a moment: “Two days.”","She sounded a bit shy: “I kept thinking about how to make the painting of you more perfect, but I still missed a detail.”","“No.” Huailing examined the painting closely: “It’s perfect as it is.”","He praised sincerely: “This is your first impression of me, so its imperfections make it perfect.”","Weisheng Wenzhan glanced at the phone screen and frowned.","The painting was indeed beautiful.","But what was the big deal? It was just a painting. Weisheng Huailing had seen so much in life. How could a simple painting make him this happy?","Qiao Chuchu didn’t expect Huailing to be so thrilled either and felt a bit embarrassed: “You gave me so many expensive bags, and I’m giving you a cheap painting. I hope you don’t mind.”","“Of course I don’t mind! I love it!!” Huailing’s eyes shone like stars as he suddenly picked Qiao Chuchu up and spun her around several times!!","Qiao Chuchu: “?!”","Pei Youchuan: “!”","Weisheng Wenzhan: “!”","Huailing happily set her down, signing excitedly: “I hope you’ve been thinking of me, because I’ve been thinking of you ever since we met.”","“Your painting proves that while I was thinking of you, you were thinking of me too.”","His eyes gleamed: “Can you silently say my name in your heart? Can you remember me?”","Qiao Chuchu was puzzled: [? Why does he want me to use my thoughts?]","But she obediently complied: [Weisheng Huailing?]","Huailing froze, his breathing quickening.","Qiao Chuchu, seeing how excited he was, felt a bit weird: [Weisheng Huailing? Weisheng Huailing? Weisheng Huailing???]","Huailing seemed to have been supercharged, instantly full of energy as he hoisted Pei Youchuan onto his back and started running!","“I’ll help you take your brother to the doctor!!”","He grinned from ear to ear, carrying Pei Youchuan like Zhu Bajie carrying his bride, happily running off!","What a win! He heard his name four times!","Hahahahahahahahahahahahahahahahaha!"]},{"number":86,"title":"Chapter 86: Cold in Front of Me, but a Love Fool in Front of Xia Xuechun","paragraphs":["For the entire day, Weisheng Huailing was attentively hovering around Qiao Chuchu.","Qiao Chuchu thought he didn’t resemble the cold-blooded killer described in the script at all.","[I even think Weisheng Huailing is quite adorable.]","After that, Weisheng Huailing spent the whole day grinning like a fool.","He even chased after Pei Youchuan and Weisheng Wenzhan, asking, “What’s wrong, brothers? Ever since I arrived, you’ve stopped smiling.”","Weisheng Wenzhan: “......”","Pei Youchuan: “......”","Weisheng Huailing kept clinging to Qiao Chuchu until they disembarked, at which point Pei Youchuan grabbed Qiao Chuchu by the collar and dragged her into the car.","Weisheng Huailing was still chasing after them.","Just as he was about to catch up, Pei Youchuan stepped on the gas and drove off.","Qiao Chuchu felt the heavy atmosphere in the car and tightly gripped her seatbelt, trying to make conversation: “The Wei Sheng Family doesn’t seem as difficult to get along with as the rumors say. In fact, Weisheng Huailing is even more optimistic than I imagined. What do you think?”","Pei Youchuan let out a cold laugh: “Yeah, I bet you’ve already called him adorable eight hundred times in your head. No wonder he’s so happy.”","Qiao Chuchu: “......?”","[What does it have to do with me thinking he’s cute? It’s not like he can hear it anyway.]","The two didn’t speak again, and Pei Youchuan sped all the way to the Pei Family’s courtyard.","Qiao Chuchu awkwardly got out of the car: “Aren’t you coming down?”","Pei Youchuan slammed the car door shut.","Qiao Chuchu: “......”","[What’s his problem? Getting angry out of nowhere, acting like I begged him to stay. So annoying!]","[Good thing I only have brothers and no boyfriend. If my boyfriend treated me like this, I would’ve broken up with him eight hundred times already!]","Inside the car, Pei Youchuan looked at her. Through the tinted window, his expression was hard to make out, but there was a sharpness to it.","Qiao Chuchu couldn’t be bothered with him and walked off with her suitcase.","Pei Youchuan gripped the steering wheel tightly, his face as dark as an impending storm. He rolled down the window: “I’m going to work!”","Qiao Chuchu was startled and turned back in surprise.","Pei Youchuan stuck his head out of the window, fuming: “Say goodbye to me!!”","Qiao Chuchu was stunned, and a wave of anger surged up: “Goodbye my ass! Stop acting crazy with me, get lost!!!!”","She slammed the door shut as she stormed into the house!","Pei Youchuan laughed bitterly, muttering as he drove off: “Calling someone else ‘adorable’ and telling me to get lost! Unbelievable!”","Qiao Chuchu angrily entered the Pei Family home.","Little Xie greeted her: “Welcome back, Miss Eighth!~”","She was in a foul mood and handed her luggage over: “I’m not in a good mood. Don’t bother with me.”","Little Xie’s smile stiffened as she took the luggage: “Is it because of Mr. Pei Yuan?”","Qiao Chuchu flopped onto the sofa like a dead fish: “No, it’s my third brother.”","Little Xie nodded: “I thought you were upset because Mr. Pei Yuan is sick.”","Qiao Chuchu: “?”","Sick?","She sat up: “My brother is sick?”","Little Xie nodded: “Yes, he’s hospitalized with viral meningitis. He’s been in Mr. Pei Che’s hospital for two days.”","Qiao Chuchu froze, suddenly realizing something.","Oh no!","The plot!","The storyline involving Pei Che and Pei Yuan has begun!","She quickly said: “Little Xie, help me prepare a big pot of chicken soup, enough for two people. I’ll take it to the hospital to visit my brother!”","-","Pei Yuan sat weakly on the hospital bed, listening to the voice messages Pei Youchuan had sent him.","Pei Youchuan was ranting: “I spent three whole days with her, taking care of her, worrying about what she ate, making sure she didn’t eat anything bad, controlling her diet, even sleeping with her when she was scared. And what does she do? As soon as Weisheng Huailing showed up, she tossed me aside. Just now, she even said I’m crazy! She even said if I were her boyfriend, she would’ve broken up with me eight hundred times already!”","“What does that mean? It means she thinks I’m not good enough! I took care of her, gave her everything she wanted, bought her anything she even glanced at, and I’m still in the wrong?!”","“What’s wrong with Qiao Chuchu’s taste? She doesn’t like a man like me but goes for those soft, delicate pretty boys?!”","“What do I have to do to compete with that damn Weisheng Huailing?!”","Pei Yuan’s head was pounding from the noise: “So if Qiao Chuchu liked you, you’d be happy. Are you jealous of Weisheng Huailing?”","Pei Youchuan was silent for a moment, then exploded!","Message after message came flooding in!","Pei Yuan couldn’t be bothered to listen and tossed his phone aside, muttering irritably: “Just because you’re my brother, you think I’ll happily help you sort out your problems?”","He leaned back weakly on the bed, closing his eyes to rest.","[This must be my brother’s room, right? I hope I didn’t get it wrong.]","Pei Yuan opened his eyes in surprise, looking at the door that had been cracked open slightly.","Qiao Chuchu, wearing a cream-colored fur jacket with her hair half-tied in a princess style, peeked in: “Brother?”","Pei Yuan was stunned, and a hint of joy and admiration flickered in his eyes, though he didn’t notice it himself.","Qiao Chuchu, holding a thermos, walked in hesitantly: “How are you feeling? Are you doing better?”","[Ugh, it’s been so long since I’ve been alone with my brother. I feel nervous just seeing him.]","[I used to rely on him the most. He was like a mother to me. I always wanted to be close to him, and I’d relax as soon as I saw him.]","[But now, I get tense every time I’m with him.]","The faint light in Pei Yuan’s eyes dimmed, and his tone turned cold: “What are you doing here?”","Qiao Chuchu adjusted her mindset and sat by the bed: “I came to see you.”","[And to check if you’ve fallen for Xia Xuechun.]","Pei Yuan: “?”","Qiao Chuchu cautiously scanned the room.","[No flowers he grew himself—safe!]","[No plastic bead bracelets—safe!]","[No heartwarming quotes written by Xia Xuechun—safe!]","Pei Yuan: “?”","What, would he receive so many ridiculous gifts if he fell for Xia Xuechun?","Qiao Chuchu, satisfied that there was no trace of Xia Xuechun in the room, smiled brightly: “How are you feeling?”","Pei Yuan’s face darkened: “I feel sick.”","Qiao Chuchu: “?”","Pei Yuan glared at her, annoyed: “You’ve seen me. I’m not dead yet. You can leave now.”","Qiao Chuchu quickly pushed the thermos forward: “Don’t be like that. I brought chicken soup. Try it, it’s lunchtime anyway.”","Pei Yuan’s furrowed brow relaxed slightly: “Chicken soup?”","His tone softened a bit: “Did you make it?”","Qiao Chuchu grinned: “I had Little Xie make it.”","......","Pei Yuan stared at her expressionlessly.","She grinned back at him.","Pei Yuan: “You can leave now.”","Qiao Chuchu was taken aback, feeling hurt.","[Why do you keep trying to kick me out? Just because we’ve had arguments, because I chased after you, because I climbed into your bed, you don’t want to be alone with me?]","[Besides, why do you look so pissed the moment I show up? I’m not even dressed provocatively. I’m wearing thermal underwear, and it’s bright red for good luck during the New Year!]"]},{"number":87,"title":"Chapter 87: This Life Is Unbearable, I'll Go Abroad After I Survive Till the End","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu grew more and more resentful as she thought about it. \"Alright, remember to drink it. I’m leaving.\"","[I’ll find a place to stay for the day. This is the most dangerous time because Pei Yuan is bound to run into Xia Xuechun.]","She pouted inwardly, her tone sarcastic: [Because when Pei Yuan is at his most vulnerable, Xia Xuechun is like a little sun, bringing her love, her heart, and her radiant smile to heal Pei Yuan’s shattered soul, which I’ve torn to pieces.]","[But according to the original timeline, by this point, I’d already been dead for seven days. Pei Yuan, overwhelmed with grief, ended up in the hospital, where he met Xia Xuechun, who was working as a cleaner in place of her mother.]","Qiao Chuchu stomped to the door but still made sure to close it gently. [He acts all high and mighty with me, but the moment Xia Xuechun smiles at him, he loses all sense of direction. He’s such a hopeless romantic!]","Pei Yuan: \"?????\"","Hopeless romantic?","He let out a bitter laugh.","The Pei Family of eight had 797 schemes between them.","Pei Youchuan was missing one, and Qiao Chuchu was missing two.","There was no way he could be the hopeless romantic.","He picked up his phone and opened the message Pei Youchuan had sent him: \"Why haven’t you replied to any of my voice messages?\"","He replied: \"Qiao Chuchu came to see me. She made me some chicken soup. I’m going to eat now.\"","Pei Youchuan: \"?\"","Pei Youchuan sent him a meme.","Pei Yuan’s mood suddenly lifted, and he grabbed the thermos to go find Qiao Chuchu.","---","Chuchu sat gloomily in the recuperation greenhouse.","This was the indoor garden at the Pei Family Hospital, designed for patients who couldn’t go outside during the winter to enjoy the scenery and relax.","She sighed, her mood utterly foul.","[I’ve lived a life where I had everything, yet I ended up being hated by my entire family.]","[I’ve shared both the good times and the bad. We’ve endured every disaster together, and just when everything was about to be perfect, I had to tear it all apart and leave the mess for myself, making everyone despise me, even the dogs.]","She closed her eyes wearily and leaned back in the chair.","[Forget it. Once I survive until the end and make sure they all avoid their death flags, I’ll go abroad. Anywhere is fine. I’ll just disappear, as if I’d died out there, and never come back.]","Pei Yuan stood behind her, holding the thermos, his expression somewhat forlorn.","He knew Qiao Chuchu had been forced into this.","But he still couldn’t just accept her so easily.","Meanwhile, Pei Che, dressed in a white lab coat, passed by the greenhouse.","His phone dinged: \"Chairman, Miss Qiao is at the hospital. I just saw her sitting alone in the greenhouse. She might be here to see Mr. Pei Yuan.\"","Pei Che: \"...\"","Wasn’t her relationship with them all terrible?","Yet she cared enough about her brother to come all the way here.","Pei Che put his phone away and glanced over, narrowing his eyes.","Was that... Qiao Chuchu and Pei Yuan?","Qiao Chuchu looked around boredly, her gaze settling on a particular spot.","A white-haired old lady in a cheongsam was chatting cheerfully with a familiar figure.","Xia Xuechun, wearing a khaki cleaner’s uniform, her hair in a perky ponytail and no makeup, handed the old lady a thermos with a smile: \"Grandma Zhang, this is chicken soup I made myself. It’s been simmering for four hours. Try it! It’s great for replenishing your energy!\"","Grandma Zhang’s eyes crinkled with joy as she affectionately patted Xia Xuechun’s cheek. \"Xuechun, you’re such a sweet girl. If my five sons weren’t already married, I’d definitely want you to marry into our family!\"","Xia Xuechun blushed. \"Grandma, what are you saying?!\"","Qiao Chuchu smirked, unimpressed.","[An old lady praises you for being good at cooking and wanting you to marry into her family, not because she likes you, but because she likes that you can cook, that you’ll cook for her, for her sons, and for her entire family.]","Xia Xuechun seemed to sense Qiao Chuchu’s presence and turned around, surprised. \"Qiao Chuchu?\"","Grandma Zhang followed her gaze, and her smile instantly faded.","Qiao Chuchu crossed her legs, sitting like a boss across from them. \"Hey~\"","Xia Xuechun sneered. \"Here to see your brother? Where is he? Ignoring you again?\"","Qiao Chuchu replied with a straight face, \"No, I’m here to accompany my husband for his vasectomy.\"","Xia Xuechun: \"?\"","Pei Yuan: \"?\"","Pei Che: \"?\"","Grandma Zhang chuckled. \"Qiao Chuchu, it’s been so long, and you’re still as ill-mannered as ever.\"","Xia Xuechun was surprised. \"You know Qiao Chuchu?\"","Grandma Zhang nodded. \"Yes, she’s my neighbor downstairs. We’ve met a few times.\"","Her tone was meaningful. \"I’ve also met her so-called... brothers.\"","Pei Yuan: \"?\"","The old lady must be referring to the apartment Qiao Chuchu had been living in for the past few years.","Since they had fallen out, they’d only sent things through drivers, and neither he nor his brothers had ever visited Qiao Chuchu.","What brothers could Qiao Chuchu possibly have in that apartment?","Pei Yuan eyed Qiao Chuchu’s back suspiciously.","Qiao Chuchu was still in high spirits: [Ha, perfect. I’ve got a lot of pent-up anger with nowhere to vent. You two running into me is like stepping on a live wire!]","She tilted her chin at Grandma Zhang. \"My eldest brother asked me to wish you a happy New Year. So, how’s your New Year going?\"","Grandma Zhang frowned, about to speak, but Qiao Chuchu cut her off. \"Probably not great, otherwise you wouldn’t be chatting with someone like Xia Xuechun, who has nothing to do with you, but with your sons and grandsons.\"","Xia Xuechun’s brows furrowed, and she stood up angrily. \"Qiao Chuchu, don’t insult Grandma Zhang. She’s a good person!\"","\"Good person?\" Qiao Chuchu smirked. \"She has five sons, five daughters-in-law, three of whom are divorced. Only two daughters-in-law are left—one who gave birth to a son and comes from a wealthy family, and the other who had a daughter and comes from an ordinary background. Guess who’s on her knees scrubbing the floors?\"","Grandma Zhang stiffened. \"That’s her duty! She’s my daughter-in-law. It’s none of your business!\"","Qiao Chuchu smiled confidently. \"Xia Xuechun, see? If you marry into her family without money, status, or a son, you’ll be on your knees scrubbing floors too. Not just scrubbing floors, but also making chicken soup and washing her feet!\"","Xia Xuechun: \"I’m fine with that.\"","?","Qiao Chuchu thought she’d misheard. \"You’re fine with that? What about your mom? Would she be fine with it?\"","Xia Xuechun smirked. \"Qiao Chuchu, it’s our duty to respect the elderly. As a daughter-in-law, I should do that. Can’t you? Besides, I prefer boys. I’m not biased against girls, but I think boys are more lively. I only want to have boys. There’s nothing wrong with liking boys. Your family is full of brothers, isn’t it?\"","Qiao Chuchu shot back without hesitation. \"Don’t compare me to my mom. She’s from a wealthy family, and her goal was clear—to have more heirs to compete for the family business! She didn’t care about gender, only about their abilities. The fact that she had all boys was just my dad’s probability. It had nothing to do with her!\"","Xia Xuechun was speechless.","Qiao Chuchu rolled her eyes in disdain. \"How dare you even mention my mom?\"","Pei Che smirked and walked over to Qiao Chuchu.","Pei Yuan also approached her.","Qiao Chuchu was so caught up in her frustration that she didn’t even notice Pei Yuan and Pei Che sitting down on either side of her."]},{"number":88,"title":"Chapter 88: Qiao Chuchu, No Wonder You're So Arrogant, Turns Out You Have Seven Husbands","paragraphs":["Zhang Old Lady held Xia Xuechun’s arm and gestured for her to sit down, patting her hand affectionately. “Don’t mind this person. You’re the perfect daughter-in-law in my eyes. I think a girl should be like you—someone who can cook and take care of others. That’s what makes a woman independent and dignified.”","The old lady smiled gently, her gaze subtly shifting toward Qiao Chuchu. “Not like some people who’ve never cooked a meal in their life, spoiled and pampered. How can they grow and mature in society like that?”","Qiao Chuchu sneered. “I don’t think a woman’s independence should be defined by one thing. Cooking is one form of independence, but it’s certainly not the only one. For example, earning money to hire a maid is independence, and throwing slippers at a sassy old lady is also independence.”","Zhang Old Lady choked on her anger, glaring at Pei Yuan and Pei Che. “Oh, so you’re independent? Then which one of these two is the husband you’re going to have a vasectomy for?”","Pei Yuan: “?”","Pei Che: “?”","Qiao Chuchu: “?”","She only then noticed that Pei Che was sitting to her left and Pei Yuan to her right.","【When did they get here?】","Xia Xuechun was also stunned and quickly tried to explain. “Zhang Old Lady, they’re not—”","Pei Yuan: “I am.”","Pei Che: “I am.”","Qiao Chuchu: “?”","Xia Xuechun: “?”","Zhang Old Lady: “?”","Pei Yuan and Pei Che glanced at each other and pointed at one another—","“He’s not. Only I am.”","“He’s not. Only I am.”","Qiao Chuchu: “?”","Xia Xuechun: “?”","Zhang Old Lady: “Which one of you is it?”","Pei Yuan and Pei Che’s expressions darkened, both visibly annoyed as they averted their gazes and spoke in unison again: “We both are.”","Qiao Chuchu froze.","Xia Xuechun also froze.","Zhang Old Lady’s face turned pale, her bewildered eyes darting between the three of them. “What—what kind of nonsense is this? Do your parents even approve of this?”","Pei Che replied stiffly, “They’re deceased.”","Zhang Old Lady turned to Pei Yuan. “And you?”","Pei Yuan replied impassively, “We’re brothers.”","Zhang Old Lady: “Brothers from the same family?!”","She stared at Qiao Chuchu in shock. “How did you manage this?!”","“Don’t ask my wife,” Pei Che said, crossing his legs lazily. “Since you’re clearly from a wealthy background, you should understand that in our social circle, as long as both parties are willing, a man can have many women, and likewise, a woman can have many men.”","Qiao Chuchu felt like she’d been struck by lightning. “A woman can, but I didn’t know I could.”","“I said you can, so you can,” Pei Che said, his gloomy gaze fixed on her. “Have some backbone, okay, darling?”","Pei Yuan didn’t say a word, simply draping his arm over the back of Qiao Chuchu’s chair, calmly watching the old lady.","Qiao Chuchu: “!!!!”","【Even though this is just boasting in front of outsiders, I feel like I’m suffocating.】","She couldn’t take it anymore and whispered, “What are you two doing?”","Pei Yuan’s expression remained unreadable as he whispered back, “Playing the role of your vasectomized husband.”","Pei Che stayed silent, implicitly agreeing.","Qiao Chuchu: “?????”","【This is not something to joke about! Xia Xuechun is right here!】","Xia Xuechun’s face turned green!","So this was the relationship between Pei Yuan, Pei Che, and Qiao Chuchu?!","To avoid bringing sinful children into the world, they were willing to get vasectomies?","No wonder none of the seven Pei brothers had partners and treated Qiao Chuchu so strangely!","Xia Xuechun’s brain short-circuited, her eyes wide with shock as she covered her mouth, unable to speak.","Qiao Chuchu, sweating profusely, grabbed both men’s heads and pulled them together. “With what you two just said, Xia Xuechun is going to think there’s something wrong with the three of us. Look, she’s completely frozen!”","Pei Yuan glanced indifferently at Xia Xuechun. “Why don’t you get along with this old lady?”","Qiao Chuchu cleared her throat and naturally leaned closer to his ear. “She used to be my upstairs neighbor.”","Pei Yuan’s breath hitched as he felt her body close to his, her warm breath brushing against his ear.","His body tensed involuntarily, his pale hand gripping his hospital gown, his Adam’s apple bobbing unnaturally.","Pei Che, noticing this, narrowed his eyes and pulled Qiao Chuchu back.","“Then why don’t you two get along?”","Qiao Chuchu leaned into his ear. “Her grandson would run around upstairs all day, and it was so noisy it affected my work. I politely approached them several times, but they didn’t listen. Then this old lady scolded me, calling me picky and accusing me of making false accusations.”","Thinking about it, Qiao Chuchu’s mood soured. “So I hired five shirtless, tattooed guys to pretend to be my brothers. They stood at the old lady’s door, eating hot pot and sleeping on the floor. After that, she behaved.”","Pei Che: “...”","Shirtless, tattooed guys pretending to be her brothers?","He found it increasingly bizarre. “Why didn’t you ask us? Aren’t we your brothers?”","Qiao Chuchu shrugged. “Our relationship wasn’t at the point where you’d help me with my problems. Besides, you’re all just good-looking. How could you compare to the intimidation factor of tattooed guys?”","【Plus, after how I’ve treated you, I couldn’t just come running to you when I needed help. I solve my own problems and clean up my own messes.】","Pei Che’s brows furrowed almost into a knot, murmuring very softly, “In your heart, am I still your brother?”","Qiao Chuchu didn’t hear him and leaned closer to his ear. “So I’ll win this argument myself. You and Pei Yuan don’t need to get involved, okay?”","Her voice was soft, like rippling water drifting into Pei Che’s ear, swaying gently until it reached his heart, making it tremble.","Pei Che blinked in confusion, his body stiffening under his white coat, his breathing growing uneven.","By the time Qiao Chuchu moved away, his expression had returned to normal, but his ears were still as red as tomatoes.","Xia Xuechun, sharp-eyed, asked, “Qiao Chuchu, did you bring chicken soup too? Did you make it yourself?”","Zhang Old Lady sneered. “Didn’t you hear? She’s too delicate to do anything herself. This chicken soup definitely has nothing to do with her.”","Qiao Chuchu crossed her legs, her posture now relaxed. “I killed the chicken.”","Zhang Old Lady: “?”","Xia Xuechun: “?”","Qiao Chuchu glanced at her pink manicured nails and calmly explained, “First, I drained its blood, then plucked its feathers, gutted it, and turned it from a fully intact bird into an empty shell.”","Zhang Old Lady: “...”","Xia Xuechun: “...”","Pei Yuan, holding the chicken soup, said, “So you’re the one who killed the chicken.”","Qiao Chuchu: “?”","Pei Yuan took a careful sip. “Mmm, it’s very fresh.”","Pei Che reached out. “Let me taste it.”","Pei Yuan handed him a bottle cap.","Pei Che took a sip and nodded. “It is fresh. Qiao Chuchu’s chicken-killing skills are as good as ever.”","Qiao Chuchu: “...”","They actually believed her!","A familiar male voice interrupted. “What are you three doing here?”","The trio turned to look.","Pei Buxian, with his platinum blonde hair, walked over holding a laptop, glaring at Qiao Chuchu. “Why didn’t you tell me you were back? I was just at home writing.”","Zhang Old Lady’s jaw dropped, struggling to process it all. She stared at Qiao Chuchu in disbelief. “You have even more?!”","Qiao Chuchu’s lips twitched.","Pei Buxian frowned. “What do you mean, more?”","Zhang Old Lady pointed a trembling finger at Pei Yuan. “He’s the eldest.”","Then at Pei Che. “He’s the second.”","Finally, at Pei Buxian. “Which one are you?”","Pei Buxian frowned. “I’m the seventh.”","“?!” Zhang Old Lady’s blood pressure skyrocketed. “Qiao Chuchu, no wonder you’re so impressive—you have seven of them!”","Pei Buxian: “?”","Pei Che: “...”","Pei Yuan: “...”","Qiao Chuchu: “...”"]},{"number":89,"title":"Chapter 89: If She Wants to Live Such a Life, Unless Qiao Chuchu Dies","paragraphs":["In the deathly silence, Zhang Old Lady's gaze at Qiao Chuchu was laden with a multitude of deep emotions.","Several times she seemed on the verge of speaking but held back, only to nearly speak again.","Her expression was a tangled mix of admiration and disdain, making it all appear incredibly complex.","Qiao Chuchu, her face ashen, thought to herself: *[...I should leave as soon as possible. I can’t stand this world for another moment.]*","She steeled herself and stood up: \"Let’s go. I’m tired of sitting here. Time to rest.\"","Pei Yuan and Pei Che rose together, flanking Qiao Chuchu on either side.","Pei Buxian trailed behind, clutching his laptop like an attendant.","Zhang Old Lady waited until Qiao Chuchu was out of sight before speaking: \"That girl, with seven men around her, two hands aren’t enough to hold them all. She’d need at least seven hands to manage.\"","\"What are you talking about?\" Xia Xuechun glared at Qiao Chuchu’s retreating figure. \"Those are her seven brothers.\"","Zhang Old Lady was thunderstruck: \"What?! Then why did they say they were her seven husbands?\"","Xia Xuechun’s face darkened. \"They were just messing with you, talking nonsense. How could seven men willingly be with one woman? Qiao Chuchu isn’t some celestial beauty.\"","Zhang Old Lady slowly caught on and scoffed: \"Hah, these young people nowadays...\"","Whatever else Zhang Old Lady said, Xia Xuechun didn’t hear.","Her eyes were fixed on Qiao Chuchu and the three men walking with her.","Pei Yuan, dressed in a light blue hospital gown, stood to Qiao Chuchu’s left, while Pei Che, in a white lab coat, stood to her right. They strolled leisurely, sandwiching the petite Qiao Chuchu between them.","They looked like two handsome bodyguards protecting their sister, drawing the gazes of passersby.","Pei Buxian quickened his pace and nudged Pei Che aside, insisting on standing next to Qiao Chuchu.","Pei Che shot his brother a cold glance before letting his gaze linger on Qiao Chuchu for a moment longer.","The scene was warm and harmonious.","Especially when Xia Xuechun knew that this large hospital belonged to the Pei family, and that Qiao Chuchu’s monthly income easily exceeded 200,000 yuan. The image of the three of them, untouched by the struggles of daily life, worrying only about their emotions, was almost enviable.","A wave of bitterness rose in Xia Xuechun’s heart, and she muttered gloomily: \"Grandma Zhang, I’m going to get back to work.\"","Zhang Old Lady was puzzled: \"Why do you suddenly look so upset? Did Qiao Chuchu do something to offend you?\"","\"No,\" Xia Xuechun rubbed the sweat from her palms and whispered to herself: \"I’m just feeling a bit sad.\"","After Jiahao’s death, she had a vivid dream.","In it, Qiao Chuchu had died, and she stood by the side of the Pei brothers, comforting their shattered hearts. They cherished her like a precious treasure, just as they did Qiao Chuchu.","In the dream, Pei Buxian, the youngest of the Pei brothers, had choked up and said to her: \"You and my sister share the same unyielding spirit. Every time I see you, I’m reminded of her.\"","The dream felt so real.","When she woke up, it took her a while to recover. Thinking about the warmth of that dream, she couldn’t help but smile.","But those things could never happen.","Because Qiao Chuchu would never die.","Xia Xuechun stared at Qiao Chuchu’s back, heartbroken as she repeated the thought to herself.","If she wanted to live that kind of life...","Qiao Chuchu would have to die.","-","Qiao Chuchu had to exert a great deal of effort to extricate herself from her three brothers.","To escape, she used every trick in the book, talking nonstop until her lips felt raw—","Finally, Pei Yuan’s IV drip was due.","Pei Che had subordinates reporting to him.","Pei Buxian suddenly had a burst of inspiration and stayed in Pei Yuan’s hospital room to write.","Although the reasons they let her go had nothing to do with her, she was still relieved.","Because Xia Xuechun’s main storyline hadn’t yet begun.","Qiao Chuchu hurried to the location where Xia Xuechun’s story was set to unfold.","Pei Buxian, sneaking around, followed behind her with his phone.","He had long sensed that Qiao Chuchu was up to something, so he made up the excuse of needing inspiration to give her the freedom to act.","Pei Buxian typed in the group chat: *«@Pei Yuan @Pei Che I’m tailing Qiao Chuchu right now.»*","Lin Qing: *«? Is there more drama?»*","Lin Shen: *«Is Qiao Chuchu back? Why didn’t anyone tell me?»*","Pei Fengnong: *«Let’s just start a video call so everyone can hear her thoughts.»*","Without hesitation, Pei Buxian initiated a group video call, put on his headphones, and acted like a spy.","Those who were free quickly joined in.","Lin Qing’s strikingly beautiful face appeared first on the screen: \"Can Qiao Chuchu’s thoughts really be transmitted through video? If not, I’m leaving.\"","Lin Shen frowned.","Pei Yuan, leaning against the bedside table, stared coldly at the screen.","Pei Buxian aimed the camera at Qiao Chuchu: \"We’ll find out in a moment.\"","Unaware, Qiao Chuchu walked on, calculating in her mind—","*[In the original storyline, because Xia Xuechun was a temporary housekeeper for our family, she had already met my seven brothers. She took a few days off to substitute for her mother at work, and while my brothers were reserved in their feelings for her, they were smitten at first sight. However, they didn’t show it openly, so each of their individual mini-stories with Xia Xuechun became the way they deepened their bonds.]*","*[At this point, Xia Xuechun should have already had some emotional exchanges with my eldest brother, Pei Yuan, marking the end of his mini-story.]*","Lin Qing was stunned: \"Wow, her thoughts are crystal clear in my head. This is so bizarre. You all heard it too, right?\"","Everyone in the video nodded.","Lin Qing couldn’t help but laugh: \"Brother Pei Yuan, in the original timeline, you’d already had some emotional exchanges with Xia Xuechun by now. How does it feel hearing this news?\"","Pei Yuan shot her a look: \"It feels disgusting.\"","Lin Qing burst into laughter.","Qiao Chuchu, still walking ahead, continued to ponder: *[After interacting with Xia Xuechun at the hospital, Pei Yuan gradually developed more feelings for her and received several handmade crafts from her.]*","*[Since Pei Yuan hasn’t received any handmade crafts, his affection for Xia Xuechun probably hasn’t reached the required level. It seems the mini-story hasn’t started yet, so it’s safe for now.]*","*[But things must progress. Next up should be Pei Che’s mini-story.]*","Lin Shen asked curiously: \"Why hasn’t Pei Che joined the video call?\"","Pei Buxian explained: \"Second Brother is busy with work. He went to sign some documents and couldn’t join. He’ll probably be here soon.\"","Still oblivious, Qiao Chuchu continued to think: *[Since Xia Xuechun is a cleaner, her encounter with Pei Che happened while she was cleaning the stairs. She got into an argument with another cleaner and accidentally fell down the stairs.]*","*[The argument happened near Pei Che’s office, so when he heard the commotion, he stepped in to help Xia Xuechun. He brought her back to his office, knelt down to tend to her sprained ankle, and left the door open. When Pei Yuan arrived and saw this, the two men began competing for her attention.]*","Lin Qing, struggling to hold back her laughter, looked at Pei Yuan: \"Brother Pei Yuan, you’re quite something. You seem so gentle, but secretly you’re quite jealous. Seeing Pei Che kneel down to tend to Xia Xuechun’s ankle made you unhappy, didn’t it?\"","Pei Yuan: \"...\"","Pei Fengnong smirked, lounging in his office chair: \"Big Brother really is quite jealous.\"","Pei Yuan: \"...\"","Lin Shen disagreed: \"I think all seven of you brothers are jealous. I remember when Qiao Chuchu was in kindergarten and a little boy kissed her. She came home and told you all about it, and you were so mad you couldn’t sleep that night. The next day, you scared the poor kid into tears.\"","Pei Fengnong: \"...\"","Pei Yuan: \"...\"","Pei Buxian: \"...\"","Lin Qing: \"Brother, if you don’t have the tact to keep some things to yourself, you might get kicked out of the group. I suggest you shut up.\"","Lin Shen: \"?\""]},{"number":90,"title":"Chapter 90: Xia Xuechun: You're Just Bullying Me","paragraphs":["Pei Buxian unhappily shifted his gaze and suddenly realized Qiao Chuchu was gone: \"Huh? Where’s Qiao Chuchu?!\"","Qiao Chuchu had already arrived at the HR department and knocked on the manager’s door.","The manager looked puzzled: \"Can I help you?\"","Qiao Chuchu spoke confidently: \"I’d like to work as a temporary cleaner for a few hours.\"","The manager: \"?\"","The manager stared at her, confused: \"We’re not short on cleaners, let alone temporary ones.\"","\"I know,\" Qiao Chuchu stepped closer. \"There’s something I need to do.\"","\"Then I definitely can’t agree to that,\" the manager said, baffled. \"Who are you anyway, just showing up and asking to be a cleaner?\"","Qiao Chuchu pulled out a prepared red envelope of cash from her pocket: \"I’m Pei Che’s eighth sister, the chairman. You can call me Miss Pei.\"","She then took out a photo, placed it on top of the envelope, and slid it toward the manager: \"I just need to borrow the temporary cleaner identity.\"","The manager was stunned, first looking at the money.","One thousand yuan!","Then she glanced at the photo.","It was a family portrait from seven years ago.","Qiao Chuchu, dressed in a cheongsam, sat properly in the center, with Pei Che on her left and Pei Yuan on her right. Several brothers stood behind them.","It was clear that Qiao Chuchu was the center of the photo, and while her appearance had matured, she was unmistakably the same person.","Ten minutes later, Qiao Chuchu got her wish, dressed in a cleaner’s uniform, holding a mop at the stairwell.","Lin Qing: \"...\"","Lin Shen: \"...\"","Pei Fengnong: \"...\"","Pei Yuan: \"...\"","Pei Buxian: \"...\"","Qiao Chuchu tied up her hair and put on a mask she had prepared earlier.","[To understand how things happened, I needed to immerse myself in this environment. If Xia Xuechun was really being bullied, the employee who bullied her had to be removed first, so she couldn’t bully others.]","[The bully couldn’t stay, and the romantic subplot between Xia Xuechun and Pei Che couldn’t start either.]","In the video call, Lin Qing expressed doubt: \"The plan sounds good, but can Qiao Chuchu actually do the work?\"","Qiao Chuchu picked up the mop and started cleaning diligently.","This was the staff passageway, with both an elevator and stairs. She and Xia Xuechun were assigned to clean the stairs.","A cleaner passing by complimented her: \"Are you new? You’re doing a great job.\"","Qiao Chuchu used a scraper to remove stubborn stains from the floor and smiled: \"I’ve done this kind of work before, so it’s easier for me.\"","[In my past life, I was somewhat of a \"jack-of-all-trades\"—delivery person, temporary cleaner, cashier, waiter. I’ve done it all, so making the floor shine is no problem!]","Everyone in the video call was momentarily stunned, and a heavy silence fell over them.","Qiao Chuchu worked quietly until she heard a suppressed scolding from upstairs: \"You’ve made the stairs like this—how are people supposed to walk down?!\"","[Here comes the plot!]","She hurried upstairs and peeked around the corner.","Xia Xuechun and the cleaner lady were arguing.","A large puddle of water covered the marble stairs, dripping down to where Qiao Chuchu stood.","The cleaner lady pointed at the water angrily: \"Many employees take the stairs to save time. If someone slips because of this, what then?!\"","Xia Xuechun, standing below the cleaner, retorted stubbornly: \"Adults don’t just slip! Besides, I’m here to warn them. I like wetting the stairs before mopping.\"","The lady was furious: \"That’s not how we do it here! You’re supposed to clean one step at a time. If the boss sees this, I’ll be blamed for not instructing you properly. I’m the supervisor here, and I’m responsible for this area. Understand?!\"","Xia Xuechun sneered: \"So you’re just throwing your weight around because I’m new, huh?\"","The lady widened her eyes in disbelief: \"How can you be so unreasonable? You’re doing the job wrong, and as your supervisor, I can’t even point it out?\"","Xia Xuechun scoffed: \"Instead of wasting time blaming me, why not let me finish? Once I’m done, it won’t be wet anymore. If someone slips, it’ll be your fault for delaying me.\"","The lady’s face turned red with anger: \"I only told you not to do it this way because it’s dangerous, but you insisted on talking back, saying you’ll do it however you want. That’s why I’m scolding you!\"","Xia Xuechun dismissed her: \"Why should I listen to you? We’re all human beings, and we’re equal. I don’t have to follow your orders!\"","The lady shook her head in frustration: \"I’m done talking to you!\"","As she turned to go upstairs, her foot slipped, and she leaned back: \"Ah!!\"","Xia Xuechun was also bumped and lost her footing, tumbling down the stairs: \"Ahhh!!!\"","Qiao Chuchu reacted quickly, catching Xia Xuechun in her arms!","Xia Xuechun screamed as she fell into Qiao Chuchu’s embrace!","The cleaner lady, gripping the railing, looked back at them in panic: \"Are you two okay?!\"","Qiao Chuchu was drenched in cold sweat, holding Xia Xuechun tightly: \"Are you hurt?\"","Xia Xuechun’s face was pale as she slowly stood up: \"N-no, I’m fine...\"","Qiao Chuchu sighed in relief: [I thought the lady was bullying Xia Xuechun, but it turns out Xia Xuechun was causing trouble again. But since I prevented her from getting hurt, does that mean this chapter’s conflict is over?]","She relaxed: \"You’re both fine, so I’ll head out now.\"","Xia Xuechun turned to her: \"Wait, thank you—Qiao Chuchu?!\"","Xia Xuechun’s voice rose sharply as she realized the person who saved her was Qiao Chuchu.","Pei Buxian and the others immediately became alert.","Qiao Chuchu turned her head, puzzled: \"What?\"","Xia Xuechun looked her up and down, nodding in realization: \"No wonder that old lady was bullying me—you two were in on it together!\"","The cleaner lady: \"?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"? What are you talking about? You made a mistake, and now you’re trying to blame me?\"","Xia Xuechun laughed loudly, unapologetic: \"I made a mistake? Mopping the stairs and wetting them is a mistake? You’re just nitpicking!\"","Qiao Chuchu shot back: \"Did you think I’m deaf? The lady wasn’t blaming you; she was just reminding you not to do it that way next time. But you argued back, and that’s why she got upset. If you hadn’t talked back, none of this would’ve happened.\"","\"Oh, really?\" Xia Xuechun pouted. \"So you’re saying I should just take it quietly?\"","The cleaner lady was so angry she could barely breathe: \"How can you be so unreasonable? I’m your supervisor, and I’m just giving you a heads-up. Is that too much to ask?\"","\"You think I’m stupid? That’s not a heads-up!\" Xia Xuechun glared at Qiao Chuchu. \"You’re doing this on purpose. You ordered the cleaner to bully me! You’ve bullied me at home, and now you’re doing it here too!\""]},{"number":91,"title":"Chapter 91: Qiao Chuchu held Pei Che's hand: Brother, you're hurt.","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu’s temper flared up instantly. \"If I wanted to bully you, I would’ve let you fall. Why would I help you?!\"","Xia Xuechun refused to back down. \"You’re so strong, who knows if you were trying to push me down the stairs! You’re definitely up to no good!\"","She shoved Qiao Chuchu hard!","Qiao Chuchu stumbled two steps back, rolling up her sleeves in anger. \"You’re pushing me, huh? Then I’ll gouge your eyes out!!\"","She directly poked Xia Xuechun’s eyes with her hand!","Xia Xuechun covered her eyes. \"Ah! You actually gouged my eyes! Then I’ll pull your hair!\"","Qiao Chuchu’s head tilted from the tug, her anger skyrocketing. \"I just had my hair treated!!!\"","She pounced on Xia Xuechun like a hungry tiger!","Screams echoed through the staircase!","The Cleaning Auntie was beside herself with worry. \"Stop fighting, stop fighting! It’s the New Year, please don’t fight!!\"","Pei Buxian quickly ran up the stairs. \"Let my sister go—\"","His feet slipped on the wet floor, and he tumbled down the stairs, his phone flying out of his hand!","Pei Buxian was shocked. \"My phone!\"","Qiao Chuchu sensed something flying toward her from the shadows and instinctively caught it, placing the phone against the wall before continuing to pin Xia Xuechun down and beat her!!","Lin Qing, watching up close: \"...\"","Lin Shen: \"...\"","Pei Fengnong: \"...\"","Pei Yuan: \"...\"","Pei Buxian, sprawled on the stairs like a frog, looked at Qiao Chuchu with admiration. \"Such precise moves, it’s like Qiao Chu from my novel has come to life...\"","The Manager arrived at the scene, standing at the staircase entrance, nearly jumping in fright. \"Oh my! How did this fight start?! Miss Pei!!\"","The Manager started descending the stairs but suddenly slipped, sliding down step by step. \"Ah!\"","She bumped down to the last step and stopped, her face turning pale.","\"Who the hell spilled water on the stairs?!!!!\"","Pei Che walked out of his office, puzzled by the commotion in the stairwell.","Qiao Chuchu and Xia Xuechun were rolling around, pulling hair and gouging eyes, screeching wildly!","Pei Che took a closer look. \"Chuchu?\"","He ran down the stairs!","The Manager and Cleaning Auntie shouted in panic. \"Chairman, don’t come down!!!\"","Pei Che’s feet slipped, and he flew forward!","The Manager let out a sharp scream. \"Chairman!!!\"","Qiao Chuchu looked up and saw Pei Che hurtling toward her like a rocket!","She instinctively reached out to catch him!","Pei Che landed with a crash, wrapping his arms around Qiao Chuchu and protecting the back of her head.","Qiao Chuchu was slammed against the wall, trapped in Pei Che’s embrace.","Her cheek felt a heavy pressure!","The scene fell into complete silence.","Pei Buxian’s eyes widened in shock.","The Manager and Cleaning Auntie cowered in the corner.","Xia Xuechun staggered to her feet, staring at the two pressed against the wall.","Pei Che had one hand protecting Qiao Chuchu’s head and the other braced against the wall, his eyes wide with shock.","His lips... had accidentally kissed Qiao Chuchu’s cheek!","Qiao Chuchu’s face was squished, showing just how forceful the kiss was.","Pei Che stiffly pulled back, a trace of blood at the corner of his mouth.","He had bitten his lip.","Pei Che nervously licked his lips.","Qiao Chuchu rubbed her cheek, wincing. \"Brother, your lips are so hard, I thought you punched me!\"","Pei Che’s face turned red. \"What... what’s going on here? And what are you wearing?\"","Qiao Chuchu looked down at the cleaning uniform she was wearing, feeling a bit frustrated.","[It’s all to blend into Xia Xuechun’s workplace, investigate the situation, help you avoid falling for her, and see if there’s a harsh supervisor bullying colleagues. I didn’t expect things to turn out like this.]","Pei Che was stunned.","She did all this... for his sake?","Xia Xuechun, furious, pointed at Qiao Chuchu. \"Qiao Chuchu, I’m warning you, don’t think just because your brother is here, you can play the victim. Let me make it clear, this is your fault. You wanted to bully me! You’re trying to throw your weight around!\"","Qiao Chuchu glared at Xia Xuechun, both angry and hurt.","[I’m throwing my weight around? I was trying to understand her life, see if there was someone bullying her. If it was true, I wouldn’t let my brother keep them around. But the Cleaning Auntie isn’t the bully, and Xia Xuechun is slandering me like this!]","\"Fine!\" Qiao Chuchu sat cross-legged on the floor. \"You say I’m throwing my weight around? Then I’ll show you what that looks like!\"","She grabbed Pei Che’s arm!","Pei Che: \"?!\"","Pei Buxian: \"?\"","Everyone in the video: \"?\"","Qiao Chuchu raised her chin defiantly. \"Brother, fire Xia Xuechun and her mother!\"","Xia Xuechun’s face changed. \"What does my mother have to do with this?\"","Qiao Chuchu shot back. \"Your mother didn’t come to work, but you did. Your incompetence caused so many people to get hurt. That’s why it’s related!\"","She clung to Pei Che’s arm. \"Brother, fire her!\"","Pei Che looked at her hand wrapped around his arm, his expression full of shock and discomfort.","Qiao Chuchu pouted, urging him. \"Hurry up!~\"","Pei Che snapped out of it, the tips of his ears turning pink, nodding repeatedly. \"Okay, I’ll fire them. I’ll fire them all.\"","Xia Xuechun was stunned. \"Chairman, are you really going to indulge your sister like this?!\"","\"Should I indulge you instead?\" Pei Che glared at her. \"You caused everyone here to slip. I haven’t even held you accountable yet.\"","He gave the Manager a look.","The Manager immediately understood. \"Alright, Xia Xuechun, you and your mother don’t need to come back. Tell your mother to find another job.\"","Xia Xuechun was thunderstruck. \"You can fire me, but you can’t fire my mother! She loves this job. This is too cruel!\"","She glared at Qiao Chuchu.","Qiao Chuchu smiled insincerely. \"If you apologize to everyone, I can let your mother come back.\"","Xia Xuechun’s face darkened. \"I won’t apologize to you!\"","Qiao Chuchu didn’t back down. \"Suit yourself.\"","[After all, Xia Xuechun’s mother is just like her, supporting her daughter’s affair and even giving her tips to chase after someone else’s man, bullying Lin Qing and causing her to lose a tooth. She’s no good either.]","Lin Qing in the video: \"...\"","She lost a tooth because of Xia Xuechun’s mother?!!","How infuriating!","Qiao Chuchu got up from the floor.","Pei Che also stood up, wincing in pain. \"Ouch!\"","He had sprained his wrist.","Qiao Chuchu was concerned. \"You’re hurt?\"","She gently held Pei Che’s hand, looking up at him. \"Your lip is bleeding too. Let’s go back to your office, and I’ll take care of it.\"","Pei Che was momentarily stunned, his deep eyes swirling with unreadable emotions, and nodded.","Qiao Chuchu carefully supported him. \"Be careful.\"","Pei Buxian, still sprawled on the stairs, suddenly realized what was happening and grabbed his phone to follow them.","Pei Che and Qiao Chuchu entered the office.","Qiao Chuchu went in first, and Pei Che closed the door, just as Pei Buxian arrived.","Pei Buxian raised his hand. \"Wait—\"","Pei Che’s gaze darkened, and he shut the door firmly.","\"Click.\"","The door was locked.","He turned to Qiao Chuchu, his deep eyes like a stormy sea at midnight. \"Let’s begin.\""]},{"number":92,"title":"Chapter 92: You Were Once My Best Second Brother, I Know It, and You Know It Too.","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu and Pei Che sat facing each other.","She carefully examined Pei Che’s wrist, gently pressing the bones: “It’s fine, nothing’s out of place. It’s probably just a sprain.”","Pei Che felt a sharp, needle-like pain in his wrist, his brow furrowing slightly: “You know quite a bit about this?”","Qiao Chuchu didn’t look up: “Yes, I’ve studied it.”","[In my past life, I tried many industries that suited me to earn more money, hoping to find something that would bring in quick cash. I had planned to save up a hundred thousand to buy a tablet and a computer for drawing. Unfortunately, just as I reached that amount, I died before I could make the purchase. I ended up transmigrating into this world, and even my hundred thousand savings were swallowed by the system.]","Pei Che’s expression tightened.","It seemed she had lived a hard life in her past life.","Qiao Chuchu looked up at Pei Che: “Do you have any bruise ointment or something? I can massage it for you.”","Pei Che’s gaze deepened: “In the first drawer.”","Qiao Chuchu walked over and started rummaging through the drawer. Inside, she found a bottle of used bruise ointment and a photo frame.","It was a selfie of her with Pei Che.","In the photo, she stood in the front, holding a bag, her arm around Pei Che’s shoulder, smiling brightly.","Pei Che leaned naturally against her cheek, relaxed, with a slight smile on his lips as he faced the camera.","Just one glance, and the warmth of the past came flooding back.","A hand suddenly appeared in front of her, flipping the photo frame face down!","Qiao Chuchu looked up in surprise, meeting Pei Che’s cold eyes: “Haven’t found it yet?”","Flustered, she picked up the bruise ointment: “Ah, no, I found it.”","Pei Che stood beside her, coldly closing the drawer.","Qiao Chuchu quickly retreated to the sofa.","Pei Che lazily sat down across from her, extending his hand toward her.","Pei Che’s hand was beautiful.","Although all seven Pei brothers had long, slender fingers, Pei Che’s hands were the most exquisite—not just in shape, but in color as well.","His knuckles were tinged with a soft pink, like a work of art meticulously crafted by a painter.","Qiao Chuchu couldn’t help but think: [Looking at Pei Che’s hand, I suddenly understand hand fetishes. Such a beautiful hand—I really want to hold it and play with it.]","Pei Che’s eyes darkened, and he shifted into a more comfortable position, looking down at Qiao Chuchu as she cradled his hand.","Qiao Chuchu was earnestly massaging his wrist.","It hurt.","But it felt good.","He leaned back on the sofa, his long fingers subtly curling, brushing against Qiao Chuchu’s fingers.","Qiao Chuchu’s hands were also beautiful.","Delicate and slender, though not particularly small, they were easily enveloped by his.","Her pale fingers kneaded his wrist repeatedly.","The more Pei Che watched, the more restless he became. His throat moved unnaturally, his gaze deepening as it lingered on Qiao Chuchu’s face.","Qiao Chuchu gently massaged the injured area: “Does it hurt?”","Pei Che lightly pressed his lips together, tasting a faint metallic tang.","His breathing began to quicken: “Does your face still hurt?”","Qiao Chuchu was startled. Just as she was about to look up, Pei Che suddenly cupped her face.","He leaned in, his body almost fully extending toward her, his fingers lightly touching the red mark on her cheek.","“Here, does it hurt?”","Qiao Chuchu felt a bit uncomfortable and shrugged slightly.","Pei Che’s breath was now on her face.","She awkwardly turned away: “It doesn’t hurt, it’s fine.”","Pei Che licked his lips, his voice low as it resonated in her ear: “I didn’t mean to kiss you.”","Qiao Chuchu shrank back, avoiding his breath: “I know, it’s nothing. I don’t mind. Besides, it was just my cheek, not my lips. You just bumped into me.”","Pei Che, hearing this, slowly withdrew, sitting back in front of Qiao Chuchu.","Qiao Chuchu felt a bit at a loss.","Originally, there had been a considerable distance between their faces, but now Pei Che was directly in front of her, their eyes locked. If Pei Che leaned in just a little, their lips would meet.","His gaze was like an unfathomable ocean, capable of drowning anyone who looked too deeply.","Feeling the pressure, she quickly searched for a topic: “Why are you wearing a white coat?”","Pei Che’s tone was indifferent: “Although I can’t perform surgeries, I can still handle outpatient consultations. It just so happens that I had a morning shift today.”","She nodded, a bit intrigued: “I think this is the first time I’ve seen you in this outfit. It suits you.”","Pei Che glanced down at himself: “Do you like me in this kind of attire?”","Qiao Chuchu shook her head: “Not exactly. It’s just that when you’re in your workplace, wearing your work clothes, it gives off a different vibe. It’s like you’re in your element, radiating confidence.”","[Unlike when he takes off this coat and puts on a regular suit, where he looks all polished but gives off a sinister aura.]","Pei Che: “?”","As she continued massaging, Qiao Chuchu suddenly felt something unusual and turned Pei Che’s wrist over.","There were deep and shallow scars from self-harm.","Qiao Chuchu’s heart ached, her brows furrowing as she rubbed the scars: “Brother.”","Pei Che raised an eyebrow: “Hmm?”","She pressed both hands against his wounds, her voice filled with sorrow: “Brother, please don’t do this again. I can keep my distance from you, and I won’t bully you anymore. But please, don’t hurt yourself like this, okay?”","Pei Che frowned, catching onto one point: “You’re going to keep your distance from me?”","Qiao Chuchu nodded seriously: “Yes! You don’t like it when I cling to you, right? I won’t cling to you anymore, and I won’t hurt you in that way again.”","She held his hand tightly, her tone sincere: “I’m really scared that one day you’ll die. Seriously.”","Pei Che was stunned.","Qiao Chuchu lowered her head in guilt.","[If Pei Che ever commits suicide, and I can never see him again, I’ll be the one to blame. I—]","Suddenly, a shadow loomed over Qiao Chuchu.","Before she could react, Pei Che’s warm lips pressed against her forehead.","Qiao Chuchu, like a kitten suddenly being petted, shrank back, her eyes widening in shock.","Pei Che closed his eyes, placing a deep kiss on her forehead, like a devout worshipper. His relaxed posture conveyed an indescribable emotion.","Qiao Chuchu: “????????”","She looked up in confusion, meeting Pei Che’s gaze.","Pei Che looked down at her, his eyes heavy: “In the past, whenever you made requests, I always accepted them unconditionally. You don’t need to deliberately distance yourself from me.”","Qiao Chuchu was stunned, recalling the photo in the drawer.","Back then, she was only fifteen, still in the testing phase with her brothers, not pushing things too far, so their daily interactions were relatively harmonious.","The origin of that photo was her sneaking up behind Pei Che to scare him: “Boo!”","Pei Che jumped, grabbing her nose and pulling her toward him: “Trying to scare me, huh?”","She winced in pain, tumbling from the sofa onto his lap, quickly apologizing: “Second brother, I’m sorry, I’m sorry, I’m sorry!”","Pei Che let go immediately, and she sat next to him, grinning flatteringly: “Brother, I saw a really nice bag recently.”","Pei Che, as if he already knew, handed her a card.","She pushed it back with both hands: “No, no, it’s not about the money. It’s just really hard to get. There are only three in the world. I can give you the money, but can you help me get it?”","Pei Che raised an eyebrow, glancing at her sideways: “Why don’t you ask our eldest brother to help you?”","Qiao Chuchu grinned: “Because I know you have the connections, second brother. You can definitely get it!”","She clung to his arm: “Please, help me get it. Everyone at school is watching me. They’re laughing behind my back, saying that even though I’m Miss Eight, I can’t get that bag.”","Pei Che raised an eyebrow: “So you’re buying it out of vanity?”","Qiao Chuchu admitted openly: “Yes! I’m vain. If you get me that bag, I can’t even imagine how happy I’ll be!”","A day later, she found the limited-edition bag in a box on the coffee table.","Pei Che sat on the sofa, watching her with a smile.","She squealed like a kettle, holding the bag lovingly: “Ah! You actually got it for me!”","Pei Che’s tone was calm: “After you told me yesterday, I looked into it. I had to spend five million on other items to get it. It arrived this morning from overseas. The extra items are in your room. You can give them away if you want.”","Qiao Chuchu was overwhelmed, clutching the bag to her chest: “Second brother~”","She felt like crying: “You’re so good to me!~”","Pei Che smirked: “Aren’t you going to show some appreciation?”","She hopped over to Pei Che, kissed him on the cheek, and hugged him tightly: “Thank you, second brother!~”","Pei Che was momentarily stunned, then touched his cheek and couldn't help but laugh as he hugged her. \"You're this happy?\"","\"Mm!\" She sat down beside him. \"My sisters usually don't like me; they're always competing with me. They've been making snide remarks about this bag for days. I want them to know that I, Qiao Chuchu, can get it!\"","But she also felt a little guilty. \"Brother, isn't it bad that I'm so vain?\"","Pei Che's expression remained calm. \"It's perfectly normal to desire material things. As long as it's not illegal, I'll fulfill your wishes.\"","She pouted. \"What if you can't fulfill them?\"","Pei Che chuckled. \"If I can't, then it's my incompetence, not your fault.\"","Her heart melted, and she hugged him, cooing, \"Then I'll post on my Moments later, declaring to the world that I have the best second brother ever!~\"","Pei Che's lips curved into a smile as he asked with interest, \"Will it be visible to everyone? You won't hide it from your other brothers, will you?\"","She frowned. \"Of course, it'll be visible to everyone! We even need to take a photo together!~\"","Pei Che nodded in satisfaction. \"Good. After all, when it comes to giving you things, your second brother has a bit of vanity too.\"","She laughed, wrapping her arm around his shoulder. \"Alright, I'm going to show off to everyone in my Moments! I'll brag about my amazing second brother!\""]},{"number":93,"title":"Chapter 93: Where Did the Ring Come From","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu snapped out of her thoughts and looked at Pei Che sitting in front of her. His features hadn’t changed, but there was a certain distance between them now. She lowered her head in dejection.","[I’ve done so many terrible things. How can I expect you to unconditionally agree to all my requests now?]","[All I hope for now is to survive until the end of the story, and for all of you to avoid the tragic fate of death. That way, I can leave this place peacefully, go abroad, and never return, completely severing ties with all of you.]","Pei Che raised an eyebrow. “?”","Qiao Chuchu kept her head down, fidgeting with her hands, completely oblivious to Pei Che’s sharp gaze.","Pei Che narrowed his eyes dangerously. “Qiao Chuchu, have you ever thought about moving abroad? About starting a new life in a different environment?”","Qiao Chuchu was taken aback. “Huh? No, I haven’t.”","[How does he know I’ve been considering going abroad?!]","[As expected, Pei Che has always been sharp and perceptive. He can see through my every thought.]","Pei Che coldly averted his gaze and licked the scab on his lip. “Good. I suggest you don’t entertain that idea. Don’t force me to lock you up if it comes to that.”","Qiao Chuchu was stunned. “What?”","Pei Che calmly rotated his wrist, his presence like a storm cloud looming over her. “Even if you manage to go abroad, I’ll drag you back and lock you up at home. If you don’t want to lose your freedom, behave yourself. If you really want to travel abroad, just let us know. One of the seven of us will always find time to accompany you.”","Qiao Chuchu was confused. “Why are you saying this?”","Pei Che glanced down at her.","She sat upright on the sofa, a little indignant. “What you’re saying makes me feel uncomfortable.”","[Even though our relationship is like this, you still won’t let me go. It’s as if I’m not a person but a caged bird.]","Pei Che raised an eyebrow, leaning on the back of the sofa as he slowly bent down toward her.","Qiao Chuchu was forced to meet his gaze as he closed the distance between them.","Pei Che’s eyes were calm, devoid of any emotion. “What? Did I hit a nerve?”","His beautiful peach-blossom eyes held no warmth, resembling the abyss of the ocean—dark, terrifying, and filled with unknown dangers.","Qiao Chuchu gripped the edge of the sofa nervously. “I think, given our current relationship—”","“What relationship?” Pei Che asked expressionlessly.","Qiao Chuchu bit her lower lip, her back now pressed against the sofa.","Pei Che leaned closer, his tone icy. “I’m asking you, what is our relationship?”","She felt suffocated and weakly replied, “Brother and sister...”","“Then who raised you?” Pei Che pressed.","Qiao Chuchu pursed her lips. “You did.”","Pei Che sneered. “And who are we to you?”","She clutched the hem of her clothes. “My brothers.”","Pei Che seemed satisfied, his gaze falling on her teary eyes. His tone softened, almost coaxing. “Didn’t I tell you before that I don’t like it when you talk about leaving? I don’t care what you say in front of the others, but control yourself when you’re with me.”","Qiao Chuchu nodded lifelessly.","[Wait a minute, I never said I wanted to go abroad. He just guessed it.]","[How is he so sure I’m planning to leave?]","Qiao Chuchu looked at Pei Che, completely baffled.","Pei Che picked up his phone. “You’ve worked hard today. I’ll transfer you 100,000 yuan. Go buy something for yourself.”","She was startled and quickly dismissed her confusion. “No, it’s okay, Brother.”","Pei Che’s expression turned cold. “Take it.”","Qiao Chuchu hesitated. “Alright, I’ll take it.”","She obediently accepted the transfer and stood up. “I’ll be going now.”","But Pei Che grabbed her wrist. “Wait.”","Qiao Chuchu looked at him in surprise.","Pei Che took out a jewelry box from his pocket, revealing an exquisite square-cut pink diamond ring inside.","He slid it onto her middle finger, a faint smile on his lips. “As I thought, it suits you perfectly.”","Qiao Chuchu was flustered. “It’s so beautiful. It must be very expensive, right?”","Pei Che shrugged indifferently. “Over 100 million. I saw it while out with a friend. His girlfriend really wanted it, but I thought it would suit you better, so I bought it.”","Qiao Chuchu was stunned. “His girlfriend wanted it, but you bought it instead?”","Pei Che sat back in his office chair. “He wasn’t planning to buy it for her. He thought it was too expensive. Why shouldn’t I buy it?”","Qiao Chuchu walked over to him, still wearing the ring. “And you don’t think it’s expensive?”","Pei Che opened a file. “Not at all.”","Qiao Chuchu was speechless.","[Over 100 million, and he doesn’t think it’s expensive??????!]","“...” Pei Che rubbed his temples, as if her thoughts were giving him a headache. He glanced at her. “You can go now. I’ll have someone bring over half of the chicken soup you made for Pei Yuan later.”","Qiao Chuchu was still in a daze. “But I haven’t bought New Year’s gifts for you all yet. I can’t afford anything this expensive.”","[Unless I dip into the 3.5 billion they gave me.]","Pei Che paused, his tone nonchalant. “If you want to buy gifts, use the money you earned from your comic. I don’t care how much it costs.”","She was speechless and left, her mind still reeling.","But Pei Che called her back once more. “Chuchu.”","Qiao Chuchu turned around in surprise.","Behind the desk, Pei Che put on his gold-rimmed glasses, looking refined as he adjusted the frame. “You need to listen to me.”","His voice was gentle, almost coaxing.","“As long as you stay home, stop causing trouble, and don’t leave me, I’ll buy you anything you want.”","Qiao Chuchu’s heart skipped a beat. She didn’t respond, still in a daze as she walked out.","As soon as she stepped outside, she bumped into an angry Pei Buxian.","Pei Buxian was holding his laptop, his hair disheveled. His sharp gaze locked onto her face. “What were you two doing in there?”","Qiao Chuchu was startled. Before she could answer, Pei Buxian grabbed her hand. “He gave you a ring?”","Qiao Chuchu didn’t deny it. “Yes.”","Pei Buxian tightened his grip on her hand. “When I saw that ring, I specifically asked him if it was for you. He denied it and said he was buying it for someone else. And now it’s on your finger. How sneaky of him to lie to me!”","Qiao Chuchu was confused. “Why are you so angry?”","Pei Buxian didn’t answer. He let go of her hand. “Go. I need to talk to Pei Che.”","Qiao Chuchu was worried. “You’re not going to argue with him, are you?”","Pei Buxian brushed past her, fuming. “Do I look like I’m here to argue?”","He stormed into Pei Che’s office, slamming the door shut. His voice roared from inside, “Pei Che, you’re too cunning!!!”","Qiao Chuchu sighed.","[I’d better go buy their gifts now.]","She returned to Pei Yuan’s hospital room and greeted him. “Brother, I’m heading home now.”","Pei Yuan was in the middle of a meeting while hooked up to an IV. He glanced at her lazily, but his eyes suddenly fixed on the ring on her middle finger.","He narrowed his eyes suspiciously and muted his microphone. “Where did you get that ring?”","Qiao Chuchu was baffled.","[Why does everyone notice the ring I’m wearing?]"]},{"number":94,"title":"Chapter 94: We've Changed, But Neither of Us Says It, Perhaps We Just Want to Muddle Through Life in a Daze","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu said, \"Second brother just gave it to me. He said it suits me.\"","Pei Yuan's face darkened. \"Did he mention how much it cost?\"","She scratched her head. \"Over a hundred million, I’m not sure of the exact amount.\"","Pei Yuan’s expression instantly fell.","Someone called out during the video conference, \"Mr. Pei? Mr. Pei?!\"","Pei Yuan, his face grim, noticed the entire meeting room waiting for him to speak. He took a deep breath and adjusted his tone, saying to Qiao Chuchu, \"Come over tonight. There’s a caretaker bed in my room; you can stay here.\"","Qiao Chuchu thought she misheard. \"I should stay with you?\"","Pei Yuan’s eyes darkened, and he coughed weakly. \"You used to stay with me when I was sick before. Don’t you want to this time?\"","He lowered his eyelashes, his tone tinged with loneliness. \"I’ve been staying alone all this time.\"","Qiao Chuchu suddenly felt guilty. \"Stop talking. I’ll stay with you.\"","She turned to leave. \"Finish your meeting first. I’ll come back afterward.\"","Pei Yuan’s gaze lingered on Qiao Chuchu’s retreating figure. He unmuted himself, his voice now cold and sharp. \"Continue.\"","With his other hand, he picked up his phone and sent a message to Pei Che: «I saw you making several calls the other day, asking someone to bring that ring from abroad. I thought you were giving it to someone special, but it turns out it was for Qiao Chuchu.»","Pei Che replied quickly: «Don’t be sarcastic. Pei Buxian is going crazy in front of me right now, almost smashing things.»","«Oh, really?» Pei Yuan sneered. «Then tell Pei Buxian to smash whatever he wants. I’ll cover the cost.»","Pei Che: «Since when did you become so jealous, big brother?»","Pei Yuan: «And since when did you start hiding things from me, second brother? We’ve never kept secrets when giving gifts to Qiao Chuchu before.»","Pei Che: «I wasn’t hiding. I gave it openly, so you all saw it, didn’t you?»","Pei Yuan: «?»","-","Qiao Chuchu finished calling her driver in the hallway and scratched her head.","She felt that since moving back, her relationship with her brothers had changed, becoming harder to understand.","She hoped she wasn’t just being overly sensitive.","Zhang Old Lady suddenly appeared out of nowhere, walking up to her. \"Qiao Chuchu, aren’t you ashamed of passing off your brother as your husband?\"","Qiao Chuchu was startled. \"Why are you here?\"","Zhang Old Lady sneered and pointed down the hallway. \"My room is right there.\"","Qiao Chuchu glanced at the room and wasn’t surprised.","Her apartment was in a mid-to-high-end complex, and Zhang Old Lady lived upstairs, so she was obviously well-off too.","However, the Zhang family had a terrible reputation.","Her eldest son was a CEO with multiple mistresses, some even bold enough to show up at their doorstep while pregnant.","The wife was so furious she demanded a divorce, and they had a loud argument downstairs, with her pulling her husband’s hair and yelling.","Zhang Old Lady defended her son, saying that since he was rich, he could do as he pleased.","Qiao Chuchu had no goodwill toward the old lady or her family, so she responded coldly, \"You’ve said your piece. Now you can leave.\"","But the old lady wasn’t ready to go. She snorted disdainfully. \"Pretending your brother is your husband, putting on an act in front of an old lady like me. Does your mother know you’re so shameless?\"","Qiao Chuchu’s face turned icy. \"Say one more word about my mother.\"","The old lady looked her up and down mockingly. \"I didn’t say anything about your mother. I’m saying you’re shameless, that you’re poorly raised, and that you dare to shout at your elders!\"","Qiao Chuchu opened her mouth to retort!","But Pei Yuan, who had quietly stepped out of his room, suddenly grabbed her hand.","She looked at him, confused. \"What?!\"","Pei Yuan calmly asked Zhang Old Lady, \"You look familiar. Are you the mother of Boss Zhang from Feiyang Group?\"","Zhang Old Lady puffed up with pride, a smug smile on her lips. \"You’ve got a sharp eye. Yes, Boss Zhang of Feiyang Group is my eldest son.\"","Qiao Chuchu was puzzled. \"What? Is her son a business partner of ours?\"","Pei Yuan smiled and held her hand. \"No, he’s not worthy.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","Zhang Old Lady: \"?\"","Pei Yuan looked at Zhang Old Lady. \"Your son was in front of me just the other day, passionately presenting his new plan for an hour, hoping I’d fund him.\"","\"I’ve looked into it. His company isn’t doing well, and he’s in desperate need of money to stay afloat.\"","Pei Yuan’s lips curled into a mocking smile. \"I was still considering it, but maybe I should give him my answer now.\"","Zhang Old Lady’s mouth twitched, and she rolled her eyes in disbelief. \"You’re lying. My son would never beg someone as young as you!\"","\"My surname is Pei,\" Pei Yuan said, his smile turning cold, an intimidating aura radiating from him. \"In Lan City’s elite circles, only my brothers and I bear the surname Pei. If you haven’t heard of me, perhaps it’s because you’re not at the right level.\"","Zhang Old Lady froze, her brow furrowing with growing unease.","But she still didn’t know who the Pei family was.","She still thought... there was some exaggeration here.","Pei Yuan continued leisurely, \"Your son is quite impressive. He drank himself to the point of stomach bleeding with my subordinates just to get a meeting with me and beg for investment. He even gifted me a collector’s-grade imperial jade. What a shame.\"","Zhang Old Lady choked. \"What do you mean?\"","Pei Yuan didn’t answer her. Instead, he pulled up a number on his phone. \"This is your son’s number, right?\"","Zhang Old Lady’s face paled, and she looked scared. \"What are you going to do?!\"","Pei Yuan smirked and dialed the number. \"Boss Zhang, this is Pei Yuan. I’ve reconsidered your proposal, and I don’t think it’s viable.\"","The other end seemed to be frantically asking something.","Pei Yuan’s tone was calm but cutting. \"Your mother insulted my sister, saying she was poorly raised and acting like she’s above her as an elder.\"","He narrowed his eyes, his voice dripping with sarcasm. \"There are only a few families in Lan City who can claim to be elders to the Pei family. It seems your family is one I’ve never heard of, so I won’t be needing to fund you. I’ll be sure to share this good news with all my business partners. I look forward to the day your Zhang family surpasses the Pei family. That’s all.\"","Without waiting for a response, Pei Yuan hung up and gave Zhang Old Lady a polite smile.","Zhang Old Lady’s phone suddenly rang.","She looked dazed as she answered it, only to be met with a roar that echoed through the hallway: \"Are you out of your mind?! How dare you offend the Pei family!!! You’ve ruined all my hard work!!! Are you trying to kill me?! I drank myself half to death just to get a meeting, and now it’s all gone because of you! Ruined!!!\"","Zhang Old Lady’s face turned deathly pale as she trembled and looked at Pei Yuan.","Pei Yuan smiled, wrapped an arm around Qiao Chuchu’s shoulders, and said, \"Let’s go, little sister. I’ll pick out a New Year’s gift for you.\"","Qiao Chuchu obediently followed him, her hands clasped over her heart, her eyes sparkling with admiration.","[Big brother is so cool!!!]"]},{"number":95,"title":"Chapter 95: In My Eyes, My Eldest Brother Is a Very Clean Person","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu followed behind Pei Yuan, her eyes completely starstruck.","[Big brother is so cool when he’s fierce! He’s so handsome I can’t take my eyes off him! I should use him as inspiration for a painting! Make him the male lead!]","Pei Yuan pulled Qiao Chuchu back to the hospital room, the corners of his mouth subtly curving upward.","At least she has good taste.","Pei Yuan closed the door and turned to face her.","Qiao Chuchu’s eyes sparkled as she grinned at him.","[The charm of a male mommy, I want a male mommy, I want a male mommy, hehehe...]","Pei Yuan: “...?”","Was he a male mommy?","Qiao Chuchu lowered her gaze, her eyes darting around: [A male mommy should be designed as a gentleman in front of others, but a deeply devoted and slightly crazy lover at heart. He wouldn’t openly confess his love for the female lead but would cook for her, dry her hair, and try to win her heart through her stomach—a cunning yet perfect man. And in the female lead’s eyes, he’s the epitome of gentleness. This contrast makes it interesting.]","Qiao Chuchu pressed her lips together to suppress a smile: [Too bad my brother is different. Although he’s decisive at work, he’s genuinely gentle and like a male mommy, completely guileless in front of family.]","Pei Yuan, who had somehow already returned to the bed, asked, “Qiao Chuchu, don’t you think the pink diamond is too precious? It’s easy to lose if you wear it on your hand.”","Qiao Chuchu paused and looked at the ring: “I do have that concern.”","Pei Yuan smiled softly, “Then give the ring to me. I’ll keep it safe for you.”","Without hesitation, she took off the pink diamond ring, placed it back in the gift box, and handed it to Pei Yuan: “Where are you going to put it?”","“In the safe,” Pei Yuan replied with a smile as he took it. “I’ll never take it out.”","Qiao Chuchu: “...So I can’t wear it for the rest of my life?”","Pei Yuan maintained his smile: “I’ll have another pink diamond bought for you.”","Qiao Chuchu: “? Then what’s the difference between wearing one from second brother and wearing one from you?”","Pei Yuan opened his laptop: “Of course there’s a difference. Your second brother doesn’t earn money easily. It’s better to treasure the things he gives you.”","Qiao Chuchu: “...That makes sense.”","She sat on the edge of the bed, smiling at Pei Yuan like an aunt: “Big brother is so good to second brother. Every time second brother gives me something, you always help me keep it safe.”","Pei Yuan also smiled, turning his laptop toward her: “What do you think of this ring?”","On the screen was a photo of an incredibly beautiful pink diamond ring.","It was larger and more transparent than the one Pei Che had given her.","Though she wasn’t particularly fond of jewelry, she was still pleasantly surprised: “This one is so pretty too!”","Pei Yuan nodded knowingly: “Then this one it is.”","Qiao Chuchu became cautious: “But this one is clearly more valuable than the one second brother gave me. It looks even more precious, so it should be kept in the safe, right?”","Pei Yuan picked up his phone to message his secretary: “No, that’s just your imagination.”","Qiao Chuchu: “?”","She suddenly remembered something: “Does Zhang Old Lady’s son still have a chance to work with you?”","Pei Yuan didn’t look up: “No.”","Qiao Chuchu scratched her head: “If his proposal is good, you should still consider it. Don’t let it affect your business.”","Pei Yuan glanced at her calmly: “His proposal is just passable, not particularly outstanding. I have several better ones already. I was only considering helping him because he nearly risked his life to meet me, but now I think it’s better to let it go. His family isn’t worth it.”","Pei Yuan held his phone: “Running into someone like this at a time like this is really annoying. I’ll transfer you some money. Go buy a red outfit and a red envelope to ward off bad luck.”","As soon as he finished speaking, Qiao Chuchu received a transfer from Pei Yuan.","Pei Yuan dismissed her: “I’ll get back to work. You can come back later.”","Qiao Chuchu didn’t say much and turned to leave.","[Perfect timing. I’ll go check out the New Year gifts I bought for everyone.]","Pei Yuan’s fingers paused on the keyboard as he watched Qiao Chuchu’s retreating figure, the corners of his mouth curling ever so slightly.","---","Lin Qing parked her car in the open-air parking lot and happened to see Qiao Chuchu walking out of the hospital.","She waved: “Chuchu!”","Qiao Chuchu didn’t hear her but noticed Xia Xuechun talking to a child.","A little boy was crying in front of Xia Xuechun.","Xia Xuechun crouched down and smiled gently to comfort him: “It’s okay, I’ll find your mom soon, alright?”","Lin Qing followed Qiao Chuchu’s gaze and also saw Xia Xuechun. She rolled her eyes and walked toward Qiao Chuchu.","Qiao Chuchu squinted, trying to recall—","[Why does this scene with Xia Xuechun and the boy feel so familiar?]","[Oh right! It’s part of the plot!]","[This boy is Lin Qing’s father’s illegitimate child!]","Lin Qing: “?”"]},{"number":96,"title":"Chapter 96: Villainous Thinking","paragraphs":["Lin Qing and Qiao Chuchu watched Xia Xuechun and the little boy intently.","Xia Xuechun gently took the boy's hand and led him to the front desk.","Not long after, a well-dressed woman in high heels rushed over, scooped up the crying boy, and repeatedly thanked Xia Xuechun: \"Thank you, miss, thank you so much.\"","Xia Xuechun smiled warmly. \"It's nothing. The little one was scared. Remember to take him for ice cream—he mentioned he wanted some earlier.\"","The woman extended an invitation: \"Why don’t we all go together?\"","Xia Xuechun’s eyes widened in surprise. \"Really? Is that okay?\"","The woman smiled. \"Of course! Let’s treat you to Häagen-Dazs, alright?\"","Qiao Chuchu, standing in the shadows, watched with a dark expression.","[This child is Lin Qing’s father’s late-life son. Lin Qing’s mother passed away, and her father, being single, is entitled to find a new partner. But I don’t think he should have had another child.]","[Lin Qing is already in her twenties, and this child is only five. She has a five-year-old half-brother who even has inheritance rights. Isn’t that absurd?]","[From Lin Qing’s perspective, her father suddenly has a girlfriend close to her age and a child who could compete for the family fortune.]","[What’s even more infuriating is that this was a subtle subplot. Lin Qing and Lin Shen only found out about this brother much later, by which time their father had already brought the mother and child into their home.]","[And before Lin Qing and Lin Shen knew, Xia Xuechun had already formed a close relationship with their father’s girlfriend. She even supported their relationship, calling it true love, and helped Ji Yanchuan hide the secret of their father’s illegitimate child!]","[When Lin Qing found out about her father’s illegitimate child, she was furious and wanted to kick the mother and son out. But by then, Xia Xuechun was Ji Yanchuan’s official girlfriend, so she fiercely protected the pair, insisting on safeguarding their \"true love.\"]","[As expected... the mother and son ended up fine. Even though the Lin family later went bankrupt, Xia Xuechun ensured their safety because of her close ties to them.]","Qiao Chuchu let out a cold laugh. \"So this is when Xia Xuechun and that woman first connected.\"","Lin Qing stood behind Qiao Chuchu, watching her curiously.","Qiao Chuchu continued to stare at Xia Xuechun and the woman’s retreating figures, her gaze filled with venom.","[An old man who can’t stop sowing his seeds, and a woman willing to climb the social ladder—such people aren’t worth my judgment, but Lin Qing deserves to know!]","She clenched her fists tightly and blurted out, \"I’ll tell Lin Qing right now!\"","A voice sounded behind her. \"Tell me what?\"","Qiao Chuchu jumped in surprise, turning around with wide eyes. \"Lin Qing?\"","Lin Qing smiled lazily at her. \"Were you going to tell me about my father’s illegitimate child?\"","Qiao Chuchu was caught off guard. \"...When did you find out?\"","Lin Qing smiled mysteriously. \"Just now.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","[Just now? That doesn’t align with the timeline!]","Lin Qing grinned brightly and pulled her toward the parking lot.","The woman and Xia Xuechun got into a Maybach.","Lin Qing pointed at the car and said, \"That’s my father’s car. I saw the woman getting out of it, and I figured it out.\"","Qiao Chuchu breathed a sigh of relief.","[So that’s it. The discovery just happened earlier than expected. I thought I’d accidentally spilled the secret.]","Lin Qing lowered her eyes and smiled.","Of course, it was her who had revealed it.","She had to thank him for that.","Otherwise, it would’ve been harder to deal with once the little brat showed up at their house.","Lin Qing winked at her mysteriously. \"Chuchu, want to follow them and see what they’re talking about?\"","Qiao Chuchu’s interest was instantly piqued. \"Yes!\"","Lin Qing swiftly wrapped an arm around her shoulders. \"Let’s go!\""]},{"number":97,"title":"Chapter 97: Lin Qing: Chu Chu, You Are as Wonderful as a Dog","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu and Lin Qing followed three people to a Häagen-Dazs shop.","Through the conversation between Xia Xuechun and the woman, it became clear that this woman genuinely liked Lin Qing’s father, who was in his fifties, and was willingly having a child with him.","The woman hugged her son, smiling with happiness. “Actually, age and money don’t matter to me. Even though he gave me a villa and a Maybach, I still believe our love is pure and free from material concerns.”","Lin Qing poked at the ice cream in her bowl and sneered, “My dad has a beer belly, athlete’s foot, a receding hairline, and age spots on his face. If he didn’t have money, do you really think she’d fall for him?”","Qiao Chuchu shrugged.","[I don’t know if it’s true or not, but I do know that after the Lin family went bankrupt, this woman and her child continued to live happily.]","Lin Qing gritted her teeth.","After chatting for a while longer, the woman exchanged contact information with Xia Xuechun. “Xuechun, don’t worry, I’ll find your mother a new job. If nothing else, she can come work as a cleaner at my house.”","Xia Xuechun was extremely grateful and accepted the business card with both hands. “That’s great! Now I can finally explain things to my mom!”","Qiao Chuchu pursed her lips.","[The original plot wasn’t like this. It seems that because I changed the storyline, Xia Xuechun’s mother ended up working for this woman, which deepened their relationship.]","Lin Qing ate her ice cream, watching the scene coldly.","After Xia Xuechun and the woman parted ways, Lin Qing and Qiao Chuchu continued to follow her.","They tailed the woman’s car all the way to a villa district.","The woman got out of the car, holding her son’s hand, just as a pot-bellied man walked out of the villa.","Sitting in the passenger seat, Qiao Chuchu straightened up the moment she saw the man.","This pot-bellied man was none other than Lin’s father!","Lin’s father walked up to the woman, wrapped his arm around her waist, and kissed her. Then he crouched down, picked up the boy, and spun him around in the air. “Whose precious son is this?”","The little boy laughed heartily in the air. “I’m Daddy’s precious son!”","The woman stood by, watching with a blissful expression.","The three of them stood in the sunlight. Ignoring their looks or demeanor, the sheer happiness they radiated made them look like an imperfect yet heartwarming painting.","Not flawless, but undeniably warm.","Qiao Chuchu turned her head away in disgust.","[Ugh, this is so gross. They look like three generations of the same family. That old stallion is disgusting.]","Lin Qing froze for a moment, then laughed. “Ha! You know what? He’s never treated me or my brother like that.”","Qiao Chuchu was taken aback and placed her hand on Lin Qing’s. “A father like him isn’t worth your sadness.”","Lin Qing’s smile stiffened, and she looked at her in surprise.","Qiao Chuchu didn’t know how to comfort her. “I know you might think I don’t understand, but I want to say that his kind of affection is worthless. I’d find it disgusting even if it were given to me for free.”","[I really find it disgusting. If this were ancient times, I might have coldly disposed of him and his illegitimate child. I’d spare the woman, but the child would have to go to prevent any competition for the family fortune. As for the old man, I’d cut off his roots!]","Lin Qing was surprised and couldn’t help but laugh. “Hahaha!”","Qiao Chuchu was puzzled. “What are you laughing about all of a sudden?”","Lin Qing shook her head. “Nothing. I just think you’re very lucky in your family. You have seven brothers who love you as if you’re their life. If it were anyone else, they would have gotten married by now, and you’d have seven sisters-in-law. Then, they’d prioritize their girlfriends, their families, their wives, and their children. You’d always be overlooked, always feel like you’re in the way.”","Qiao Chuchu imagined it for a moment and felt like she couldn’t breathe. “That would be hard to bear, but I’d have to accept it. I can’t expect my brothers to stay single forever.”","Lin Qing chuckled. “You don’t have to accept it. Your brothers won’t get married. They love you, and only you. If they were capable of loving someone else, they would have left long ago. They wouldn’t have waited for you all these years.”","Qiao Chuchu: “?”","She wanted to ask something.","But Lin Qing didn’t give her a chance and changed the subject. “My brother and I didn’t have a great childhood. Our parents were both from wealthy families, a strong alliance. My mother loved my father, but he didn’t love her. He had a ‘white moonlight’ on the side, so they were always fighting.”","Qiao Chuchu was immediately drawn into the new topic. “Then why didn’t your father just marry the ‘white moonlight’ back then? Wouldn’t that have saved your mother a lot of pain?”","Lin Qing’s tone was flippant. “The ‘white moonlight’ was from a family that was slightly less wealthy than ours. She had money, but not enough to meet the standards for being my father’s wife.”","Qiao Chuchu: “Where is the ‘white moonlight’ now?”","“In a cemetery,” Lin Qing said casually, looking at her. “After my mother passed away from illness, the ‘white moonlight’ moved into our house. She loved skydiving and would go skydiving ten times a month. She came back nine times.”","Qiao Chuchu: “?”","So, the ‘white moonlight’ died during her tenth skydiving trip?","Lin Qing smiled. “Unfortunate, isn’t it?”","Qiao Chuchu: “...”","She felt something was off.","But she couldn’t say it.","She scratched her head. “Does this one like skydiving too?”","“No,” Lin Qing said, scrolling through some information on her phone. “This one’s a singer.”","Qiao Chuchu’s mind went blank, and she blurted out, “Then it seems she won’t have a skydiving accident.”","Lin Qing paused her scrolling and looked up in surprise, then burst into laughter. “Your third brother always tells me you’re an innocent little baby, but I see you know everything!”","Qiao Chuchu: “...”","[Oh no, why did I say what I was thinking out loud?]","Lin Qing laughed so hard she shook, then pulled Qiao Chuchu into a tight hug and kissed her on the cheek!","Qiao Chuchu: “!”","Lin Qing took a piece of white chocolate from her bag, popped one into her own mouth, and then forced one into Qiao Chuchu’s.","Qiao Chuchu didn’t want to eat it, but Lin Qing was too strong and didn’t respect her wishes. She pried open Qiao Chuchu’s lips and shoved the chocolate in.","Forced to eat the chocolate, Qiao Chuchu looked at Lin Qing, who was smirking.","Lin Qing leaned lazily against the car seat, propping her head up with her hand, gazing down at her.","Unlike the seductive charm of Wei Shengyucan, Lin Qing exuded more of a cold beauty.","Her eyes were classic phoenix eyes, her eyebrows sharp and aggressive, her skin glowing white, and her facial lines downward.","So, when she wasn’t smiling, she gave off an aura like the cold, misty mornings of early spring—chilly yet mysteriously beautiful.","Qiao Chuchu’s mind wandered.","[‘Husband’ is a feeling, not a gender.]","[I think Lin Qing fits the ‘husband’ vibe perfectly.]","[She’s the ultimate crush in the sapphic community.]","Lin Qing smiled softly. “Qiao Chuchu, do you know that you’re a really good person? In our circle, someone with your personality is especially likable.”","Qiao Chuchu was flattered. “Really?”","Lin Qing nodded, her tone gentle. “Yes. I really like dogs, and you have the same kind of sincerity as a dog. So, when I’m with someone like you, I’m willing to be genuine because I know you’ll respond with the same sincerity. I don’t have to hide or worry.”","Lin Qing gently pinched Qiao Chuchu’s cheek. “You have a kind of magic that makes people want to rely on and protect you. Those around you instinctively take care of you and grow sharp thorns to shield you.”","Qiao Chuchu: “...”","So... being compared to a dog was actually a compliment."]},{"number":98,"title":"Chapter 98: What to Do If Lin Qing Is Kidnapped","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu glanced at the villa and asked, \"Are you going to tell Lin Shen about this?\"","\"No,\" Lin Qing replied without hesitation. \"My brother is a naive fool when it comes to love, just like my mom. They’re both hopelessly waiting for others to come back to them.\"","\"But I’m different,\" she continued, pulling out a cigarette from her pocket. \"I take after my dad—ruthless and cunning.\"","Lin Qing lit the cigarette, enveloping herself in a cloud of smoke, and fell silent.","Her eyes were filled with resentment and worry as she coldly stared at the villa, lost in thought.","After finishing the cigarette, Lin Qing suddenly asked, \"Do you have Weisheng Huailing’s WeChat?\"","Qiao Chuchu nodded.","Lin Qing picked up her phone. \"Send it to me.\"","Without hesitation, Qiao Chuchu forwarded Weisheng Huailing’s contact to Lin Qing and sent a quick message to Weisheng: 「Lin Qing wants to add you. I’ve sent your contact over. Please accept it.」","Weisheng Huailing replied almost immediately: 「Sure~」","For the next while, Lin Qing chatted with Weisheng Huailing while smoking.","Whatever they discussed, it didn’t take long before Lin Qing stubbed out her cigarette, started the car, and drove off.","Qiao Chuchu was confused. \"What’s going on? We’re leaving already?\"","Lin Qing smiled faintly. \"Let’s go shopping to lift our spirits.\"","She added, \"Can you keep this a secret? My brother mustn’t find out about today.\"","Qiao Chuchu nodded vigorously. \"Don’t worry, my lips are sealed.\"","【Super-duper sealed!!】","Lin Qing chuckled and patted her head. \"Alright, alright, I know you’re tight-lipped.\"","As they drove out of the villa area and onto a quieter road, several jeeps suddenly appeared, surrounding their car.","Qiao Chuchu’s face paled. \"Holy crap, are they here for us?!\"","Lin Qing quickly turned the car around to escape, but they were already blocked from behind.","Several burly men in black suits and sunglasses swiftly got out of the vehicles.","Qiao Chuchu grabbed her phone to call the police, but the window beside her was smashed open with a glass hammer!","The sound of shattering glass was followed by a rough hand reaching in.","Her phone was snatched, and a gun was pressed against her temple. \"Get out of the car.\"","Qiao Chuchu froze.","A gun?!","She looked over at Lin Qing.","Lin Qing’s window had also been smashed, and a gun was pressed to her temple as well.","Lin Qing’s face turned ashen, and her body trembled slightly.","Though clearly terrified, she remained calm and patted Qiao Chuchu’s hand. \"Don’t be afraid, Chuchu. I’m here. We’ll be fine.\"","Qiao Chuchu felt a surge of warmth and nodded calmly.","【Lin Qing, don’t worry. Even if we die, I can bring us back. I still have five rebirth chances left!】","Lin Qing couldn’t help but smile faintly as she stepped out of the car.","Qiao Chuchu also raised her hands and reluctantly exited the vehicle.","They were both marched to the front of the car.","A man grabbed Qiao Chuchu from behind, holding a gun to her temple to keep her in place.","Lin Qing, with a gun pressed to the back of her head, snapped, \"How much do you want? Name your price.\"","The man holding her chuckled coldly. \"We don’t want money, Miss Lin Qing. We want you. Cooperate, and you won’t suffer. Your friend here won’t be harmed either.\"","Lin Qing frowned. \"You want me?\"","Qiao Chuchu’s mind raced.","【Holy shit!】","【I remember now! Lin Qing was kidnapped once, but that was supposed to happen much later in the story. During the kidnapping, she was repeatedly assaulted, which completely shattered her mentally. After that, she went insane and ended up crashing into Xia Xuechun.】","【The novel never explicitly stated who sent the kidnappers. It was like they appeared out of thin air, dumped a naked Lin Qing on the street, and vanished. She was only rescued after someone called the police.】","Qiao Chuchu’s breathing quickened. 【But that was supposed to happen in the middle-to-late stages of the story! Right now, the main couple’s relationship hasn’t even developed yet. Why is the timeline shifting?!】","【When I read the novel the system sent me, I thought these men were sent by Ji Yanchuan. In the story, Lin Qing went crazy and did a lot of terrible things that disrupted Ji Yanchuan’s business and family, so he sent people to deal with her. But now it seems I was wrong.】","【The people behind Lin Qing’s kidnapping... it’s not Ji Yanchuan.】","【Then who is it?!】","【Who would send people to hurt Lin Qing but leave her alive?】","Qiao Chuchu glanced at Lin Qing in shock.","Lin Qing’s face had turned deathly pale, and her body trembled under the man’s grip.","Was she going to be assaulted?","By multiple men?","And then left naked on the street?","Lin Qing looked at the men holding guns on her and suddenly felt nauseous, retching uncontrollably.","Qiao Chuchu snapped out of her thoughts, watching Lin Qing’s agony with bated breath.","【These men aren’t after me. They’ll probably knock me out and dump me on the side of the road. But if I really pass out, it’s over. To save Lin Qing, I need to pretend to faint, make them think I’m no threat, then follow them and call the police. That’s our only chance!】","Lin Qing’s heart clenched as she stared at Qiao Chuchu in alarm.","No!","That’s too dangerous! Let the police handle it. She can’t risk herself!","It’s already a miracle these men aren’t targeting Qiao Chuchu. If she falls into their hands, she’ll suffer the same fate!","But before Lin Qing could signal her, Qiao Chuchu suddenly \"fainted.\"","The man holding her felt her body go limp and turned her face toward his boss. \"Boss, this one’s passed out from fear.\"","The boss glanced at Qiao Chuchu irritably. \"Throw her on the ground. Let me see.\"","Qiao Chuchu was tossed onto the ground like a sack of garbage.","The boss walked over and stomped on her fingers, grinding them into the dirt.","Qiao Chuchu thought, 【Holy crap, that hurts like hell!!!!】","Lin Qing’s face drained of color, her heart aching as she watched.","She saw Qiao Chuchu’s fingers being crushed, yet Qiao Chuchu didn’t even flinch. Lin Qing cursed inwardly.","【You son of a @#%¥@#&¥*@#%¥*¥#¥!】","Lin Qing almost laughed.","If she hadn’t been able to hear Qiao Chuchu’s thoughts, she would’ve believed she’d really fainted.","The boss confirmed she was out cold and sneered, \"Well, well, this little rich girl really did faint.\"","His men laughed mockingly. \"Spoiled brats. She’s lucky she didn’t wet herself.\"","The group erupted in laughter.","The boss yanked Lin Qing toward the car. \"Let’s go, boys. Time to have some fun with the rich girl!\"","Lin Qing was dragged roughly to her feet but walked calmly, her head held high.","If her fate was sealed, she would endure it.","They only wanted to violate her body and break her spirit.","But she wouldn’t break.","Nothing was more important than her life!","She could handle being hurt, but she couldn’t let Qiao Chuchu suffer the same fate.","Qiao Chuchu, a delicate rich girl, wouldn’t be able to handle such trauma.","Lin Qing couldn’t face the Pei Family or Pei Youchuan if something happened to her.","Without struggling, Lin Qing shouted, \"Qiao Chuchu, when you wake up, protect yourself! Don’t come after me!!\"","Qiao Chuchu lay on the ground, her fingers twitching slightly.","Lin Qing was shoved into the car, screaming at Qiao Chuchu, \"Protect yourself! Nothing is more important than your own safety! No matter what happens to me, I’ll survive! Do you hear me?! I, Lin Qing, will never be afraid! I’ll live on! You have to live too! Don’t come after me!!!\""]},{"number":99,"title":"Chapter 99: Qiao Chuchu: Give Me Ten Minutes to Save Lin Qing, I'm Not Joking","paragraphs":["The man quickly covered Lin Qing's mouth and used tape to bind it shut, rendering her unable to speak.","The driver cautiously glanced at Qiao Chuchu through the rearview mirror.","Qiao Chuchu lay motionless on the ground.","As the car drove further away, her figure gradually shrank into a tiny dot before disappearing completely from the rearview mirror.","Suddenly, Qiao Chuchu sprang up from the ground like a carp leaping out of water. She scanned her surroundings and found her discarded phone.","She scrambled over to it and decisively called the police!","She reported her current location, the direction the vehicle was heading, and the most likely destination to the officers. After hanging up, she rushed to Lin Qing's car!","Although the car window was broken, the vehicle was still drivable!","Qiao Chuchu started the engine and chased after the car based on her memory of the route.","According to the book, the car followed the road until it stopped at an old house near Lan City.","She drove forward, following the car’s path, and opened WeChat. She entered the family group she hadn’t visited in a long time and quickly added Lin Shen, sending several voice messages in rapid succession.","“Lin Qing has been kidnapped! She’s in grave danger. I’ve already called the police. I don’t care who’s free right now, but anyone who can spare the time, come and help me! We need to find more people to rescue Lin Qing! Oh, and the kidnappers are armed with guns!”","Pei Yuan immediately initiated a video call!","Qiao Chuchu placed her phone on the car mount and answered.","Pei Yuan’s face was filled with anxiety: “Qiao Chuchu, where are you? I told you to go shopping, how did you end up with Lin Qing and get kidnapped?!”","Qiao Chuchu, driving frantically, replied urgently: “I’m chasing the car! If I hadn’t pretended to be unconscious, they would’ve knocked me out. If I were really unconscious, it would’ve been too late to save her!”","Lin Shen joined the video call, running as he spoke: “Chuchu, I’m on my way now. Don’t go there, it’s too dangerous!”","Pei Buxian also joined the call, immediately scolding her: “Qiao Chuchu, you’re not allowed to go! Didn’t you call the police? We’re on our way to save her. Stay put and don’t cause any more trouble!”","Pei Che entered the video call but remained silent, frowning at Qiao Chuchu without saying a word.","Qiao Chuchu didn’t have time to look at the video participants. She tried to recall the plot’s key points to locate the car’s trail: “I’ve already called the police, but they need time, and so do you. Right now, I’m the closest. If I don’t save Lin Qing, who will?!”","Pei Yuan’s face darkened as he pulled out his IV drip and got off the hospital bed: “How are you going to save her? Just with your words? Do you even know what kind of people you’re dealing with? They have guns! What if you die?!”","Qiao Chuchu snapped back: “If I die, then I die!”","[I still have five chances to revive anyway, so what’s there to fear?! I can’t let Lin Qing be violated!!]","Pei Yuan: “?!”","Her palms were sweaty as she stared ahead: “Every minute she’s in the hands of those bastards is another minute of danger and torment.”","Qiao Chuchu grew angrier the more she thought about it, pounding the steering wheel: “Why?! Why is it that whenever a female character is in danger, it always has to involve sexual assault?!”","Her frustration boiled over: “When a man faces a setback, it’s about his business failing, his massive debts, or his family falling apart. But when it’s a woman, it’s always about sexual violence!”","“I almost went through that, and Lin Qing almost went through it too!”","Qiao Chuchu pressed the accelerator to the floor: “I’ll rescue Lin Qing in the shortest time possible. You all just wait to clean up the mess!”","Pei Yuan, already in his car with his phone, felt his mind explode: “What are you going to use to save her? Just the few years of martial arts you’ve learned?!”","The others also watched her nervously.","In the video, Qiao Chuchu’s expression was resolute as she stared ahead, spotting the Jeep that had kidnapped Lin Qing: “I’m here. I’ll send you the location. Give me ten minutes, and I’ll get her out. Just wait.”","Pei Yuan: “?”","Pei Che: “?”","Pei Buxian: “?”","Pei Fengnong: “?”","Lin Shen: “?”","Ten minutes???","Qiao Chuchu decisively ended the call.","Yes.","Ten minutes.","Years ago, when the system had granted her this skill, it had proudly explained:","—[Host, this reward of ours will automatically detect the lowest probability event in your life and enhance your abilities based on that.]","—[If we enhance your strengths, you’d be too overpowered, which would upset the balance. So we can only enhance areas you rarely use. Of course, if you use this ability to make money, it will gradually weaken back to its original state. We suggest you avoid doing that. It’s fine to use it in emergencies.]","—[Today, I’m giving you the skill of stealth.]","—[In dangerous situations, as long as you lock onto your target, your body will naturally react. You’ll move like a ghost to achieve your goal.]","—[But be warned, you’re invincible only as long as the enemy doesn’t notice you. Once they do, your ability to respond will drastically diminish, and that’s very dangerous.]","She had never imagined she’d actually use stealth one day.","She thought it was only good for sneaking snacks in the kitchen.","Qiao Chuchu took a deep breath: “I’ll rescue Lin Qing before those scumbags can harm her.”","A warm surge of energy coursed through her body, and a powerful force emanated from her fingertips.","Qiao Chuchu felt a plan forming in her mind as she smoothly hid behind the Jeep.","It was a rural three-room house.","Two burly men guarded the courtyard, while the rest of the group crowded into one of the rooms.","Silently, she bypassed the two men and made her way to the back of the kitchen, skillfully picking the lock and slipping inside.","A man entered the kitchen, laughing and calling out to the others inside: “I have to say, it’s the first time we’ve been hired to mess with a rich girl. Feels pretty good.”","Qiao Chuchu hid behind the door, and as the man entered the kitchen, she grabbed his neck and twisted it sharply!","Crack!","The man collapsed into her arms.","She quickly took the silenced gun from his waist and hid him under a pile of corn stalks used for heating.","After finishing, Qiao Chuchu couldn’t help but gasp: [I’m so cool, like, effortlessly cool. I can’t imagine how awesome this would look if it were filmed.]","Lin Qing, lying on the bed with a pale face, suddenly perked up her ears.","Qiao Chuchu was here?","Her heart raced uncontrollably!","How did she get in?","She had told her not to come, it was too dangerous!","The gang leader walked over to Lin Qing, pinched her face, and spoke in a lecherous tone, his breath foul: “You’re a pretty little thing, like a damn celebrity.”","Lin Qing glared at him coldly.","The leader smirked: “Let’s take a photo to prove we’ve kidnapped you, and then we can get started.”","He took out his phone and snapped a picture of Lin Qing.","The angle was vulgar, capturing her from head to toe, even her feet.","Lin Qing suppressed her disgust, her mind racing.","How was Qiao Chuchu here?","If she was here, wouldn’t she be in danger too?"]},{"number":100,"title":"Chapter 100: Even While in Hiding, Remember to Compliment Yourself Beautifully","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu hid behind the door, still savoring her recent actions.","【I’m such a badass.】","【If this were a movie, my theme music would already be playing.】","【It’s a shame no one can witness my heroic moment—only I can savor it in detail.】","-","Pei Yuan sat in the car, driving with Pei Che toward Qiao Chuchu’s last known location.","Pei Yuan’s palms were drenched in sweat as he calmly dialed Lou Tingsi’s number: “Lou Tingsi, do you have a moment?”","The other end of the line was filled with clanging noises, clearly in the midst of a firefight.","The sound of gunfire echoed incessantly, and Lou Tingsi’s amplified voice came through the receiver: “Mr. Pei Yuan, what’s wrong?!”","Pei Yuan: “? Why is it so noisy? Are you on a battlefield?”","Lou Tingsi, hiding behind cover with bullets whizzing past him, couldn’t hide his irritation: “I was in the middle of a deal, and the other side tried to double-cross me! I’m fighting back now! If you have something to say, just say it!”","Pei Yuan’s lips twitched: “Qiao Chuchu has been kidnapped. I was wondering if you could investigate the kidnappers’ information—anything at all. But I guess you’re in no position to handle this right now.”","It seemed like Lou Tingsi could barely save himself.","Lou Tingsi shouted through the chaos: “No problem! Call my son! I’ll send you his number!”","Pei Yuan: “? Your son? Isn’t he only ten years old?”","Lou Tingsi, crouched behind cover, sent him a message: “Sent it! Call him! He can handle it!”","As soon as he finished, a bullet grazed his cover!","Lou Tingsi roared: “Damn it! I’ll take you all down!!!”","With that, he decisively hung up.","Pei Yuan: “...”","Pei Che, who was driving, glanced at him: “What did Lou Tingsi say?”","Pei Yuan, still reeling, replied: “He told us to contact his son. He’s busy in a gunfight and can’t deal with this right now.”","Pei Che’s calm expression cracked slightly: “A gunfight? Will he even make it out alive?”","“I don’t know.” Pei Yuan leaned back weakly, feeling like he was about to run a fever again. Reluctantly, he called Lou Yuejue: “What kind of people does Xiao Ba have around her? They’re all so bizarre. We’re the only normal ones.”","As soon as he finished speaking, Pei Buxian drove past them in his white G-Wagon.","Pei Buxian rolled down the window, revealing the heads of a Doberman, a Cane Corso, a Rottweiler, and a Tibetan Mastiff.","A car full of aggressive dogs!","Pei Yuan: “?”","Pei Che: “?”","Pei Buxian, driving with a ferocious expression, yelled at them: “Why are you driving so slowly?! Hurry up and save Xiao Ba!!!! If you take any longer, her body will be rotting by the time you get there!!! Move it!!!!!!”","After his outburst, Pei Buxian started sobbing: “Wuwuwu... my Xiao Ba... if anything happens to her, I won’t live either!!!”","His window slowly rolled up as he drove off, crying.","Pei Yuan: “...”","Pei Che, expressionless, continued driving: “From a doctor’s perspective, I’d say our family isn’t exactly normal either. So let’s not judge others.”","Pei Yuan’s lips twitched again as he resignedly waited for Lou Yuejue to answer the call.","When the call connected, he got straight to the point: “Lou Yuejue, this is Pei Yuan. I need your help with something.”","Lou Yuejue’s voice on the other end was listless: “First, I don’t like being called a kid. Second, if you need my help, don’t call yourself ‘uncle.’ I call Qiao Chuchu ‘sister,’ so you’re just ‘brother.’ Don’t mess up the hierarchy, brother. Just say what you need.”","Pei Yuan: “...”","He regretted not raising a younger brother who could handle dirty work. Now he had to beg the Lou family!","He cut to the chase: “Your sister has been kidnapped. I need to know her current situation.”","Lou Yuejue shot up from the couch: “Why didn’t you say so earlier?!”","Pei Yuan: “...”","Lou Yuejue opened his laptop and put the phone on speaker: “Send me the address.”","Pei Yuan took a deep breath and sent the address: “What can you find?”","“Everything.” Lou Yuejue’s fingers flew across the keyboard: “If they have surveillance, I can even hack into their system and see the live feed.”","Pei Yuan and Pei Che exchanged glances, their expressions filled with disbelief.","Pei Yuan couldn’t help but ask: “Are you really that good?”","Lou Yuejue shrugged: “It’s basic skills for a novel’s child prodigy. After all, I’m the backup suitor for Xia Xuechun. Isn’t it normal for me to know hacking?”","His eyes lit up: “Got it. I’ll send the video link to our group chat. You can see the surveillance footage by clicking on it.”","Pei Yuan quickly opened the link.","Lou Yuejue spotted Qiao Chuchu: “Qiao Chuchu is hiding in the kitchen!”","Pei Yuan’s breath hitched as he stared intently at the screen.","In the footage, Qiao Chuchu was curled up behind the door, her eyes darting around.","Pei Yuan’s grip on the phone tightened, his body trembling involuntarily.","This was too dangerous!","Qiao Chuchu, hiding behind the door, heard someone say: “Old Ten, what’s taking you so long in the kitchen? Did you die in there?!”","A man walked into the kitchen as he spoke.","Qiao Chuchu’s body instinctively went into combat mode. The moment the man appeared, she pounced from behind and snapped his neck with a crisp crack!","The man collapsed into her arms.","She quickly covered him with firewood.","The whole sequence was seamless!","Lou Yuejue exclaimed: “What the hell?!”","Pei Yuan’s heart was about to leap out of his throat!","Pei Youchuan commented in the group chat: 「Has Qiao Chuchu quit being a manga artist to become an actress? Did she just snap a man’s neck?」","Pei Buxian sent a voice message filled with expletives: “Your sister’s been kidnapped, you idiot! Stop talking nonsense!!!”","Pei Youchuan: 「???????」","Pei Mu: 「???????」","Pei Ci: 「???????」","Pei Fengnong glanced at the surveillance footage and drove toward the location.","Everyone in the group chat who was free turned their attention to the screen.","Qiao Chuchu took a deep breath and picked up another gun.","【There’s only one room left. Sneaking around won’t work—I need to strike first.】","【The system says I never miss a shot, so with two guns, I’m doubly unstoppable. If I shoot their shoulders, they’re done for!】","She summoned her courage, picked up her phone, and opened a music app.","She needed some empowering BGM!","In the room, a man pinned Lin Qing down: “Start recording the video!”","Suddenly, a blaring DJ track erupted from another room:","“I’m the queen, shining bright! If you love me, come on, if not, don’t flaunt! Put away your little tricks, sweet talk is for little girls! I’m the queen, shining bright!”","The boss: “?”","The other men: “?”","Pei Yuan: “...”","Pei Che: “...”","Lou Yuejue: “...”","Pei Buxian: “...”","Pei Fengnong: “...”","Pei Youchuan: “...”","Pei Mu, Pei Ci: “...”","Lin Shen: “...”"]}]);
